an traditional hydroelectric power, since the tides are more consistent. And it's also less invasive, since the turbines are underwater and don't disrupt the natural flow of the river.\n\n**Maya:** That's great to hear. I've also heard that hydropower is one of the cleanest forms of energy production. Is that true?\n\n**Alex:** Absolutely. Hydropower is a renewable energy source that produces no greenhouse gas emissions or pollution. It's a great alternative to fossil fuels.\n\n**Maya:** I'm definitely going to look into learning more about this. Thanks for bringing it up, Alex.\n\n**Alex:** No problem, happy to share the excitement!", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 7402, 1990, 1403, 1274, 25394, 6409, 6861, 1223, 1473, 334, 28487, 68063, 28653, 11, 617, 499, 6755, 922, 279, 3293, 83787, 304, 6409, 6861, 1223, 5557, 1980, 334, 11356, 64, 68063, 22335, 11, 358, 3077, 1027, 2768, 433, 13, 1102, 596, 8056, 1268, 1790, 810, 11297, 814, 3077, 3719, 13, 3639, 596, 10791, 701, 6666, 922, 433, 1980, 334, 28487, 68063, 8489, 11, 358, 574, 5403, 922, 264, 502, 2447, 304, 32603, 430, 596, 1701, 86559, 2410, 311, 7068, 18200, 13, 2435, 2351, 33508, 287, 279, 4907, 505, 279, 18435, 259, 3422, 311, 2410, 10632, 323, 9873, 382, 334, 11356, 64, 68063, 3011, 596, 15400, 0, 358, 3287, 956, 1440, 814, 1051, 3815, 430, 13, 2650, 1587, 433, 990, 1980, 334, 28487, 68063, 71854, 11, 814, 3077, 5918, 264, 4101, 315, 46474, 76775, 430, 12903, 439, 279, 259, 3422, 10205, 323, 4498, 13, 578, 7351, 315, 279, 3090, 11705, 264, 22936, 4907, 430, 596, 16489, 1139, 18200, 382, 334, 11356, 64, 68063, 3011, 596, 779, 7155, 13, 358, 3077, 2744, 1027, 61914, 555, 279, 4754, 315, 86559, 2410, 13, 3639, 527, 279, 7720, 315, 1701, 433, 927, 8776, 17055, 64465, 2410, 11012, 1980, 334, 28487, 68063, 8489, 11, 369, 832, 11, 86559, 2410, 374, 810, 45207, 1109, 8776, 17055, 64465, 2410, 11, 2533, 279, 259, 3422, 527, 810, 13263, 13, 1628, 433, 596, 1101, 2753, 53354, 11, 2533, 279, 76775, 527, 46474, 323, 1541, 9