Output~2025-04-24 16:35:14.609770: [RequestOutput(request_id=99, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Design a database schema to record employee salaries. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7127, 264, 4729, 11036, 311, 3335, 9548, 37532, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a possible database schema to record employee salaries:\n\n**Employee Table**\n\n* `Employee_ID` (Primary Key, Unique Identifier for each employee)\n* `First_Name`\n* `Last_Name`\n* `Job_Title`\n* `Department`\n* `Hire_Date`\n* `Salary` (the current salary of the employee)\n\n**Salary_History Table**\n\n* `Salary_History_ID` (Primary Key, Unique Identifier for each salary record)\n* `Employee_ID` (Foreign Key referencing the Employee table)\n* `Salary_Date` (the date the salary was effective)\n* `Salary_Amount` (the salary amount at the specified date)\n* `Reason` (optional, a brief description of the reason for the salary change, e.g. promotion, raise, etc.)\n\n**Department Table**\n\n* `Department_ID` (Primary Key, Unique Identifier for each department)\n* `Department_Name`\n* `Manager_ID` (Foreign Key referencing the Employee table, the manager of the department)\n\n**Job_Title Table**\n\n* `Job_Title_ID` (Primary Key, Unique Identifier for each job title)\n* `Job_Title_Name`\n* `Job_Description`\n\n**Relationships:**\n\n* An employee can have multiple salary records (one-to-many) in the Salary_History table.\n* A salary record is associated with one employee (many-to-one) in the Employee table.\n* A department can have multiple employees (one-to-many) in the Employee table.\n* A department is managed by one employee (many-to-one) in the Department table.\n* A job title can be associated with multiple employees (one-to-many) in the Employee table.\n\nThis schema captures the essential information about employees, their salaries, and their job titles, as well as the relationships between them. It also allows for tracking of salary changes over time and the ability to query for salary information by employee, department, or job title.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3284, 4729, 11036, 311, 3335, 9548, 37532, 1473, 334, 17415, 6771, 57277, 9, 1595, 17415, 3533, 63, 320, 16352, 5422, 11, 29750, 35721, 369, 1855, 9548, 340, 9, 1595, 5451, 19552, 4077, 9, 1595, 5966, 19552, 4077, 9, 1595, 12524, 73101, 4077, 9, 1595, 27725, 4077, 9, 1595, 39, 556, 40664, 4077, 9, 1595, 42773, 63, 320, 1820, 1510, 16498, 315, 279, 9548, 696, 334, 42773, 2083, 2644, 6771, 57277, 9, 1595, 42773, 2083, 2644, 3533, 63, 320, 16352, 5422, 11, 29750, 35721, 369, 1855, 16498, 3335, 340, 9, 1595, 17415, 3533, 63, 320, 59732, 5422, 57616, 279, 17275, 2007, 340, 9, 1595, 42773, 40664, 63, 320, 1820, 2457, 279, 16498, 574, 7524, 340, 9, 1595, 42773, 1596, 16966, 63, 320, 1820, 16498, 3392, 520, 279, 5300, 2457, 340, 9, 1595, 26197, 63, 320, 13099, 11, 264, 10015, 4096, 315, 279, 2944, 369, 279, 16498, 2349, 11, 384, 1326, 13, 20862, 11, 4933, 11, 5099, 9456, 334, 27725, 6771, 57277, 9, 1595, 27725, 3533, 63, 320, 16352, 5422, 11, 29750, 35721, 369, 1855, 9476, 340, 9, 1595, 27725, 19552, 4077, 9, 1595, 2087, 3533, 63, 320, 59732, 5422, 57616, 279, 17275, 2007, 11, 279, 6783, 315, 279, 9476, 696, 334, 12524, 73101, 6771, 57277, 9, 1595, 12524, 73101, 3533, 63, 320, 16352, 5422, 11, 29750, 35721, 369, 1855, 2683, 2316, 340, 9, 1595, 12524, 73101, 19552, 4077, 9, 1595, 12524, 80787, 19884, 334, 51922, 82, 25, 57277, 9, 1556, 9548, 649, 617, 5361, 16498, 7576, 320, 606, 4791, 81288, 8, 304, 279, 42858, 2083, 2644, 2007, 627, 9, 362, 16498, 3335, 374, 5938, 449, 832, 9548, 320, 35676, 4791, 19101, 8, 304, 279, 17275, 2007, 627, 9, 362, 9476, 649, 617, 5361, 8420, 320, 606, 4791, 81288, 8, 304, 279, 17275, 2007, 627, 9, 362, 9476, 374, 9152, 555, 832, 9548, 320, 35676, 4791, 19101, 8, 304, 279, 6011, 2007, 627, 9, 362, 2683, 2316, 649, 387, 5938, 449, 5361, 8420, 320, 606, 4791, 81288, 8, 304, 279, 17275, 2007, 382, 2028, 11036, 41255, 279, 7718, 2038, 922, 8420, 11, 872, 37532, 11, 323, 872, 2683, 15671, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 279, 12135, 1990, 1124, 13, 1102, 1101, 6276, 369, 15194, 315, 16498, 4442, 927, 892, 323, 279, 5845, 311, 3319, 369, 16498, 2038, 555, 9548, 11, 9476, 11, 477, 2683, 2316, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
