 such as a president, vice president, secretary, and treasurer. This will not only help with decision-making and organization but also provide opportunities for members to take on new challenges and develop their skills.\n\n5. **Conduct Member Feedback Surveys**: To better understand what members want and need from the club, we can conduct regular surveys to gather feedback and suggestions. This will help us identify areas for improvement and make data-driven decisions to enhance the overall club experience.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 6848, 311, 7417, 279, 6469, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 70656, 31966, 96618, 2057, 2567, 3697, 16369, 323, 17045, 11, 584, 649, 1893, 264, 879, 5690, 1912, 477, 41113, 6369, 1405, 584, 649, 4430, 9013, 11, 66697, 11, 323, 3062, 45976, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 8108, 279, 54180, 389, 2613, 323, 1304, 433, 8831, 369, 3697, 311, 4822, 8599, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 9480, 4497, 18093, 96618, 2057, 9504, 502, 3697, 323, 2567, 1510, 6305, 17045, 11, 584, 649, 3197, 810, 4455, 323, 7640, 6957, 279, 1060, 13, 1115, 1436, 2997, 1847, 22178, 11, 5818, 22178, 11, 26202, 10708, 11, 477, 1524, 3674, 66237, 13, 1226, 649, 1101, 2980, 70220, 449, 1023, 19424, 477, 11351, 311, 1080, 39689, 4455, 323, 5662, 264, 22622, 10877, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 1453, 35563, 10349, 34835, 96618, 2057, 5376, 24035, 323, 9504, 502, 3697, 11, 584, 649, 1893, 264, 6469, 3997, 477, 3674, 3772, 2199, 311, 35883, 1057, 7640, 11, 4455, 11, 323, 33997, 13, 1226, 649, 1101, 1893, 86108, 477, 39568, 311, 12192, 1057, 6469, 323, 16822, 1124, 2212, 15679, 477, 304, 2254, 4029, 19169, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 21076, 37263, 52007, 96618, 2057, 26285, 3697, 323, 15253, 11692, 4500, 11, 584, 649, 1893, 3230, 13073, 2949, 279, 6469, 11, 1778, 439, 264, 4872, 11, 17192, 4872, 11, 19607, 11, 323, 96491, 13, 1115, 690, 539, 1193, 1520, 449, 5597, 28846, 323, 7471, 719, 1101, 3493, 10708, 369, 3697, 311, 1935, 389, 502, 11774, 323, 2274, 872, 7512, 382, 20, 13, 3146, 1128, 1076, 12308, 37957, 8242, 50369, 9661