roduct is defective or not as described, we'll be happy to provide a full refund or exchange it for a new one.\n\nPlease note that our refund policy is as follows: [insert company refund policy details].\n\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to reach out to us. We value your business and appreciate your feedback.\n\nThank you for your patience and cooperation.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Company Name] Customer Service", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 4754, 2077, 311, 279, 6130, 596, 2613, 1473, 31765, 510, 13084, 50188, 13359, 499, 369, 19261, 704, 311, 603, 922, 701, 10742, 449, 279, 2027, 499, 15075, 505, 1057, 3637, 13, 1226, 37979, 430, 279, 4367, 1550, 539, 3449, 701, 17078, 323, 584, 2351, 14931, 311, 6865, 430, 499, 2351, 539, 20097, 449, 701, 7782, 382, 1687, 4265, 387, 6380, 311, 7945, 499, 449, 264, 21639, 13, 2057, 1920, 701, 1715, 11, 1436, 499, 4587, 3493, 603, 449, 279, 2768, 2038, 1473, 9, 4718, 2015, 1396, 477, 279, 2457, 315, 7782, 198, 9, 362, 11944, 4096, 315, 279, 4360, 449, 279, 2027, 198, 9, 5884, 9959, 7397, 477, 6029, 315, 279, 23011, 271, 12805, 584, 5371, 420, 2038, 11, 584, 3358, 3477, 701, 1715, 323, 636, 1203, 311, 499, 2949, 220, 18, 12, 20, 2626, 2919, 449, 264, 11175, 13, 1442, 279, 2027, 374, 64903, 477, 539, 439, 7633, 11, 584, 3358, 387, 6380, 311, 3493, 264, 2539, 21639, 477, 9473, 433, 369, 264, 502, 832, 382, 5618, 5296, 430, 1057, 21639, 4947, 374, 439, 11263, 25, 510, 4302, 2883, 21639, 4947, 3649, 30662, 2746, 499, 617, 904, 4860, 477, 10742, 11, 4587, 1541, 956, 39666, 311, 5662, 704, 311, 603, 13, 1226, 907, 701, 2626, 323, 15763, 701, 11302, 382, 13359, 499, 369, 701, 30401, 323, 23915, 382, 14809, 24886, 345, 58, 7927, 4076, 933, 58, 14831, 4076, 60, 12557, 5475, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
