Output~2025-04-24 16:37:18.030649: [RequestOutput(request_id=173, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story that begins with the following sentence. ### Input: She opened the door to find a tall figure cloaked in shadows. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 430, 12302, 449, 279, 2768, 11914, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 3005, 9107, 279, 6134, 311, 1505, 264, 16615, 7216, 5405, 7897, 304, 35612, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='She opened the door to find a tall figure cloaked in shadows. The air was thick with the scent of damp earth and decaying leaves, and the flickering candles that lined the hallway cast eerie silhouettes on the walls. The figure didn\'t move, didn\'t speak, didn\'t even seem to breathe. It was as if it was a statue, a dark and foreboding sentinel guarding some ancient secret.\n\nAs she stepped closer, the figure slowly raised its head, its face still shrouded in darkness. She felt a shiver run down her spine as its eyes, two glinting points of light, fixed on her. She tried to take a step back, but her feet seemed rooted to the spot.\n\n"Who are you?" she whispered, her voice barely audible over the creaking of the old wooden floorboards.\n\nThe figure didn\'t respond, but instead took a slow, deliberate step forward. She could feel its gaze burning into her skin, like a cold, dark flame. She tried to turn and run, but her legs wouldn\'t move. She was trapped, frozen in place by the figure\'s unblinking stare.\n\nAnd then, in a voice that was like the rustling of dry leaves, the figure spoke. "I have been waiting for you," it said. "You have something that belongs to me."\n\nShe tried to shake her head, to deny whatever it was that the figure was talking about, but her voice was stuck in her throat. The figure took another step closer, its eyes burning brighter, and she felt herself being pulled towards it, like a moth to a flame.', token_ids=[8100, 9107, 279, 6134, 311, 1505, 264, 16615, 7216, 5405, 7897, 304, 35612, 13, 578, 3805, 574, 12314, 449, 279, 41466, 315, 41369, 9578, 323, 1654, 17718, 11141, 11, 323, 279, 29447, 4776, 52305, 430, 32393, 279, 51902, 6445, 97383, 5554, 18664, 47003, 389, 279, 14620, 13, 578, 7216, 3287, 956, 3351, 11, 3287, 956, 6604, 11, 3287, 956, 1524, 2873, 311, 37397, 13, 1102, 574, 439, 422, 433, 574, 264, 35372, 11, 264, 6453, 323, 2291, 65, 3785, 81878, 80600, 1063, 14154, 6367, 382, 2170, 1364, 25319, 12401, 11, 279, 7216, 14297, 9408, 1202, 2010, 11, 1202, 3663, 2103, 559, 583, 9988, 304, 27394, 13, 3005, 6612, 264, 559, 1553, 1629, 1523, 1077, 35776, 439, 1202, 6548, 11, 1403, 2840, 396, 287, 3585, 315, 3177, 11, 8521, 389, 1077, 13, 3005, 6818, 311, 1935, 264, 3094, 1203, 11, 719, 1077, 7693, 9508, 41976, 311, 279, 7858, 382, 1, 15546, 527, 499, 7673, 1364, 58366, 11, 1077, 7899, 20025, 80415, 927, 279, 272, 1127, 287, 315, 279, 2362, 23162, 6558, 19826, 382, 791, 7216, 3287, 956, 6013, 11, 719, 4619, 3952, 264, 6435, 11, 46072, 3094, 4741, 13, 3005, 1436, 2733, 1202, 36496, 20252, 1139, 1077, 6930, 11, 1093, 264, 9439, 11, 6453, 35678, 13, 3005, 6818, 311, 2543, 323, 1629, 11, 719, 1077, 14535, 8434, 956, 3351, 13, 3005, 574, 31691, 11, 20268, 304, 2035, 555, 279, 7216, 596, 653, 2067, 16113, 46943, 382, 3112, 1243, 11, 304, 264, 7899, 430, 574, 1093, 279, 23941, 2785, 315, 9235, 11141, 11, 279, 7216, 12570, 13, 330, 40, 617, 10