Output~2025-04-24 16:38:55.680203: [RequestOutput(request_id=226, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a unique way to cook a steak. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 5016, 1648, 311, 4394, 264, 50059, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a unique way to cook a steak:\n\n**Korean-Style Steak with Gochujang Glaze and Smoked Pineapple**\n\nFor a flavorful and visually stunning steak, try cooking it using a Korean-inspired method that combines the savory flavors of gochujang (Korean chili paste) with the sweetness of smoked pineapple. Here's how:\n\n**Step 1: Prepare the Steak**\n\nChoose a high-quality ribeye or strip loin steak, about 1-1.5 inches thick. Season the steak with a mixture of salt, black pepper, and a pinch of sugar.\n\n**Step 2: Make the Gochujang Glaze**\n\nIn a small saucepan, combine 2 tablespoons of gochujang, 2 tablespoons of soy sauce, 2 tablespoons of brown sugar, 2 tablespoons of rice vinegar, and 1 tablespoon of sesame oil. Whisk until smooth. Bring the mixture to a simmer over medium heat and cook for about 5 minutes, or until the glaze has thickened slightly.\n\n**Step 3: Smoke the Pineapple**\n\nPreheat your grill or grill pan to medium-high heat. Cut a fresh pineapple ring into 1-inch thick slices. Place the pineapple slices on the grill and cook for about 2-3 minutes per side, or until caramelized and slightly charred. Remove from heat and set aside.\n\n**Step 4: Cook the Steak**\n\nPlace the steak on the grill or grill pan and cook for about 4-5 minutes per side, or until it reaches your desired level of doneness. For medium-rare, cook for 8-10 minutes total.\n\n**Step 5: Finish with the Gochujang Glaze and Smoked Pineapple**\n\nOnce the steak is cooked, brush the gochujang glaze all over the steak, making sure to coat it evenly. Place the smoked pineapple slices on top of the steak and serve immediately.\n\nThis unique cooking method combines the bold flavors of gochujang with the sweetness of smoked pineapple, creating a truly unforgettable steak experience. The caramelized pineapple adds a pop of color and texture to the dish, making it perfect for a special occasion or dinner party.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 5016, 1648, 311, 4394, 264, 50059, 1473, 334, 42, 46295, 12, 2377, 85343, 449, 480, 5059, 9832, 526, 8444, 10033, 323, 4487, 11059, 42609, 23182, 57277, 2520, 264, 94631, 323, 43395, 20441, 50059, 11, 1456, 17677, 433, 1701, 264, 16526, 53161, 1749, 430, 33511, 279, 94760, 32523, 315, 733, 331, 9832, 526, 320, 42, 46295, 59717, 25982, 8, 449, 279, 64550, 315, 48637, 78182, 13, 5810, 596, 1268, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 32266, 279, 85343, 57277, 25017, 264, 1579, 22867, 20735, 19494, 477, 13619, 78060, 50059, 11, 922, 220, 16, 12, 16, 13, 20, 15271, 12314, 13, 14598, 279, 50059, 449, 264, 21655, 315, 12290, 11, 3776, 25349, 11, 323, 264, 50346, 315, 13465, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 7557, 279, 480, 5059, 9832, 526, 8444, 10033, 57277, 644, 264, 2678, 19737, 857, 11, 16343, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 733, 331, 9832, 526, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 29839, 19737, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 14198, 13465, 11, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 20228, 47205, 11, 323, 220, 16, 62611, 315, 92223, 5707, 13, 1254, 3267, 3156, 11113, 13, 40224, 279, 21655, 311, 264, 62915, 927, 11298, 8798, 323, 4394, 369, 922, 220, 20, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 2840, 10033, 706, 12314, 6901, 10284, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 54304, 279, 42609, 23182, 57277, 4808, 20559, 701, 40158, 477,