contrasting with the deep blues and greens of the ocean. The overall effect is one of energy, movement, and drama, capturing the awe-inspiring power of nature. "The Great Wave off Kanagawa" is widely considered one of the most iconic and influential works of Japanese art, and its imagery has been reproduced and parodied countless times in popular culture.', token_ids=[10227, 8681, 32418, 1022, 31663, 351, 14406, 1, 374, 264, 37048, 7732, 4677, 1194, 3549, 555, 279, 11002, 10255, 735, 1900, 1136, 11755, 473, 91176, 2192, 304, 279, 4216, 220, 777, 339, 9478, 13, 578, 19354, 374, 961, 315, 264, 4101, 315, 24370, 3967, 439, 330, 92702, 55541, 25987, 315, 10640, 88153, 1359, 902, 71849, 279, 27373, 11002, 16700, 505, 2204, 348, 25843, 3585, 382, 791, 1194, 62991, 264, 11191, 12330, 922, 311, 1464, 11, 449, 279, 12056, 1824, 5795, 16557, 315, 10640, 88153, 9621, 304, 279, 4092, 13, 578, 12330, 374, 23188, 304, 14265, 11, 78223, 15998, 267, 56137, 11, 449, 4251, 32183, 323, 23749, 16706, 1022, 1202, 73024, 13, 578, 12330, 596, 7351, 374, 8915, 323, 83321, 11, 439, 422, 433, 596, 922, 311, 77836, 279, 14373, 32731, 323, 31284, 382, 644, 279, 40405, 11, 264, 2478, 32731, 527, 3970, 20427, 279, 12330, 11, 872, 86105, 323, 296, 12019, 30280, 323, 38817, 555, 279, 5457, 315, 279, 3090, 13, 578, 32731, 527, 13987, 304, 12593, 311, 279, 11191, 12330, 11, 82003, 279, 2410, 323, 64159, 315, 279, 18435, 13, 578, 18528, 374, 15884, 24770, 11, 449, 279, 12330, 596, 73024, 30164, 264, 38336, 1584, 430, 11767, 279, 26792, 596, 8071, 311, 279, 81389, 16557, 315, 10640, 88153, 382, 791, 1194, 374, 32971, 555, 1202, 1005, 315, 14265, 11, 34076, 8146, 11, 449, 279, 12330, 596, 4251, 32183, 323, 23749, 75055, 449, 279, 5655, 44695, 323, 52011, 315, 279, 18435, 13, 578, 8244, 2515, 374, 832, 315, 4907, 11, 7351, 11, 323, 20156, 11, 40880, 279, 51517, 22610, 79863, 2410, 315, 7138, 13, 330, 791, 8681, 32418, 1022, 31663, 351, 14406, 1, 374, 13882, 6646, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 27373, 323, 32549, 