Output~2025-04-24 16:40:51.127924: [RequestOutput(request_id=281, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a creative description of a sunset in the beach. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 11782, 4096, 315, 264, 44084, 304, 279, 11573, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="As the day's final breath escaped, the sky transformed into a kaleidoscope of warm hues, a breathtaking sunset unfolding on the beach. The horizon, once a sharp line, began to blur and soften, as if kissed by the gentle fingers of a painter. Soft pinks and peaches melted into the sky, gradually deepening into burnt oranges and fiery reds. The clouds, tinted with shades of coral and salmon, seemed to glow from within, as if infused with an inner light.\n\nThe air was alive with the sweet scent of saltwater and the distant call of seagulls, their cries carried on the gentle breeze like a soothing melody. The sound of the waves, a constant rhythm, provided a soothing background hum, as the tide ebbed and flowed with the ebb and flow of the day's final moments.\n\nAs the sun dipped lower, its rays danced across the waves, casting a golden glow on the water. The beach, once a bustling hub of activity, grew quiet, as if the very world was holding its breath in anticipation of the sun's final descent. The sky, now a deep shade of crimson, seemed to pulse with an otherworldly energy, as if the very fabric of reality was being rewoven with every passing moment.\n\nAnd then, in a flash of glory, the sun vanished, leaving behind a sky ablaze with stars, a moon glowing like a silver crescent, and the beach bathed in the soft, ethereal light of twilight. The world was bathed in a peaceful silence, as if the very essence of the day's beauty had been distilled into this one, perfect moment.", token_ids=[2170, 279, 1938, 596, 1620, 11745, 28883, 11, 279, 13180, 24411, 1139, 264, 63577, 13652, 2474, 315, 8369, 82757, 11, 264, 57192, 44084, 33831, 389, 279, 11573, 13, 578, 35174, 11, 3131, 264, 17676, 1584, 11, 6137, 311, 29613, 323, 81045, 11, 439, 422, 59334, 555, 279, 22443, 19779, 315, 264, 30581, 13, 25046, 281, 15872, 323, 1069, 14576, 50459, 1139, 279, 13180, 11, 27115, 5655, 6147, 1139, 50440, 85138, 323, 64942, 2579, 82, 13, 578, 30614, 11, 49104, 291, 449, 37199, 315, 53103, 323, 41420, 11, 9508, 311, 37066, 505, 2949, 11, 439, 422, 72903, 449, 459, 9358, 3177, 382, 791, 3805, 574, 13989, 449, 279, 10437, 41466, 315, 12290, 13284, 323, 279, 29827, 1650, 315, 513, 351, 71523, 11, 872, 58845, 11953, 389, 279, 22443, 46385, 1093, 264, 65464, 62684, 13, 578, 5222, 315, 279, 17301, 11, 264, 6926, 37390, 11, 3984, 264, 65464, 4092, 2854, 11, 439, 279, 43038, 25470, 2788, 323, 85750, 449, 279, 384, 6194, 323, 6530, 315, 279, 1938, 596, 1620, 14269, 382, 2170, 279, 7160, 73307, 4827, 11, 1202, 45220, 84852, 4028, 279, 17301, 11, 25146, 264, 21411, 37066, 389, 279, 3090, 13, 578, 11573, 11, 3131, 264, 90256, 19240, 315, 5820, 11, 14264, 11594, 11, 439, 422, 279, 1633, 1917, 574, 10168, 1202, 11745, 304, 50919, 315, 279, 7160, 596, 1620, 38052, 13, 578, 13180, 11, 1457, 264, 5655, 28601, 315, 97119, 11, 9508, 311, 28334, 449, 459, 1023, 14957, 398, 4907, 11, 439, 422, 279, 1633, 13354, 315, 8903, 574, 1694, 79722, 16651, 449, 1475, 12579, 4545, 382, 3112, 1243, 11, 304, 264, 8381, 315, 27025, 11, 279, 7160, 59581, 11, 9564, 4920, 264, 13180, 98492, 10033, 449, 9958, 11, 264, 18266, 49592, 1093, 264, 15310, 46858, 1189, 11, 323, 279, 11573, 9