Output~2025-04-24 16:40:58.856646: [RequestOutput(request_id=286, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest a suitable card game for a birthday party with 10 year old kids. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 264, 14791, 3786, 1847, 369, 264, 15553, 4717, 449, 220, 605, 1060, 2362, 6980, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='What a fun task!\n\nFor a 10-year-old\'s birthday party, I would highly recommend the card game "Go Fish"! It\'s a classic, easy-to-learn, and super fun game that\'s perfect for kids around that age. Here\'s why:\n\n1. Simple to learn: The rules of Go Fish are easy to understand, even for kids who have never played a card game before. It\'s a great way to introduce them to the world of card games.\n2. Social interaction: Go Fish encourages social interaction and teamwork. Players take turns asking each other for specific cards, which promotes communication and friendly competition.\n3. Strategic thinking: While the game is easy to learn, it still requires strategic thinking and planning to win. Kids will need to think about which cards to ask for and when to hold back.\n4. Fast-paced: Go Fish is a quick game that can be played in about 15-20 minutes, making it perfect for a birthday party with a short attention span.\n5. No need for special equipment: All you need is a standard deck of 52 cards, which is easy to find or purchase.\n\nTo make the game even more exciting, you can add some fun twists, such as:\n\n* Creating teams instead of playing individually\n* Setting a timer to add an element of speed\n* Offering small prizes for the winner(s)\n\nOverall, Go Fish is an excellent choice for a 10-year-old\'s birthday party. It\'s a classic, fun, and engaging game that\'s sure to be a hit with the kids!', token_ids=[3923, 264, 2523, 3465, 2268, 2520, 264, 220, 605, 4771, 6418, 596, 15553, 4717, 11, 358, 1053, 7701, 7079, 279, 3786, 1847, 330, 11087, 17019, 1, 0, 1102, 596, 264, 11670, 11, 4228, 4791, 12, 12964, 11, 323, 2307, 2523, 1847, 430, 596, 4832, 369, 6980, 2212, 430, 4325, 13, 5810, 596, 3249, 1473, 16, 13, 9170, 311, 4048, 25, 578, 5718, 315, 6122, 17019, 527, 4228, 311, 3619, 11, 1524, 369, 6980, 889, 617, 2646, 6476, 264, 3786, 1847, 1603, 13, 1102, 596, 264, 2294, 1648, 311, 19678, 1124, 311, 279, 1917, 315, 3786, 3953, 627, 17, 13, 9983, 16628, 25, 6122, 17019, 37167, 3674, 16628, 323, 84633, 13, 25640, 1935, 10800, 10371, 1855, 1023, 369, 3230, 7563, 11, 902, 39990, 10758, 323, 11919, 10937, 627, 18, 13, 46661, 7422, 25, 6104, 279, 1847, 374, 4228, 311, 4048, 11, 433, 2103, 7612, 19092, 7422, 323, 9293, 311, 3243, 13, 23338, 690, 1205, 311, 1781, 922, 902, 7563, 311, 2610, 369, 323, 994, 311, 3412, 1203, 627, 19, 13, 17737, 65319, 25, 6122, 17019, 374, 264, 4062, 1847, 430, 649, 387, 6476, 304, 922, 220, 868, 12, 508, 4520, 11, 3339, 433, 4832, 369, 264, 15553, 4717, 449, 264, 2875, 6666, 9575, 627, 20, 13, 2360, 1205, 369, 3361, 7241, 25, 2052, 499, 1205, 374, 264, 5410, 9722, 315, 220, 4103, 7563, 11, 902, 374, 4228, 311, 1505, 477, 7782, 382, 1271, 1304, 279, 1847, 1524, 810, 13548, 11, 499, 649, 923, 1063, 2523, 62990, 11, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 32406, 7411, 4619, 315, 5737, 32399, 198, 9, 20638, 264, 9198, 311, 923, 459, 2449, 315, 4732, 198, 9, 67118, 2678, 38508, 369, 279, 13946, 1161, 696, 28589, 11, 6122, 17019, 374, 459, 9250, 5873, 369, 264, 220, 605, 4771, 6418, 596, 15553, 4717, 13, 1102, 596, 264, 11670, 11, 2523, 11, 323, 23387, 1847, 430, 596, 2771, 311