Output~2025-04-24 16:42:15.302002: [RequestOutput(request_id=317, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List five characteristics of good communication. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 4330, 17910, 315, 1695, 10758, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are five characteristics of good communication:\n\n1. **Clearness**: Good communication involves conveying information in a clear and concise manner, avoiding ambiguity and confusion. This means using simple language, avoiding jargon and technical terms that may be unfamiliar to the audience, and providing specific examples or explanations to support complex ideas.\n\n2. **Active Listening**: Good communication is a two-way process that involves not only speaking but also listening actively. This means paying attention to the other person, maintaining eye contact, and asking questions to clarify any doubts or misunderstandings.\n\n3. **Respect**: Good communication involves treating others with respect and dignity, regardless of their background, culture, or opinion. This means avoiding condescending or patronizing tone, using inclusive language, and being open to feedback and criticism.\n\n4. **Open-Mindedness**: Good communication involves being open-minded and receptive to different perspectives and ideas. This means being willing to consider alternative viewpoints, asking questions, and seeking clarification when necessary.\n\n5. **Feedback**: Good communication involves providing and seeking feedback to ensure that the message is understood and to improve the communication process. This means being willing to receive constructive criticism, providing specific and timely feedback, and being open to adjusting the communication approach as needed.\n\nBy incorporating these characteristics, effective communication can help build trust, foster collaboration, and achieve desired outcomes.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 17910, 315, 1695, 10758, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 14335, 2136, 96618, 7839, 10758, 18065, 94165, 2038, 304, 264, 2867, 323, 64694, 11827, 11, 31526, 72868, 323, 22047, 13, 1115, 3445, 1701, 4382, 4221, 11, 31526, 503, 71921, 323, 11156, 3878, 430, 1253, 387, 50383, 311, 279, 10877, 11, 323, 8405, 3230, 10507, 477, 41941, 311, 1862, 6485, 6848, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 5847, 77797, 96618, 7839, 10758, 374, 264, 1403, 27896, 1920, 430, 18065, 539, 1193, 12365, 719, 1101, 14624, 22815, 13, 1115, 3445, 12798, 6666, 311, 279, 1023, 1732, 11, 20958, 8071, 3729, 11, 323, 10371, 4860, 311, 38263, 904, 40017, 477, 90700, 826, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 1079, 1002, 96618, 7839, 10758, 18065, 27723, 3885, 449, 5201, 323, 38929, 11, 15851, 315, 872, 4092, 11, 7829, 11, 477, 9647, 13, 1115, 3445, 31526, 390, 89132, 477, 36380, 4954, 16630, 11, 1701, 29408, 4221, 11, 323, 1694, 1825, 311, 11302, 323, 19347, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 5109, 5364, 17003, 2136, 96618, 7839, 10758, 18065, 1694, 1825, 34423, 323, 88651, 311, 2204, 39555, 323, 6848, 13, 1115, 3445, 1694, 10032, 311, 2980, 10778, 90909, 11, 10371, 4860, 11, 323, 11125, 64784, 994, 5995, 382, 20, 13, 3146, 36448, 96618, 7839, 10758, 18065, 8405, 323, 11125, 11302, 311, 6106, 430, 279, 1984, 374, 16365, 323, 311, 7417, 279, 10758, 1920, 13, 1115, 3445, 1694, 10032, 311, 5371, 54584, 19347, 11, 8405, 3230, 323, 32100, 11302, 11, 323, 1694, 1825, 311, 43468, 279, 10758, 5603, 439, 4460, 382, 1383, 52913, 1521, 17910, 11, 7524, 10758, 649, 1520, 1977, 7095, 11, 31087, 20632, 11, 323, 11322, 12974, 20124, 13, 128009], cumu