vate others, which has allowed me to build a strong and cohesive team. I am proud to say that my leadership skills have been instrumental in driving success in my previous roles.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and experience to [Company] and contribute to the success of your team. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing my qualifications further.\n\nSincerely,\nMaxwell Smart', token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 59624, 3504, 6661, 304, 279, 1176, 1732, 1473, 31765, 510, 39, 6322, 10790, 50188, 40, 1097, 12304, 311, 3881, 369, 279, 510, 3897, 60, 3560, 520, 510, 14831, 948, 3161, 16781, 3217, 304, 279, 10960, 5064, 11, 358, 1097, 16913, 430, 856, 25363, 6130, 2532, 323, 3575, 99246, 7512, 1304, 757, 459, 10728, 9322, 369, 420, 2361, 382, 60105, 856, 7076, 304, 279, 10960, 5064, 11, 358, 617, 21356, 1027, 264, 1948, 49254, 11, 323, 856, 33997, 617, 1027, 15324, 555, 856, 2307, 22625, 13, 3861, 315, 856, 12474, 36486, 374, 856, 5845, 311, 62425, 3885, 11, 902, 706, 5535, 757, 311, 1977, 264, 3831, 323, 87516, 2128, 13, 358, 1097, 12691, 311, 2019, 430, 856, 11692, 7512, 617, 1027, 42045, 304, 10043, 2450, 304, 856, 3766, 13073, 382, 40, 1097, 12304, 922, 279, 6776, 311, 4546, 856, 7512, 323, 3217, 311, 510, 14831, 60, 323, 17210, 311, 279, 2450, 315, 701, 2128, 13, 9930, 499, 369, 13126, 856, 3851, 13, 358, 1427, 4741, 311, 25394, 856, 43784, 4726, 382, 50, 87191, 345, 6102, 9336, 16147, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
