Output~2025-04-24 16:42:59.052492: [RequestOutput(request_id=334, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Explain the difference between HTML and CSS. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 83017, 279, 6811, 1990, 9492, 323, 15533, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) and CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) are two fundamental technologies used to create and design websites. While they are often used together, they serve distinct purposes and have different functions.\n\n**HTML:**\n\nHTML is a markup language used to create the structure and content of a website. It is used to define the different elements of a web page, such as headings, paragraphs, images, links, forms, tables, and more. HTML consists of a series of elements, represented by tags, which are used to wrap around the content to define its meaning. For example, the `<p>` tag is used to define a paragraph of text, while the `<img>` tag is used to embed an image on a web page.\n\nHTML is responsible for the following:\n\n* Defining the structure and content of a web page\n* Providing the basic layout and organization of the page\n* Creating the foundation for the website's content\n\n**CSS:**\n\nCSS, on the other hand, is a styling language used to control the layout and appearance of a website. It is used to add visual styling, layout, and user experience to a web page. CSS is applied to the HTML elements to change their appearance, such as font styles, colors, spacing, and more. CSS is used to create a visually appealing and user-friendly interface for the website.\n\nCSS is responsible for the following:\n\n* Controlling the layout and appearance of a web page\n* Adding visual styling, such as colors, fonts, and spacing\n* Creating a responsive design that adapts to different devices and screen sizes\n* Enhancing the user experience through interactive effects and animations\n\n**Key differences:**\n\n* HTML is used to define the structure and content of a web page, while CSS is used to style and layout the page.\n* HTML is concerned with the meaning and content of the page, while CSS is concerned with the presentation and appearance of the page.\n* HTML is used to create the basic structure of the page, while CSS is used to add visual flair and interactivity to the page.\n\nIn summary, HTML provides the foundation for a website's content and structure, while CSS adds the visual styling and layout to make the website visually appealing and user-friendly. Both HTML and CSS are essential technologies for building a website, and they work together to create a cohesive and effective online presence.", token_ids=[5959, 320, 39, 1100, 38320, 99661, 11688, 8, 323, 15533, 320, 34, 5171, 2277, 12179, 61572, 8, 527, 1403, 16188, 14645, 1511, 311, 1893, 323, 2955, 13335, 13, 6104, 814, 527, 3629, 1511, 3871, 11, 814, 8854, 12742, 10096, 323, 617, 2204, 5865, 382, 334, 5959, 25, 57277, 5959, 374, 264, 41851, 4221, 1511, 311, 1893, 279, 6070, 323, 2262, 315, 264, 3997, 13, 1102, 374, 1511, 311, 7124, 279, 2204, 5540, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 11, 1778, 439, 70552, 11, 43743, 11, 5448, 11, 7902, 11, 7739, 11, 12920, 11, 323, 810, 13, 9492, 17610, 315, 264, 4101, 315, 5540, 11, 15609, 555, 9681, 11, 902, 527, 1511, 311, 15411, 2212, 279, 2262, 311, 7124, 1202, 7438, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 279, 31686, 79, 44726, 4877, 374, 1511, 311, 7124, 264, 14646, 315, 1495, 11, 1418, 279, 31686, 1931, 44726, 4877, 374, 1511, 311, 11840, 459, 2217, 389, 264, 356