Output~2025-04-24 16:44:26.902673: [RequestOutput(request_id=371, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate an example that illustrates the concept of "artificial intelligence". ### Response:\'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 459, 3187, 430, 46480, 279, 7434, 315, 330, 472, 16895, 11478, 3343, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's an example that illustrates the concept of artificial intelligence:\n\n**Example:** A self-driving car, like the ones developed by companies like Waymo or Tesla, is a great example of artificial intelligence in action. This car is equipped with a sophisticated AI system that uses a combination of sensors, cameras, and GPS data to navigate through roads and traffic.\n\nHere's how it works:\n\n1. The car's AI system uses machine learning algorithms to analyze data from various sensors, such as radar, lidar, and cameras, to detect and recognize objects around it, including other cars, pedestrians, road signs, and lane markings.\n2. The AI system uses this data to predict the behavior of other road users, such as whether a pedestrian is likely to step into the road or whether another car is going to cut off the self-driving car.\n3. Based on this analysis, the AI system makes decisions in real-time, such as adjusting the car's speed, steering, and braking to avoid accidents or maintain a safe distance from other vehicles.\n4. The AI system also continuously learns and improves its performance by updating its algorithms and adapting to new situations, such as unexpected road closures or construction.\n\nIn this example, the self-driving car's AI system is able to perform tasks that would typically require human intelligence, such as perception, decision-making, and problem-solving, without human intervention. This is a classic example of artificial intelligence in action, as the system is able to simulate human-like intelligence and make decisions based on data and algorithms rather than human intuition or instinct.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 430, 46480, 279, 7434, 315, 21075, 11478, 1473, 334, 13617, 68063, 362, 659, 60811, 1841, 11, 1093, 279, 6305, 8040, 555, 5220, 1093, 12424, 6489, 477, 28298, 11, 374, 264, 2294, 3187, 315, 21075, 11478, 304, 1957, 13, 1115, 1841, 374, 19167, 449, 264, 27877, 15592, 1887, 430, 5829, 264, 10824, 315, 26148, 11, 18632, 11, 323, 24229, 828, 311, 21546, 1555, 19795, 323, 9629, 382, 8586, 596, 1268, 433, 4375, 1473, 16, 13, 578, 1841, 596, 15592, 1887, 5829, 5780, 6975, 26249, 311, 24564, 828, 505, 5370, 26148, 11, 1778, 439, 28608, 11, 27431, 277, 11, 323, 18632, 11, 311, 11388, 323, 15641, 6302, 2212, 433, 11, 2737, 1023, 9515, 11, 62558, 11, 5754, 12195, 11, 323, 21971, 65172, 627, 17, 13, 578, 15592, 1887, 5829, 420, 828, 311, 7168, 279, 7865, 315, 1023, 5754, 3932, 11, 1778, 439, 3508, 264, 47854, 374, 4461, 311, 3094, 1139, 279, 5754, 477, 3508, 2500, 1841, 374, 2133, 311, 4018, 1022, 279, 659, 60811, 1841, 627, 18, 13, 20817, 389, 420, 6492, 11, 279, 15592, 1887, 3727, 11429, 304, 1972, 7394, 11, 1778, 439, 43468, 279, 1841, 596, 4732, 11, 33277, 11, 323, 73588, 311, 5766, 33788, 477, 10519, 264, 6220, 6138, 505, 1023, 11731, 627, 19, 13, 578, 15592, 1887, 1101, 31978, 47310, 323, 36050, 1202, 5178, 555, 21686, 1202, 26249, 323, 70817, 311, 502, 15082, 11, 1778, 439, 16907, 5754, 61000, 477, 8246, 382, 644, 420, 3187, 11, 279, 659, 60811, 1841, 596, 15592, 1887, 374, 3025, 311, 2804, 9256, 430, 1053, 11383, 1397, 3823, 11478, 11, 1778, 43