Output~2025-04-24 16:44:36.604426: [RequestOutput(request_id=373, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Analyze the following poem and explain its meaning. ### Input: \'My love is like a red, red rose\' ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 38527, 3059, 279, 2768, 33894, 323, 10552, 1202, 7438, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 364, 5159, 3021, 374, 1093, 264, 2579, 11, 2579, 16392, 6, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The poem "My love is like a red, red rose" is a classic Scottish ballad, and its meaning is a beautiful expression of romantic love. The poem, written by Robert Burns, compares the speaker\'s love to a red rose, emphasizing its beauty, passion, and enduring nature.\n\nThe rose is often a symbol of love and passion in literature and poetry, and in this poem, it represents the speaker\'s deep and abiding love for someone. The use of the word "red" to describe the rose is significant, as it conveys a sense of intensity and passion. The rose is not just any ordinary flower, but a vibrant and striking one that captures the speaker\'s attention and emotions.\n\nThe poem also touches on the idea of the fleeting nature of life and the impermanence of beauty. The rose, like all things in life, is subject to the forces of nature and will eventually wilt and die. However, the speaker\'s love is not just a passing fancy, but a deep and abiding emotion that will endure even after the rose has faded.\n\nThe poem can also be seen as a commentary on the human experience, where love is often compared to something beautiful and fleeting, like a rose. The speaker is acknowledging that their love is not just a feeling, but a choice that they have made, and that it will continue to grow and flourish even in the face of adversity.\n\nOverall, the poem "My love is like a red, red rose" is a beautiful expression of romantic love, and its meaning is a celebration of the beauty and passion that it brings to our lives.', token_ids=[791, 33894, 330, 5159, 3021, 374, 1093, 264, 2579, 11, 2579, 16392, 1, 374, 264, 11670, 27188, 5041, 329, 11, 323, 1202, 7438, 374, 264, 6366, 7645, 315, 24364, 3021, 13, 578, 33894, 11, 5439, 555, 8563, 51016, 11, 43565, 279, 19114, 596, 3021, 311, 264, 2579, 16392, 11, 82003, 1202, 13444, 11, 11939, 11, 323, 52876, 7138, 382, 791, 16392, 374, 3629, 264, 7891, 315, 3021, 323, 11939, 304, 17649, 323, 32349, 11, 323, 304, 420, 33894, 11, 433, 11105, 279, 19114, 596, 5655, 323, 671, 6714, 3021, 369, 4423, 13, 578, 1005, 315, 279, 3492, 330, 1171, 1, 311, 7664, 279, 16392, 374, 5199, 11, 439, 433, 390, 50369, 264, 5647, 315, 21261, 323, 11939, 13, 578, 16392, 374, 539, 1120, 904, 19664, 23153, 11, 719, 264, 34076, 323, 21933, 832, 430, 41255, 279, 19114, 596, 6666, 323, 21958, 382, 791, 33894, 1101, 29727, 389, 279, 4623, 315, 279, 96435, 7138, 315, 2324, 323, 279, 17190, 1543, 768, 315, 13444, 13, 578, 16392, 11, 1093, 682, 2574, 304, 2324, 11, 374, 3917, 311, 279, 8603, 315, 7138, 323, 690, 9778, 75596, 323, 2815, 13, 4452, 11, 279, 19114, 596, 3021, 374, 539, 1120, 264, 12579, 27555, 11, 719, 264, 5655, 323, 671, 6714, 20356, 430, 690, 46753, 1524, 1306, 279, 16392, 706, 54434, 382, 791, 33894, 649, 1101, 387, 3970, 439, 264, 31710, 389, 279, 3823, 3217, 11, 1405, 3021, 374, 3629, 7863, 311, 2555, 6366, 323, 96435, 11, 1093, 264, 16392, 13, 578, 19114, 374, 61708, 430, 872, 3021, 374, 539, 1120, 264, 8430, 11, 71