Output~2025-04-24 16:45:03.744448: [RequestOutput(request_id=383, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Identify the continents with the most carnivores. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 65647, 279, 66959, 449, 279, 1455, 97733, 4692, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Based on various sources, including the International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN) and scientific studies, here are the continents with the most carnivores:\n\n1. **Africa**: Africa is home to the highest number of carnivore species, with over 350 species, including lions, leopards, cheetahs, hyenas, wild dogs, and various species of mongooses, meerkats, and civets.\n2. **Asia**: Asia has the second-highest number of carnivore species, with over 250 species, including tigers, leopards, snow leopards, clouded leopards, Asiatic lions, and various species of bears, wolves, and foxes.\n3. **North America**: North America is home to around 150 carnivore species, including bears, wolves, mountain lions, bobcats, coyotes, and various species of foxes, weasels, and raccoons.\n4. **South America**: South America has around 120 carnivore species, including jaguars, pumas, ocelots, margays, and various species of foxes, weasels, and raccoons.\n5. **Europe**: Europe has around 50 carnivore species, including bears, wolves, lynxes, foxes, and various species of weasels and stoats.\n6. **Australia**: Australia has around 20 carnivore species, including dunnarts, quolls, and various species of snakes, lizards, and spiders.\n7. **Antarctica**: Antarctica has no native carnivore species, as it is inhospitable to most life forms due to its extreme climate.\n\nPlease note that these numbers are approximate and may vary depending on the source and classification of species.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 5370, 8336, 11, 2737, 279, 7327, 9323, 369, 45435, 315, 22037, 320, 40, 5576, 45, 8, 323, 12624, 7978, 11, 1618, 527, 279, 66959, 449, 279, 1455, 97733, 4692, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 74691, 96618, 10384, 374, 2162, 311, 279, 8592, 1396, 315, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 449, 927, 220, 8652, 9606, 11, 2737, 69132, 11, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 3091, 295, 1494, 82, 11, 6409, 28043, 11, 8545, 12875, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 34914, 20274, 11, 757, 17172, 1900, 11, 323, 18969, 1441, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 39563, 96618, 13936, 706, 279, 2132, 2902, 7656, 1396, 315, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 449, 927, 220, 5154, 9606, 11, 2737, 259, 33214, 11, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 12056, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 9624, 291, 514, 454, 2402, 11, 88810, 780, 69132, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 323, 39935, 288, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 26287, 5270, 96618, 4892, 5270, 374, 2162, 311, 2212, 220, 3965, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 16700, 69132, 11, 36292, 38552, 11, 75709, 6429, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 39935, 288, 11, 584, 300, 2053, 11, 323, 9148, 1030, 2439, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 26070, 5270, 96618, 4987, 5270, 706, 2212, 220, 4364, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 27840, 67487, 11, 281, 55024, 11, 297, 3757, 2469, 11, 19205, 954, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 39935, 288, 11, 584, 300, 2053, 11, 323, 9148, 1030, 2439, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 31880, 96618, 4606, 706, 2212, 220, 1135, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 30824, 11, 56271, 11, 90303, 90774, 11, 39935, 288, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 584, 300, 2053, 323, 43132, 1900, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 49137, 96618, 8494, 706, 2212, 220, 508, 97733, 461, 9606, 11, 2737, 294, 15278, 7183, 11, 934, 68978, 11, 323, 5370, 9606, 315, 57196, 11, 326, 35191, 11, 323, 