Output~2025-04-24 16:45:12.171096: [RequestOutput(request_id=385, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Explain the purpose of hypertext markup language (HTML). ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 83017, 279, 7580, 315, 9950, 38320, 41851, 4221, 320, 5959, 570, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The purpose of Hypertext Markup Language (HTML) is to provide a standard way to create and structure content on the web. HTML is a markup language that uses a series of tags and attributes to define the structure and layout of a web page. It is used to create the basic structure and content of a web page, including headings, paragraphs, images, links, forms, tables, and more.\n\nHTML allows developers to define the different elements of a web page, such as headings, paragraphs, and lists, and to specify the relationships between them. It also provides a way to add semantic meaning to the content of a web page, which helps search engines and other software to understand the structure and content of the page.\n\nThe main purpose of HTML is to provide a way to create a web page that is both human-readable and machine-readable. Human-readable means that the HTML code is easy for humans to read and understand, while machine-readable means that the code can be interpreted by web browsers and other software.\n\nSome of the key purposes of HTML include:\n\n* Providing a structure for the content of a web page\n* Defining the layout and design of a web page\n* Adding semantic meaning to the content of a web page\n* Providing a way to link to other web pages and resources\n* Enabling search engines and other software to understand the structure and content of a web page\n\nOverall, the purpose of HTML is to provide a standard way to create and structure content on the web, making it possible for people to access and share information online.', token_ids=[791, 7580, 315, 39515, 38320, 99661, 11688, 320, 5959, 8, 374, 311, 3493, 264, 5410, 1648, 311, 1893, 323, 6070, 2262, 389, 279, 3566, 13, 9492, 374, 264, 41851, 4221, 430, 5829, 264, 4101, 315, 9681, 323, 8365, 311, 7124, 279, 6070, 323, 6932, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 13, 1102, 374, 1511, 311, 1893, 279, 6913, 6070, 323, 2262, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 11, 2737, 70552, 11, 43743, 11, 5448, 11, 7902, 11, 7739, 11, 12920, 11, 323, 810, 382, 5959, 6276, 13707, 311, 7124, 279, 2204, 5540, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 11, 1778, 439, 70552, 11, 43743, 11, 323, 11725, 11, 323, 311, 14158, 279, 12135, 1990, 1124, 13, 1102, 1101, 5825, 264, 1648, 311, 923, 42833, 7438, 311, 279, 2262, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 11, 902, 8779, 2778, 21787, 323, 1023, 3241, 311, 3619, 279, 6070, 323, 2262, 315, 279, 2199, 382, 791, 1925, 7580, 315, 9492, 374, 311, 3493, 264, 1648, 311, 1893, 264, 3566, 2199, 430, 374, 2225, 3823, 84318, 323, 5780, 84318, 13, 11344, 84318, 3445, 430, 279, 9492, 2082, 374, 4228, 369, 12966, 311, 1373, 323, 3619, 11, 1418, 5780, 84318, 3445, 430, 279, 2082, 649, 387, 33398, 555, 3566, 33957, 323, 1023, 3241, 382, 8538, 315, 279, 1401, 10096, 315, 9492, 2997, 1473, 9, 81200, 264, 6070, 369, 279, 2262, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 198, 9, 3979, 5859, 279, 6932, 323, 2955, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 198, 9, 31470, 42833, 7438, 311, 279, 2262, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 198, 9, 81200, 264, 1648, 311, 2723, 311, 1023, 3566, 6959, 323, 5070, 198, 9, 2998, 19295, 2778, 21787, 323, 1023, 3241, 311, 3619, 279, 6070, 323, 2262, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 271, 28589, 11, 279, 7580, 315, 9492, 374, 311, 3493, 264, 5410, 1648, 311,