such as assembly lines, surgery, and search and rescue operations.\n6. **Healthcare**: AI can help diagnose diseases, develop personalized treatment plans, and improve patient outcomes. It can also assist in medical research, drug discovery, and clinical trials.\n7. **Cybersecurity**: AI-powered systems can detect and respond to cyber threats in real-time, protecting networks, systems, and data from attacks.\n8. **Virtual Assistants**: AI-powered virtual assistants, like Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant, can perform tasks, answer questions, and provide information to users.\n9. **Gaming**: AI can create realistic game environments, characters, and opponents, enhancing the gaming experience and enabling new types of games.\n10. **Education**: AI can personalize learning experiences, provide real-time feedback, and help teachers identify areas where students need extra support.\n11. **Customer Service**: AI-powered chatbots can provide 24/7 customer support, answering frequently asked questions, and routing complex issues to human representatives.\n12. **Supply Chain Management**: AI can optimize logistics, predict demand, and streamline supply chain operations, reducing costs and improving efficiency.\n13. **Environmental Monitoring**: AI can monitor and analyze environmental data, such as air and water quality, weather patterns, and climate change, to help mitigate its effects.\n14. **Autonomous Vehicles**: AI can enable self-driving cars, trucks, and drones to navigate roads, avoid', token_ids=[9470, 16895, 11478, 320, 15836, 8, 706, 12387, 5829, 4028, 5370, 19647, 323, 13878, 315, 1057, 6439, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 315, 279, 1455, 5199, 8522, 315, 15592, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 99956, 96618, 15592, 649, 69711, 59177, 323, 69782, 9256, 11, 67817, 709, 3823, 5070, 369, 810, 6485, 323, 11782, 990, 13, 26379, 2997, 6369, 63005, 11, 4200, 57619, 11, 323, 28598, 6130, 2532, 6067, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1061, 18825, 96618, 15592, 649, 6288, 1920, 323, 24564, 13057, 15055, 315, 82