to protect user transactions, launched in 2014.\n10. **Dogecoin (DOGE)**: A decentralized digital currency created as a joke in 2013, but has since gained a large community and use cases.\n11. **Tether (USDT)**: A stablecoin pegged to the value of the US dollar, launched in 2014.\n12. **Binance Coin (BNB)**: The native cryptocurrency of the Binance exchange, launched in 2017.\n13. **Chainlink (LINK)**: A decentralized oracle network that provides real-world data to smart contracts, launched in 2017.\n14. **Tezos (XTZ)**: A decentralized blockchain platform that allows for on-chain governance and smart contracts, launched in 2018.\n15. **EOSIO (EOS)**: A decentralized operating system that supports the deployment of industrial-scale dApps, launched in 2018.\n\nThis is not an exhaustive list, as there are many more cryptocurrencies out there. But these are some of the most well-known and widely used ones.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 2204, 4595, 315, 45074, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 49387, 320, 60218, 33395, 25, 578, 1176, 323, 1455, 1664, 22015, 27128, 11, 3549, 304, 220, 1049, 24, 555, 93252, 44329, 57960, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 36, 19041, 372, 320, 7780, 33395, 25, 362, 49063, 5452, 430, 20682, 279, 9886, 315, 7941, 17517, 323, 49063, 8522, 320, 67, 54702, 705, 11887, 304, 220, 679, 20, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 44944, 7307, 320, 43, 7905, 33395, 25, 362, 14734, 4791, 79697, 27128, 3549, 304, 220, 679, 16, 439, 264, 10819, 323, 23917, 10778, 311, 13428, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 49, 52264, 320, 55, 22394, 33395, 25, 362, 1972, 7394, 20547, 17516, 1887, 320, 5463, 16929, 8, 323, 11667, 9473, 323, 1323, 88291, 4009, 11, 11887, 304, 220, 679, 17, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 49387, 23139, 320, 33, 2198, 33395, 25, 362, 23243, 315, 13428, 11, 3549, 304, 220, 679, 22, 311, 5376, 279, 2565, 1404, 323, 2187, 369, 10819, 14463, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 5889, 5770, 320, 33393, 33395, 25, 362, 49063, 586, 18428, 323, 27128, 2447, 11, 11887, 304, 220, 679, 22, 449, 264, 5357, 389, 41329, 323, 94840, 627,