Output~2025-04-24 16:47:01.703373: [RequestOutput(request_id=434, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a review of the restaurant. ### Input: The restaurant is called La Taqueria. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3477, 315, 279, 10960, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 578, 10960, 374, 2663, 5034, 24172, 16339, 689, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="**4.5/5 stars**\n\nI recently had the pleasure of dining at La Taqueria, and I must say, it was a delightful experience. From the moment we walked in, the warm and inviting atmosphere immediately put us at ease. The decor was vibrant and colorful, with traditional Mexican tiles and lively music setting the tone for a fun and festive meal.\n\nOur server, Carlos, was attentive and knowledgeable, taking the time to explain the menu and make recommendations. We started with the guacamole, which was creamy and fresh, served with crispy tortilla chips that were perfect for scooping up the delicious dip.\n\nFor my main course, I opted for the carne asada tacos, which did not disappoint. The grilled steak was tender and flavorful, served with a generous portion of sautéed onions and bell peppers. The tortillas were soft and pliable, and the salsa bar offered a variety of options to add an extra kick.\n\nMy companion's veggie burrito was also a hit, packed with a generous helping of beans, cheese, and roasted vegetables. The portion was generous, and we left feeling satisfied but not stuffed.\n\nThe prices were reasonable, and the service was prompt and friendly. Overall, I would highly recommend La Taqueria to anyone looking for a delicious and authentic Mexican meal. The only reason I didn't give it a full 5 stars is that the music was a bit too loud, making it difficult to carry on a conversation at times. However, this is a minor quibble, and we will definitely be back to try more of their menu items.", token_ids=[334, 19, 13, 20, 14, 20, 9958, 57277, 40, 6051, 1047, 279, 17069, 315, 18397, 520, 5034, 24172, 16339, 689, 11, 323, 358, 2011, 2019, 11, 433, 574, 264, 50189, 3217, 13, 5659, 279, 4545, 584, 15203, 304, 11, 279, 8369, 323, 42292, 16975, 7214, 2231, 603, 520, 14553, 13, 578, 10799, 574, 34076, 323, 34966, 11, 449, 8776, 24160, 21130, 323, 49277, 4731, 6376, 279, 16630, 369, 264, 2523, 323, 59937, 15496, 382, 8140, 3622, 11, 30397, 11, 574, 73898, 323, 42066, 11, 4737, 279, 892, 311, 10552, 279, 5130, 323, 1304, 19075, 13, 1226, 3940, 449, 279, 1709, 96708, 1286, 11, 902, 574, 47985, 323, 7878, 11, 10434, 449, 73624, 16831, 6374, 24512, 430, 1051, 4832, 369, 25661, 34807, 709, 279, 18406, 24522, 382, 2520, 856, 1925, 3388, 11, 358, 41867, 369, 279, 95954, 439, 2649, 85501, 11, 902, 1550, 539, 14429, 13, 578, 61733, 50059, 574, 28682, 323, 94631, 11, 10434, 449, 264, 28771, 13651, 315, 829, 332, 978, 291, 45697, 323, 29519, 58573, 13, 578, 16831, 34344, 1051, 8579, 323, 628, 2205, 11, 323, 279, 74314, 3703, 9076, 264, 8205, 315, 2671, 311, 923, 459, 5066, 10536, 382, 5159, 22489, 596, 48438, 22235, 7951, 29141, 574, 1101, 264, 4295, 11, 19937, 449, 264, 28771, 10695, 315, 27994, 11, 17604, 11, 323, 54662, 24822, 13, 578, 13651, 574, 28771, 11, 323, 584, 2163, 8430, 20097, 719, 539, 45413, 382, 791, 7729, 1051, 13579, 11, 323, 279, 2532, 574, 10137, 323, 11919, 13, 28993, 11, 358, 1053, 7701, 7079, 5034, 24172, 16339, 689, 311, 5606, 3411, 369, 264, 1840