Output~2025-04-24 16:48:20.058212: [RequestOutput(request_id=460, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a pop quiz about clouds. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 2477, 28223, 922, 30614, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a pop quiz about clouds:\n\n**Cloud Quiz**\n\n**Instructions:** Choose the correct answer for each question.\n\n**1. What is the main component of clouds?**\na) Water vapor\nb) Oxygen\nc) Nitrogen\nd) Helium\n\n**Answer:** a) Water vapor\n\n**2. What is the term for a cloud that produces precipitation?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Cirrus\n\n**Answer:** c) Nimbus\n\n**3. Which type of cloud is often seen on a sunny day?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Cirrus\nd) Altocumulus\n\n**Answer:** a) Cumulus\n\n**4. What is the highest type of cloud?**\na) Cirrus\nb) Cumulus\nc) Stratus\nd) Cirrostratus\n\n**Answer:** d) Cirrostratus\n\n**5. What is the term for a cloud that is low-lying and flat?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Altocumulus\n\n**Answer:** b) Stratus\n\n**6. Which of the following is NOT a type of cloud?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Rainbow\n\n**Answer:** d) Rainbow (Rainbow is a meteorological phenomenon, not a type of cloud)\n\n**7. What is the term for a cloud that is tall and puffy?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Cumulonimbus\n\n**Answer:** d) Cumulonimbus\n\n**8. Which type of cloud is often associated with thunderstorms?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Cumulonimbus\n\n**Answer:** d) Cumulonimbus\n\n**9. What is the term for a cloud that is high-level and wispy?**\na) Cirrus\nb) Cumulus\nc) Stratus\nd) Altocumulus\n\n**Answer:** a) Cirrus\n\n**10. What is the term for a cloud that is a combination of different types of clouds?**\na) Cumulus\nb) Stratus\nc) Nimbus\nd) Stratocumulus\n\n**Answer:** d) Stratocumulus\n\n**How did you do? Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on any of", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 2477, 28223, 922, 30614, 1473, 334, 16440, 42248, 57277, 334, 56391, 68063, 22991, 279, 4495, 4320, 369, 1855, 3488, 382, 334, 16, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 1925, 3777, 315, 30614, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 10164, 38752, 198, 65, 8, 87669, 198, 66, 8, 50616, 26252, 198, 67, 8, 16183, 2411, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 264, 8, 10164, 38752, 271, 334, 17, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 4751, 369, 264, 9624, 430, 19159, 61050, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 32678, 19990, 198, 65, 8, 4610, 1015, 198, 66, 8, 72593, 198, 67, 8, 42009, 20962, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 272, 8, 72593, 271, 334, 18, 13, 16299, 955, 315, 9624, 374, 3629, 3970, 389, 264, 40798, 1938, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 32678, 19990, 198, 65, 8, 4610, 1015, 198, 66, 8, 42009, 20962, 198, 67, 8, 24610, 511, 372, 19990, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 264, 8, 32678, 19990, 271, 334, 19, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 8592, 955, 315, 9624, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 42009, 20962, 198, 65, 8, 32678, 19990, 198, 66, 8, 4610, 1015, 198, 67, 8, 42009, 299, 496, 1015, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 294, 8, 42009, 299, 496, 1015, 271, 334, 20, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 4751, 369, 264, 9624, 430, 374, 3428, 12, 6852, 323, 10269, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 32678, 19990, 198, 65, 8, 4610, 1015, 198, 66, 8, 72593, 198, 67, 8, 24610, 511, 372, 19990, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 293, 8, 4610, 1015, 271, 334, 21, 13, 16299, 315, 279, 2768, 374, 4276, 264, 955, 315, 9624, 30, 1035, 64, 8, 32678, 19990, 198, 65, 8, 4610, 1015, 198, 66, 8, 72593, 198, 67, 8, 47745, 271, 334, 16533, 68063, 294, 8, 47745, 320, 60139, 15802, 374, 264, 42142, 