 2020**\n\n* May 4: The global death toll surpasses 100,000.\n* May 11: The United States surpasses 1 million reported cases.\n\n**June 2020**\n\n* June 1: The global death toll surpasses 300,000.\n* June 15: The United States surpasses 2 million reported cases.\n\n**July 2020**\n\n* July 1: The global death toll surpasses 500,000.\n* July 20: The United States surpasses 3 million reported cases.\n\n**August 2020**\n\n* August 1: The global death toll surpasses 700,000.\n* August 15: The United States surpasses 4 million reported cases.\n\n**September 2020**\n\n* September 1: The global death toll surpasses 900,000.\n* September 20: The United States surpasses 5 million reported cases.\n\n**October 2020**\n\n* October 1: The global death toll surpasses 1 million.\n* October 15: The United States surpasses 6 million reported cases.\n\n**November 2020**\n\n* November 1:', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 25845, 369, 279, 33333, 31188, 1473, 334, 33246, 220, 679, 24, 57277, 9, 6790, 220, 16, 25, 578, 1176, 5068, 5157, 315, 69329, 315, 9987, 5353, 527, 16914, 304, 37230, 10118, 11, 5734, 627, 9, 6790, 220, 23, 25, 8620, 11527, 527, 16369, 315, 279, 31188, 323, 3240, 24834, 382, 334, 33327, 220, 2366, 15, 57277, 9, 6186, 220, 22, 25, 8620, 11527, 7838, 430, 264, 502, 33333, 374, 279, 5353, 315, 279, 69329, 31188, 627, 9, 6186, 220, 806, 25, 578, 4435, 6401, 21021, 320, 78847, 8, 374, 16369, 315, 279, 31188, 627, 9, 6186, 220, 508, 25, 578, 1176, 4648, 505, 279, 17188, 374, 5068, 304, 37230, 10118, 11, 5734, 382, 334, 33877, 220, 2366, 15, 57277, 9, 7552, 220, 22, 25, 578, 40312, 50888, 279, 31188, 264, 3142, 6401, 32708, 315, 7327, 52347, 320, 47, 1837, 1341, 4390, 9, 7552, 220, 806, 25, 578, 17188, 374, 7086, 20562, 12, 777, 555, 279, 40312, 627, 9, 7552, 220, 1187, 25, 578, 1176, 1162, 315, 20562, 12, 777, 374, 5068, 4994, 315, 5734, 11, 304, 30567, 382, 334, 28623, 220, 2366, 15, 57277, 9, 5587, 220, 806, 25, 578, 40312, 50888, 279, 31188, 264, 3728, 28522, 627, 9, 5587, 22