Output~2025-04-24 16:50:52.956532: [RequestOutput(request_id=522, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a story about a girl who visits an alien planet. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 3828, 889, 21728, 459, 20167, 11841, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='As soon as the spaceship landed on the alien planet, Lily\'s eyes widened with wonder. She had always dreamed of visiting another world, and now she was finally here. The planet\'s landscape stretched out before her like an endless canvas of purple and green, with towering mountains and deep valleys carved out by ancient rivers.\n\nLily stepped out of the ship and took a deep breath of the crisp, clean air. It was a far cry from the polluted atmosphere of her home planet. She felt invigorated and alive, and she couldn\'t wait to explore this new world.\n\nHer guide, a friendly alien named Zorvath, greeted her warmly. "Welcome to Xylophia-IV," he said, his voice like a gentle breeze. "I\'m glad you\'re here. We don\'t often get visitors from other planets."\n\nLily smiled, feeling a sense of excitement and trepidation. She had studied Xylophia-IV in school, but she had never imagined she would actually set foot on the planet. "It\'s amazing," she breathed. "I\'ve never seen anything like it."\n\nZorvath nodded, his long, slender body bobbing up and down. "Yes, it\'s a beautiful planet. We\'re very proud of it. Would you like to see some of the sights?"\n\nLily nodded eagerly, and Zorvath led her on a tour of the planet. They walked through fields of towering, iridescent flowers that shimmered and glowed in the sunlight. They visited a crystal cave, where the walls sang a haunting melody that echoed through the cavern. And they climbed to the top of a mountain, where they watched the sunset paint the sky with vibrant colors.\n\nAs the day drew to a close, Lily reluctantly said goodbye to Zorvath and boarded her spaceship. She felt changed, as if she had been transformed by her visit to Xylophia-IV. She knew that she would never forget this experience, and she couldn\'t wait to share it with her friends back on her home planet.\n\nAs she soared through the galaxy, Lily felt a sense of wonder and awe that she had never felt before. She knew that she would always carry the memory of Xylophia-IV with her, and she couldn\'t wait to see what other wonders the universe held.', token_ids=[2170, 5246, 439, 279, 85942, 27212, 389, 279, 20167, 11841, 11, 48390, 596, 6548, 86988, 449, 5895, 13, 3005, 1047, 2744, 57636, 315, 17136, 2500, 1917, 11, 323, 1457, 1364, 574, 5616, 1618, 13, 578, 11841, 596, 18921, 41398, 704, 1603, 1077, 1093, 459, 26762, 10247, 315, 25977, 323, 6307, 11, 449, 87794, 24405, 323, 5655, 86497, 49267, 704, 555, 14154, 36617, 382, 43, 1570, 25319, 704, 315, 279, 8448, 323, 3952, 264, 5655, 11745, 315, 279, 42954, 11, 4335, 3805, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 3117, 16106, 505, 279, 95869, 16975, 315, 1077, 2162, 11841, 13, 3005, 6612, 1558, 71070, 660, 323, 13989, 11, 323, 1364, 7846, 956, 3868, 311, 13488, 420, 502, 1917, 382, 21364, 8641, 11, 264, 11919, 20167, 7086, 1901, 269, 85, 589, 11, 44865, 1077, 97470, 13, 330, 14262, 311, 1630, 88, 385, 18120, 12, 3166, 1359, 568, 1071, 11, 813, 7899, 1093, 264, 22443, 46385, 13, 330, 40, 2846, 16089, 499, 2351, 1618, 13, 1226, 1541, 956, 3629, 636, 15613, 505, 1023, 33975, 2266, 43, 1570, 31645, 11, 8430, 264, 5647, 315, 28361, 323, 4353, 10629, 367, 13, 3005, 1047, 20041, 1