Output~2025-04-24 16:52:19.994193: [RequestOutput(request_id=555, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List 5 benefits of playing sports ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 220, 20, 7720, 315, 5737, 10034, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are 5 benefits of playing sports:\n\n1. **Improves Physical Health**: Playing sports can help improve cardiovascular health, increase strength and flexibility, and boost overall physical fitness. Regular exercise can also reduce the risk of chronic diseases, such as heart disease, diabetes, and obesity.\n\n2. **Enhances Mental Well-being**: Sports can have a positive impact on mental health by reducing stress and anxiety, improving mood, and increasing self-esteem. The sense of accomplishment and confidence gained from participating in sports can also help individuals develop a more positive self-image.\n\n3. **Develops Social Skills**: Team sports, in particular, provide opportunities to develop social skills such as communication, teamwork, and leadership. Players learn to work together towards a common goal, build relationships, and develop a sense of belonging.\n\n4. **Boosts Cognitive Function**: Engaging in sports can improve cognitive function by enhancing concentration, memory, and problem-solving skills. The physical activity and mental focus required in sports can also improve academic performance and overall cognitive development.\n\n5. **Fosters Discipline and Perseverance**: Playing sports requires discipline, hard work, and perseverance. These skills can translate to other areas of life, such as academics and career, helping individuals develop a strong work ethic and a growth mindset.\n\nOverall, playing sports can have a wide range of benefits that extend beyond physical fitness and athletic performance.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 7720, 315, 5737, 10034, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 48942, 2396, 28479, 6401, 96618, 40551, 10034, 649, 1520, 7417, 41713, 2890, 11, 5376, 8333, 323, 25152, 11, 323, 7916, 8244, 7106, 17479, 13, 29900, 10368, 649, 1101, 8108, 279, 5326, 315, 21249, 19338, 11, 1778, 439, 4851, 8624, 11, 20335, 11, 323, 33048, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 58568, 3095, 38895, 8489, 33851, 96618, 13482, 649, 617, 264, 6928, 5536, 389, 10723, 2890, 555, 18189, 8631, 323, 18547, 11, 18899, 20247, 11, 323, 7859, 659, 65906, 13, 578, 5647, 315, 61238, 323, 12410, 18661, 505, 24435, 304, 10034, 649, 1101, 1520, 7931, 2274, 264, 810, 6928, 659, 14064, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 21076, 82, 9983, 31340, 96618, 8068, 10034, 11, 304, 4040, 11, 3493, 10708, 311, 2274, 3674, 7512, 1778, 439, 10758, 11, 84633, 11, 323, 11692, 13, 25640, 4048, 311, 990, 3871, 7119, 264, 4279, 5915, 11, 1977, 12135, 11, 323, 2274, 264, 5647, 315, 33152, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 53463, 82, 73235, 5830, 96618, 3365, 4210, 304, 10034, 649, 7417, 25702, 734, 555, 47594, 20545, 11, 5044, 11, 323, 3575, 99246, 7512, 13, 578, 7106, 5820, 323, 10723, 5357, 2631, 304, 10034, 649, 1101, 7417, 14584, 5178, 323, 8244, 25702, 4500, 382, 20, 13, 3146, 37, 537, 388, 98646, 323, 3700, 325, 424, 685, 96618, 40551, 10034, 7612, 26434, 11, 2653, 990, 11, 323, 99841, 13, 4314, 7512, 649, 15025, 311, 1023, 5789, 315, 2324, 11, 1778, 439, 48709, 323, 7076, 11, 10695, 7931, 2274, 264, 3831, 990, 65947, 323, 264, 6650, 40543, 382, 28589, 11, 5737, 10034, 649, 617, 264, 7029, 2134, 315, 7720, 430, 13334, 7953, 7106, 17479, 323, 29703, 5178, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=N