? I am a knight, a warrior, a defender of the realm. It is my duty, my honor, my very purpose. And so I shall don this armor once more, and ride into the fray, and fight for what is right.\n\n"But oh, the doubts that plague me still. The fear of failure, the fear of death, the fear of being forgotten. Ah, Sir Edward, you are a complex man, indeed. A mix of valor and vulnerability, of strength and weakness.\n\n"But for now, I shall put aside these doubts, and focus on the task at hand. For the kingdom, for my comrades, for my own honor, I shall ride into battle, and may the gods be with me."\n\n(The knight takes a deep breath, his eyes burning with determination, and exits the room, ready to face whatever lies ahead.)', token_ids=[83696, 47709, 13656, 1603, 264, 3544, 11, 40545, 349, 18327, 304, 813, 53279, 11, 43468, 813, 20634, 323, 342, 6795, 520, 813, 22599, 13, 1283, 21881, 311, 5678, 11, 813, 7899, 3428, 323, 39471, 1413, 9456, 1, 25797, 11, 17177, 22653, 11, 279, 76813, 478, 315, 1124, 682, 13, 2582, 779, 814, 2019, 13, 2030, 1148, 15812, 24923, 420, 20634, 11, 420, 9699, 323, 18012, 12811, 30, 362, 4851, 430, 34427, 449, 10712, 11, 264, 4059, 430, 89248, 364, 12840, 422, 6, 1980, 7189, 1781, 315, 279, 25572, 358, 3077, 21095, 11, 279, 6680, 358, 3077, 74125, 11, 279, 6439, 358, 3077, 4529, 13, 1628, 369, 1148, 30, 2100, 430, 279, 26135, 1253, 387, 6220, 30, 2100, 430, 279, 11734, 1253, 31402, 44222, 30, 2582, 374, 433, 369, 279, 54904, 315, 279, 4465, 11, 279, 13270, 315, 79492, 439, 279, 41003, 315, 9699, 389, 9699, 71057, 1555, 279, 52473, 1980, 7189, 1781, 315, 856, 67128, 11, 21536, 323, 8208, 13, 11205, 12580, 84758, 757, 2103, 11, 872, 43214, 323, 13599, 82, 92781, 555, 279, 9439, 11, 6453, 9578, 13, 1628, 358, 5895, 11, 574, 433, 682, 5922, 433, 30, 15148, 433, 5922, 279, 2853, 1980, 42513, 1148, 5873, 656, 358, 617, 30, 358, 1097, 264, 47709, 11, 264, 38490, 11, 264, 29315, 315, 279, 22651, 13, 1102, 374, 856, 14523, 11, 856, 16044, 11, 856, 1633, 758