Output~2025-04-24 16:54:50.212476: [RequestOutput(request_id=625, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story about a doctor and his patient ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 10896, 323, 813, 8893, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a story about a doctor and his patient:\n\nDr. Smith had been a doctor for over 20 years, and he had seen it all. From broken bones to chronic illnesses, he had treated patients of all ages and backgrounds. But despite his vast experience, he still got nervous before each new patient\'s appointment. What if he missed something? What if he couldn\'t help them?\n\nAs he walked into the examination room, he saw a young woman, no more than 25 years old, sitting nervously on the edge of the bed. She looked up at him with tears in her eyes, and Dr. Smith\'s heart went out to her.\n\n"Hi, I\'m Dr. Smith," he said, trying to sound calm and reassuring. "I\'m here to help you with whatever\'s going on. Can you tell me a little bit about what brings you in today?"\n\nThe woman, whose name was Sarah, explained that she had been experiencing severe stomach pain and nausea for the past few weeks. She had tried over-the-counter medications and home remedies, but nothing seemed to be working. Dr. Smith listened attentively, taking notes and asking questions to clarify her symptoms.\n\nAfter a thorough examination, Dr. Smith ordered some tests to rule out any serious underlying conditions. The results came back a few days later, and Dr. Smith was relieved to find that Sarah\'s symptoms were likely caused by a simple case of food poisoning.\n\nHe explained the diagnosis to Sarah, and she was relieved to know that it wasn\'t anything more serious. Dr. Smith prescribed her some medication to help alleviate her symptoms and advised her to take it easy for a few days.\n\nAs Sarah left the office, Dr. Smith couldn\'t help but feel a sense of satisfaction. He had helped another patient, and he knew that he had made a difference in her life. It was moments like these that reminded him why he became a doctor in the first place - to help people, to make a difference.\n\nAs he walked back to his office, Dr. Smith felt a sense of calm wash over him. He knew that he had done his best, and that was all anyone could ask for. He took a deep breath, feeling grateful for the opportunity to make a difference in the world, one patient at a time.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 10896, 323, 813, 8893, 1473, 9023, 13, 9259, 1047, 1027, 264, 10896, 369, 927, 220, 508, 1667, 11, 323, 568, 1047, 3970, 433, 682, 13, 5659, 11102, 25896, 311, 21249, 49909, 11, 568, 1047, 12020, 6978, 315, 682, 17051, 323, 36576, 13, 2030, 8994, 813, 13057, 3217, 11, 568, 2103, 2751, 23418, 1603, 1855, 502, 8893, 596, 18101, 13, 3639, 422, 568, 13942, 2555, 30, 3639, 422, 568, 7846, 956, 1520, 1124, 1980, 2170, 568, 15203, 1139, 279, 24481, 3130, 11, 568, 5602, 264, 3995, 5333, 11, 912, 810, 1109, 220, 914, 1667, 2362, 11, 11961, 20233, 7162, 389, 279, 6964, 315, 279, 4950, 13, 3005, 7111, 709, 520, 1461, 449, 24014, 304, 1077, 6548, 11, 323, 2999, 13, 9259, 596, 4851, 4024, 704, 311, 1077, 382, 1, 13347, 11, 358, 2846, 2999, 13, 9259, 1359, 568, 1071, 11, 4560, 311, 5222, 19858, 323, 82964, 13, 330, 40, 2846, 1618, 311, 1520, 499, 449, 8996, 596, 2133, 389, 13, 3053, 499, 3371, 757, 264, 2697, 2766, 922, 1148, 12716, 499, 304, 3432, 12241, 791, 5333, 11, 6832, 836, 574, 21077, 11, 11497, 43