#convenience"\n* "Did you know that [interesting medical fact]? Stay informed and take control of your health! #healthyliving #medicalfacts"\n\n**Hashtags:** #healthyliving #medicalprofessional #patientcare #telemedicine #wellness #medicine\n\nThis profile aims to showcase the doctor\'s professional credentials, while also highlighting their friendly and approachable personality. The tweets are designed to be informative, engaging, and relevant to the doctor\'s patients and followers.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 4754, 6405, 5643, 369, 264, 6593, 10896, 1473, 334, 11362, 68063, 571, 9023, 42985, 6204, 271, 334, 8694, 25586, 68063, 362, 6721, 6685, 315, 279, 10896, 304, 264, 4251, 23724, 11, 449, 264, 11919, 323, 5603, 481, 15648, 382, 334, 4137, 4758, 68063, 362, 4092, 2217, 315, 264, 8952, 477, 6593, 12764, 11, 449, 264, 27545, 20779, 2515, 311, 3041, 433, 264, 6617, 1427, 382, 334, 60360, 68063, 330, 53654, 19150, 765, 64888, 349, 922, 24944, 25363, 8893, 2512, 765, 57135, 6593, 26793, 11, 10631, 11, 323, 9013, 765, 6914, 596, 4667, 323, 4822, 9498, 3871, 17642, 334, 8694, 26496, 25, 57277, 9, 16406, 25, 510, 2185, 16928, 12816, 44774, 916, 9725, 1277, 1129, 2185, 16928, 12816, 44774, 916, 8, 320, 64, 2723, 311, 279, 10896, 596, 4443, 3997, 477, 6593, 6725, 340, 9, 8463, 25, 510, 3696, 34117, 31, 3055, 12816, 44774, 916, 9725, 39626, 25, 3696, 34117, 31, 3055, 12816, 44774, 916, 8, 320, 64, 6721, 2613, 2686, 369, 6978, 311, 5662, 704, 340, 9, 14642, 5742, 25, 220, 14148, 12, 14148, 12, 14148, 20, 320, 64, 4641, 1396, 369, 6978, 311, 9899, 37256, 477, 2610, 4860, 696, 334, 51, 26488, 25, 57277, 9, 330, 10156, 4756, 264, 502, 5117, 1772, 389, 279, 12939, 315, 5912, 1817, 27859, 0, 4557, 433, 1618, 25, 510, 2125, 311, 5117, 1772, 60, 674, 12393, 4010, 2299, 674, 93755, 535, 10727, 702, 9, 330, 42821, 1639, 311, 22203, 430, 1057, 6593, 6725, 374, 1457, 10209, 8122, 83543, 37256, 0, 29837, 9498, 505, 279, 6981, 315, 701, 1866, 2162, 13, 674, 15772, 83543, 674, 444, 406