 vessels used to transport scuba divers to and from dive sites\n10. Dive lights: underwater lights used to illuminate dark or murky water, allowing divers to see more clearly\n11. Wreck diving: exploring shipwrecks and other underwater structures\n12. Night diving: diving at night, often using specialized equipment and techniques to navigate and communicate underwater\n13. Technical diving: advanced diving techniques and equipment used for deeper, longer, or more complex dives\n14. Dive insurance: insurance policies that cover scuba diving accidents and injuries\n15. Dive resorts: resorts that offer scuba diving packages and accommodations for divers.\n\nI hope this list is helpful! Let me know if you have any further requests.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 3673, 5552, 311, 1156, 31529, 43515, 1473, 16, 13, 2522, 31529, 14787, 25, 7056, 11, 97806, 301, 11, 66079, 11, 289, 1441, 3159, 11, 40704, 11, 75720, 6709, 2585, 3756, 320, 5002, 35, 705, 13192, 11, 323, 14661, 198, 17, 13, 89617, 19002, 25, 7766, 430, 3839, 30963, 892, 11, 8149, 11, 323, 1023, 16595, 12195, 311, 6106, 6220, 43515, 12659, 198, 18, 13, 89617, 6732, 25, 5526, 10687, 369, 1156, 31529, 43515, 11, 1778, 439, 53103, 92822, 11, 8448, 86, 265, 14895, 11, 323, 46474, 76304, 82, 198, 19, 13, 23820, 2324, 25, 7795, 11, 9581, 72503, 11, 61535, 11, 45220, 11, 323, 1023, 72491, 20566, 430, 649, 387, 3970, 1418, 1156, 31529, 43515, 198, 20, 13, 89617, 82571, 25, 4967, 7620, 430, 4639, 1156, 31529, 43515, 7512, 323, 7296, 16346, 11, 1778, 439, 393, 34885, 11, 21317, 2327, 11, 323, 328, 14137, 198, 21, 13, 89617, 9293, 25, 9293, 323, 18459, 369, 264, 30963, 11, 2737, 13598, 9282, 4787, 11, 259, 3422, 11, 323, 3090, 9499, 198, 22, 13, 9636, 13284, 24685, 25, 40880, 5448, 315, 29691, 2324, 323, 46474, 51331, 1701, 28175, 18632, 323, 7241, 198, 23, 13, 2522, 31529, 43515, 7296, 25, 61003, 323, 13147, 16346, 311, 6106, 264, 6220, 323, 32180, 30963, 11, 1778, 439, 37772, 12621, 323, 13147, 24463, 8312, 198,