Output~2025-04-24 16:57:03.989520: [RequestOutput(request_id=669, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Give an example of a miscommunication between two people. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 21335, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 5906, 51271, 1990, 1403, 1274, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here\'s an example of a miscommunication between two people:\n\n**Scenario:** John and Emily are planning a weekend getaway to the beach. John sends Emily a text message saying, "Meet me at the beach at 10 am on Saturday."\n\n**Emily\'s understanding:** Emily reads the message and assumes that John means they should meet at the beach at 10 am on Saturday to start their trip, and that they will be leaving from her place at that time.\n\n**John\'s intention:** John meant to say that they should meet at the beach at 10 am on Saturday to start their trip, but he didn\'t specify where they would be leaving from. He was planning to pick Emily up from her place at 9 am and then head to the beach together.\n\n**The miscommunication:** When Emily shows up at her place at 10 am on Saturday, John is nowhere to be found. She waits for a bit, thinking that he\'s running late, but then realizes that he never said where they were supposed to meet. She tries calling him, but he doesn\'t answer. Emily is confused and frustrated, thinking that John has stood her up.\n\n**The resolution:** John eventually shows up at Emily\'s place, apologizing for the misunderstanding. He explains that he meant to say they would meet at the beach, but didn\'t specify where they would be leaving from. Emily is relieved that everything is okay, but also frustrated that they almost missed their trip due to the miscommunication. They decide to clarify their plans more clearly in the future to avoid similar misunderstandings.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 5906, 51271, 1990, 1403, 1274, 1473, 334, 55131, 68063, 3842, 323, 35266, 527, 9293, 264, 9178, 70993, 311, 279, 11573, 13, 3842, 22014, 35266, 264, 1495, 1984, 5605, 11, 330, 41651, 757, 520, 279, 11573, 520, 220, 605, 1097, 389, 7884, 2266, 334, 85148, 596, 8830, 68063, 35266, 16181, 279, 1984, 323, 22204, 430, 3842, 3445, 814, 1288, 3449, 520, 279, 11573, 520, 220, 605, 1097, 389, 7884, 311, 1212, 872, 8577, 11, 323, 430, 814, 690, 387, 9564, 505, 1077, 2035, 520, 430, 892, 382, 334, 13379, 596, 14944, 68063, 3842, 8967, 311, 2019, 430, 814, 1288, 3449, 520, 279, 11573, 520, 220, 605, 1097, 389, 7884, 311, 1212, 872, 8577, 11, 719, 568, 3287, 956, 14158, 1405, 814, 1053, 387, 9564, 505, 13, 1283, 574, 9293, 311, 3820, 35266, 709, 505, 1077, 2035, 520, 220, 24, 1097, 323, 1243, 2010, 311, 279, 11573, 3871, 382, 334, 791, 5906, 51271, 68063, 3277, 35266, 5039, 709, 520, 1077, 2035, 520, 220, 605, 1097, 389, 7884, 11, 3842, 374, 28211, 311, 387, 1766, 13, 3005, 48036, 369, 264, 2766, 11, 7422, 430, 568, 596, 4401, 3389, 11, 719, 1243, 52694, 430, 568, 2646, 1071, 1405, 814, 1051, 10171, 311, 3449, 13, 3005, 16696, 8260, 1461, 11, 719, 568, 3250, 956, 4320, 13, 35266, 374, 22568, 323, 33630, 11, 7422, 430, 3842, 706, 14980, 1077, 709, 382, 334, 791, 11175, 68063, 3842, 9778, 5039, 709, 520, 35266, 596, 2035, 11, 21050, 4954, 369, 279, 70847, 13, 1283, 15100, 430, 568, 8967, 311, 2019, 814, 1053, 3449, 520, 279, 11573, 11, 719, 3287, 956, 14158, 1405, 814, 1053, 387, 9564, 505, 13, 35266, 374, 51512, 430, 4395, 374, 17339, 11, 719, 1101, 33630, 430, 814, 4661, 13942, 872, 8577, 4245, 311, 279, 5906,