 led the company's growth from a small startup to a global electric vehicle leader. However, his tenure has also been marked by controversy, including a series of high-profile tweets and a Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) settlement.\n* Jeff Bezos: Founded Amazon in 1994 and has been the CEO since then. Under his leadership, Amazon has grown from an online bookstore to a global e-commerce giant, with a market capitalization of over $1 trillion. The company has also expanded into new areas such as cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and media production.\n\nBased on this information, it's clear that Jeff Bezos has had the most successful tenure as a CEO, with Amazon's market capitalization and growth far surpassing that of the other three CEOs.", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 11, 358, 1053, 2019, 430, 12149, 2893, 54801, 1047, 279, 1455, 6992, 40061, 439, 264, 12432, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 10015, 12399, 315, 1855, 12432, 596, 40061, 1473, 9, 4488, 67034, 25, 3623, 83208, 5690, 304, 220, 1049, 19, 323, 706, 1027, 279, 12432, 2533, 1243, 13, 6104, 5690, 706, 15042, 311, 3719, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 5526, 3674, 3772, 15771, 304, 279, 1917, 11, 1202, 5708, 3430, 706, 1027, 17509, 323, 706, 17011, 12387, 86893, 2391, 813, 40061, 627, 9, 8766, 36593, 25, 3623, 83208, 5210, 304, 220, 4468, 20, 323, 10434, 439, 12432, 3156, 220, 1049, 15, 13, 12220, 813, 40061, 11, 5210, 6244, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 6992, 323, 34235, 5220, 304, 279, 1917, 11, 449, 264, 3157, 6864, 2065, 315, 927, 400, 2636, 7239, 13, 4452, 11, 279, 2883, 706, 17011, 5199, 11774, 304, 3293, 1667, 11, 2737, 3276, 85971, 43986, 323, 43848, 3157, 4430, 627, 9, 69639, 40638, 25, 3623, 83208, 36431, 304, 220, 2550, 23, 323, 3010, 18538, 63024, 323, 28298, 13, 1283, 706, 1027, 279, 12432, 315, 28298, 2533, 220, 1049, 23, 323, 706, 6197, 279, 2883, 596, 6650, 505, 264, 2678, 21210, 311, 264, 3728, 9249, 7458, 7808, 13, 4452, 11, 813, 40061, 706, 1101, 1027, 13160, 555, 26654, 11, 2737, 264, 4101, 315, 157