s: (assuming no change in prepaid expenses, as no information is provided)\n\t\t- Increase in accrued expenses: (assuming no change in accrued expenses, as no information is provided)\n* Cash flows from operations: $1,200\n\n**Cash Flows from Investing**\n\n* Purchase of property, plant, and equipment: ($2,100)\n\n**Cash Flows from Financing**\n\n* Proceeds from issuance of debt: $3,200\n* Repayment of debt: (assuming no repayment of debt, as no information is provided)\n* Dividends paid: (assuming no dividends paid, as no information is provided)\n\n**Net Change in Cash**\n\n* Beginning cash balance: (assuming no beginning cash balance, as no information is provided)\n* Ending cash balance: $1,200 + $2,100 - $3,200 = $100\n\n**Ending Cash Balance**: $100', token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 5224, 315, 8515, 28555, 369, 279, 2728, 2626, 1473, 334, 8806, 315, 23139, 3061, 4336, 57277, 334, 48541, 3061, 4336, 505, 25927, 57277, 9, 9558, 8070, 25, 400, 22, 11, 2636, 198, 9, 28295, 1392, 311, 64508, 4272, 8070, 311, 8515, 28555, 505, 7677, 512, 197, 10, 4241, 2827, 7246, 323, 93364, 2065, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 94189, 323, 93364, 2065, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 197, 10, 29240, 304, 3318, 6864, 9815, 512, 197, 197, 12, 40733, 304, 9815, 2215, 43672, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 2349, 304, 9815, 2215, 43672, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 197, 197, 12, 40733, 304, 9815, 45691, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 2349, 304, 9815, 45691, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 197, 197, 12, 40733, 304, 15808, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 2349, 304, 15808, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 197, 197, 12, 40733, 304, 83776, 18512, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 2349, 304, 83776, 18512, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 197, 197, 12, 40733, 304, 99216, 18512, 25, 320, 66463, 912, 2349, 304, 99216, 18512, 11, 439, 912, 2038, 374, 3984, 340, 9, 23139, 28555, 505, 7677, 25, 400, 16, 11, 1049, 271, 334, 48541, 3061, 4336, 505, 93696, 57277, 9, 32088, 315, 3424, 11, 6136, 11, 323, 7241, 25, 1746, 17, 11, 1041, 696, 33