Output~2025-04-24 16:58:31.275874: [RequestOutput(request_id=706, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a recipe for a Creamy Tomato Soup. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 11363, 369, 264, 30800, 88, 94091, 61434, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Creamy Tomato Soup Recipe**\n\n Servings: 4-6\n\n**Ingredients:**\n\n* 2 tablespoons butter\n* 1 medium onion, chopped\n* 3 cloves garlic, minced\n* 2 cups chopped fresh tomatoes (or 1 can of diced tomatoes, 14.5 oz)\n* 1 cup chicken or vegetable broth\n* 1/2 cup heavy cream or half-and-half\n* 1 teaspoon dried basil\n* Salt and pepper, to taste\n* Freshly grated Parmesan cheese, for serving (optional)\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1. In a large pot, melt the butter over medium heat. Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.\n2. Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.\n3. Add the chopped fresh tomatoes (or canned diced tomatoes) and cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally, until they start to break down and release their juices.\n4. Pour in the chicken or vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.\n5. Reduce the heat to low and let the soup simmer for 20-25 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the flavors have melded together and the soup has thickened slightly.\n6. Use an immersion blender or a regular blender to puree the soup until smooth.\n7. Stir in the heavy cream or half-and-half and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until heated through.\n8. Season the soup with salt, pepper, and dried basil to taste.\n9. Serve the soup hot, topped with a sprinkle of freshly grated Parmesan cheese if desired.\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n* For a creamier soup, use more heavy cream or half-and-half.\n* For a lighter soup, use less heavy cream or substitute with Greek yogurt or sour cream.\n* Add a pinch of sugar to balance out the acidity of the tomatoes.\n* Experiment with different herbs, such as oregano or thyme, for a unique flavor profile.\n* Serve with a swirl of cream or a sprinkle of croutons for added texture and visual appeal.\n\nEnjoy your delicious and comforting Creamy Tomato Soup!', token_ids=[334, 99881, 88, 94091, 61434, 26371, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 14432, 198, 9, 220, 16, 11298, 38427, 11, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 18, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 38525, 7878, 41613, 320, 269, 220, 16, 649, 315, 89964, 41613, 11, 220, 975, 13, 20, 25616, 340, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 16553, 477, 36581, 45993, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 8987, 12932, 477, 4376, 9976, 34902, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 32720, 68186, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 30260, 398, 97276, 56744, 63524, 17604, 11, 369, 13788, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 763, 264, 3544, 3419, 11, 30099, 279, 14432, 927, 11298, 8798, 13, 2758, 279, 38525, 38427, 323, 4394, 3156, 90158, 11, 922, 220, 20, 4520, 627, 17, 13, 2758, 279, 94927, 31735, 323, 4394, 369, 459, 5217, 220, 16, 12, 17, 4520, 11, 3156, 8508, 35534, 627, 18, 13, 2758, 279, 38525, 7878, 41613, 320, 269, 64114, 89964, 41613, 8, 323, 4394, 369, 220, 20, 12, 22, 4520, 11, 55054, 23781, 11, 3156, 814, 1212, 311, 1464, 1523, 323, 4984, 872, 65959, 627, 19, 13, 27058, 304, 279, 16553, 477, 36581, 45993, 323, 4546, 279, 21655, 311, 264, 62915, 627, 20, 13, 53253, 279, 8798, 311, 3428, 323, 1095, 279, 19724, 62915, 369, 220, 508, 12, 914, 4520, 11, 55054, 23