te expenses.\n\n**Timeline:**\n\n* 1 week before Thanksgiving: Make the cranberry sauce and store it in the fridge.\n* 2-3 days before Thanksgiving: Prepare the stuffing and store it in the fridge.\n* Thanksgiving Day: Roast the turkey breast, prepare the mashed potatoes, green bean casserole, and pumpkin pie.\n* After Thanksgiving: Use leftover turkey to make sandwiches or soups, and freeze any leftover sides for future meals.\n\n**Tips for Cooking:**\n\n* Use a slow cooker to cook the turkey breast and make the mashed potatoes.\n* Make the green bean casserole ahead of time and refrigerate or freeze until ready to bake.\n* Use a store-bought pie crust to make the pumpkin pie, or make your own crust using a simple recipe.\n* Don't be afraid to get creative and adjust the menu to suit your tastes and dietary needs.\n\nBy following this plan, you can enjoy a delicious and budget-friendly Thanksgiving meal without breaking", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3197, 369, 264, 8199, 22658, 37250, 15496, 1473, 334, 3598, 25, 57277, 9, 4802, 17026, 25, 12093, 15386, 17442, 57598, 449, 2895, 5781, 198, 9, 17072, 423, 21168, 512, 197, 10, 386, 13883, 14020, 20798, 198, 197, 10, 7997, 34823, 26520, 261, 1286, 198, 197, 10, 46586, 287, 320, 985, 51451, 16385, 323, 24822, 340, 197, 10, 67530, 15717, 61276, 320, 35940, 29532, 1701, 7878, 477, 20268, 70637, 36989, 340, 9, 70596, 531, 25, 76357, 41097, 320, 35940, 29532, 1701, 64114, 50625, 10748, 68, 323, 3637, 1481, 2509, 40712, 696, 334, 64001, 15996, 2996, 25, 57277, 9, 17442, 57598, 320, 19, 12, 20, 29160, 1680, 400, 605, 22104, 717, 198, 9, 14020, 20798, 320, 19, 12, 20, 1680, 400, 16, 13, 1135, 22104, 17, 198, 9, 7997, 81836, 320, 16, 19398, 1680, 400, 16, 13, 1135, 22104, 17, 198, 9, 46586, 287, 14293, 320, 48616, 11, 24822, 11, 42393, 1680, 400, 17, 22104, 18, 198, 9, 67530, 36989, 320, 72408, 477, 20268, 1680, 400, 17, 22104, 18, 198, 9, 76357, 10748, 68, 320, 66, 7443, 1680, 400, 16, 22104, 17, 198, 9, 41097, 40712, 320, 4412,