Output~2025-04-24 17:02:31.842437: [RequestOutput(request_id=814, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a short story about a visit to a museum. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 2875, 3446, 922, 264, 4034, 311, 264, 24925, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="As I walked through the grand entrance of the museum, I couldn't help but feel a sense of excitement and curiosity. I had been looking forward to this visit for weeks, and finally, I was here. The museum was a sprawling complex of modern architecture, with sleek glass and steel walls that seemed to stretch on forever.\n\nI had planned my visit carefully, making a list of the exhibits I wanted to see and the artifacts I wanted to learn more about. My first stop was the ancient civilizations gallery, where I was immediately struck by the sheer scale and grandeur of the artifacts on display. I wandered through the rows of glass cases, taking in the intricate carvings, the delicate pottery, and the imposing statues.\n\nAs I turned a corner, I stumbled upon a particularly impressive exhibit: a reconstructed ancient city, complete with crumbling stone buildings and a bustling marketplace. I felt as though I had stepped back in time, and I couldn't help but imagine what life must have been like for the people who once lived here.\n\nNext, I made my way to the art gallery, where I was blown away by the stunning works on display. I spent hours admiring the masterpieces, from the bold brushstrokes of the Impressionists to the intricate details of the Renaissance paintings.\n\nAs the day wore on, I began to feel a sense of fatigue creeping in. My feet ached from standing for so long, and my eyes felt dry from staring at so many works of art. But I was determined to see everything, and I pressed on, fueled by my curiosity and enthusiasm.\n\nFinally, as the museum began to close, I made my way to the gift shop. I had been eyeing a beautiful book on ancient civilizations, and I couldn't resist the urge to buy it. As I left the museum, I felt a sense of satisfaction and fulfillment. I had seen so many incredible things, and I had learned so much. It had been a truly unforgettable visit, and I couldn't wait to come back again.", token_ids=[2170, 358, 15203, 1555, 279, 6800, 20396, 315, 279, 24925, 11, 358, 7846, 956, 1520, 719, 2733, 264, 5647, 315, 28361, 323, 41328, 13, 358, 1047, 1027, 3411, 4741, 311, 420, 4034, 369, 5672, 11, 323, 5616, 11, 358, 574, 1618, 13, 578, 24925, 574, 264, 71992, 6485, 315, 6617, 18112, 11, 449, 48494, 9168, 323, 9699, 14620, 430, 9508, 311, 14841, 389, 16058, 382, 40, 1047, 13205, 856, 4034, 15884, 11, 3339, 264, 1160, 315, 279, 50829, 358, 4934, 311, 1518, 323, 279, 36136, 358, 4934, 311, 4048, 810, 922, 13, 3092, 1176, 3009, 574, 279, 14154, 86569, 18537, 11, 1405, 358, 574, 7214, 17948, 555, 279, 33638, 5569, 323, 6800, 12844, 315, 279, 36136, 389, 3113, 13, 358, 82294, 1555, 279, 7123, 315, 9168, 5157, 11, 4737, 304, 279, 57216, 1841, 85, 826, 11, 279, 36301, 83763, 11, 323, 279, 49941, 59002, 382, 2170, 358, 6656, 264, 9309, 11, 358, 50157, 5304, 264, 8104, 16358, 31324, 25, 264, 83104, 14154, 3363, 11, 4686, 449, 89417, 9998, 14016, 323, 264, 90256, 30633, 13, 358, 6612, 439, 3582, 358, 1047, 25319, 1203, 304, 892, 11, 323, 358, 7846, 956, 1520, 719, 13085, 1148, 2324, 2011, 617, 1027, 1093, 369, 279, 1274, 889, 3131, 12439, 1618, 382, 5971, 11, 358, 1903, 856, 1648, 311, 279, 1989, 18537, 11, 1405, 358, 574, 36574,