 Spices (e.g. oregano, basil, cumin, chili powder)\n* Tomato sauce (for spaghetti)\n* Taco seasoning (for tacos)\n* Stir-fry sauce (optional)\n\n**Miscellaneous:**\n\n* Salad dressing (for salads)\n* Beverages (e.g. milk, juice, water)\n\nFeel free to adjust this list based on your personal preferences and dietary needs. Enjoy your meals!", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 21644, 499, 3077, 13205, 369, 279, 2046, 11, 1618, 596, 264, 12090, 30687, 1160, 1473, 334, 1360, 13677, 25, 57277, 9, 30260, 24822, 512, 197, 10, 18366, 58573, 320, 2000, 23935, 2269, 894, 340, 197, 10, 1952, 919, 320, 2000, 23935, 2269, 894, 323, 85501, 340, 197, 10, 8529, 20798, 320, 2000, 88010, 323, 85501, 340, 197, 10, 6914, 83, 10743, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 197, 10, 356, 321, 87290, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 9, 30260, 42393, 512, 197, 10, 67070, 320, 2000, 88010, 340, 9, 30260, 14098, 512, 197, 10, 1883, 645, 477, 1023, 14098, 369, 4224, 9162, 271, 334, 7979, 266, 14, 1360, 39340, 25, 57277, 9, 26486, 25309, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 9, 46701, 1752, 11, 6930, 1752, 16553, 37449, 320, 2000, 61733, 16553, 340, 9, 3165, 65065, 320, 2000, 88010, 696, 334, 6600, 1771, 25, 57277, 9, 98446, 320, 2000, 88010, 340, 9, 56927, 34344, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 9, 30616, 320, 2000, 23935, 2269, 894, 696, 334, 35, 22704, 26729, 70, 5981, 25, 57277, 9, 56744, 63524, 17604, 320, 2000, 88010, 340, 9, 1443, 33874, 291, 17604, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 9, 76892, 320, 2000, 17954, 477, 439, 264, 61376, 369, 23935, 2269, 894, 696, 334, 47, 32310, 25, 57277, 9, 356, 7443, 41613, 320, 2000, 88010, 19737, 340, 9, 47814, 5707, 320, 2000, 17677, 340, 9, 63103, 19737, 320, 2000, 23935, 2269, 894, 340, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 320, 2000, 87319, 340, 9, 3165, 1238, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 297, 1610, 5770, 11, 68186, 11, 272, 10318, 11, 59717, 17138, 340, 9, 94091, 19737, 320, 2000, 88010, 340, 9, 79997, 87319, 320, 2000, 85501, 340, 9, 65292, 2269, 894, 19737, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 52079, 41242, 25, 57277, 9, 64646, 32623, 320, 2000, 77852, 34