Output~2025-04-24 17:03:06.083578: [RequestOutput(request_id=824, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a story about a child\'s first day of school ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 1716, 596, 1176, 1938, 315, 2978, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='It was a sunny Monday morning, and Emma was beyond excited to start her first day of school. She had been waiting for this day for what felt like forever, and she couldn\'t wait to put on her brand new uniform and meet her new classmates.\n\nAs she got dressed, Emma\'s mom helped her brush her hair and tie her shoes. Emma\'s mom had made her favorite breakfast, pancakes with strawberries and whipped cream, and Emma gobbled it up quickly. She was so focused on getting to school on time that she almost forgot to grab her backpack.\n\nAs they walked to school, Emma\'s mom asked her what she was most looking forward to about her first day. Emma thought for a moment before responding, "I want to make new friends and learn new things!" Her mom smiled and gave her a hug. "I know you will, sweetie. You\'re going to do great."\n\nWhen they arrived at school, Emma\'s mom gave her a big hug and a kiss. "I\'ll be here to pick you up after school, okay?" Emma nodded, took a deep breath, and walked into her classroom.\n\nThe teacher, Mrs. Johnson, greeted Emma with a warm smile. "Welcome, Emma! I\'m so glad you\'re here. Why don\'t you go find a seat and get settled in?" Emma looked around the room, taking in the colorful posters and the rows of desks. She spotted an empty seat next to a girl with curly brown hair and a big smile.\n\nAs she sat down, the girl introduced herself as Olivia. "Hi, I\'m Olivia! I\'ve never seen you before. Are you new here?" Emma nodded, and Olivia asked her what her name was. Emma told her, and they started chatting about their summer vacations and favorite TV shows.\n\nThroughout the day, Emma made more friends, including a boy named Max who loved dinosaurs and a girl named Ava who loved reading. They played with blocks, sang songs, and did a fun art project.\n\nAt recess, Emma and her new friends ran around the playground, laughing and playing tag. Emma felt like she was flying, her heart full of joy and excitement.\n\nWhen the bell rang, signaling the end of the day, Emma\'s mom was waiting for her in the pickup line. Emma ran to her, beaming with pride. "Mom, I had the best day ever! I made new friends and learned so much. Can I go back tomorrow?"\n\nHer mom smiled and hugged her tight. "Of course, sweetie. You\'re going', token_ids=[2181, 574, 264, 40798, 7159, 6693, 11, 323, 36035, 574, 7953, 12304, 311, 1212, 1077, 1176, 1938, 315, 2978, 13, 3005, 1047, 1027, 8748, 369, 420, 1938, 369, 1148, 6612, 1093, 16058, 11, 323, 1364, 7846, 956, 3868, 311, 2231, 389, 1077, 6883, 502, 14113, 323, 3449, 1077, 502, 61190, 382, 2170, 1364, 2751, 26435, 11, 36035, 596, 3450, 9087, 1077, 15998, 1077, 7013, 323, 18623, 1077, 15653, 13, 36035, 596, 3450, 1047, 1903, 1077, 7075, 17954, 11, 80960, 449, 76203, 323, 64357, 12932, 11, 323, 36035, 342, 92046, 433, 709, 6288, 13, 3005, 574, 779, 10968, 389, 3794, 311, 2978, 389, 892, 430, 1364, 4661, 29695, 311, 11894, 1077, 34236, 382, 2170, 814, 15203, 311, 2978, 11, 36035, 596, 3450, 4691, 1077, 1148, 1364, 574, 1455, 3411, 4741, 311, 922, 1077, 1176, 1938, 13, 36035, 3463, 369, 264, 4545, 1603, 30438, 11, 330, 40, 1390, 311, 1304, 502, 4885, 323, 4048, 502, 2574, 9135, 6385, 34