sa made with diced avocado, lime juice, and cilantro.\n\nThis dish is a great match for the ingredients because:\n\n* Chicken breasts provide a lean and protein-rich base for the dish.\n* Black beans could be added to the fajita mixture for extra fiber and texture.\n* Bell peppers and onions add a crunchy sweetness and a burst of flavor.\n* Tomatoes could be diced and added to the salsa for extra juiciness.\n* Avocado provides a creamy and rich element to the dish, while also adding healthy fats.\n* Lime juice and cilantro add a bright and fresh flavor to the dish, tying everything together.\n* Cumin adds a warm and earthy flavor, characteristic of Mexican cuisine.\n\nThis dish is a great way to showcase the flavors and textures of the ingredients, and it's perfect for a quick and easy weeknight dinner or a casual gathering with friends.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 10824, 315, 14293, 2268, 29815, 389, 279, 14293, 3984, 11, 358, 1053, 4284, 20646, 264, 18406, 323, 94631, 24160, 53161, 12269, 25, 3146, 6600, 4473, 34619, 435, 1662, 21920, 449, 7671, 47282, 328, 42926, 334, 382, 8586, 596, 264, 10015, 4096, 315, 279, 12269, 1473, 6600, 4473, 16553, 37449, 527, 3678, 15846, 304, 264, 21655, 315, 42819, 23661, 11, 272, 10318, 11, 323, 62444, 87290, 11, 1243, 61733, 311, 39143, 13, 328, 75730, 29519, 58573, 323, 45697, 527, 829, 332, 978, 291, 449, 279, 16553, 11, 7999, 264, 2477, 315, 1933, 323, 64550, 311, 279, 12269, 13, 54032, 279, 16553, 323, 24822, 449, 8369, 20415, 477, 14095, 16831, 34344, 11, 323, 1948, 449, 264, 47985, 68346, 74314, 1903, 449, 89964, 68346, 11, 42819, 23661, 11, 323, 62444, 87290, 382, 2028, 12269, 374, 264, 2294, 2489, 369, 279, 14293, 1606, 1473, 9, 34619, 37449, 3493, 264, 16025, 323, 13128, 41947, 2385, 369, 279, 12269, 627, 9, 5348, 27994, 1436, 387, 3779, 311, 279, 282, 1662, 6388, 21655, 369, 5066, 24722, 323, 10651, 627, 9, 18366, 58573, 323, 45697, 923, 264, 95333, 64550, 323, 264, 21165, 315, 17615, 627, 9, 8529, 20798, 1436, 387, 89