ind a workout buddy or join a fitness class to provide accountability and motivation.\n\nRemember, the key is to start small and be consistent. As you get into the habit of regular physical activity, you can gradually increase the duration and intensity of your workouts. With time, you\'ll find that physical activity becomes an enjoyable and essential part of your daily routine."', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 2077, 430, 13533, 264, 1648, 311, 1304, 7106, 5820, 264, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 1473, 66220, 33435, 7106, 5820, 1139, 701, 7446, 14348, 11, 358, 4284, 6041, 449, 2678, 11, 89253, 9021, 13, 19110, 555, 6376, 16038, 220, 605, 12, 868, 4520, 1855, 1938, 369, 7106, 5820, 11, 1778, 439, 4737, 264, 2875, 4321, 2212, 701, 12818, 11, 3815, 264, 2478, 30102, 503, 7977, 2391, 8518, 18808, 1418, 10307, 6007, 11, 477, 3815, 264, 4062, 27102, 14348, 304, 279, 6693, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 1456, 52913, 7106, 5820, 1139, 701, 7446, 59263, 11, 1778, 439, 4737, 279, 32249, 4619, 315, 279, 39736, 477, 11689, 477, 67180, 311, 990, 382, 14364, 1648, 311, 1304, 7106, 5820, 264, 14464, 374, 311, 9899, 433, 1139, 701, 7446, 50811, 477, 13470, 13, 19409, 7106, 5820, 439, 264, 2536, 5392, 67078, 2205, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 11, 1120, 1093, 77826, 701, 18311, 477, 4737, 264, 17639, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 63652, 433, 323, 1304, 433, 264, 13263, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 382, 50674, 11, 1505, 459, 5820, 430, 499, 4774, 11, 3508, 433, 596, 11689, 11, 4401, 11, 24269, 11, 477, 29066, 11, 323, 1304, 433, 264, 961, 315, 701, 7446, 14348, 13, 1115, 690, 1304, 433, 810, 4461, 430, 499, 3358, 9396, 311, 433, 323, 1427, 4741, 311, 433, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 1505, 264, 26308, 37772, 477, 5249, 264, 17479, 538, 311, 3493, 39242, 323, 25835, 382, 29690, 11, 279, 1401, 374, 311, 1212, 2678, 323, 387, 13263, 13, 1666, 499, 636, 1139, 279, 14464, 315, 5912, 7106, 5820, 11, 499, 649, 27115, 5376, 279, 8250, 323, 21261, 315, 701, 46944, 13, 3161, 892, 11, 499, 3358, 1505, 430, 7106, 5820, 9221,