Output~2025-04-24 17:04:03.309163: [RequestOutput(request_id=846, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a review for a book of your choice. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3477, 369, 264, 2363, 315, 701, 5873, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Book Review: "The Nightingale" by Kristin Hannah**\n\nI just finished reading "The Nightingale" by Kristin Hannah, and I must say, it\'s a masterpiece. This historical fiction novel is a powerful and emotional portrayal of the lives of two sisters in France during World War II. The story is a testament to the strength and resilience of the human spirit, and it\'s a must-read for anyone who loves historical fiction or is interested in learning more about this pivotal period in history.\n\nThe novel tells the story of Vianne and Isabelle, two sisters who are forced to navigate the treacherous landscape of occupied France. Vianne, the older and more responsible sister, is determined to keep her family safe and her home intact, while Isabelle, the younger and more impulsive sister, joins the French Resistance to fight against the Nazi occupation. As the war rages on, the sisters\' lives become increasingly complicated, and they are forced to make difficult choices that will change their lives forever.\n\nHannah\'s writing is superb, and she has a remarkable ability to transport the reader to the time and place of the story. The characters are well-developed and complex, with rich backstories that make them relatable and believable. The plot is engaging and suspenseful, with unexpected twists and turns that keep the reader on the edge of their seat.\n\nOne of the things that struck me most about this book was the way it highlighted the struggles and sacrifices that women made during World War II. The novel shows how women were forced to take on new roles and responsibilities, and how they found ways to resist and fight against the occupation. It\'s a powerful reminder of the important contributions that women made to the war effort, and it\'s a testament to their strength and courage.\n\nOverall, I highly recommend "The Nightingale" to anyone who loves historical fiction or is interested in learning more about World War II. It\'s a powerful and emotional read that will stay with you long after you finish the book.', token_ids=[334, 7280, 10506, 25, 330, 791, 13120, 287, 1604, 1, 555, 27973, 258, 48361, 57277, 40, 1120, 8220, 5403, 330, 791, 13120, 287, 1604, 1, 555, 27973, 258, 48361, 11, 323, 358, 2011, 2019, 11, 433, 596, 264, 59831, 13, 1115, 13970, 17422, 11775, 374, 264, 8147, 323, 14604, 75033, 315, 279, 6439, 315, 1403, 30393, 304, 9822, 2391, 4435, 5111, 8105, 13, 578, 3446, 374, 264, 61300, 311, 279, 8333, 323, 56062, 315, 279, 3823, 9090, 11, 323, 433, 596, 264, 2011, 29906, 369, 5606, 889, 16180, 13970, 17422, 477, 374, 8173, 304, 6975, 810, 922, 420, 60850, 4261, 304, 3925, 382, 791, 11775, 10975, 279, 3446, 315, 650, 64452, 323, 2209, 55267, 11, 1403, 30393, 889, 527, 9770, 311, 21546, 279, 4353, 11252, 788, 18921, 315, 25366, 9822, 13, 650, 64452, 11, 279, 9191, 323, 810, 8647, 13219, 11, 374, 11075, 311, 2567, 1077, 3070, 6220, 323, 1077, 2162, 35539, 11, 1418, 2209, 55267, 11, 279, 14992, 323, 810, 3242, 58921, 13219, 11, 29782, 279, 8753, 40980, 311, 4465, 2403, 279, 32527, 30747, 13, 1666, 279, 4208, 436, 1154, 389, 11, 279, 30393, 6, 6439, 3719, 15098, 17395, 11, 323, 814, 527, 9770, 311, 1304, 5107, 11709, 430, 690, 2349, 872, 6439,