althy and satisfying snack. Cost: $1.25\n* Fresh fruit: A banana or apple makes for a quick and easy snack. Cost: $0.50\n\n**Total cost for the day:** $11.25\n\nThis meal plan includes a variety of healthy and delicious options that can be made on a limited budget. The ingredients are affordable and can be found at most grocery stores. You can also customize the meal plan to suit your personal preferences and dietary needs.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 6205, 15496, 3197, 369, 4423, 889, 6944, 311, 8343, 9498, 323, 706, 264, 7347, 8199, 369, 16986, 1473, 334, 23340, 9533, 57277, 9, 507, 266, 42880, 449, 44196, 323, 26828, 25, 12797, 9699, 43321, 85270, 449, 14403, 477, 3090, 323, 1948, 449, 48715, 44196, 323, 264, 1377, 44237, 315, 26828, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 16, 13, 1135, 198, 9, 42209, 25, 2522, 2453, 38759, 19335, 449, 4459, 34153, 23211, 323, 264, 9168, 315, 19087, 23661, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 17, 13, 410, 271, 334, 43, 3265, 57277, 9, 2895, 4473, 17604, 28974, 449, 75294, 34240, 323, 2854, 38827, 25, 5560, 4459, 34153, 16385, 323, 264, 16363, 315, 17604, 11, 35526, 449, 75294, 34240, 323, 264, 3185, 315, 2854, 38827, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 17, 13, 1135, 198, 9, 42209, 25, 84470, 321, 19724, 449, 4459, 34153, 16385, 323, 264, 3185, 33566, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 17, 13, 914, 271, 334, 35, 4481, 57277, 9, 3165, 65065, 449, 90215, 5169, 19737, 323, 264, 3185, 315, 4179, 3690, 79276, 25, 12797, 88010, 4184, 311, 6462, 11470, 11, 8854, 449, 264, 3637, 1481, 2509, 90215, 5169, 19737, 323, 264, 3185, 315, 4179, 3690, 79276, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 18, 13, 410, 198, 9, 42209, 25, 5348, 21059, 323, 20228, 19763, 449, 54662, 24822, 25, 12797, 3776, 27994, 323, 20228, 11, 1243, 1948, 449, 54662, 24822, 1778, 439, 29519, 58573, 323, 45697, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 17, 13, 2075, 271, 334, 21380, 7977, 57277, 9, 21266, 62517, 449, 2854, 38827, 25, 362, 9145, 315, 8945, 62517, 323, 264, 5593, 315, 2854, 38827, 1304, 369, 264, 9498, 323, 37154, 40459, 13, 11443, 25, 400, 16, 13, 914, 198, 9, 3026