Output~2025-04-24 17:06:18.249102: [RequestOutput(request_id=899, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a story describing the emotions of a character in a given situation. ### Input: Alice is stuck in traffic, trying to get to her parent\'s house for Thanksgiving. ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 3446, 23524, 279, 21958, 315, 264, 3752, 304, 264, 2728, 6671, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 30505, 374, 16075, 304, 9629, 11, 4560, 311, 636, 311, 1077, 2748, 596, 3838, 369, 37250, 13, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="As Alice sat stuck in traffic, her anxiety began to simmer just below the surface. She had been looking forward to spending Thanksgiving with her parents all week, and now it seemed like she was going to be late. The clock on her dashboard read 3:45 PM, and she was still miles away from her parents' house.\n\nAs she inched along the highway, Alice's mind began to wander to all the things that could go wrong. What if she was late for dinner? What if her parents were worried sick about her? What if she missed the whole family gathering? The more she thought about it, the more her anxiety grew, her heart racing with every brake light and every slow-moving car in front of her.\n\nBut as she gazed out at the sea of brake lights stretching out before her, Alice's anxiety began to give way to frustration. Why did this have to happen on Thanksgiving of all days? Why did she have to be stuck in traffic when she was already running late? She let out a deep sigh and drummed her fingers on the steering wheel, feeling her anger and irritation simmering just below the surface.\n\nAs the minutes ticked by, Alice's emotions began to shift again. She thought about all the things she was grateful for - her parents, her family, her health, her home. She thought about the delicious turkey dinner that was waiting for her, the laughter and conversation that would fill the room. And as she did, her frustration began to melt away, replaced by a sense of calm and appreciation. She took a deep breath, let go of her anxiety, and focused on the present moment. She was going to make it to her parents' house, and she was going to enjoy every minute of it.", token_ids=[2170, 30505, 7731, 16075, 304, 9629, 11, 1077, 18547, 6137, 311, 62915, 1120, 3770, 279, 7479, 13, 3005, 1047, 1027, 3411, 4741, 311, 10374, 37250, 449, 1077, 6699, 682, 2046, 11, 323, 1457, 433, 9508, 1093, 1364, 574, 2133, 311, 387, 3389, 13, 578, 9042, 389, 1077, 28065, 1373, 220, 18, 25, 1774, 5975, 11, 323, 1364, 574, 2103, 8931, 3201, 505, 1077, 6699, 6, 3838, 382, 2170, 1364, 304, 2454, 3235, 279, 27834, 11, 30505, 596, 4059, 6137, 311, 40320, 311, 682, 279, 2574, 430, 1436, 733, 5076, 13, 3639, 422, 1364, 574, 3389, 369, 14177, 30, 3639, 422, 1077, 6699, 1051, 18290, 14363, 922, 1077, 30, 3639, 422, 1364, 13942, 279, 4459, 3070, 23738, 30, 578, 810, 1364, 3463, 922, 433, 11, 279, 810, 1077, 18547, 14264, 11, 1077, 4851, 22019, 449, 1475, 35718, 3177, 323, 1475, 6435, 86572, 1841, 304, 4156, 315, 1077, 382, 4071, 439, 1364, 342, 28109, 704, 520, 279, 9581, 315, 35718, 13001, 42949, 704, 1603, 1077, 11, 30505, 596, 18547, 6137, 311, 3041, 1648, 311, 33086, 13, 8595, 1550, 420, 617, 311, 3621, 389, 37250, 315, 682, 2919, 30, 8595, 1550, 1364, 617, 311, 387, 16075, 304, 9629, 994, 1364, 574, 2736, 4401, 3389, 30, 3005, 1095, 704, 264, 5655, 31238, 323