 The trees\' growth is a reminder that everything is constantly changing, and that even the most seemingly permanent things can be fleeting.\n\nThe poem\'s tone is contemplative and introspective, with a focus on the quiet, subtle beauty of the natural world. Larkin\'s use of simple, concise language and careful attention to detail creates a sense of intimacy and immediacy, drawing the reader into the speaker\'s quiet reflection.\n\nOverall, "The Trees" is a poem about the human experience of time and mortality, and the ways in which the natural world can serve as a reminder of our own impermanence.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3284, 6492, 315, 279, 33894, 330, 791, 59984, 1, 555, 26241, 445, 93421, 1473, 644, 420, 33894, 11, 445, 93421, 41424, 279, 7057, 315, 279, 12579, 315, 892, 323, 279, 96435, 7138, 315, 2324, 13, 578, 19114, 16964, 279, 12690, 5108, 1139, 16312, 11, 902, 374, 3629, 264, 7891, 315, 6650, 323, 43901, 13, 4452, 11, 445, 93421, 1207, 29263, 420, 31293, 555, 23524, 279, 1920, 439, 330, 34431, 4661, 1694, 1071, 1359, 73967, 430, 279, 12690, 6, 6650, 374, 539, 264, 31439, 477, 83212, 1567, 382, 791, 1005, 315, 279, 3492, 330, 70, 4462, 1, 311, 7664, 279, 12690, 6, 6307, 2136, 13533, 430, 279, 19114, 16008, 279, 12690, 6, 6650, 439, 264, 293, 29163, 4589, 477, 87163, 7918, 1567, 13, 1115, 1436, 387, 33398, 439, 264, 31710, 389, 279, 17190, 1543, 768, 315, 2324, 323, 279, 21314, 275, 2968, 315, 2349, 13, 578, 12690, 6, 6650, 374, 264, 27626, 430, 4395, 374, 15320, 10223, 11, 323, 430, 1524, 279, 1455, 23490, 15690, 2574, 649, 387, 96435, 382, 791, 33894, 596, 16630, 374, 39471, 1413, 323, 26609, 9262, 11, 449, 264, 5357, 389, 279, 11594, 11, 27545, 13444, 315, 279, 5933, 1917, 13, 445, 93421, 596, 1005, 315, 4382, 11, 64694, 4221, 323, 16994, 6666, 311, 7872, 11705, 264, 5647, 315, 66264, 323, 5668, 2826, 11, 13633, 279, 6742, 1139, 279, 19114, 596, 11594, 22599, 382, 28589, 11, 330, 791, 59984, 1, 374, 264, 33894, 922, 279, 3823, 3217, 315, 892, 323, 