Output~2025-04-24 17:08:28.582285: [RequestOutput(request_id=959, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a technology used for measuring people\'s emotional responses. ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 5557, 1511, 369, 30090, 1274, 596, 14604, 14847, 13, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="One technology used for measuring people's emotional responses is Functional Near-Infrared Spectroscopy (fNIRS). fNIRS is a non-invasive, portable, and cost-effective technique that uses light to measure changes in blood oxygenation in the brain, which is closely linked to emotional states. It is often used in social and affective computing, psychology, and neuroscience research to study emotional processing, emotional regulation, and emotional intelligence.\n\nfNIRS works by shining near-infrared light through the skull and into the brain, where it is absorbed by the blood. The amount of light absorbed is then measured and used to calculate changes in blood oxygenation, which is a proxy for neural activity. This allows researchers to non-invasively measure brain activity in real-time, providing insights into emotional states such as happiness, sadness, fear, and excitement.\n\nfNIRS has been used in various applications, including:\n\n1. Emotion recognition: fNIRS can be used to recognize and classify emotional states, such as detecting when a person is experiencing stress, anxiety, or happiness.\n2. Emotional regulation: fNIRS can be used to study how people regulate their emotions, such as how they manage stress or anxiety.\n3. Neurofeedback training: fNIRS can be used to provide real-time feedback to individuals on their emotional states, allowing them to learn to regulate their emotions more effectively.\n4. Brain-computer interfaces: fNIRS can be used to develop brain-computer interfaces that allow people to control devices or communicate with others using their emotional states.\n\nOverall, fNIRS is a powerful tool for measuring emotional responses and has the potential to revolutionize our understanding of emotional processing and regulation.", token_ids=[4054, 5557, 1511, 369, 30090, 1274, 596, 14604, 14847, 374, 55550, 31494, 32600, 82482, 27726, 299, 51856, 320, 69, 45, 91064, 570, 282, 45, 91064, 374, 264, 2536, 3502, 78134, 11, 23665, 11, 323, 2853, 53421, 15105, 430, 5829, 3177, 311, 6767, 4442, 304, 6680, 24463, 367, 304, 279, 8271, 11, 902, 374, 15499, 10815, 311, 14604, 5415, 13, 1102, 374, 3629, 1511, 304, 3674, 323, 7958, 535, 25213, 11, 31018, 11, 323, 93048, 3495, 311, 4007, 14604, 8863, 11, 14604, 19812, 11, 323, 14604, 11478, 382, 69, 45, 91064, 4375, 555, 49025, 3221, 3502, 82482, 3177, 1555, 279, 35113, 323, 1139, 279, 8271, 11, 1405, 433, 374, 42101, 555, 279, 6680, 13, 578, 3392, 315, 3177, 42101, 374, 1243, 17303, 323, 1511, 311, 11294, 4442, 304, 6680, 24463, 367, 11, 902, 374, 264, 13594, 369, 30828, 5820, 13, 1115, 6276, 12074, 311, 2536, 3502, 4378, 3210, 6767, 8271, 5820, 304, 1972, 7394, 11, 8405, 26793, 1139, 14604, 5415, 1778, 439, 23871, 11, 51978, 11, 8850, 11, 323, 28361, 382, 69, 45, 91064, 706, 1027, 1511, 304, 5370, 8522, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 5867, 6082, 18324, 25, 282, 45, 91064, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 15641, 323, 49229, 14604, 5415, 11, 1778, 439, 54626, 994, 264, 1732, 374, 25051, 8631, 11, 18547, 11, 477, 23871, 627, 17, 13, 95300, 19812, 25, 282, 45, 91064, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 4007, 1268, 1274, 37377, 872, 21958, 11, 1778, 439, 1268, 814, 10299, 8631, 477, 1854