Output~2025-04-24 17:08:32.238091: [RequestOutput(request_id=960, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Name five medicinal plants widely used in Ayurveda. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4076, 4330, 58041, 11012, 13882, 1511, 304, 24852, 80627, 64, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are five medicinal plants widely used in Ayurveda:\n\n1. **Turmeric (Curcuma longa)**: Known for its anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, turmeric is used to treat various health conditions such as arthritis, digestive issues, and skin problems.\n2. **Neem (Azadirachta indica)**: Neem is used to treat a range of health issues, including skin problems, respiratory issues, and digestive issues. Its antibacterial and antifungal properties make it effective against various infections.\n3. **Ginger (Zingiber officinale)**: Ginger is used to alleviate nausea, digestive issues, and respiratory problems. Its anti-inflammatory properties also make it effective in reducing pain and inflammation.\n4. **Ashwagandha (Withania somnifera)**: Also known as "winter cherry," ashwagandha is an adaptogenic herb that helps to reduce stress and anxiety. It\'s also used to treat insomnia, arthritis, and other health conditions.\n5. **Triphala (Terminalia chebula, Emblica officinalis, and Phyllanthus emblica)**: Triphala is a combination of three herbs that is used to treat various health issues, including digestive problems, respiratory issues, and skin problems. It\'s also used to promote overall health and well-being.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many medicinal plants used in Ayurveda. Ayurvedic medicine emphasizes the use of natural remedies and emphasizes the importance of a balanced diet and lifestyle in maintaining overall health.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 58041, 11012, 13882, 1511, 304, 24852, 80627, 64, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 38062, 2165, 320, 17119, 66, 13722, 1317, 64, 33395, 25, 49386, 369, 1202, 7294, 67595, 323, 70339, 6012, 11, 13535, 2165, 374, 1511, 311, 4322, 5370, 2890, 4787, 1778, 439, 55652, 11, 60071, 4819, 11, 323, 6930, 5435, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 8989, 336, 320, 38299, 42273, 613, 2629, 75780, 33395, 25, 4275, 336, 374, 1511, 311, 4322, 264, 2134, 315, 2890, 4819, 11, 2737, 6930, 5435, 11, 42631, 4819, 11, 323, 60071, 4819, 13, 11699, 21196, 71034, 323, 3276, 333, 58267, 6012, 1304, 433, 7524, 2403, 5370, 30020, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 38, 5248, 320, 57, 287, 8799, 2856, 258, 1604, 33395, 25, 68394, 374, 1511, 311, 61705, 61880, 11, 60071, 4819, 11, 323, 42631, 5435, 13, 11699, 7294, 67595, 6012, 1101, 1304, 433, 7524, 304, 18189, 6784, 323, 37140, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 53856, 86, 351, 438, 4317, 320, 2409, 9345, 1794, 77, 333, 2473, 33395, 25, 7429, 3967, 439, 330, 84028, 41980, 1359, 24767, 86, 351, 438, 4317, 374, 459, 10737, 29569, 39999, 430, 8779, 311, 8108, 8631, 323, 18547, 13, 1102, 596, 1101, 1511, 311, 4322, 83511, 11, 55652, 11, 323, 1023, 2890, 4787, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 22646, 764, 6181, 320, 48990, 689, 3091, 65, 5724, 11, 30227, 15677, 2856, 992, 285, 11, 323, 2405, 25734, 32329, 355, 8126, 15677, 33395, 25, 12639, 764, 6181, 374, 264, 10824, 315, 2380, 42393, 430, 374, 1511, 311, 4322, 5370, 2890, 4819, 11, 2737, 60071, 5435, 11, 42631, 4819, 11, 323, 6930, 5435, 13, 1102, 596, 1101, 1511, 311, 12192, 8244, 2890, 323, 1664, 33851, 382, 9673, 527, 1120, 264, 2478, 10507, 315, 279, 1690, 58041, 11012, 1511, 304, 24852, 80627, 64, 13, 24852, 80627, 292, 16088, 66159, 279, 1005, 315, 5933, 51236, 323