Output~2025-04-24 17:08:43.818644: [RequestOutput(request_id=962, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story of friendship between two boys from different backgrounds. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 315, 27607, 1990, 1403, 13305, 505, 2204, 36576, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**The Unlikely Bond**\n\nIn a small town nestled in the heart of the city, two boys from different worlds lived just a few blocks away from each other. Ahmed, a bright-eyed 10-year-old with a mop of curly black hair, lived in a cozy apartment with his family in a low-income neighborhood. His parents, immigrants from Somalia, worked multiple jobs to make ends meet. On the other side of town, in a posh neighborhood with manicured lawns and gleaming white houses, lived 11-year-old Max, a freckled-faced boy with a messy blond haircut. His parents, both successful professionals, owned a large house with a sprawling backyard.\n\nOne sunny Saturday morning, Ahmed and Max crossed paths at the local park. Ahmed was playing soccer with his friends, while Max was riding his bike around the playground. As Ahmed kicked the ball, it flew over the fence and landed in Max\'s path. Max, being the curious type, picked up the ball and approached Ahmed\'s group. Ahmed, feeling a bit self-conscious about his worn-out sneakers and hand-me-down clothes, hesitated to ask Max to return the ball. But Max, with his bright blue eyes and genuine smile, put him at ease.\n\n"Hey, sorry about that! I didn\'t mean to interrupt your game," Max said, holding out the ball.\n\nAhmed smiled, feeling a sense of relief. "No worries, it\'s okay. We\'re just playing a friendly match."\n\nAs they introduced themselves, Ahmed and Max discovered they had more in common than they thought. Both loved playing soccer, reading books, and exploring the outdoors. Ahmed was fascinated by Max\'s stories about his family\'s vacations to exotic destinations, while Max was intrigued by Ahmed\'s tales of his parents\' traditional Somali cooking and cultural traditions.\n\nTheir chance encounter turned into a regular routine. Ahmed and Max would meet at the park every Saturday, playing soccer, sharing snacks, and swapping stories. Ahmed introduced Max to his favorite Somali dishes, like suhur and basmati rice, while Max taught Ahmed how to ride a bike without training wheels.\n\nAs the weeks went by, their friendship deepened. Ahmed\'s parents, initially hesitant about their son befriending a boy from a different background, grew to appreciate Max\'s kindness and respect for their culture. Max\'s parents, too, were delighted to see their son embracing diversity and learning about the world beyond his own neighborhood.\n\nOne day, Ahmed invited Max to join him for a traditional Somali dinner at his home. Max', token_ids=[334, 791, 1252, 14617, 24537, 57277, 644, 264, 2678, 6424, 89777, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 3363, 11, 1403, 13305, 505, 2204, 24800, 12439, 1120, 264, 2478, 10215, 3201, 505, 1855, 1023, 13, 41769, 11, 264, 10107, 53613, 220, 605, 4771, 6418, 449, 264, 89164, 315, 69203, 3776, 7013, 11, 12439, 304, 264, 43535, 13455, 449, 813, 3070, 304, 264, 3428, 32197, 12818, 13, 5414, 6699, 11, 20550, 505, 60851, 11, 6575, 5361, 7032, 311, 1304, 10548, 3449, 13, 1952, 279, 1023, 3185, 315, 6424, 11, 304, 264, 1153, 71, 12818, 449, 70222, 3149, 2383, 4511, 323, 30103, 6605, 4251, 15316, 11, 12439, 220, 806, 4771, 6418, 7639, 11, 264, 3541, 377, 839, 77981, 8