 spread my arms and let the sunshine in\n(C) And let my spirit soar and spin\n(Am) In the warmth of the sun\'s sweet light\n(F) I\'ll bask in its radiance, feeling alive tonight.\n\nThis song is written in the key of C Major, with a simple and catchy melody that should be easy to play on a guitar or piano. The lyrics are meant to be uplifting and joyful, capturing the feeling of freedom and happiness that comes with basking in the warmth of the sun.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 5609, 304, 279, 1401, 315, 356, 17559, 1473, 334, 3936, 68063, 330, 50, 28397, 4923, 552, 1875, 334, 69143, 220, 16, 25, 1035, 6838, 8, 763, 279, 6693, 3177, 11, 358, 15508, 709, 8430, 10107, 198, 3100, 8, 578, 1917, 4994, 374, 2539, 315, 18454, 198, 4444, 76, 8, 578, 20229, 527, 26139, 872, 10437, 62684, 198, 7988, 8, 1628, 4395, 11321, 1120, 1314, 271, 334, 1163, 30969, 25, 1035, 6838, 8, 8840, 11, 279, 7160, 374, 49025, 1523, 389, 757, 198, 3100, 8, 468, 34002, 856, 4851, 323, 6376, 757, 1949, 198, 4444, 76, 8, 358, 2733, 13989, 11, 358, 2733, 779, 2512, 10816, 198, 7988, 8, 763, 1521, 40798, 50393, 11, 430, 596, 1405, 358, 3358, 387, 271, 334, 69143, 220, 17, 25, 1035, 6838, 8, 578, 46385, 374, 35955, 287, 24511, 304, 856, 2487, 198, 3100, 8, 5046, 29827, 12098, 323, 19459, 779, 25237, 198, 4444, 76, 8, 578, 41466, 315, 14545, 18238, 19837, 41687, 279, 3805, 198, 7988, 8, 1628, 358, 2846, 10409, 449, 16267, 7953, 9616, 271, 334, 1163, 30969, 25, 1035, 6838, 8, 8840, 11, 279, 7160, 374, 49025, 1523, 389, 757, 198, 3100, 8, 468, 34002, 856, 4851, 323, 6376, 757, 1949, 198, 4444, 76, 8, 358, 2733, 13989, 11, 358, 2733, 779, 2512, 10816, 198, 7988, 8, 763, 1521, 40798, 50393, 11, 430, 596, 1405, 358, 3358, 387, 271, 334, 33948, 25, 1035, 7, 2321, 8, 18156, 2324, 649, 636, 264, 2697, 20366, 198, 5549, 8, 2030, 358, 1440, 430, 279, 7160, 690, 2586, 704, 311, 1514, 198, 6838, 8, 1628, 358, 3358, 33586, 279, 30614, 3201, 198, 3100, 8, 1628, 15612, 304, 279, 52495, 1475, 1938, 271, 334, 1163, 3096