mplex behaviors such as navigation, predator avoidance, and even learning and memory. For example, some species of jellyfish have been observed to be able to learn and remember the location of food sources, and to adjust their behavior accordingly.\n\nTherefore, while it is true that jellyfish do not have a brain in the classical sense, it is not accurate to say that they do not have any cognitive abilities. Instead, their distributed nervous system and ganglion allow them to process information and make decisions in a way that is unique to their biology.', token_ids=[791, 5224, 330, 41, 12160, 18668, 1541, 956, 617, 35202, 11, 9093, 814, 1541, 956, 617, 904, 25702, 18000, 1, 374, 459, 17918, 6517, 2461, 323, 539, 11622, 13687, 13, 6104, 433, 374, 837, 430, 52441, 18668, 656, 539, 617, 264, 58983, 8271, 1093, 12966, 477, 1023, 67861, 99868, 11, 814, 656, 617, 264, 4332, 23418, 1887, 430, 6276, 1124, 311, 6013, 311, 56688, 323, 1304, 11429, 382, 41, 12160, 18668, 617, 264, 4009, 315, 32015, 7917, 11, 2663, 264, 330, 1215, 588, 4272, 1359, 430, 374, 9041, 6957, 872, 13162, 13, 1115, 32015, 4272, 6276, 1124, 311, 11388, 3177, 11, 5916, 11, 323, 1023, 56688, 11, 323, 311, 6013, 28178, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 994, 264, 52441, 18668, 374, 24891, 11, 433, 649, 5226, 1202, 24569, 311, 3351, 3201, 505, 279, 39535, 382, 50674, 11, 1063, 9606, 315, 52441, 18668, 617, 264, 810, 6485, 23418, 1887, 430, 5764, 264, 330, 47114, 79251, 1359, 902, 374, 264, 10879, 315, 32015, 7917, 430, 649, 1920, 2038, 323, 1304, 11429, 13, 1115, 13481, 79251, 374, 3629, 7559, 3221, 279, 52441, 18668, 596, 11013, 323, 374, 3463, 311, 387, 6532, 304, 26991, 1202, 26040, 7865, 382, 8142, 52441, 18668, 656, 539, 617, 264, 58983, 8271, 11, 814, 527, 2103, 13171, 315, 6485, 28198, 1778, 439, 10873, 11, 68006, 65411, 11, 323, 1524, 6975, 323, 5044, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 1063, 9606, 315, 52441, 18668, 617, 1027, 13468, 311, 387, 3025, 311, 4048, 323, 6227, 279, 3813, 315, 3691, 8336, 11, 323, 311, 7652, 872, 786