Output~2025-04-24 17:11:37.654532: [RequestOutput(request_id=1030, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the process of making a peanut butter and jelly sandwich step by step. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 1920, 315, 3339, 264, 50933, 14432, 323, 52441, 28974, 3094, 555, 3094, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a step-by-step guide on how to make a peanut butter and jelly sandwich:\n\n**Step 1: Gather the ingredients**\n\n* 2 slices of bread\n* Peanut butter\n* Jelly or jam\n* A knife for spreading\n* A plate for assembling the sandwich\n\n**Step 2: Lay out the bread slices**\n\n* Place the two slices of bread side by side on the plate.\n\n**Step 3: Spread the peanut butter on one slice**\n\n* Take the knife and scoop up a small amount of peanut butter from the jar.\n* Spread the peanut butter evenly onto one slice of bread, covering the entire surface. You can spread it all the way to the edges or leave a small border around the edges, depending on your preference.\n\n**Step 4: Spread the jelly on the other slice**\n\n* Follow the same process as Step 3, but with the jelly or jam. Scoop up a small amount and spread it evenly onto the other slice of bread.\n\n**Step 5: Assemble the sandwich**\n\n* Carefully place the slice with the jelly on top of the slice with the peanut butter.\n* Press down gently to ensure the sandwich is secure and the filling is evenly distributed.\n\n**Step 6: Cut the sandwich (optional)**\n\n* If you want to cut your sandwich, use the knife to cut it into halves, quarters, or even smaller pieces, depending on your preference.\n\n**Step 7: Serve and enjoy!**\n\n* Your peanut butter and jelly sandwich is now ready to eat! You can serve it on its own or paired with a side of fruit, chips, or a salad.\n\nThat's it! With these simple steps, you can make a delicious peanut butter and jelly sandwich in no time.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 8641, 389, 1268, 311, 1304, 264, 50933, 14432, 323, 52441, 28974, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 279, 14293, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 35354, 315, 16385, 198, 9, 94044, 14432, 198, 9, 74239, 477, 20673, 198, 9, 362, 22145, 369, 31135, 198, 9, 362, 12235, 369, 81759, 279, 28974, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 45024, 704, 279, 16385, 35354, 57277, 9, 11004, 279, 1403, 35354, 315, 16385, 3185, 555, 3185, 389, 279, 12235, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 48816, 279, 50933, 14432, 389, 832, 16363, 57277, 9, 12040, 279, 22145, 323, 57507, 709, 264, 2678, 3392, 315, 50933, 14432, 505, 279, 30695, 627, 9, 48816, 279, 50933, 14432, 42147, 8800, 832, 16363, 315, 16385, 11, 18702, 279, 4553, 7479, 13, 1472, 649, 9041, 433, 682, 279, 1648, 311, 279, 13116, 477, 5387, 264, 2678, 3973, 2212, 279, 13116, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 22698, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 48816, 279, 52441, 389, 279, 1023, 16363, 57277, 9, 11359, 279, 1890, 1920, 439, 15166, 220, 18, 11, 719, 449, 279, 52441, 477, 20673, 13, 50159, 454, 709, 264, 2678, 3392, 323, 9041, 433, 42147, 8800, 279, 1023, 16363, 315, 16385, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 1666, 16167, 279, 28974, 57277, 9, 10852, 3725, 2035, 279, 16363, 449, 279, 52441, 389, 1948, 315, 279, 16363, 449, 279, 50933, 14432, 627, 9, 8612, 1523, 30373, 311, 6106, 279, 28974, 374, 9966, 323, 279, 21973, 374, 42147, 4332, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 21, 25, 20223, 279, 28974, 320, 13099, 33395, 271, 9, 1442, 499, 1390, 311, 4018, 701, 28974, 11, 1005, 279, 22145, 311, 4018, 433, 1139, 75212, 11, 32573, 11, 477