s, digital equity issues, and the potential for technology to exacerbate existing social and economic inequalities in education?\n\nI hope these questions are helpful! Let me know if you have any further requests.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 4860, 389, 279, 8712, 330, 791, 29680, 315, 12053, 389, 11930, 52518, 16, 13, 2650, 706, 279, 24716, 1005, 315, 7528, 6975, 15771, 323, 2930, 5070, 5614, 279, 1648, 4236, 2680, 323, 16988, 449, 16627, 2262, 1980, 17, 13, 3639, 527, 1063, 4754, 7720, 323, 89173, 315, 1701, 21075, 11478, 41503, 48232, 6975, 6067, 304, 279, 24978, 11, 323, 1268, 649, 50794, 13750, 32172, 1521, 7526, 1139, 872, 12917, 12659, 1980, 18, 13, 763, 1148, 5627, 706, 279, 10205, 315, 2930, 6975, 323, 6138, 6873, 5614, 279, 8776, 1646, 315, 25878, 9976, 90653, 277, 8853, 11, 323, 1148, 527, 279, 25127, 369, 4236, 11, 13639, 11, 323, 14673, 1980, 19, 13, 2650, 649, 50794, 13750, 1005, 3674, 3772, 323, 1023, 7528, 7526, 311, 12192, 5575, 20392, 11, 20632, 11, 323, 10758, 11, 323, 1148, 527, 1063, 4754, 82075, 311, 5766, 304, 420, 1920, 1980, 20, 13, 3639, 527, 1063, 4754, 31308, 38864, 323, 11774, 430, 31889, 994, 1701, 16627, 5557, 11, 1778, 439, 828, 12625, 10742, 11, 7528, 25452, 4819, 11, 323, 279, 4754, 369, 5557, 311, 52875, 349, 6484, 3674, 323, 7100, 93334, 304, 6873, 1980, 40, 3987, 1521, 4860, 527, 11190, 0, 6914, 757, 1440, 422, 499, 617, 904, 4726, 7540, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
