 machine learning to analyze water usage patterns and provide personalized recommendations for reducing consumption, such as fixing leaks or using water-efficient appliances.\n\n**5. EcoGuide**: An augmented reality app that provides users with information on sustainable living practices and eco-friendly products. Using AR technology, users can point their camera at products or environments and receive information on their environmental impact, such as the carbon footprint of a product or the best ways to reduce waste in a particular area.\n\nThese ideas aim to promote sustainability, reduce waste, and encourage environmentally conscious behaviors through innovative technology and user engagement.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 18699, 6848, 369, 459, 3851, 449, 279, 7057, 315, 364, 13013, 56530, 334, 16, 13, 51951, 45920, 96618, 1556, 15592, 41503, 34978, 917, 430, 5829, 6500, 11376, 323, 5780, 6975, 311, 10765, 323, 3460, 92465, 481, 7384, 505, 14048, 12571, 13, 14969, 649, 1935, 264, 6685, 315, 872, 92465, 4893, 11, 323, 279, 917, 690, 3493, 19351, 389, 1148, 649, 387, 47658, 323, 1268, 311, 10772, 433, 369, 4526, 382, 334, 17, 13, 7997, 1463, 96618, 362, 3674, 4009, 430, 34161, 1274, 889, 1390, 311, 8108, 872, 12782, 43972, 449, 2254, 42688, 22658, 9873, 323, 3600, 13, 14969, 649, 4430, 872, 42688, 22658, 26870, 323, 9021, 11, 323, 5371, 35649, 19075, 369, 22556, 3956, 323, 3600, 304, 872, 3158, 382, 334, 18, 13, 6690, 3407, 412, 96618, 1556, 3805, 4367, 16967, 917, 430, 5829, 264, 4009, 315, 3428, 41238, 26148, 323, 5780, 6975, 26249, 311, 3493, 1972, 7394, 3805, 4367, 828, 311, 3932, 13, 578, 917, 690, 1101, 3085, 35649, 19075, 369, 18189, 14675, 311, 8009, 3805, 4367, 11, 1778, 439, 31526, 3738, 5789, 477, 1701, 3805, 4087, 12099, 382, 334, 19, 13, 10164, 54, 1082, 96618, 362, 3090, 29711, 917, 430, 8779, 3932, 3839, 323, 8108, 872, 3090, 10648, 13, 578, 917, 690, 1005, 5780, 6975, 311, 24564, 3090, 10648, 12912, 323, 3493, 35649, 19075, 369, 18189, 15652, 1