 trends: Detect patterns, trends, and correlations in the data that can inform further analysis.\n3. Identify anomalies and outliers: Identify data points that are significantly different from the rest of the data, which may indicate errors, inconsistencies, or unusual behavior.\n4. Formulate hypotheses: Develop hypotheses that can be tested using statistical methods or other analytical techniques.\n\nBy performing EDA, analysts can gain a better understanding of the data, identify potential issues, and develop a plan for further analysis and modeling.', token_ids=[45053, 269, 5382, 2956, 18825, 320, 87861, 8, 374, 264, 1920, 315, 38936, 323, 29385, 4954, 828, 311, 3619, 1202, 16940, 6070, 11, 12912, 11, 323, 12135, 13, 1102, 374, 264, 16996, 3094, 304, 279, 828, 6492, 1920, 11, 439, 433, 8779, 311, 10765, 279, 1455, 3062, 4519, 11, 11388, 75559, 11, 323, 8895, 26793, 1139, 279, 828, 8141, 11, 26670, 11, 323, 54709, 13, 469, 6486, 18065, 264, 2134, 315, 12823, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 2956, 16204, 323, 64731, 25, 23322, 7922, 323, 11850, 7554, 2819, 11, 87763, 11, 323, 92922, 304, 279, 828, 627, 17, 13, 2956, 42148, 25, 12362, 31794, 323, 27223, 311, 51187, 279, 828, 323, 10765, 12912, 11, 18845, 11, 323, 69916, 627, 18, 13, 22241, 13443, 25, 32459, 1113, 11193, 1778, 439, 3152, 11, 23369, 11, 3941, 11, 323, 5410, 38664, 311, 3619, 279, 8792, 31954, 323, 54709, 315, 279, 828, 627, 19, 13, 2956, 18475, 25, 15583, 287, 279, 828, 1139, 264, 810, 14791, 3645, 369, 6492, 11, 1778, 439, 49823, 11, 28041, 11, 477, 52729, 627, 20, 13, 39515, 78, 13491, 9659, 25, 3459, 15853, 74513, 3196, 389, 279, 26793, 18661, 505, 279, 469, 6486, 1920, 382, 791, 6156, 9021, 315, 469, 6486, 527, 311, 1473, 16, 13, 71994, 279, 828, 25, 50809, 264, 19662, 8830, 315, 279, 828, 11, 2737, 1202, 6070, 11, 4367, 11, 323, 12135, 627, 17, 13, 65647, 12912, 323, 18845, 25, 34387, 12912, 11, 18845, 11, 323, 69916, 304, 279, 828, 430, 649, 6179, 4726, 6492, 627, 18, 13, 65647, 75559, 323, 87763, 25, 65