Output~2025-04-24 17:14:07.777875: [RequestOutput(request_id=1117, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Brainstorm ideas for a creative ensemble for a formal event. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 31417, 27511, 6848, 369, 264, 11782, 40126, 369, 264, 16287, 1567, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='What a thrilling task! Here are some creative ensemble ideas for a formal event:\n\n**Elegant Evening**\n\n* A black-tie affair: A sleek black tuxedo with a crisp white shirt, paired with a bow tie and a pocket watch. Add a touch of sophistication with a black bowler hat and a pair of black patent leather shoes.\n* A glamorous gown: A floor-length, strapless evening gown in a jewel-toned color like emerald green or sapphire blue. Accentuate the look with a statement necklace and a pair of high heels.\n\n**Vintage Glamour**\n\n* A 1920s-inspired look: A fitted, long-sleeved dress with a dropped waist and a flowing skirt. Add a fedora hat, a pearl necklace, and a pair of high heels with a subtle ankle strap.\n* A 1950s-style ensemble: A fitted, knee-length dress with a full skirt and a fitted bodice. Pair it with a statement jacket, a pair of gloves, and a pair of high heels with a pointed toe.\n\n**Modern Elegance**\n\n* A minimalist chic look: A simple, floor-length dress in a neutral color like beige or navy blue. Add a pair of statement earrings and a sleek, low-heeled shoe.\n* A bold and bright look: A brightly colored, fitted dress with a high-low hem. Pair it with a pair of bold, geometric earrings and a pair of high heels with a block heel.\n\n**Whimsical Wonder**\n\n* A fairytale-inspired look: A flowing, floor-length gown with a sweetheart neckline and a full skirt. Add a tiara, a pair of dangling earrings, and a pair of high heels with a delicate ankle strap.\n* A bohemian-inspired ensemble: A flowy, floor-length dress with a V-neckline and a flowing skirt. Pair it with a floppy hat, a layered necklace, and a pair of ankle boots with a stacked heel.\n\nThese are just a few ideas to get you started. Remember to have fun and express your personal style through your ensemble!', token_ids=[3923, 264, 57399, 3465, 0, 5810, 527, 1063, 11782, 40126, 6848, 369, 264, 16287, 1567, 1473, 334, 36, 59902, 57202, 57277, 9, 362, 3776, 2442, 648, 31017, 25, 362, 48494, 3776, 259, 2249, 66981, 449, 264, 42954, 4251, 15845, 11, 35526, 449, 264, 15631, 18623, 323, 264, 18301, 3821, 13, 2758, 264, 5916, 315, 85536, 449, 264, 3776, 15631, 1565, 9072, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 3776, 25589, 18012, 15653, 627, 9, 362, 77014, 65510, 25, 362, 6558, 30425, 11, 34647, 1752, 11714, 65510, 304, 264, 66941, 75735, 291, 1933, 1093, 991, 25380, 6307, 477, 274, 56205, 6437, 13, 82909, 6426, 279, 1427, 449, 264, 5224, 55547, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 1579, 34460, 382, 334, 89567, 87813, 414, 57277, 9, 362, 220, 5926, 15, 82, 53161, 1427, 25, 362, 29441, 11, 1317, 1355, 8669, 2111, 8679, 449, 264, 12504, 29142, 323, 264, 36612, 38380, 13, 2758, 264, 23114, 6347, 9072, 11, 264, 70723, 55547, 11, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 1579, 34460, 449, 264, 27545, 39448, 34647, 627, 9, 362, 220, 6280, 15, 82, 11549, 40126, 25, 362, 29441, 11, 22095, 30425, 8679, 449, 264, 2539, 38380, 323, 264, 29441, 30111, 560, 13, 27086, 433, 449, 264, 5224, 27300, 11, 264, 6857, 315, 36516, 11, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 1579, 34460, 449, 264, 14618, 31316, 382, 334, 49552, 469, 1978, 685, 57277, 9, 362, 72770, 47994, 1427, 25, 362, 4382, 11, 6558, 30425, 8679, 304, 264, 21277, 1933, 10