ted by the `<h1>`, `<h2>`, `<h3>`, etc. tags, with `<h1>` being the most important and `<h6>` being the least important.\n6. **Paragraphs**: HTML paragraphs are used to define blocks of text on a web page. They are represented by the `<p>` tag.\n7. **Links**: HTML links are used to create hyperlinks between web pages or to link to external resources. They are represented by the `<a>` tag.\n8. **Images**: HTML images are used to add images to a web page. They are represented by the `<img>` tag.\n9. **Lists**: HTML lists are used to define ordered or unordered lists of items. They are represented by the `<ol>` and `<ul>` tags, respectively.\n10. **Semantic HTML**: Semantic HTML refers to the use of HTML elements that provide meaning to the structure and organization of a web page, such as `<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>`, etc.\n\nThese are the most basic elements of HTML, and understanding', token_ids=[791, 1455, 6913, 5540, 315, 9492, 320, 39, 1100, 38320, 99661, 11688, 8, 527, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 16309, 96618, 9492, 9681, 527, 1511, 311, 7124, 279, 2204, 5596, 315, 264, 3566, 2199, 13, 2435, 527, 23712, 555, 9392, 40029, 29754, 27, 63, 323, 1595, 29, 33981, 323, 6118, 2586, 304, 13840, 11, 449, 279, 8736, 4877, 38846, 279, 2262, 323, 279, 15676, 4877, 2768, 279, 2262, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 12132, 96618, 9492, 5540, 527, 279, 4857, 10215, 315, 459, 9492, 2246, 13, 2435, 527, 15609, 555, 264, 1212, 4877, 323, 459, 842, 4877, 11, 323, 649, 6782, 2262, 11, 1023, 5540, 11, 477, 2225, 13, 26379, 315, 9492, 5540, 2997, 70552, 29754, 27, 71, 16, 29, 7964, 31686, 71, 17, 29, 7964, 5099, 25390, 43743, 29754, 27, 79, 44726, 705, 5448, 29754, 27, 1931, 44726, 705, 323, 7902, 29754, 27, 64, 44726, 4390, 18, 13, 3146, 10738, 96618, 9492, 8365, 527, 1511, 311, 3493, 5217, 2038, 922, 459, 9492, 2449, 13, 2435, 527, 3779, 311, 279, 1212, 4877, 323, 6824, 315, 264, 836, 323, 264, 907, 11, 19180, 555, 459, 17239, 1879, 29754, 23046, 570, 1789