Output~2025-04-24 17:16:24.462932: [RequestOutput(request_id=1173, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a list of 6 questions about sustainable energy. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 1160, 315, 220, 21, 4860, 922, 22556, 4907, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are six questions about sustainable energy:\n\n1. What are the most common forms of renewable energy used to power homes and businesses, and how do they compare in terms of cost and environmental impact?\n\n2. How does solar energy work, and what are some of the benefits and limitations of using solar panels to generate electricity?\n\n3. What is the role of wind energy in the global transition to sustainable energy, and what are some of the challenges and opportunities associated with wind power?\n\n4. What are some of the most promising emerging technologies in the field of sustainable energy, and how might they help address the challenges of climate change?\n\n5. How can individuals and communities reduce their energy consumption and carbon footprint, and what are some simple and effective ways to make a positive impact on the environment?\n\n6. What are the economic and social benefits of investing in sustainable energy, and how can governments and businesses work together to create a more sustainable energy future?', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4848, 4860, 922, 22556, 4907, 1473, 16, 13, 3639, 527, 279, 1455, 4279, 7739, 315, 33268, 4907, 1511, 311, 2410, 10632,