Output~2025-04-24 17:16:43.605828: [RequestOutput(request_id=1178, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a psychological condition called "depersonalization disorder". ### Response:\'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 24064, 3044, 2663, 330, 451, 30712, 2065, 19823, 3343, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Depersonalization disorder, also known as depersonalization derealization disorder, is a psychological condition characterized by a feeling of detachment or estrangement from oneself or one's body. People with depersonalization disorder may experience a sense of being an outside observer of their own thoughts, feelings, or actions, as if they are watching themselves from outside their body. This can be a distressing and disorienting experience, and can lead to feelings of anxiety, fear, and disconnection from others.\n\nThe symptoms of depersonalization disorder can vary in severity and may include:\n\n* Feeling detached from one's body or self\n* Feeling like one is observing oneself from outside the body\n* Feeling like one is in a dream or a movie\n* Feeling like one's thoughts, feelings, or actions are not one's own\n* Feeling like one is a robot or a puppet\n* Feeling like one is in a fog or a haze\n* Difficulty recognizing oneself in mirrors or photographs\n* Feeling like one is not in control of one's actions or thoughts\n\nDepersonalization disorder can be triggered by a variety of factors, including:\n\n* Trauma or stress\n* Anxiety or depression\n* Sleep deprivation\n* Substance abuse\n* Medical conditions, such as epilepsy or migraines\n* Neurological disorders, such as multiple sclerosis or Parkinson's disease\n\nTreatment for depersonalization disorder typically involves a combination of psychotherapy and medication. Cognitive-behavioral therapy (CBT) can help individuals learn to manage their symptoms and develop coping strategies. Medications such as antidepressants or anti-anxiety drugs may also be prescribed to help alleviate symptoms. In some cases, individuals with depersonalization disorder may also benefit from relaxation techniques, such as meditation or deep breathing exercises, to help manage stress and anxiety.", token_ids=[7996, 1293, 278, 2065, 19823, 11, 1101, 3967, 439, 2219, 1293, 278, 2065, 26344, 278, 2065, 19823, 11, 374, 264, 24064, 3044, 32971, 555, 264, 8430, 315, 100177, 477, 30607, 57733, 505, 57669, 477, 832, 596, 2547, 13, 9029, 449, 2219, 1293, 278, 2065, 19823, 1253, 3217, 264, 5647, 315, 1694, 459, 4994, 22842, 315, 872, 1866, 11555, 11, 16024, 11, 477, 6299, 11, 439, 422, 814, 527, 10307, 5694, 505, 4994, 872, 2547, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 264, 35104, 287, 323, 834, 15226, 287, 3217, 11, 323, 649, 3063, 311, 16024, 315, 18547, 11, 8850, 11, 323, 834, 7898, 505, 3885, 382, 791, 13803, 315, 2219, 1293, 278, 2065, 19823, 649, 13592, 304, 31020, 323, 1253, 2997, 1473, 9, 74658, 45017, 505, 832, 596, 2547, 477, 659, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 374, 46071, 57669, 505, 4994, 279, 2547, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 374, 304, 264, 8063, 477, 264, 5818, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 596, 11555, 11, 16024, 11, 477, 6299, 527, 539, 832, 596, 1866, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 374, 264, 12585, 477, 264, 50548, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 374, 304, 264, 31349, 477, 264, 90409, 198, 9, 56046, 49183, 57669, 304, 41585, 477, 25232, 198, 9, 74658, 1093, 832, 374, 539, 304, 2585, 315, 832, 596, 6299, 477, 11555, 271, 7996, 1293, 278, 2065, 19823, 649, 387, 22900, 555, 264, 8205, 315, 9547, 11, 27