th.\n\nAdditionally, a 35% annual return is unusually high and may not be sustainable in the long term. Such high returns often come with a higher risk of volatility, and the startup may experience significant fluctuations in value, which could result in significant losses.\n\nIn my opinion, this investment plan is too risky for a $10,000 investment. I would recommend diversifying the portfolio by investing in a mix of low-risk and moderate-risk assets, such as bonds, dividend-paying stocks, or index funds, to minimize the potential for significant losses.\n\nIf you're looking for higher returns, I would suggest exploring other investment options with a lower risk profile, such as a diversified mutual fund or an exchange-traded fund (ETF) that tracks a broad market index. These options may not offer the same level of returns as the technology startup, but they are generally more stable and less prone to significant losses.\n\nIn conclusion, while the potential returns of this technology startup may be attractive, the high-risk profile and lack of profitability history make it a high-risk investment that may not be suitable for a $10,000 investment. I would advise against investing in this startup and instead recommend exploring other investment options with a more balanced risk-reward profile.", token_ids=[334, 57330, 54432, 596, 6075, 25, 57277, 29815, 389, 279, 3984, 2038, 11, 358, 1053, 32113, 2403, 26012, 400, 605, 11, 931, 304, 420, 5557, 21210, 13, 6104, 279, 28448, 9974, 4780, 315, 220, 1758, 4, 1253, 2873, 19411, 11, 279, 1579, 46570, 5643, 323, 6996, 315, 3925, 315, 63336, 527, 5199, 10742, 382, 12243, 46570, 22538, 3629, 2586, 449, 264, 5190, 4754, 369, 18151, 11, 323, 279, 19821, 315, 264, 17033, 3839, 3335, 315, 63336, 12992, 279, 27924, 315, 279, 9341, 596, 2450, 13, 3161, 912, 3925, 315, 63336, 11, 433, 596, 5107, 311, 8720, 279, 21210, 596, 5845, 311, 7068, 13263, 4780, 477, 14201, 6650, 382, 50674, 11, 264, 220, 1758, 4, 9974, 471, 374, 57899, 1579, 