e\n\n(Outro)\nSo let's raise our hands, and let the music play\nWe'll soak up the sun, and seize the day\nSummer's here, and we're feeling alive\nWe'll make this summer, one to thrive!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 334, 51787, 97664, 288, 57277, 7, 69143, 220, 16, 340, 54, 1802, 709, 311, 52495, 10107, 198, 6251, 20659, 13989, 11, 8430, 1314, 198, 791, 41463, 389, 856, 6930, 11, 433, 11321, 1093, 264, 18454, 198, 40, 2846, 5644, 311, 1935, 389, 279, 7474, 3814, 271, 7, 1163, 30969, 340, 12174, 11, 7474, 596, 1618, 11, 323, 358, 2846, 8430, 1949, 198, 2822, 38145, 11, 912, 8631, 11, 1120, 757, 323, 279, 9581, 198, 40, 2846, 29066, 389, 279, 11573, 11, 8430, 13989, 198, 2409, 279, 7160, 389, 856, 3663, 11, 358, 2846, 16926, 41972, 271, 7, 69143, 220, 17, 340, 52430, 12932, 304, 856, 1450, 11, 264, 9439, 4322, 389, 264, 4106, 1938, 198, 8921, 7490, 323, 1695, 3115, 11, 304, 1475, 3254, 1648, 198, 17111, 19033, 304, 279, 13180, 11, 264, 3814, 311, 6227, 198, 43346, 19459, 430, 690, 1566, 16058, 271, 7, 1163, 30969, 340, 12174, 11, 7474, 596, 1618, 11, 323, 358, 2846, 8430, 1949, 198, 2822, 38145, 11, 912, 8631, 11, 1120, 757, 323, 279, 9581, 198, 40, 2846, 29066, 389, 279, 11573, 11, 8430, 13989, 198, 2409, 279, 7160, 389, 856, 3663, 11, 358, 2846, 16926, 41972, 271, 5462, 11431, 340, 1687, 3358, 33586, 279, 7160, 5022, 11, 323, 15612, 304, 279, 3814, 198, 2409, 1057, 45713, 304, 279, 9462, 11, 323, 1057, 23492, 8430, 1314, 198, 1687, 3358, 1304, 420, 7474, 11, 832, 311, 6227, 198, 2409, 279, 16267, 323, 279, 3021, 11, 430, 584, 3358, 32859, 271, 7, 1163, 30969, 340, 12174, 11, 7474, 596, 1618, 11, 323, 358, 2846, 8430, 1949, 198, 2822, 38145, 11, 912, 8631, 11, 1120, 757, 323, 279, 9581, 198, 40, 2846, 29066, 389, 279, 11573, 11, 8430, 13989, 198, 2409, 279, 7160, 389, 856, 3663, 11, 358, 2846, 16926, 41972, 271, 7, 2729, 299, 340, 4516, 1095, 596, 4933, 1057, 6206, 11, 323, 1095, 279, 4731, 1514, 198, 1687, 3358, 61792, 709, 279, 7160