 right place at the right time, reducing the risk of stockouts or overstocking.\n\nBy leveraging these AI-powered solutions, businesses can improve their inventory management processes, reduce costs, and increase customer satisfaction.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 5627, 304, 902, 15592, 649, 1520, 10299, 15808, 5990, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 54644, 535, 33527, 96618, 15592, 41503, 60336, 28975, 649, 1520, 9873, 18057, 7631, 323, 30536, 15808, 5990, 555, 42118, 13970, 6763, 828, 11, 3280, 2786, 11, 323, 9434, 9547, 1778, 439, 9282, 323, 25425, 13, 1115, 20682, 5220, 311, 463, 64119, 2800, 1197, 477, 7652, 872, 15808, 5990, 311, 3449, 10223, 7631, 11, 18189, 279, 5326, 315, 5708, 11934, 477, 927, 13787, 287, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 42172, 660, 29226, 47170, 96618, 15592, 41503, 15808, 6373, 6067, 649, 9651, 3839, 15808, 5990, 11, 8891, 5708, 19567, 11, 323, 5225, 9873, 994, 5990, 527, 3428, 477, 994, 3956, 527, 31047, 872, 32792, 13003, 13, 1115, 26420, 430, 15808, 374, 2744, 709, 4791, 18920, 323, 13687, 11, 18189, 279, 5326, 315, 5708, 11934, 477, 927, 13787, 287, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 22078, 67064, 315, 29226, 66807, 323, 328, 45456, 96618, 15592, 649, 30536, 15808, 30158, 323, 38952, 555, 42118, 9547, 1778, 439, 9629, 12912, 11, 9282, 11, 323, 5754, 4787, 311, 8417, 279, 1455, 11297, 11543, 369, 9889, 323, 30686, 13, 1115, 649, 1520, 8108, 18386, 7194, 11, 7417, 9889, 3115, 11, 323, 6106, 430, 15808, 374, 12886, 311, 279, 1314, 2035, 520, 279, 1314, 892, 11, 18189, 279, 5326, 315, 5708, 11934, 477, 927, 13787, 287, 382, 1383, 77582, 1521, 15592, 41503, 10105, 11, 9873, 649, 7417, 872, 15808, 6373, 11618, 11, 8108, 7194, 11, 323, 5376, 6130, 24617, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
