Output~2025-04-24 17:20:46.557702: [RequestOutput(request_id=1290, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story that begins with the sentence: "As he looked out into the horizon, he saw..." ### Response:\'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 430, 12302, 449, 279, 11914, 25, 330, 2170, 568, 7111, 704, 1139, 279, 35174, 11, 568, 5602, 21908, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='As he looked out into the horizon, he saw a faint glow on the edge of the sky, a soft pinkish hue that seemed to pulse with an otherworldly energy. It was a sight he had seen before, but never with such intensity. The sun was setting, casting a warm orange glow over the landscape, but this strange light seemed to be emanating from beyond the horizon, drawing his attention like a magnet.\n\nHe felt a shiver run down his spine as he gazed out at the phenomenon, his mind racing with questions. What was it? Where was it coming from? And why did it seem to be calling to him?\n\nAs he stood there, transfixed, the light began to grow brighter, illuminating the darkening landscape with an ethereal glow. The air seemed to vibrate with an electric charge, and he could feel the hairs on the back of his neck standing on end.\n\nSuddenly, the light vanished, leaving him blinking in the sudden darkness. But the memory of it lingered, etched in his mind like a brand. He knew that he had to follow it, to uncover the source of that strange and wondrous light.\n\nWithout hesitation, he set off across the desert, driven by a sense of wonder and curiosity. The stars were beginning to twinkle in the sky above, and the moon was rising, casting a silver glow over the landscape. He walked for hours, the darkness illuminated only by the faint light of the stars, until finally, he saw it - a shimmering portal, pulsing with the same energy he had seen on the horizon.\n\nWithout hesitation, he stepped through the portal, and found himself in a world unlike any he had ever known. The air was filled with a sweet, musical hum, and the ground beneath his feet was soft and spongy. Strange, glowing plants towered above him, casting an eerie light over the landscape.\n\nHe wandered through this strange new world, marveling at the wonders that surrounded him. He saw creatures that defied explanation, and plants that seemed to defy the laws of nature. And at the heart of it all, he saw the source of the light - a great, glowing crystal, pulsing with energy.\n\nAs he reached out to touch it, the crystal began to glow even brighter, and he felt himself being drawn into its heart. He closed his eyes, and let the energy wash over him, feeling his mind expanding, his senses heightening. And when he opened his eyes again, he saw the world in', token_ids=[2170, 568, 7111, 704, 1139, 279, 35174, 11, 568, 5602, 264, 38678, 37066, 389, 279, 6964, 315, 279, 13180, 11, 264, 8579, 18718, 819, 40140, 430, 9508, 311, 28334, 449, 459, 1023, 14957, 398, 4907, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 14254, 568, 1047, 3970, 1603, 11, 719, 2646, 449, 1778, 21261, 13, 578, 7160, 574, 6376, 11, 25146, 264, 8369, 19087, 37066, 927, 279, 18921, 11, 719, 420, 15234, 3177, 9508, 311, 387, 69239, 1113, 505, 7953, 279, 35174, 11, 13633, 813, 6666, 1093, 264, 33297, 382, 1548, 6612, 264, 559, 1553, 1629, 1523, 813, 35776, 439, 568, 342, 28109, 704, 520, 279, 25885, 11, 813, 4059, 22019, 449, 4860, 13, 3639, 574, 433, 30, 11208, 574, 433, 5108, 505, 30, 1628, 3249, 1550, 433, 2873, 311, 387, 8260, 311, 1461, 1980, 2170,