money does not require power or batteries to function, making it a reliable choice for transactions in areas with limited access to electricity.\n\n9. **Easy to store**: Paper money is easy to store and organize, with bills folding up neatly and taking up minimal space.\n\n10. **Cultural significance**: Paper money often holds cultural and historical significance, with many countries featuring iconic designs and symbols on their currency.\n\nOverall, paper money offers a range of advantages that make it a popular and practical choice for everyday transactions.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 22934, 315, 1701, 5684, 3300, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1128, 40647, 96618, 18343, 3300, 374, 13882, 11928, 323, 6847, 15987, 11, 3339, 433, 264, 17125, 1376, 315, 8323, 369, 18254, 14463, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 7229, 2968, 96618, 18343, 19123, 527, 30244, 323, 4228, 311, 6920, 11, 3339, 1124, 264, 15325, 5873, 369, 40386, 323, 7931, 889, 1205, 311, 1304, 21420, 24393, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 15712, 96618, 18343, 3300, 374, 6319, 449, 4868, 4519, 1778, 439, 3090, 15914, 11, 72927, 95801, 11, 323, 1933, 7666, 18148, 27513, 311, 5471, 5663, 1897, 5977, 323, 6106, 54348, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 37830, 311, 1005, 96618, 18343, 3300, 374, 4228, 311, 1005, 323, 3619, 11, 449, 2867, 62265, 811, 323, 4382, 14463, 382, 20, 13, 3146, 2822, 1205, 369, 5557, 96618, 18343, 3300, 1587, 539, 1397, 904, 3361, 7241, 477, 5557, 311, 1005, 11, 3339, 433, 15987, 311, 1274, 315, 682, 17051, 323, 36576, 382, 21, 13, 3146, 2822, 5326, 315, 7528, 28483, 96618, 18343, 3300, 374, 539, 47281, 311, 7528, 28483, 477, 39238, 11, 8405, 459, 3779, 6324, 315, 4868, 369, 14463, 382, 22, 13, 3146, 51, 533, 458, 3217, 96618, 18343, 3300, 5825, 264, 99683, 3217, 11, 10923, 7931, 311, 2733, 279, 10651, 323, 4785, 315, 279, 19123, 11, 902, 649, 387, 264, 37154, 323, 82964, 3217, 382, 23, 13, 3146, 2822, 1205, 369, 2410, 96618, 18343, 3300, 1587, 539, 1397, 2410, 477, 27360, 311, 734, 11, 3339, 433, 264, 15062, 5873, 369, 14463, 