Output~2025-04-24 17:21:30.575455: [RequestOutput(request_id=1315, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a blurb for a book about time travel. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 1529, 9225, 369, 264, 2363, 922, 892, 5944, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='"Join renowned physicist Dr. Emma Taylor on a thrilling adventure through the fabric of time as she uncovers the secrets of the timestream. In "The Chronos Prophecy," Emma\'s groundbreaking research into the mysteries of quantum mechanics has led her to a shocking discovery: a way to manipulate the very fabric of time itself. As she embarks on a journey through the ages, Emma must navigate treacherous landscapes, avoid the consequences of her own actions, and confront the dark forces that seek to exploit her discovery for their own gain. With the fate of the timestream hanging in the balance, Emma must use her wits and her knowledge to prevent a catastrophic future and restore the course of history. But as the stakes grow higher, Emma begins to realize that the past is not as fixed as she thought, and that the very fabric of reality is about to be torn apart. Can she find a way to set things right, or will the timestream be forever altered?"', token_ids=[1, 12572, 37048, 83323, 2999, 13, 36035, 16844, 389, 264, 57399, 18427, 1555, 279, 13354, 315, 892, 439, 1364, 21482, 9146, 279, 24511, 315, 279, 259, 4350, 1259, 13, 763, 330, 791, 26560, 437, 3998, 50831, 1359, 36035, 596, 6495