Output~2025-04-24 17:23:05.047956: [RequestOutput(request_id=1346, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a letter to your future self 10 years from now. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 6661, 311, 701, 3938, 659, 220, 605, 1667, 505, 1457, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Dear Future Self,\n\nAs I sit down to write this letter to you, I am filled with a mix of emotions - excitement, nervousness, and a hint of curiosity. I am writing to you from the present, 10 years from now, and I can only imagine the incredible journey that lies ahead of you.\n\nAs I reflect on the past decade, I am reminded of the struggles, triumphs, and lessons learned. I hope that by the time you read this, you will have continued to grow, evolve, and thrive. I hope that you will have pursued your passions, taken risks, and made mistakes that have led to valuable experiences.\n\nI hope that you will have found a sense of purpose and fulfillment in your career, whether that be in a traditional 9-to-5 job or through entrepreneurial ventures. I hope that you will have built meaningful relationships with loved ones, friends, and like-minded individuals who support and inspire you.\n\nI hope that you will have traveled to new places, explored different cultures, and experienced the beauty of the world around you. I hope that you will have taken time to appreciate the little things, to practice mindfulness, and to prioritize your mental and physical well-being.\n\nAs you look back on the past decade, I hope that you will be proud of the person you have become. I hope that you will have learned to be kind to yourself, to forgive yourself, and to celebrate your accomplishments. I hope that you will have developed a growth mindset, embracing challenges and viewing failures as opportunities for growth.\n\nAs you move forward into the next decade, I hope that you will continue to be open to new experiences, to take calculated risks, and to stay true to yourself. I hope that you will continue to prioritize your values, to nurture your relationships, and to pursue your dreams.\n\nMost importantly, I hope that you will remember to be patient, kind, and compassionate with yourself. Remember that life is a journey, not a destination, and that every step you take is a step closer to becoming the best version of yourself.\n\nAs you read this letter, I hope that you will be filled with a sense of hope, optimism, and excitement for the future. I hope that you will be reminded of the incredible potential that lies within you, and that you will continue to strive to be the best version of yourself.\n\nWith love and support,\n\nYour Past Self', token_ids=[31765, 12781, 10323, 3638, 2170, 358, 2503, 1523, 311, 3350, 420, 6661, 311, 499, 11, 358, 1097, 10409, 449, 264, 6651, 315, 21958, 482, 28361, 11, 23418, 2136, 11, 323, 264, 13310, 315, 41328, 13, 358, 1097, 4477, 311, 499, 505, 279, 3118, 11, 220, 605, 1667, 505, 1457, 11, 323, 358, 649, 1193, 13085, 279, 15400, 11879, 430, 15812, 8469, 315, 499, 382, 2170, 358, 8881, 389, 279, 3347, 13515, 11, 358, 1097, 31256, 315, 279, 28970, 11, 38586, 82, 11, 323, 18872, 9687, 13, 358, 3987, 430, 555, 279, 892, 499, 1373, 420, 11, 499, 690, 617, 8738, 311, 3139, 11, 38680, 11, 323, 41972, 13, 358, 3987, 430, 499, 690, 617, 46531, 701, 58724, 11, 4529, 15635, 11, 323, 1903, 21294, 430, 617, 6197, 311, 15525, 11704, 382, 40, 3987, 430, 499, 690, 617, 1766, 264, 5647, 315, 7580, 323, 57383, 304, 701,