Output~2025-04-24 17:23:23.363099: [RequestOutput(request_id=1351, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a list of five vegetables and their nutritional benefits. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 1160, 315, 4330, 24822, 323, 872, 43226, 7720, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a list of five vegetables and their nutritional benefits:\n\n**1. Broccoli**\n\n* Rich in vitamins C and K, broccoli is a powerful antioxidant that helps protect against cancer and supports healthy bones.\n* High in fiber, broccoli can help lower cholesterol levels and regulate blood sugar levels.\n* Contains a group of compounds called glucosinolates, which have been shown to have anti-inflammatory properties.\n\n**2. Spinach**\n\n* Packed with iron, spinach is essential for healthy red blood cells and can help prevent anemia.\n* Rich in lutein and zeaxanthin, spinach can help protect vision health and reduce the risk of age-related macular degeneration.\n* High in antioxidants, spinach can help reduce inflammation and protect against chronic diseases like heart disease and cancer.\n\n**3. Carrots**\n\n* High in vitamin A, carrots are essential for healthy vision, immune function, and skin health.\n* Rich in fiber, carrots can help regulate blood sugar levels and support healthy digestion.\n* Contain a powerful antioxidant called beta-carotene, which can help protect against cancer and heart disease.\n\n**4. Sweet Potatoes**\n\n* Rich in vitamin A and fiber, sweet potatoes are a great source of energy and can help support healthy digestion.\n* High in antioxidants, sweet potatoes can help protect against chronic diseases like heart disease and cancer.\n* Contain a type of antioxidant called anthocyanin, which has been shown to have anti-inflammatory properties.\n\n**5. Kale**\n\n* Packed with vitamins A, C, and K, kale is a powerful antioxidant that can help protect against chronic diseases like heart disease and cancer.\n* Rich in fiber, kale can help regulate blood sugar levels and support healthy digestion.\n* Contains a group of compounds called isothiocyanates, which have been shown to have anti-inflammatory and anti-cancer properties.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any questions.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 4330, 24822, 323, 872, 43226, 7720, 1473, 334, 16, 13, 6031, 60803, 57277, 9, 8269, 304, 46192, 356, 323, 735, 11, 79276, 374, 264, 8147, 70339, 430, 8779, 6144, 2403, 9572, 323, 11815, 9498, 25896, 627, 9, 5234, 304, 24722, 11, 79276, 649, 1520, 4827, 39086, 5990, 323, 37377, 6680, 13465, 5990, 627, 9, 31911, 264, 1912, 315, 32246, 2663, 30217, 437, 258, 337, 988, 11, 902, 617, 1027, 6982, 311, 617, 7294, 67595, 6012, 382, 334, 17, 13, 41785, 613, 57277, 9, 393, 11440, 449, 11245, 11, 68798, 374, 7718, 369, 9498, 2579, 6680, 7917, 323, 649, 1520, 5471, 459, 22689, 627, 9, 8269, 304, 326, 1088, 258, 323, 14017, 710, 32329, 258, 11, 68798, 649, 1520, 6144, 11376, 2890, 323, 8108, 279, 5326, 315, 4325, 14228, 9155, 1299, 5367, 17699, 627, 9, 5234, 304, 81115, 11, 68798, 649, 1520, 8108, 37140, 323, 6144, 2403, 21249, 19338, 1093, 4851, 8624, 323, 9572, 382, 334, 18, 13, 3341, 90329, 57277, 9, 5234, 304, 28170, 362, 11, 62517, 527, 7718, 369, 9498, 11376, 11, 22852, 734, 11, 323, 6930, 2890, 627, 9, 8269, 304, 24722, 11, 62517, 649, 1520, 37377, 6680, 13465, 5990, 323, 1862, 9498, 74502, 627, 9, 2140, 467, 264, 8147, 70339, 2663, 13746, 24948, 354, 1994, 11, 902, 649, 1520, 6