entence structure, and tenses\n* Use flashcards, language learning apps, or online resources to practice vocabulary and grammar exercises\n* Gradually move on to more complex grammar and vocabulary as confidence and skills improve\n\nBy achieving these two sub-goals, the person will be well on their way to developing a strong foundation in Spanish and making consistent progress towards fluency in a year.", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 11, 358, 1053, 4284, 279, 2768, 1403, 1207, 20521, 1147, 311, 1520, 11322, 279, 17139, 5915, 315, 1694, 58868, 304, 15506, 304, 264, 1060, 1473, 334, 3214, 12, 41092, 220, 16, 25, 8000, 264, 13263, 4221, 6975, 14348, 57277, 9, 2638, 16038, 264, 3230, 892, 1855, 1938, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 220, 966, 4520, 8, 311, 74704, 311, 15506, 4221, 6975, 198, 9, 4324, 264, 9899, 323, 9396, 311, 433, 11, 1524, 422, 433, 596, 1120, 220, 868, 12, 508, 4520, 264, 1938, 198, 9, 5560, 264, 4221, 6975, 917, 11, 18181, 11, 477, 2930, 5211, 311, 8641, 279, 7446, 6725, 198, 9, 22547, 1870, 5376, 279, 8250, 323, 11900, 315, 6725, 927, 892, 271, 334, 3214, 12, 41092, 220, 17, 25, 26891, 389, 4857, 36018, 323, 32528, 16665, 57277, 9, 5256, 555, 6975, 279, 1455, 4279, 36018, 323, 32847, 304, 15506, 11, 1778, 439, 95185, 11, 6111, 5247, 11, 323, 6913, 32847, 369, 22106, 3691, 323, 10371, 369, 18445, 198, 9, 26891, 389, 8830, 323, 1701, 32528, 5718, 11, 1778, 439, 19120, 64380, 367, 11, 11914, 6070, 11, 323, 259, 4377, 198, 9, 5560, 8381, 26076, 11, 4221, 6975, 10721, 11, 477, 2930, 5070, 311, 6725, 36018, 323, 32528, 23783, 198, 9, 22547, 1870, 3351, 389, 311, 810, 6485, 32528, 323, 36018, 439, 12410, 323, 7512, 7417, 271, 1383, 32145, 1521, 1403, 1207, 20521, 1147, 11, 279, 1732, 690, 387, 1664, 389, 872, 1648, 311, 11469, 264, 3831, 16665, 304, 15506, 323, 3339, 13263, 5208, 7119, 20236, 2301, 304, 264, 1060, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cach