for the team's success\n* Willingness to learn from mistakes and improve\n\n**VI. Flexibility and Adaptability**\n\n* Ability to adjust to changing circumstances and priorities\n* Willingness to pivot and adapt plans as needed\n* Flexibility in leadership style and approach\n* Ability to manage ambiguity and uncertainty\n\n**VII. Integrity and Trust**\n\n* Demonstrates honesty and transparency in all interactions\n* Builds trust with team members and stakeholders\n* Consistently follows through on commitments\n* Maintains confidentiality and discretion when necessary\n\n**VIII. Continuous Learning and Development**\n\n* Commitment to ongoing learning and professional development\n* Encourages team members to learn and grow\n* Stays up-to-date with industry trends and best practices\n* Fosters a culture of continuous improvement and innovation.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 459, 21782, 315, 279, 17910, 315, 264, 6992, 2128, 7808, 1473, 334, 40, 13, 48023, 31966, 57277, 9, 12292, 323, 64694, 10758, 1742, 198, 9, 10106, 14624, 7512, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 69318, 11376, 323, 9021, 198, 9, 5377, 323, 18300, 10758, 12006, 271, 334, 5660, 13, 37263, 31340, 57277, 9, 27191, 5597, 28846, 323, 3575, 99246, 18000, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 62425, 323, 31740, 2128, 3697, 198, 9, 48023, 46361, 323, 74477, 315, 2128, 3697, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 10737, 311, 10223, 13463, 323, 30601, 271, 334, 23440, 13, 95300, 22107, 57277, 9, 10323, 66104, 2136, 323, 659, 33263, 2987, 198, 9, 13714, 19682, 323, 8830, 315, 2128, 3697, 6, 21958, 323, 3966, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 10299, 12324, 323, 5107, 21633, 198, 9, 45003, 323, 33445, 19451, 271, 334, 3166, 13, 31541, 323, 46661, 53389, 57277, 9, 12292, 8830, 315, 279, 2128, 596, 7580, 323, 9021, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 743, 323, 63652, 26470, 198, 9, 46661, 9293, 323, 11572, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 10737, 311, 10223, 13463, 323, 30601, 271, 334, 53, 13, 84790, 323, 78712, 57277, 9, 38707, 15637, 315, 2128, 5178, 323, 20124, 198, 9, 67084, 2128, 3697, 36977, 369, 872, 6299,