op-Punk: This genre emerged in the mid-1990s and was characterized by its catchy melodies, simple harmonies, and energetic live performances. Bands like Green Day, Blink-182, and Sum 41 were popular in this genre, which was often associated with the skateboarding and surfer cultures of California.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 18273, 36744, 430, 1051, 5526, 304, 279, 220, 2550, 15, 82, 1473, 16, 13, 2895, 14208, 25, 362, 1207, 34713, 315, 10778, 7091, 430, 44853, 304, 16759, 11, 32971, 555, 1202, 8987, 17418, 436, 19383, 11, 26609, 9262, 24142, 11, 323, 35947, 26480, 9404, 13, 88402, 1093, 78843, 68559, 11, 37343, 20614, 11, 323, 14936, 70, 8506, 1051, 21102, 304, 420, 17779, 627, 17, 13, 45628, 11529, 454, 19945, 391, 25, 578, 220, 2550, 15, 82, 5602, 279, 10205, 315, 18638, 49819, 323, 7477, 4731, 11, 449, 13820, 1093, 97197, 582, 87665, 324, 11, 578, 2876, 22766, 426, 2506, 1246, 2637, 323, 2999, 13, 66110, 68366, 279, 27223, 13, 1115, 17779, 574, 32971, 555, 1202, 29171, 21914, 8982, 11, 86337, 950, 48929, 11, 323, 40418, 17371, 22100, 627, 18, 13, 42209, 9305, 25, 1115, 17779, 22763, 304, 279, 3389, 220, 3753, 15, 82, 719, 8813, 1202, 16557, 304, 279, 220, 2550, 15, 82, 13, 88402, 1093, 13792, 2025, 11, 34528, 79067, 11, 323, 4487, 19587, 34826, 11966, 1051, 5526, 304, 420, 17779, 11, 902, 574, 32971, 555, 1202, 22772, 5222, 11, 26609, 9262, 24142, 11, 323, 7294, 31092, 4116, 19451, 627, 19, 13, 35269, 15302, 685, 25, 578, 220, 2550, 15, 82, 5602, 279, 10205, 315, 14683, 323, 15612, 4731, 11, 449, 36744, 1093, 89999, 11, 98531, 11, 323, 3838, 4731, 30240, 23354, 13, 53204, 1093, 14569, 728, 52433, 11, 36424, 34179, 11, 323, 386, 28113, 1051, 21102, 304, 420, 17779, 11, 902, 574, 32971, 555, 1202, 5043, 65319, 34427, 11, 92106, 10578, 11, 323, 45955, 16975, 627, 20, 13, 10466, 9483, 3200, 25, 1115, 17779, 22763, 304, 279, 5209, 12, 2550, 15, 82, 323, 574, 32971, 555, 1202, 86605, 90113, 11, 4382, 18249, 552, 11, 323, 45955, 3974, 24601, 13, 88402, 1093, 7997, 61