Output~2025-04-24 17:26:18.165869: [RequestOutput(request_id=1414, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What are three ways to reduce single-use plastic waste? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 527, 2380, 5627, 311, 8108, 3254, 25700, 12466, 12571, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are three ways to reduce single-use plastic waste:\n\n1. **Carry a reusable water bottle and coffee cup**: Instead of buying bottled water or coffee every day, carry a refillable water bottle and coffee cup with you. This can significantly reduce the number of plastic bottles and cups that end up in landfills and oceans. You can also consider purchasing a reusable straw and utensils to further reduce your plastic usage.\n\n2. **Choose products with minimal or biodegradable packaging**: When shopping, opt for products that have minimal or biodegradable packaging. For example, choose products with cardboard or paper packaging instead of plastic wrap or bubble wrap. You can also look for products with refill options or those that use eco-friendly packaging materials.\n\n3. **Refuse single-use bags and containers**: Refuse single-use bags and containers whenever possible. Instead, carry a reusable bag or backpack when shopping, and choose products that come in bulk or with minimal packaging. You can also opt for products with reusable containers, such as beeswax wraps or stainless steel containers, to reduce your reliance on single-use plastic containers.\n\nBy implementing these simple changes, you can significantly reduce your contribution to single-use plastic waste and help protect the environment.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 5627, 311, 8108, 3254, 25700, 12466, 12571, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 9028, 894, 264, 62671, 3090, 16893, 323, 11033, 10747, 96618, 12361, 315, 12096, 72178, 3090, 477, 11033, 1475, 1938, 11, 6920, 264, 74815, 481, 3090, 16893, 323, 11033, 10747, 449, 499, 13, 1115, 649, 12207, 8108, 279, 1396, 315, 12466, 27474, 323, 26446, 430, 842, 709, 304, 4363, 67267, 323, 54280, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 2980, 23395, 264, 62671, 31107, 323, 82036, 8839, 311, 4726, 8108, 701, 12466, 10648, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 25017, 3956, 449, 17832, 477, 6160, 536, 78130, 24066, 96618, 3277, 12185, 11, 3469, 369, 3956, 430, 617, 17832, 477, 6160, 536, 78130, 24066, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 5268, 3956, 449, 55043, 477, 5684, 24066, 4619, 315, 12466, 15411, 477, 24529, 15411, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 1427, 369, 3956, 449, 74815, 2671, 477, 1884, 430, 1005, 42688, 22658, 24066, 7384, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 4032, 817, 3254, 25700, 18381, 323, 24794, 96618, 8718, 817, 3254, 25700, 18381, 323, 24794, 15716, 3284, 13, 12361, 11, 6920, 264, 62671, 9145, 477, 34236, 994, 12185, 11, 323, 5268, 3956, 430, 2586, 304, 20155, 477, 449, 17832, 24066, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 3469, 369, 3956, 449, 62671, 24794, 11, 1778, 439, 40558, 86, 710, 40809, 477, 25468, 9699, 24794, 11, 311, 8108, 701, 54180, 389, 3254, 25700, 12466, 24794, 382, 1383, 25976, 1521, 4382, 4442, 11, 499, 649, 12207, 8108, 701, 19035, 311, 3254, 25700, 12466, 12571, 323, 1520, 6144, 279, 4676, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
