Output~2025-04-24 17:26:30.231035: [RequestOutput(request_id=1420, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Come up with a creative think to recycle an old shoe ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 15936, 709, 449, 264, 11782, 1781, 311, 61843, 459, 2362, 30077, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="What a great challenge!\n\nHere's a creative idea to recycle an old shoe:\n\n**Upcycled Shoe Planter**\n\nTransform an old shoe into a unique planter for small plants or herbs! Here's how:\n\nMaterials needed:\n\n* Old shoe (any type, but a sneaker or a sandal would work best)\n* Decorative paint (acrylic or spray paint)\n* A small amount of potting soil\n* A small plant or herb of your choice (e.g., succulent, basil, or thyme)\n* Decorative rocks or small pebbles\n* Optional: glue, scissors, and a hot glue gun\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Clean the shoe thoroughly with soap and water to remove any dirt or debris.\n2. Dry the shoe completely with a towel.\n3. Paint the shoe with decorative paint to give it a fresh, new look. You can add patterns, stripes, or even a fun design.\n4. Once the paint is dry, fill the shoe with potting soil, leaving about an inch at the top for the plant.\n5. Plant your chosen small plant or herb in the soil. You can arrange the soil and plant to create a visually appealing design.\n6. Add decorative rocks or small pebbles around the plant to add some texture and color.\n7. If you want to add an extra touch, use glue to attach a small decorative item, like a tiny figurine or a small shell, to the shoe.\n8. Finally, use a hot glue gun to attach a small piece of twine or ribbon to the top of the shoe, creating a hanger for your planter.\n\nVoilà! Your upcycled shoe planter is ready to brighten up any room or outdoor space.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 8815, 2268, 8586, 596, 264, 11782, 4623, 311, 61843, 459, 2362, 30077, 1473, 334, 2378, 66, 37676, 68181, 9878, 466, 57277, 9140, 459, 2362, 30077, 1139, 264, 5016, 3197, 466, 369, 2678, 11012, 477, 42393, 0, 5810, 596, 1268, 1473, 61612, 4460, 1473, 9, 10846, 30077, 320, 3852, 955, 11, 719, 264, 21423, 4506, 477, 264, 9462, 278, 1053, 990, 1888, 340, 9, 28069, 1413, 6308, 320, 582, 44280, 477, 23749, 6308, 340, 9, 362, 2678, 3392, 315, 3419, 1303, 17614, 198, 9, 362, 2678, 6136, 477, 39999, 315, 701, 5873, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 20639, 29580, 11, 68186, 11, 477, 270, 31218, 340, 9, 28069, 1413, 23902, 477, 2678, 1069, 6194, 645, 198, 9, 12536, 25, 38561, 11, 72724, 11, 323, 264, 4106, 38561, 6166, 271, 56391, 1473, 16, 13, 9785, 279, 30077, 27461, 449, 27883, 323, 3090, 311, 4148, 904, 26351, 477, 35098, 627, 17, 13, 31941, 279, 30077, 6724, 449, 264, 43713, 627, 18, 13, 17646, 279, 30077, 449, 46536, 6308, 311, 3041, 433, 264, 7878, 11, 502, 1427, 13, 1472, 649, 923, 12912, 11, 55788, 11, 477, 1524, 264, 2523, 2955, 627, 19, 13, 9843, 279, 6308, 374, 9235, 11, 5266, 279, 30077, 449, 3419, 1303, 17614, 11, 9564, 922, 459, 17560, 520, 279, 1948, 369, 279, 6136, 627, 20, 13, 18317, 701, 12146, 2678, 6136, 477, 39999, 304, 279, 17614, 13, 1472, 649, 31993, 279, 17614, 323, 6136, 311, 1893, 264, 43395, 33352, 2955, 627, 21, 13, 2758, 46536, 23902, 477, 2678, 1069, 6194, 645, 2212, 279, 6136, 311, 923, 1063, 10651, 323, 1933, 627, 22, 13, 1442, 499, 1390, 311, 923, 459, 5066, 5916, 11, 1005, 38561, 311, 15866, 264, 2678, 46536, 1537, 11, 1093, 264, 13987, 56755, 483, 477, 264, 2678, 12811, 11, 311, 279, 30077, 627, 23, 13, 17830, 11, 1005, 264, 4106, 38561, 6166, 