Output~2025-04-24 17:27:58.555685: [RequestOutput(request_id=1462, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a \'How to\' guide on baking a cake. ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 364, 4438, 311, 6, 8641, 389, 28915, 264, 19692, 13, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="**How to Bake a Delicious Cake: A Step-by-Step Guide**\n\nBaking a cake can seem like a daunting task, but with this simple guide, you'll be on your way to creating a moist and delicious cake in no time. Follow these steps to ensure a successful baking experience:\n\n**Step 1: Gather Ingredients and Equipment**\n\n* 2 cups of all-purpose flour\n* 1 teaspoon of baking powder\n* 1 teaspoon of salt\n* 1 cup of unsalted butter, softened\n* 1 3/4 cups of granulated sugar\n* 3 large eggs, at room temperature\n* 2 teaspoons of vanilla extract\n* 1 cup of whole milk, at room temperature\n* Confectioners' sugar, for dusting (optional)\n* A 9-inch round cake pan, greased and floured\n* A mixing bowl, whisk, rubber spatula, and electric mixer (stand or handheld)\n\n**Step 2: Preheat the Oven**\n\n* Preheat your oven to 350°F (180°C). Make sure to adjust the oven racks to the middle position.\n\n**Step 3: Prepare the Cake Pan**\n\n* Grease the cake pan with butter or cooking spray and dust it with flour. This will ensure the cake releases easily after baking.\n\n**Step 4: Mix the Dry Ingredients**\n\n* In a medium-sized bowl, whisk together the flour, baking powder, and salt. Set aside.\n\n**Step 5: Mix the Wet Ingredients**\n\n* In a large mixing bowl, cream the butter and sugar until light and fluffy, about 2-3 minutes.\n* Beat in the eggs one at a time, allowing each egg to fully incorporate before adding the next.\n* Beat in the vanilla extract.\n\n**Step 6: Combine the Wet and Dry Ingredients**\n\n* With the mixer on low speed, gradually add the dry ingredients to the wet ingredients in three parts, alternating with the milk, beginning and ending with the dry ingredients. Beat just until combined.\n\n**Step 7: Scrape Down the Bowl**\n\n* Stop the mixer and scrape down the sides of the bowl with a rubber spatula to ensure all ingredients are well incorporated.\n\n**Step 8: Beat the Mixture**\n\n* Beat the mixture on medium speed for 2 minutes, until it becomes smooth and creamy.\n\n**Step 9: Pour the Batter**\n\n* Pour the batter into the prepared cake pan and smooth the top with a spatula.\n\n**Step 10: Bake the Cake**\n\n*", token_ids=[334, 4438, 311, 53174, 264, 85788, 33860, 25, 362, 15166, 14656, 12, 8468, 13002, 57277, 33, 1802, 264, 19692, 649, 2873, 1093, 264, 57697, 3465, 11, 719, 449, 420, 4382, 8641, 11, 499, 3358, 387, 389, 701, 1648, 311, 6968, 264, 21147, 323, 18406, 19692, 304, 912, 892, 13, 11359, 1521, 7504, 311, 6106, 264, 6992, 28915, 3217, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 52275, 323, 20849, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 315, 682, 59338, 20415, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 315, 28915, 17138, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 315, 12290, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 315, 7120, 62334, 14432, 11, 90158, 198, 9, 220, 16, 220, 18, 14, 19, 26446, 315, 16109, 7913, 13465, 198, 9, 220, 18, 3544, 19335, 11, 520, 3130, 9499, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 315, 33165, 8819, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 315, 4459, 14403, 11, 520, 3130, 9499, 198, 9, 1221, 13421, 388, 6, 13465, 11, 369, 16174, 287, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 362, 220, 24, 25224, 4883, 19692, 7363, 11, 2886, 1503, 323, 1344, 21020, 198, 9, 362, 27890, 19763, 11, 41759, 11, 23506, 63983, 5724, 11, 323, 9249, 388