with just anyone.\n\nAs I continue to imagine Emilia, I find myself drawn to her contradictions - the way she's both fierce and gentle, bold and reserved, strong and vulnerable. She's a complex, multifaceted character, full of mysteries and surprises, and I'm excited to see where her journey will take her.", token_ids=[2170, 358, 2503, 1523, 311, 3240, 856, 19775, 3446, 11, 358, 1505, 7182, 15107, 311, 264, 46684, 889, 374, 2225, 6485, 323, 41765, 13, 26911, 5867, 25045, 11, 264, 220, 914, 4771, 6418, 5333, 449, 264, 89164, 315, 69203, 14198, 7013, 323, 60220, 6307, 6548, 430, 2873, 311, 3412, 264, 16579, 24511, 13, 6385, 6930, 706, 264, 8369, 11, 21411, 37066, 11, 264, 61300, 311, 1077, 3021, 315, 279, 34632, 323, 1077, 21420, 3521, 76339, 1139, 279, 14373, 33633, 382, 2321, 25045, 596, 4519, 527, 36301, 11, 3686, 3831, 11, 449, 1579, 41803, 82091, 323, 264, 2678, 19689, 430, 4483, 26286, 449, 28361, 15716, 1364, 596, 7422, 17693, 13, 6385, 23726, 527, 2539, 323, 18718, 11, 92626, 1139, 264, 66693, 15648, 430, 31743, 520, 264, 4062, 38467, 323, 264, 17676, 5647, 315, 28485, 13, 6385, 6548, 11, 4869, 11, 527, 279, 1455, 21933, 4668, 315, 1077, 3663, 482, 814, 2873, 311, 39786, 1139, 1884, 1364, 5992, 520, 11, 439, 422, 15389, 369, 2555, 8340, 24923, 279, 7479, 382, 20397, 1077, 38920, 4124, 11, 5867, 25045, 506, 29246, 264, 11594, 12410, 323, 26314, 430, 374, 2225, 86282, 323, 64130, 13, 3005, 706, 264, 1648, 315, 15691, 11937, 430, 11545, 6666, 11, 439, 422, 1364, 596, 2744, 5644, 311, 1935, 389, 279, 1917, 13, 1628, 3686, 11, 1070, 596, 264, 34104, 311, 1077, 11, 264, 5647, 315, 8508, 1429, 430, 1364, 27270, 15499, 11, 439, 422, 433, 596, 264, 27498, 32726, 1364, 596, 539, 10032, 311, 4430, 449, 1120, 5606, 382, 2170, 358, 3136, 311, 13085, 5867, 25045, 11, 358, 1505, 7182, 15107, 311, 1077, 81523, 482, 279, 1648, 1364, 596, 2225, 42442, 323, 22443, 11, 14265, 323, 4694, 11, 3831, 323, 20134, 13, 3005, 596, 264, 6485, 11, 62387, 582, 25489, 3752, 11, 2539, 315, 57