Output~2025-04-24 17:28:41.654129: [RequestOutput(request_id=1483, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a story starter given this scenario. ### Input: The dark, silent forest had been filled with rumors lately. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 3446, 27795, 2728, 420, 15398, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 578, 6453, 11, 21737, 13952, 1047, 1027, 10409, 449, 35492, 31445, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='As the last rays of sunlight faded from the sky, a sense of unease settled over the dark, silent forest. The trees, once towering and majestic, now loomed like sentinels, their branches creaking ominously in the gentle breeze. It was as if they were sharing a secret, one that only the forest creatures knew. The rumors had been circulating for weeks, whispers of strange occurrences and unexplained events that had left even the bravest of travelers hesitant to venture into the woods. Some spoke of ghostly apparitions, while others whispered of dark rituals performed under the light of the full moon. But one thing was certain: the forest was changing, and the silence was oppressive, heavy with an unspoken menace.', token_ids=[2170, 279, 1566, 45220, 315, 40120, 54434, 505, 279, 13180, 11, 264, 5647, 315, 6316, 521, 23183, 927, 279, 6453, 11, 21737, 13952, 13, 578, 12690, 11, 3131, 87794, 323, 81389, 11, 1457, 781, 25111, 1093, 3288, 258