Output~2025-04-24 17:28:55.645036: [RequestOutput(request_id=1491, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a list of 5 activities to do outdoors on a rainy day. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 1160, 315, 220, 20, 7640, 311, 656, 34632, 389, 264, 63857, 1938, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are 5 activities to do outdoors on a rainy day:\n\n1. **Nature Scavenger Hunt**: Create a list of items to find outside, such as different types of leaves, rocks, or birds, and see who can spot the most items on the list. You can even make it more challenging by giving clues or riddles to solve before finding the next item on the list.\n\n2. **Rainy Day Photography**: Grab your camera or phone and head outside to capture the beauty of the rain. Look for interesting patterns on puddles, raindrops on leaves, or the way the rain affects the lighting and shadows. You can even take photos of the rain itself, like the way it falls or the sound it makes on different surfaces.\n\n3. **Nature Journaling**: Take a notebook and pencils outside and record your observations of the natural world. Write down what you see, hear, and smell, and draw pictures of the plants and animals you encounter. You can even collect leaves, rocks, or other natural materials to glue into your journal.\n\n4. **Rainy Day Birdwatching**: Put on your rain gear and head outside to spot some birds. Look for birds that are attracted to the rain, such as robins or sparrows, and see if you can identify different species. You can even set up a bird feeder or birdbath to attract more birds to your yard.\n\n5. **Rainy Day Nature Games**: Play games that don\'t require a lot of space or equipment, such as "I Spy" or "20 Questions" using natural objects. You can also play "Follow the Leader" and see who can come up with the most creative moves, like jumping in puddles or making rain sounds with your mouth.\n\nI hope these ideas help you have a fun and adventurous rainy day!', token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 7640, 311, 656, 34632, 389, 264, 63857, 1938, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 79519, 2522, 402, 10214, 27690, 96618, 4324, 264, 1160, 315, 3673, 311, 1505, 4994, 11, 1778, 439, 2204, 4595, 315, 11141, 11, 23902, 11, 477, 20229, 11, 323, 1518, 889, 649, 7858, 279, 1455, 3673, 389, 279, 1160, 13, 1472, 649, 1524, 1304, 433, 810, 17436, 555, 7231, 43775, 477, 436, 78555, 311, 11886, 1603, 9455, 279, 1828, 1537, 389, 279, 1160, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 60139, 88, 6187, 41147, 96618, 37294, 701, 6382, 477, 4641, 323, 2010, 4994, 311, 12602, 279, 13444, 315, 279, 11422, 13, 9372, 369, 7185, 12912, 389, 55682, 645, 11, 11422, 91612, 389, 11141, 11, 477, 279, 1648, 279, 11422, 22223, 279, 18186, 323, 35612, 13, 1472, 649, 1524, 1935, 7397, 315, 279, 11422, 5196, 11, 1093, 279, 1648, 433, 17503, 477, 279, 5222, 433, 3727, 389, 2204, 27529, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 79519, 10139, 287, 96618, 12040, 264, 38266, 323, 97438, 4994, 323, 3335, 701, 24654, 315, 279, 5933, 1917, 13, 9842, 1523, 1148, 499, 1518, 11, 6865, 11, 323, 22843, 11, 323, 4128, 9364, 315, 279, 11012, 323, 10099, 499, 13123, 13, 1472, 649, 1524, 6667, 11141, 11, 23902, 11, 477, 1023, 5933, 7384, 311, 38561, 1139, 701, 8486, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 60139, 88, 6187, 24214, 14658, 287, 96618, 10435, 389, 701, 11422, 14787, 323, 2010, 4994, 311, 7858, 1063, 20229, 13, 9372, 369, 20229, 430, 527, 29123, 311, 279, 11422, 11, 1778, 439, 10773, 1354, 477, 80969, 1849, 11, 323, 1518, 422, 499, 649, 10765, 2204, 9606, 13