 the kids hydrated with juice boxes and water bottles.\n\n**Activities:**\n\n1. Arts and Crafts: Set up a craft station with paper, glue, scissors, and other supplies for the kids to create their own masterpieces.\n2. Outdoor Games: Play classic outdoor games like tag, hide-and-seek, and capture the flag.\n3. Science Experiments: Set up simple science experiments, such as making slime or creating a volcano.\n4. Karaoke Contest: Set up a karaoke machine and have the kids sing their favorite songs.\n5. Photo Booth: Create a photo booth with props like hats, glasses, and mustaches for the kids to take silly photos.\n\n**Favors:**\n\n1. Goodie Bags: Fill goodie bags with treats like candy, stickers, and small toys.\n2. Customized Water Bottles: Give each guest a customized water bottle with their name or initials.\n3. DIY Crafts: Have the kids make their own crafts, such as beaded jewelry or decorated picture frames, to take home.\n4. Bookmarks: Create bookmarks with the party's theme or a special message for each guest.\n5. Small Toys: Give each guest a small toy or trinket related to the party's theme", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2523, 3465, 0, 5810, 527, 1063, 6848, 369, 264, 2911, 596, 4717, 430, 527, 2771, 311, 18454, 1473, 334, 12880, 23748, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 7445, 18204, 16543, 16192, 25, 2638, 709, 459, 33287, 3388, 323, 617, 279, 6980, 3719, 91818, 3502, 86470, 627, 17, 13, 56297, 11746, 33112, 25, 15583, 279, 4717, 3634, 1139, 264, 34261, 449, 37066, 3502, 10826, 22592, 48679, 323, 617, 279, 6980, 733, 389, 264, 83750, 10214, 19614, 369, 20167, 36136, 627, 18, 13, 62248, 596, 58248, 27690, 25, 4324, 264, 32726, 2472, 323, 10477, 32726, 2212, 279, 4717, 3158, 369, 279, 6980, 311, 1505, 627, 19, 13, 6984, 17884, 73141, 33112, 25, 2638, 709, 264, 16006, 323, 617, 264, 33873, 18427, 449, 274, 2846, 4692, 11, 7493, 11, 323, 264, 93744, 83750, 10214, 19614, 627, 20, 13, 78844, 27726, 23868, 25, 2638, 709, 2204, 94496, 3953, 323, 7640, 11, 1778, 439, 10264, 26251, 11, 47