Output~2025-04-24 17:30:19.153364: [RequestOutput(request_id=1524, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a creative way to market a movie. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 11782, 1648, 311, 3157, 264, 5818, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here\'s a creative way to market a movie:\n\n**"Escape the Ordinary" Immersive Experience**\n\nTo promote the upcoming sci-fi thriller, "The Quantum Prophecy," we\'re creating an immersive experience that transports audiences into the world of the movie. Here\'s how:\n\n**Step 1: The Mysterious Briefcase**\n\nWe\'ll distribute mysterious briefcases containing a cryptic message and a pair of augmented reality (AR) glasses to select influencers, media outlets, and lucky fans. The message will invite them to "decode the prophecy" and unlock exclusive content.\n\n**Step 2: The Quantum Portal**\n\nWe\'ll set up interactive "quantum portals" in major cities worldwide, where people can step into a futuristic environment and experience the movie\'s themes and visuals. The portals will be equipped with AR technology, allowing users to interact with the movie\'s characters and environments.\n\n**Step 3: The Time-Traveler\'s Challenge**\n\nWe\'ll create a social media campaign where fans can participate in a time-traveler\'s challenge. By solving puzzles and completing tasks, participants will unlock exclusive content, including behind-the-scenes footage, character interviews, and a chance to win a trip to the movie\'s premiere.\n\n**Step 4: The Quantum Scavenger Hunt**\n\nWe\'ll hide QR codes and cryptic clues throughout the city, leading fans on a scavenger hunt to uncover the secrets of the movie. The final clue will reveal a special message from the movie\'s cast and crew, encouraging fans to "escape the ordinary" and experience the movie.\n\n**Step 5: The Premiere Event**\n\nThe grand finale will be a red-carpet premiere event where fans who completed the challenges will receive exclusive access to a special screening of the movie, complete with a Q&A session with the cast and crew.\n\n**Hashtag Campaign: #EscapeTheOrdinary**\n\nThroughout the campaign, we\'ll encourage fans to share their experiences on social media using the hashtag #EscapeTheOrdinary. We\'ll feature the best content on our official social media channels, creating a sense of community and FOMO (fear of missing out) among fans.\n\nBy creating an immersive experience that blurs the lines between reality and the movie, we\'ll generate buzz, drive engagement, and make "The Quantum Prophecy" a must-see event.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 11782, 1648, 311, 3157, 264, 5818, 1473, 334, 1, 49224, 279, 99011, 1, 15695, 53453, 21460, 57277, 1271, 12192, 279, 14827, 39074, 37731, 54461, 11, 330, 791, 56413, 3998, 50831, 1359, 584, 2351, 6968, 459, 65280, 3217, 430, 69169, 30994, 1139, 279, 1917, 315, 279, 5818, 13, 5810, 596, 1268, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 578, 386, 97499, 37618, 5756, 57277, 1687, 3358, 16822, 26454, 10015, 24857, 8649, 264, 14774, 292, 1984, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 57088, 8903, 320, 946, 8, 29247, 311, 3373, 87333, 11, 3772, 28183, 11, 323, 18069, 7359, 13, 578, 1984, 690, 22114, 1124, 311, 330, 18696, 279, 66884, 1, 323, 15405, 14079, 2262, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 578, 56413, 34831, 57277, 1687, 3358, 743, 709, 21416, 330, 31548, 372, 76563, 1, 304, 3682, 9919, 15603, 11, 1405, 1274, 649, 3094, 1139, 264, 80320, 4676, 323, 3217, 279, 5818, 596, 22100, 323, 54077, 13, 578,