Output~2025-04-24 17:31:55.863093: [RequestOutput(request_id=1563, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a time you felt excited. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 892, 499, 6612, 12304, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="One of the most exciting moments in my life was when I went skydiving for the first time. I had always been fascinated by the idea of freefalling from 10,000 feet in the air and taking in the breathtaking views of the earth below. As I stood at the open door of the plane, feeling the rush of the wind and the sun shining down on my face, I couldn't help but feel a mix of emotions - excitement, nervousness, and a hint of fear.\n\nAs I took the leap of faith and jumped out of the plane, the rush of adrenaline was intense. The freefall was exhilarating, and I felt like I was flying. The wind whipping past my face, the ground far below, and the stunning views of the landscape unfolding before my eyes - it was an experience unlike any other.\n\nThe excitement was palpable as I deployed my parachute and began to float gently towards the ground. I felt a sense of accomplishment and pride, knowing that I had faced my fears and pushed myself to try something new. The sense of freedom and exhilaration lingered long after the jump was over, and I knew that this was an experience I would never forget.", token_ids=[4054, 315, 279, 1455, 13548, 14269, 304, 856, 2324, 574, 994, 358, 4024, 13180, 614, 287, 369, 279, 1176, 892