Output~2025-04-24 17:32:48.950074: [RequestOutput(request_id=1577, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a plan for how to learn a new skill in 3 months. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 3197, 369, 1268, 311, 4048, 264, 502, 10151, 304, 220, 18, 4038, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a plan for learning a new skill in 3 months:\n\n**Step 1: Define the Skill and Goals (Weeks 1-2)**\n\n* Identify the new skill I want to learn (e.g., programming, photography, public speaking, etc.)\n* Set specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound (SMART) goals for learning the skill\n* Break down the goal into smaller, manageable tasks and milestones\n* Create a timeline for achieving the goal, with deadlines for each milestone\n\n**Step 2: Gather Resources and Materials (Weeks 1-2)**\n\n* Research and gather relevant resources, such as:\n\t+ Online courses or tutorials\n\t+ Books or e-books\n\t+ YouTube channels or podcasts\n\t+ Practice exercises or projects\n\t+ Online communities or forums\n* Create a list of the resources and materials needed to learn the skill\n\n**Step 3: Create a Study Schedule (Weeks 1-12)**\n\n* Create a study schedule that outlines when and how much time I will dedicate to learning the skill each week\n* Set aside dedicated time for studying and practicing the skill, ideally at the same time each day or week\n* Prioritize the most important tasks and milestones, and allocate more time for those areas\n\n**Step 4: Practice and Apply the Skill (Weeks 3-12)**\n\n* Start practicing the skill, using the resources and materials gathered in Step 2\n* Apply the skill to real-world projects or exercises, to reinforce learning and build confidence\n* Review and reflect on progress regularly, identifying areas for improvement and adjusting the study schedule as needed\n\n**Step 5: Review and Refine (Weeks 9-12)**\n\n* Review and refine the skills learned, focusing on areas that need improvement\n* Practice applying the skill in different contexts or scenarios\n* Reflect on the progress made and identify any remaining gaps or areas for further learning\n\n**Step 6: Evaluate and Celebrate (Week 12)**\n\n* Evaluate the progress made towards the original goal\n* Celebrate the achievements and accomplishments\n* Identify any remaining areas for improvement and create a plan to continue learning and refining the skill\n\nBy following this plan, I can create a structured and focused approach to learning a new skill in 3 months, and achieve my goals with confidence and motivation.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3197, 369, 6975, 264, 502, 10151, 304, 220, 18, 4038, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 19127, 279, 28582, 323, 55293, 320, 17490, 82, 220, 16, 12, 17, 33395, 271, 9, 65647, 279, 502, 10151, 358, 1390, 311, 4048, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 15840, 11, 24685, 11, 586, 12365, 11, 5099, 29275, 9, 2638, 3230, 11, 66303, 11, 89253, 11, 9959, 11, 323, 892, 50962, 320, 99872, 8, 9021, 369, 6975, 279, 10151, 198, 9, 15996, 1523, 279, 5915, 1139, 9333, 11, 71128, 9256, 323, 69376, 198, 9, 4324, 264, 25845, 369, 32145, 279, 5915, 11, 449, 58982, 369, 1855, 43291, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 50095, 16607, 323, 32009, 320, 17490, 82, 220, 16, 12, 17, 33395, 271, 9, 8483, 323, 9762, 9959, 5070, 11, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 8267, 14307, 477, 44912, 198, 197, 10, 18312, 477, 384, 84191, 198, 197, 10, 13674, 12006, 477, 55346, 198, 197, 10, 28082, 23783, 477, 7224, 198, 197, 10, 8267, 10977, 477