h-end finishes and plenty of counter space. And the master bedroom has a huge walk-in closet with custom shelving. Plus, the location is fantastic - you're just a short walk from the local park and a few blocks from the downtown area.\n\n**Potential Buyer:** That sounds amazing. What about the commute? How long would it take to get to work?\n\n**Real Estate Agent:** The commute is actually very reasonable. You're about 20 minutes from the city center, and there's a bus stop just a block away. And if you prefer to drive, the highway is just a few minutes away.\n\n**Potential Buyer:** That's perfect. What about the neighborhood? Is it a safe area?\n\n**Real Estate Agent:** Absolutely. This neighborhood is very safe and family-friendly. The neighbors are all very friendly, and there's a strong sense of community. Plus, the local school district is highly rated.\n\n**Potential Buyer:** Wow, I'm really impressed. What's the average cost of utilities here?\n\n**Real Estate Agent:** The average cost of utilities is around $150-200 per month, depending on your usage. And the property also has a great energy-efficient rating, so you can expect to save on your energy bills.\n\n**Potential Buyer:** That's great to know. Can I think about it and get back to you?\n\n**Real Estate Agent:** Of course! Take all the time you need. I'll be here when you're ready to make an offer.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 10652, 1990, 264, 1972, 12675, 8479, 323, 264, 4754, 26171, 1473, 334, 13058, 25447, 21372, 68063, 21694, 1070, 0, 9930, 499, 369, 13126, 420, 6366, 3424, 13, 358, 2846, 779, 16089, 499, 2351, 8173, 304, 6975, 810, 922, 433, 13, 3053, 358, 1212, 555, 7231, 499, 264, 4062, 7364, 323, 1243, 584, 649, 4358, 279, 3430, 1980, 334, 96711, 62178, 68063, 3011, 10578, 2294, 11, 9901, 499, 0, 358, 3077, 1027, 3411, 369, 264, 2035, 449, 264, 36760, 369, 856, 6980, 311, 1514, 11, 323, 420, 832, 5084, 4832, 382, 334, 13058, 25447, 21372, 68063, 56647, 0, 1115, 3424, 706, 264, 17104, 36760, 44