se: Dinner\n4. Recipe Name: Fresh Fruit Salad\n\t* Ingredients: Mixed Berries, Grapes, Pineapple, Kiwi\n\t* Cooking Time: 5 minutes\n\t* Course: Snack\n5. Recipe Name: Chocolate Lava Cake\n\t* Ingredients: Chocolate Chips, Eggs, Flour, Sugar\n\t* Cooking Time: 20 minutes\n\t* Course: Dessert\n\n**Goal:**\n\nDevelop a classification model that can accurately predict the course of a recipe based on its attributes. The model should be able to correctly classify new, unseen recipes into one of the five categories: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Snack, or Dessert.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 330, 70953, 498, 358, 690, 1893, 264, 24790, 3575, 382, 334, 32298, 22504, 25, 57277, 1999, 1463, 19141, 1139, 832, 315, 279, 2768, 11306, 25, 44291, 11, 56699, 11, 49191, 11, 13358, 474, 11, 477, 70596, 531, 382, 334, 1061, 25, 57277, 791, 10550, 17610, 315, 264, 1160, 315, 19141, 11, 1855, 449, 279, 2768, 8365, 1473, 9, 26371, 4076, 198, 9, 52275, 198, 9, 57410, 4212, 198, 9, 17026, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 44291, 11, 56699, 11, 49191, 11, 13358, 474, 11, 70596, 531, 696, 334, 6396, 25, 57277, 16834, 279, 2728, 828, 11, 1893, 264, 24790, 1646, 430, 649, 30357, 7168, 279, 3388, 320, 5588, 8, 315, 264, 11363, 3196, 389, 1202, 8365, 320, 39220, 11, 17677, 892, 11, 5099, 75303, 334, 13617, 45302, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 26371, 4076, 25, 7671, 47282, 9806, 198, 197, 9, 52275, 25, 7671, 47282, 11, 50141, 11, 28138, 11, 52882, 198, 197, 9, 57410, 4212, 25, 220, 20, 4520, 198, 197, 9, 17026, 25, 44291, 198, 17, 13, 26371, 4076, 25, 2895, 4473, 34619, 67836, 198, 197, 9, 52275, 25, 34619, 57598, 11, 50141, 11, 6914, 83, 10743, 11, 94091, 11, 58157, 198, 197, 9, 57410, 4212, 25, 220, 605, 4520, 198, 197, 9, 17026, 25, 56699, 198, 18, 13, 26371, 4076, 25, 3165, 65065, 426, 1640, 77, 2423, 198, 197, 9, 52275, 25, 3165, 65065, 11, 26486, 64225, 11, 94091, 61276, 11, 56744, 63524, 45419, 198, 197, 9, 57410, 4212, 25, 220, 966, 4520, 198, 197, 9, 17026, 25, 49191, 198, 19, 13, 26371, 4076, 25, 30260, 441