uschetta is perfect as an appetizer or side dish for your next gathering. The sweetness of the tomatoes pairs beautifully with the pungency of the garlic and the crunch of the toasted bread. Buon appetito!", token_ids=[3923, 264, 18406, 10824, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 5016, 3691, 11363, 1701, 279, 2728, 14293, 1473, 334, 25763, 4428, 11, 87035, 11, 323, 95825, 3320, 52178, 27625, 57277, 334, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 57277, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 18, 3544, 41613, 11, 89964, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 38427, 11, 99531, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 18, 85388, 315, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 9145, 84, 6672, 11, 48715, 1139, 220, 16, 25224, 12314, 20101, 198, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 30260, 68186, 11141, 11, 38525, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5075, 20559, 701, 24276, 311, 220, 3443, 59572, 320, 1049, 32037, 4390, 17, 13, 763, 264, 3544, 19763, 11, 16343, 279, 89964, 41613, 11, 48715, 38427, 11, 323, 94927, 31735, 627, 18, 13, 2999, 44237, 279, 33213, 5707, 927, 279, 21655, 323, 26251, 311, 23724, 13, 14598, 449, 12290, 323, 25349, 311, 12945, 627, 19, 13, 41680, 279, 9145, 84, 6672, 35354, 389, 264, 28915, 11071, 323, 23211, 304, 279, 24276, 369, 220, 20, 12, 22, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 34504, 14198, 291, 627, 20, 13, 11016, 279, 16385, 505, 279, 24276, 323, 1095, 433, 7155, 10284, 627, 21, 13, 94613, 279, 42120, 11, 38427, 11, 323, 31735, 21655, 927, 279, 93972, 16385, 35354, 627, 22, 13, 15883, 36244, 449, 38525, 7878, 68186, 11141, 11, 422, 12974, 627, 23, 13, 54032, 7214, 323, 4774, 2268, 2028, 1437, 52178, 27625, 374, 4832, 439, 459, 30168, 3213, 477, 3185, 12269, 369, 701, 1828, 23738, 13, 578, 64550, 315, 279, 41613, 13840, 32719, 449, 279, 281, 2234, 2301, 315, 279, 31735, 323, 279, 42834, 315, 279, 93972, 16385, 13, 28326, 263, 30168, 6491, 0, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cache