Output~2025-04-24 17:36:18.995731: [RequestOutput(request_id=1647, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a new recipe for a vegetarian dish. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 502, 11363, 369, 264, 46482, 12269, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Recipe: Roasted Vegetable Quinoa Bowl with Lemon-Tahini Sauce**\n\n Servings: 4-6\n\n**Ingredients:**\n\nFor the quinoa:\n\n* 1 cup quinoa, rinsed and drained\n* 2 cups water or vegetable broth\n* 1 tablespoon olive oil\n* Salt, to taste\n\nFor the roasted vegetables:\n\n* 2 large sweet potatoes, peeled and cubed\n* 1 large red bell pepper, seeded and cubed\n* 1 large red onion, peeled and cubed\n* 2 cloves garlic, minced\n* 2 cups broccoli florets\n* 2 tablespoons olive oil\n* Salt and pepper, to taste\n* Fresh parsley, chopped (optional)\n\nFor the lemon-tahini sauce:\n\n* 1/2 cup tahini\n* 1/4 cup freshly squeezed lemon juice\n* 1/4 cup water\n* 1 clove garlic, minced\n* 1/2 teaspoon salt\n* 3 tablespoons olive oil\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).\n2. In a medium saucepan, bring the quinoa and water or broth to a boil. Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for about 15-20 minutes or until the quinoa is tender and fluffy. Fluff with a fork.\n3. In a large bowl, toss the sweet potatoes, bell pepper, onion, and garlic with 1 tablespoon of olive oil, salt, and pepper until they are evenly coated. Spread the vegetables on a baking sheet and roast for 25-30 minutes or until they are tender and lightly caramelized.\n4. In a separate bowl, toss the broccoli florets with the remaining 1 tablespoon of olive oil, salt, and pepper. Spread the broccoli on a separate baking sheet and roast for 15-20 minutes or until tender and slightly browned.\n5. To make the lemon-tahini sauce, combine the tahini, lemon juice, water, garlic, and salt in a blender or food processor. Blend until smooth and creamy, adding more water if needed to achieve the desired consistency. With the blender or food processor running, slowly pour in the olive oil through the top. Season with salt to taste.\n6. To assemble the quinoa bowls, divide the cooked quinoa among bowls. Top with the roasted sweet potatoes, bell pepper, onion, and broccoli. Drizzle the lemon-tahini sauce over the top and sprinkle with chopped', token_ids=[334, 29880, 25, 12093, 15386, 95392, 3489, 80094, 20904, 449, 52310, 9469, 1494, 6729, 61276, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 2520, 279, 934, 80094, 1473, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 934, 80094, 11, 97139, 291, 323, 61508, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 3090, 477, 36581, 45993, 198, 9, 220, 16, 62611, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 11, 311, 12945, 271, 2520, 279, 54662, 24822, 1473, 9, 220, 17, 3544, 10437, 35267, 11, 83612, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 2579, 29519, 25349, 11, 90916, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 2579, 38427, 11, 83612, 323, 19250, 291, 198, 9, 220, 17, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 79276, 9943, 76430, 198, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 30260, 88621, 11, 38525, 320, 13099, 696, 2520, 279, 30564, 2442, 1494, 6729, 19737, 1473, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 91193, 6729, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 50999, 65262, 30564, 23661, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 3090, 198, 9, 220, 16, 5405, 588, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 12290, 198, 9, 220, 18, 56588, 33213, 5707, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 