Output~2025-04-24 17:36:38.036326: [RequestOutput(request_id=1651, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Imagine you are an etiquette coach, and you need to instruct someone on how to start a conversation with a stranger at a social event. Provide a list of 3 practical steps to follow. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 38891, 499, 527, 459, 94305, 7395, 11, 323, 499, 1205, 311, 21745, 4423, 389, 1268, 311, 1212, 264, 10652, 449, 264, 35058, 520, 264, 3674, 1567, 13, 40665, 264, 1160, 315, 220, 18, 15325, 7504, 311, 1833, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='As an etiquette coach, I\'d be delighted to guide you on how to start a conversation with a stranger at a social event. Here are three practical steps to follow:\n\n**Step 1: Prepare Yourself**\n\nBefore approaching the stranger, take a moment to collect your thoughts and compose yourself. Make sure you\'re standing up straight, with a friendly and approachable demeanor. Take a deep breath, and mentally prepare to be yourself. This will help you feel more confident and relaxed, which is essential for starting a conversation.\n\n**Step 2: Find a Common Ground**\n\nWhen approaching the stranger, try to find something you both have in common. This could be a shared interest, a mutual acquaintance, or even a common location. Look for something that can serve as a conversation starter. For example, you might say, "Hi, I\'m [Your Name]. I noticed you\'re from [City/Company/Industry]. I\'ve always been fascinated by [related topic]. What brings you here tonight?"\n\n**Step 3: Keep it Light and Engaging**\n\nOnce you\'ve found a common ground, keep the conversation light and engaging. Avoid asking too many personal or intrusive questions, and instead focus on topics that are easy to discuss. You might ask follow-up questions about their interests, hobbies, or work, or share a relevant anecdote of your own. Remember to actively listen to their responses and show genuine interest. Keep the conversation flowing by asking open-ended questions that encourage them to share more.\n\nBy following these three steps, you\'ll be well on your way to starting a conversation with a stranger at a social event. Just remember to be yourself, find common ground, and keep the conversation light and engaging. Happy networking!', token_ids=[2170, 459, 94305, 7395, 11, 358, 4265, 387, 35072, 311, 8641, 499, 389, 1268, 311, 1212, 264, 10652, 449, 264, 35058, 520, 264, 3674, 1567, 13, 5810, 527, 2380, 15325, 7504, 311, 1833, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 32266, 60005, 57277, 10438, 31047, 279, 35058, 11, 1935, 264, 4545, 311, 6667, 701, 11555, 323, 31435, 6261, 13, 7557, 2771, 499, 2351, 11509, 709, 7833, 11, 449, 264, 11919, 323, 5603, 481, 94115, 13, 12040, 264, 5655, 11745, 11, 323, 34325, 10772, 311, 387, 6261, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 2733, 810, 16913, 323, 31467, 11, 902, 374, 7718, 369, 6041, 264, 10652, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 7531, 264, 7874, 26486, 57277, 4599, 31047, 279, 35058, 11, 1456, 311, 1505, 2555, 499, 2225, 617, 304, 4279, 13, 1115, 1436, 387, 264, 6222, 2802, 11, 264, 27848, 82407, 11, 477, 1524, 264, 4279, 3813, 13, 9372, 369, 2555, 430, 649, 8854, 439, 264, 10652, 27795, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 499, 2643, 2019, 11, 330, 13347, 11, 358, 2846, 510, 7927, 4076, 948, 358, 14000, 499, 2351, 505, 510, 13020, 14, 14831, 14, 71616, 948, 358, 3077, 2744, 1027, 61914, 555, 510, 9920, 8712, 948, 3639, 12716, 499, 1618, 18396, 12241, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 13969, 433, 8828, 