ontemplation and peacefulness. The stillness of the snow-covered trees and the soft, diffused light create a sense of calm and serenity, inviting the viewer to step into the serene winter wonderland.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 12688, 53161, 19354, 1473, 334, 3936, 68063, 330, 37, 299, 24836, 20585, 1875, 334, 5116, 68063, 362, 95863, 323, 26733, 12688, 18921, 11, 330, 37, 299, 24836, 20585, 1, 41255, 279, 11594, 13444, 315, 264, 12056, 84408, 13952, 389, 264, 9439, 12688, 6693, 13, 578, 19354, 4519, 264, 29050, 2559, 315, 3596, 13553, 12690, 11, 872, 23962, 8987, 449, 279, 4785, 315, 50999, 21536, 12056, 13, 578, 490, 15655, 315, 279, 12690, 527, 264, 5655, 11, 9257, 14198, 11, 1418, 279, 12056, 84408, 49695, 527, 264, 20333, 4251, 11, 342, 75919, 304, 279, 8579, 11, 28639, 3177, 315, 279, 12688, 7160, 382, 334, 1668, 67509, 68063, 578, 25462, 8146, 304, 420, 19354, 527, 37199, 315, 6437, 323, 4251, 11, 449, 29727, 315, 6307, 323, 14198, 13, 578, 6437, 43076, 95263, 279, 8430, 315, 264, 9439, 12688, 13180, 11, 1418, 279, 4251, 12056, 11621, 264, 5647, 315, 53500, 323, 57311, 13, 578, 6307, 323, 14198, 82757, 4546, 41463, 323, 8149, 311, 279, 18528, 11, 95841, 279, 6237, 304, 279, 5933, 1917, 382, 334, 26004, 267, 56137, 68063, 578, 15998, 267, 56137, 304, 330, 37, 299, 24836, 20585, 1, 527, 14265, 323, 78223, 11, 449, 12314, 13931, 315, 6308, 6968, 264, 74644, 11, 4661, 2380, 33520, 2515, 13, 578, 10255, 706, 1511, 264, 10824, 315, 14739, 10539, 2695, 295, 323, 9235, 37161, 12823, 311, 11322, 279, 12974, 10651, 323, 8149, 382, 334, 44, 1411, 68063, 578, 8244, 20247, 315, 330, 37, 299, 24836, 20585, 1, 374, 832, 315, 11594, 39471, 367, 323, 26733, 2136, 13, 578, 2103, 2136, 315, 279, 12056, 84408, 12690, 323, 279, 8579, 11, 3722, 2656, 3177, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 19858, 323, 1446, 56685, 11, 42292, 279, 26792, 311, 3094, 1139, 279, 95863, 12688, 5895, 1974, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], 