Output~2025-04-24 17:38:42.691394: [RequestOutput(request_id=1682, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create an outline for a speech ### Input: Topic: The Benefits of Social Media ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 459, 21782, 369, 264, 8982, 17010, 5688, 25, 34011, 25, 578, 39195, 315, 9983, 7972, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a possible outline for a speech on "The Benefits of Social Media":\n\n**I. Introduction**\n\n* Hook: "In today\'s digital age, social media has become an integral part of our daily lives."\n* Brief overview of the topic: "The benefits of social media"\n* Thesis statement: "Social media has numerous benefits that can improve our personal and professional lives, and it\'s essential to understand and utilize them effectively."\n\n**II. Improved Communication**\n\n* Subpoint: "Social media enables global connectivity"\n\t+ Example: "With social media, we can connect with people from all over the world, share ideas, and collaborate on projects."\n* Subpoint: "Social media facilitates real-time communication"\n\t+ Example: "Social media allows us to stay updated on current events, news, and trends in real-time, making it an essential tool for staying informed."\n\n**III. Enhanced Networking Opportunities**\n\n* Subpoint: "Social media expands our professional network"\n\t+ Example: "Social media platforms like LinkedIn and Twitter allow us to connect with industry leaders, entrepreneurs, and professionals, opening up new opportunities for collaboration and career advancement."\n* Subpoint: "Social media helps us build personal relationships"\n\t+ Example: "Social media enables us to stay in touch with friends and family who live far away, and even make new connections through shared interests and hobbies."\n\n**IV. Increased Accessibility to Information**\n\n* Subpoint: "Social media provides access to a vast amount of information"\n\t+ Example: "Social media platforms like YouTube, podcasts, and online courses offer a wealth of knowledge on various topics, making it easier to learn new skills and stay updated on industry trends."\n* Subpoint: "Social media helps us stay informed about current events"\n\t+ Example: "Social media platforms like Twitter and Facebook provide real-time updates on news, allowing us to stay informed about what\'s happening in the world."\n\n**V. Conclusion**\n\n* Restate thesis statement: "Social media has numerous benefits that can improve our personal and professional lives."\n* Call to action: "Let\'s harness the power of social media to connect, learn, and grow, and make the most of its benefits."\n\nThis is just one possible outline, and you can modify it to fit your specific needs and style. Good luck with your speech!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3284, 21782, 369, 264, 8982, 389, 330, 791, 39195, 315, 9983, 7972, 52518, 334, 40, 13, 29438, 57277, 9, 29271, 25, 330, 644, 3432, 596, 7528, 4325, 11, 3674, 3772, 706, 3719, 459, 26154, 961, 315, 1057, 7446, 6439, 10246, 9, 37618, 24131, 315, 279, 8712, 25, 330, 791, 7720, 315, 3674, 3772, 702, 9, 75097, 5224, 25, 330, 27414, 3772, 706, 12387, 7720, 430, 649, 7417, 1057, 4443, 323, 6721, 6439, 11, 323, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 3619, 323, 29166, 1124, 13750, 2266, 334, 5660, 13, 59223, 31966, 57277, 9, 3804, 2837, 25, 330, 27414, 3772, 20682, 3728, 31357, 702, 197, 10, 13688, 25, 330, 2409, 3674, 377