Output~2025-04-24 17:42:20.632986: [RequestOutput(request_id=1759, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the process of selling a house. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 1920, 315, 11486, 264, 3838, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a detailed response that describes the process of selling a house:\n\n**Step 1: Preparation**\n\nBefore putting your house on the market, it's essential to prepare it for sale. This includes:\n\n* Decluttering and depersonalizing the space to make it more appealing to potential buyers\n* Cleaning and organizing the interior and exterior of the property\n* Making any necessary repairs, such as fixing leaky faucets or patching holes in the walls\n* Painting the walls and trim to give the house a fresh, neutral look\n* Landscaping the yard to improve curb appeal\n\n**Step 2: Setting a Competitive Price**\n\nDetermining the right price for your house is crucial to attracting potential buyers. Research the local real estate market to determine the average price of similar homes in your area. Consider factors such as the size, condition, and location of your property to set a competitive price.\n\n**Step 3: Choosing a Real Estate Agent**\n\nSelecting the right real estate agent can make a significant difference in the success of your sale. Look for an agent who is knowledgeable about the local market, has experience selling homes in your area, and has a good reputation. Interview several agents to find the one that best fits your needs and goals.\n\n**Step 4: Listing the Property**\n\nOnce you've chosen an agent, they will help you list your property on the local multiple listing service (MLS) and other online platforms. This will make your property visible to potential buyers and their agents.\n\n**Step 5: Showings and Offers**\n\nOnce your property is listed, potential buyers will start scheduling viewings. Be prepared to show your property at a moment's notice, and be flexible with your schedule. When an offer is made, your agent will help you negotiate the terms of the sale, including the price, closing date, and any contingencies.\n\n**Step 6: Inspections and Due Diligence**\n\nAfter an offer is accepted, the buyer will typically hire inspectors to evaluate the condition of the property. This may include inspections of the roof, foundation, and plumbing, as well as a termite inspection. Your agent can help facilitate this process and address any concerns that arise.\n\n**Step 7: Closing**\n\nThe final step is the closing process, where the ownership of the property is transferred to the buyer. This typically involves signing a stack of documents, transferring the title, and paying any outstanding fees. Your agent will guide you through this process and ensure that everything goes smoothly.\n\nBy following these steps,", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 11944, 2077, 430, 16964, 279, 1920, 315, 11486, 264, 3838, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 74435, 57277, 10438, 10917, 701, 3838, 389, 279, 3157, 11, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 10772, 433, 369, 6412, 13, 1115, 5764, 1473, 9, 32725, 6339, 287, 323, 2219, 1293, 278, 4954, 279, 3634, 311, 1304, 433, 810, 33352, 311, 4754, 23455, 198, 9, 47755, 323, 35821, 279, 15135, 323, 28362, 315, 279, 3424, 198, 9, 25274, 904, 5995, 31286, 11, 1778, 439, 36351, 24237, 88, 50886, 1441, 477, 11140, 287, 20349, 304, 279, 14620, 198, 9, 55143, 279, 14620, 323, 11259, 311, 3041, 279, 3838, 264, 7878, 11, 21277, 1427, 198, 9, 11680, 2445