ith one of the following options:\n\n1. 1 for Product Information\n2. 2 for Order Tracking\n3. 3 for Customer Support\n4. 4 for FAQs\n5. 5 to Exit\n\n**Bot Response**\n\nBased on your selection, I'll respond accordingly. If you have any further questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to ask.\n\n**Example Conversations**\n\nHere are a few examples of how our conversation might go:\n\nUser: Hi, I'm looking for information on your new product line.\nBot: Ah, great choice! Our new product line is designed to [briefly describe the product]. Would you like to know more about the features and pricing?\n\nUser: Yes, please.\nBot: Absolutely! Our new product line features [list features]. The pricing starts at [price]. Would you like to place an order?\n\nUser: Yes, I'd like to place an order.\nBot: Great! I'll guide you through the ordering process. Please provide me with your shipping information and payment details.\n\n**Error Handling**\n\nIf the user enters an invalid input, the bot will respond with an error message and ask the user to try again.\n\nError: Invalid input. Please try again.\n\n**Closing Message**\n\nThank you for chatting with me today! If", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 5429, 369, 459, 28598, 6369, 6465, 1473, 334, 14262, 4961, 57277, 9906, 0, 20776, 311, 510, 14831, 4076, 60, 13149, 6465, 13, 358, 2846, 1618, 311, 1520, 4320, 701, 4860, 323, 3493, 13291, 13, 2650, 649, 358, 1520, 499, 3432, 1980, 334, 6334, 9937, 57277, 5618, 3373, 832, 315, 279, 2768, 2671, 1473, 16, 13, 5761, 8245, 198, 17, 13, 7365, 47170, 198, 18, 13, 12557, 9365, 198, 19, 13, 87684, 198, 20, 13, 19532, 271, 334, 4921, 8245, 57277, 2746, 499, 2351, 3411, 369, 2038, 389, 1057, 3956, 11, 4587, 3373, 420, 3072, 13, 358, 649, 3493, 499, 449, 3649, 389, 1057, 2027, 4519, 11, 21913, 11, 323, 18539, 382, 334, 4531, 47170, 57277, 2746, 499, 4265, 1093, 311, 3839, 701, 2015, 11, 4587, 3373, 420, 3072, 13, 358, 649, 3493, 499, 449, 9013, 389, 279, 2704, 315, 701, 2015, 323, 13240, 9889, 24