Lower Body and Core**\n\n1. Warm-up: 5-minute light cardio\n2. Deadlifts (using dumbbells or a resistance band): 3 sets of 10 reps\n3. Calf raises: 3 sets of 15 reps\n4. Leg press (using a chair or bench): 3 sets of 10 reps\n5. Plank: 3 sets, holding for 30 seconds each\n6. Cool-down: 5-minute stretching\n\n**Day 6 and 7: Rest days**\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n\n* Start with lighter weights and gradually increase the weight as you get stronger.\n* Rest for 60-90 seconds", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 220, 19, 11477, 30619, 26308, 3197, 369, 264, 50048, 1473, 334, 10369, 220, 16, 25, 31714, 14285, 323, 92976, 57277, 16, 13, 46863, 5352, 25, 220, 20, 24401, 3177, 32844, 320, 73, 540, 3252, 304, 2035, 11, 30102, 503, 7977, 11, 5099, 29275, 17, 13, 23804, 27859, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 605, 41511, 198, 18, 13, 426, 560, 79, 90049, 449, 30355, 65, 6572, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 605, 41511, 198, 19, 13, 1183, 560, 79, 97604, 320, 985, 264, 10716, 477, 13731, 1680, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 605, 41511, 198, 20, 13, 1856, 1201, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 11, 10168, 369, 220, 966, 6622, 1855, 198, 21, 13, 92976, 25, 220, 605, 24401, 75491, 11689, 477, 99738, 304, 2035, 198, 22, 13, 24882, 15220, 25, 220, 20, 24401, 42949, 271, 334, 10369, 220, 17, 25, 28636, 14285, 323, 9708, 57277, 16, 13, 46863, 5352, 25, 220, 20, 24401, 3177, 32844, 198, 17, 13, 20685, 1900, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 605, 41511, 198, 18, 13, 356, 3181, 25930, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 868, 41511, 198, 19, 13, 78336, 288, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 605, 41511, 320, 716, 2531, 340, 20, 13, 7765, 25930, 320, 6852, 389, 701, 1203, 449, 14535, 7833, 1680, 220, 18, 7437, 315, 220, 868, 41511, 198, 21, 13, 1856, 1201, 25, 220, 18, 7437, 11, 10168, 369, 220, 966, 6622, 1855, 198, 22, 13, 24882, 15220, 25, 220, 20, 24401, 42949, 271, 334, 10369, 220, 18, 25, 9240, 1938, 57277, 334, 10369, 220, 19, 25, 31714, 14285, 323, 92976, 57277, 16, 13, 46863, 5352, 25, 220, 20, 24401, 3177, 32844, 198, 17, 13, 42871, 357