ly has a stable income and can adjust expenses accordingly.\n* The family should review and revise the budget regularly to ensure it is working effectively.\n* The budget should prioritize needs over wants, and make adjustments as necessary to ensure financial stability and security.\n\nBy following this budget plan, the family can ensure that they are managing their finances effectively, building savings, and making progress towards their financial goals.', token_ids=[334, 15547, 28368, 9878, 57277, 334, 59998, 25, 57277, 9, 45434, 16498, 25, 400, 20, 11, 931, 198, 9, 7089, 8070, 320, 13014, 11, 56364, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 400, 2636, 198, 9, 10884, 15438, 8070, 25, 400, 20, 11, 2636, 271, 334, 13829, 92523, 25, 57277, 9, 30837, 10482, 371, 15292, 25, 400, 16, 11, 4728, 198, 9, 36094, 320, 64465, 488, 11, 3090, 11, 6962, 11, 7757, 1680, 400, 3965, 198, 9, 3341, 11941, 14, 1655, 25, 400, 3101, 198, 9, 22413, 320, 12393, 11, 3313, 11, 2162, 1680, 400, 1049, 198, 9, 32025, 6807, 3786, 14507, 25, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 14642, 4121, 25, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 30717, 3600, 320, 81566, 11, 19343, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 10884, 8521, 18512, 25, 400, 17, 11, 13655, 271, 334, 7983, 92523, 25, 57277, 9, 18370, 56282, 25, 400, 2636, 198, 9, 23334, 320, 67, 5859, 704, 11, 9698, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 400, 1049, 198, 9, 21523, 369, 1841, 25, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 18589, 25, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 79377, 320, 7005, 18512, 11, 2162, 13709, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 400, 1041, 198, 9, 10884, 3977, 18512, 25, 400, 16, 11, 931, 271, 334, 50, 46851, 25, 57277, 9, 32708, 3887, 25, 220, 605, 4, 315, 2860, 8070, 1746, 13506, 340, 9, 70289, 19523, 25, 220, 20, 4, 315, 2860, 8070, 1746, 14417, 340, 9, 7089, 19523, 9021, 320, 68534, 3887, 11, 5099, 13, 1680, 220, 20, 4, 315, 2860, 8070, 1746, 14417, 340, 9, 10884, 19523, 25, 400, 16, 11, 1041, 271, 334, 1951, 13045, 3402, 6202, 25, 57277, 9, 16666, 3786, 11897, 25, 400, 2636, 198, 9, 11988, 17017, 25, 400, 1049, 198, 9, 10884, 11897, 71118, 25, 400, 7