Output~2025-04-24 17:45:10.209662: [RequestOutput(request_id=1825, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Give three tips on writing an effective resume. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 21335, 2380, 10631, 389, 4477, 459, 7524, 16063, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are three tips on writing an effective resume:\n\n**Tip 1: Tailor Your Resume to the Job**\n\nWhen writing a resume, it\'s essential to tailor it to the specific job you\'re applying for. Study the job description and requirements, and make sure your resume highlights the skills and experiences that align with the job. Use keywords from the job posting and incorporate them into your resume, especially in your summary, skills section, and work experience. This will help your resume pass through applicant tracking systems (ATS) and catch the eye of the hiring manager.\n\n**Tip 2: Use a Clear and Concise Format**\n\nA well-organized and easy-to-read format is crucial for an effective resume. Use a clean and simple layout, with bullet points and clear headings to break up large blocks of text. Use a standard font, such as Arial, Calibri or Helvetica, and a font size between 10 and 12 points. Make sure your most important information, such as your name and contact information, is prominently displayed at the top of the page. Keep your paragraphs short and focused on one or two key points, and use action verbs like "managed," "created," and "developed" to describe your achievements.\n\n**Tip 3: Highlight Achievements and Results**\n\nInstead of just listing your job responsibilities, focus on the achievements and results you\'ve achieved in your previous roles. Quantify your accomplishments by using numbers and statistics to demonstrate the impact you\'ve made. For example, instead of saying "increased sales," say "increased sales by 25%." Highlight any awards, recognition, or promotions you\'ve received, and include any relevant certifications, licenses, or education. By focusing on your achievements and results, you\'ll be able to demonstrate your value to potential employers and stand out from other candidates.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 10631, 389, 4477, 459, 7524, 16063, 1473, 334, 16394, 220, 16, 25, 37179, 269, 4718, 34498, 311, 279, 12280, 57277, 4599, 4477, 264, 16063, 11, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 52056, 433, 311, 279, 3230, 2683, 499, 2351, 19486, 369, 13, 19723, 279, 2683, 4096, 323, 8670, 11, 323, 1304, 2771, 701, 16063, 22020, 279, 7512, 323, 11704, 430, 5398, 449, 279, 2683, 13, 5560, 21513, 505, 279, 2683, 17437, 323, 33435, 1124, 1139, 701, 16063, 11, 5423, 304, 701, 12399, 11, 7512, 3857, 11, 323, 990, 3217, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 701, 16063, 1522, 1555, 32368, 15194, 6067, 320, 50207, 8, 323, 2339, 279, 8071, 315, 279, 24009, 6783, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 17, 25, 5560, 264, 12292, 323, 63798, 1082, 15392, 57277, 32, 1664, 12, 63316, 323, 4228, 4791, 29906, 3645, 374, 16996, 369, 459, 7524, 16063, 13, 5560, 264, 4335, 323, 4382, 6932, 11, 449, 17889, 3585, 323, 2867, 70552, 311, 1464, 709, 3544, 10215, 315, 1495, 13, 5560, 264, 5410, 3381, 11, 1778, 439, 53871, 11, 3400, 58934, 477, 60646, 11, 323, 264, 3381, 1404, 1990, 220, 605, 323, 220, 717, 3585, 13, 7557, 2771, 701, 1455, 3062, 2038, 11, 1778, 439, 701, 836, 323, 3729, 2038, 11, 374, 74088, 12882, 520, 279, 1948, 315, 279, 2199, 13, 13969, 701, 43743, 2875, 323, 10968, 389, 832, 477, 1403, 1401, 3585, 11, 323, 1005, 1957, 62946, 1093, 330, 26337, 1359, 330, 7266, 1359, 323, 3