 of a special self-healing material that can detect and repair minor scratches and dents automatically. This feature eliminates the need for frequent paint touch-ups and keeps the car looking like new for a longer period.\n5. **Augmented Reality Display**: The SkyRider 3000 features an augmented reality (AR) display that projects important information, such as navigation directions, traffic updates, and weather forecasts, onto the windshield. This feature provides the driver with a more immersive and interactive driving experience, reducing the need for distractions and improving road safety.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 220, 20, 5016, 4519, 430, 279, 15064, 49, 1814, 220, 3101, 15, 11, 264, 80320, 1841, 11, 2643, 617, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 32, 261, 61002, 35622, 10145, 96618, 578, 15064, 49, 1814, 220, 3101, 15, 4519, 73300, 481, 20611, 10145, 389, 1202, 11314, 11, 902, 649, 387, 11838, 311, 7417, 1202, 34548, 80011, 323, 8108, 3805, 13957, 520, 1579, 25753, 13, 4314, 20611, 10145, 649, 1101, 387, 1511, 311, 7068, 5217, 12157, 11, 10923, 279, 1841, 311, 20118, 477, 1524, 1935, 1022, 505, 279, 5015, 369, 2875, 27650, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 72041, 19482, 47449, 96618, 578, 15064, 49, 1814, 220, 3101, 15, 596, 15485, 374, 9960, 304, 264, 15792, 6324, 315, 4604, 93591, 292, 7917, 11, 902, 33508, 279, 7160, 596, 4907, 311, 6900, 279, 1841, 596, 27360, 13, 1115, 4668, 539, 1193, 26338, 279, 1841, 596, 12782, 43972, 719, 1101, 5825, 264, 22556, 2592, 315, 2410, 369, 279, 7458, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 36557, 12371, 24264, 20620, 96618, 578, 15064, 49, 1814, 220, 3101, 15, 4519, 264, 6160, 24264, 3834, 430, 5829, 28900, 18324, 11, 7899, 18324, 11, 323, 8271, 11733, 11533, 3834, 5557, 311, 2585, 279, 1841, 596, 6067, 13, 1115, 6276, 279, 5696, 311, 2585, 279, 1841, 596, 5865, 11, 1778, 439, 10873, 11, 16924, 11, 323, 10182, 2585, 11, 449, 17983, 11555, 323, 53492, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 12363, 12, 1548, 6260, 17646, 96618, 578, 15064, 49, 1814, 220, 3101, 15, 596, 6308, 2683, 374, 1903, 709, 31