Output~2025-04-24 17:46:27.334785: [RequestOutput(request_id=1863, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Find 3 new and creative ways to use banana peels. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7531, 220, 18, 502, 323, 11782, 5627, 311, 1005, 44196, 1069, 2053, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="What a fun challenge! Here are 3 new and creative ways to use banana peels:\n\n**1. Natural Pest Repellent for Indoor Plants**: Dry banana peels can be used to repel pests like aphids, whiteflies, and spider mites that can harm your indoor plants. Simply boil the peels in water, then let them cool. Strain the liquid and use it as a spray to protect your plants from these pesky insects.\n\n**2. Exfoliating Face Mask**: Mash ripe banana peels and mix them with a tablespoon of honey and a tablespoon of yogurt to create a soothing face mask. The potassium and vitamins in the banana peel can help to gently exfoliate and nourish your skin, leaving it feeling smooth and refreshed.\n\n**3. Natural Dye for Fabric**: Banana peels can be used as a natural dye for fabric, creating a beautiful, earthy brown color. Simply boil the peels in water, then soak your fabric in the dye bath. The resulting color will be a lovely, natural shade that's perfect for creating unique and eco-friendly textiles.\n\nI hope these ideas inspire you to think outside the box (or peel!) when it comes to using banana peels!", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2523, 8815, 0, 5810, 527, 220, 18, 502, 323, 11782, 5627, 311, 1005, 44196, 1069, 2053, 1473, 334, 16, 13, 18955, 89245, 3402, 616, 306, 369, 64368, 50298, 96618, 31941, 44196, 1069, 2053, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 2109, 301, 76056, 1093, 89111, 3447, 11, 4251, 55019, 11, 323, 35454, 296, 3695, 430, 649, 11682, 701, 30619, 11012, 13, 29524, 44790, 279, 1069, 2053, 304, 3090, 11, 1243, 1095, 1124, 7155, 13, 4610, 467, 279, 14812, 323, 1005, 433, 439, 264, 23749, 311, 6144, 701, 11012, 505, 1521, 18541, 8050, 41911, 382, 334, 17, 13, 1398, 8566, 23747, 19109, 20519, 96618, 69279, 57796, 44196, 1069, 2053, 323, 6651, 1124, 449, 264, 62611, 315, 26828, 323, 264, 62611, 315, 55575, 311, 1893, 264, 65464, 3663, 7056, 13, 578, 62275, 323, 46192, 304, 279, 44196, 58212, 649, 1520, 311, 30373, 506, 8566, 6629, 323, 46798, 819, 701, 6930, 11, 9564, 433, 8430, 11113, 323, 66229, 382, 334, 18, 13, 18955, 423, 9188, 369, 37407, 96618, 76924, 1069, 2053, 649, 387, 1511, 439, 264, 5933, 54631, 369, 13354, 11, 6968, 264, 6366, 11, 9578, 88, 14198, 1933, 13, 29524, 44790, 279, 1069, 2053, 304, 3090, 11, 1243, 61792, 701, 13354, 304, 279, 54631, 9061, 13, 578, 13239, 1933, 690, 387, 264, 17104, 11, 5933, 28601, 430, 596, 4832, 369, 6968, 5016, 323, 42688, 22658, 94082, 382, 40, 3987, 1521, 6848, 31740, 499, 311, 1781, 4994, 279, 3830, 320, 269, 58212, 16715, 994, 433, 4131, 311, 1701, 44196, 1069, 2053, 0, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
