Output~2025-04-24 17:47:10.526310: [RequestOutput(request_id=1878, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a character profile ### Input: Ruth ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 3752, 5643, 17010, 5688, 25, 42893, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a character profile for Ruth:\n\n**Name:** Ruth\n\n**Age:** 32\n\n**Occupation:** Graphic Designer\n\n**Personality:** Ruth is a creative and detail-oriented individual with a passion for art and design. She is a perfectionist and can be quite particular about her work, but this attention to detail has earned her a reputation as one of the best designers in her field. Ruth is also a bit of a introvert and can take time to open up to new people, but once you gain her trust, she is fiercely loyal and will go to great lengths to support those she cares about.\n\n**Background:** Ruth grew up in a small town in the Midwest and always had a love for art and design. She pursued her passion and earned a degree in graphic design from a local university. After working for a few years in a small design firm, she decided to take the leap and start her own business, which has been a huge success.\n\n**Goals:** Ruth's ultimate goal is to become a renowned designer and to use her talents to make a positive impact on her community. She is also hoping to one day start a design school to help others develop their creative skills.\n\n**Quirks:** Ruth has a habit of talking to herself when she's nervous or deep in thought, and she is a bit of a coffee snob. She also has a weakness for 80s music and will often blast it while working to get her creative juices flowing.\n\n**Strengths:** Ruth's attention to detail, creativity, and ability to work well under pressure are just a few of her many strengths. She is also an excellent communicator and is able to effectively convey her ideas to clients and colleagues.\n\n**Weaknesses:** Ruth's perfectionism can sometimes hold her back from taking risks and trying new things, and she can be quite hard on herself when things don't go according to plan. She also has a tendency to overthink things and can get caught up in the details, which can lead to procrastination.\n\nI hope this character profile gives you a good sense of who Ruth is! Let me know if you have any other questions or if there's anything else I can help with.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3752, 5643, 369, 42893, 1473, 334, 678, 68063, 42893, 271, 334, 17166, 68063, 220, 843, 271, 334, 65068, 367, 68063, 45051, 15940, 271, 334, 10909, 2786, 68063, 42893, 374, 264, 11782, 323, 7872, 36185, 3927, 449, 264, 11939, 369, 1989, 323, 2955, 13, 3005, 374, 264, 39143, 380, 323, 649, 387, 5115, 4040, 922, 1077, 990, 11, 719, 420, 6666, 311, 7872, 706, 15662, 1077, 264, 17444, 439, 832, 315, 279, 1888, 26897, 304, 1077, 2115, 13, 42893, 374, 1101, 264, 2766, 315, 264, 20285, 1653, 323, 649, 1935, 892, 311, 1825, 709, 311, 502, 1274, 11, 719, 3131, 499, 8895, 1077, 7095, 11, 1364, 374, 79045, 29947, 323, 690, 733, 311, 2294, 29416, 311, 1862, 1884, 1364, 34672, 922, 382, 334, 8879, 68063, 42893, 14264, 709, 304, 264, 2678, 6424, 304, 279, 52257, 323, 2744, 1047, 264, 3021, 369, 1989, 323, 2955, 13, 3005, 46531, 1077, 11939, 323, 15662, 264, 8547, 304, 21154, 2955, 505, 264, 2254, 12374, 13, 4740, 3318, 369, 264, 2478, 1667, 304, 264, 2678, 2955, 7626, 11, 1364, 6773, 311, 193