Output~2025-04-24 17:48:11.815063: [RequestOutput(request_id=1908, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a recipe for a vegetable stir-fry. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 11363, 369, 264, 36581, 23935, 2269, 894, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Delicious Vegetable Stir-Fry Recipe**\n\n Servings: 4-6 people\n\n**Ingredients:**\n\n* 2 tablespoons vegetable oil\n* 1 onion, sliced\n* 2 cloves garlic, minced\n* 1 red bell pepper, sliced\n* 1 yellow bell pepper, sliced\n* 2 cups broccoli florets\n* 1 cup carrots, peeled and sliced\n* 1 cup snap peas, sliced\n* 2 teaspoons soy sauce\n* 1 teaspoon oyster sauce (optional)\n* Salt and pepper, to taste\n* Cooked rice or noodles, for serving\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1. Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.\n2. Add the sliced onion and cook for 2-3 minutes, or until it starts to soften.\n3. Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute, stirring constantly to prevent burning.\n4. Add the sliced red and yellow bell peppers and cook for 3-4 minutes, or until they start to tenderize.\n5. Add the broccoli, carrots, and snap peas to the skillet. Cook for 4-5 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender-crisp.\n6. In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce and oyster sauce (if using). Pour the sauce over the vegetables and stir to combine.\n7. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n8. Serve the vegetable stir-fry over cooked rice or noodles and enjoy!\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n* Use your favorite vegetables or add other options like mushrooms, zucchini, or snow peas to the stir-fry.\n* For an extra kick, add some red pepper flakes or sriracha to the sauce.\n* Serve with a sprinkle of sesame seeds or chopped green onions for added flavor and texture.\n* Make it a meal by adding cooked protein like chicken, beef, or tofu to the stir-fry.\n\nEnjoy your delicious and healthy vegetable stir-fry!', token_ids=[334, 16939, 9824, 95392, 65292, 7424, 894, 26371, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 1274, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 36581, 5707, 198, 9, 220, 16, 38427, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 85388, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 16, 2579, 29519, 25349, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14071, 29519, 25349, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 26446, 79276, 9943, 76430, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 62517, 11, 83612, 323, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 10885, 47136, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 29839, 19737, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 297, 22604, 19737, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 12797, 291, 20228, 477, 61260, 11, 369, 13788, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 27162, 279, 36581, 5707, 304, 264, 3544, 79085, 477, 289, 564, 927, 11298, 28661, 8798, 627, 17, 13, 2758, 279, 48715, 38427, 323, 4394, 369, 220, 17, 12, 18, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 433, 8638, 311, 81045, 627, 18, 13, 2758, 279, 94927, 31735, 323, 4394, 369, 459, 5217, 220, 16, 9568, 11, 55054, 15320, 311, 5471, 20252, 627, 19, 13, 2758, 279, 48715, 2579, 323, 14071, 29519, 58573, 323, 4394, 369, 220, 18, 12, 19, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 814, 1212, 311, 28682, 553, 627, 20, 13, 2758, 279, 79276, 11, 62517, 11, 323, 10885, 47136, 311, 279, 79085, 13, 12797, 369, 220, 19, 12, 20, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 24822, 527, 28682, 1824, 6091, 79, 627, 21, 13, 763, 264, 2678, 19763, 11, 41759, 3871, 279, 29839, 19737, 323, 297, 22604, 19737, 320, 333, 1701, 570, 27058, 279, 19737, 927, 279, 24822, 323, 23935, 311, 16343, 627, 