**Step 6: Cut the Sandwich**\n\n* Use the knife to cut the sandwich into halves, quarters, or sixths, depending on your preference.\n* Cut carefully to avoid applying too much pressure, which can cause the filling to fall out.\n\n**Step 7: Serve and Enjoy**\n\n* Place the sandwich on a clean plate and serve immediately.\n* You can also wrap the sandwich in plastic wrap or aluminum foil for a quick and easy snack or lunch on-the-go.\n\nThat's it! With these simple steps, you should be able to make a delicious sandwich.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 743, 315, 11470, 369, 3339, 264, 28974, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 52275, 323, 14173, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 35354, 315, 16385, 198, 9, 4718, 5873, 315, 21973, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 45405, 11, 13824, 11, 17604, 11, 24822, 11, 5099, 29275, 9, 3297, 13767, 1082, 477, 9041, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 6914, 83, 10743, 11, 42120, 11, 323, 1023, 90771, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 362, 4335, 323, 15528, 990, 7479, 198, 9, 362, 22145, 369, 31135, 323, 14713, 198, 9, 362, 12235, 369, 81759, 279, 28974, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 45024, 4470, 279, 50141, 57277, 9, 11004, 279, 1403, 35354, 315, 16385, 3185, 555, 3185, 389, 279, 12235, 627, 9, 7557, 2771, 279, 35354, 527, 27210, 42147, 323, 279, 13116, 527, 13176, 45054, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 2758, 279, 435, 9585, 57277, 9, 22991, 701, 12974, 21973, 323, 2035, 433, 389, 832, 16363, 315, 16385, 627, 9, 48816, 279, 21973, 42147, 4028, 279, 16385, 11, 9564, 264, 2678, 3973, 2212, 279, 13116, 627, 9, 1442, 1701, 1253, 13767, 1082, 477, 9041, 11, 3881, 264, 2678, 3392, 311, 279, 21973, 311, 1520, 3412, 433, 304, 2035, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 2758, 350, 4880, 826, 320, 15669, 33395, 271, 9, 1442, 1701, 71655, 11, 42120, 11, 477, 1023, 90771, 11, 2035, 1124, 389, 1948, 315, 279, 21973, 627, 9, 41680, 279, 90771, 304, 264, 1648, 430, 5992, 33352, 311, 499, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 1666, 16167, 279, 67836, 57277, 9, 11004, 279, 2132, 16363, 315, 16385, 389, 1948, 315, 279, 21973, 323, 907