came up with a plan to help Sam overcome his fear. They told him that they would go on a special adventure together, to face the dark and show him that it wasn\'t so scary after all.\n\nSam was hesitant at first, but his friends\' encouragement and the promise of a special reward convinced him to join them. As the sun began to set, they set off into the darkening meadow.\n\nAt first, Sam was terrified. The shadows seemed to grow longer and darker, and every little sound made him jump. But Hoot and Whiskers were right by his side, guiding him through the darkness. They told him stories of their own fears and how they had overcome them, and Sam began to feel a sense of bravery growing inside him.\n\nAs they walked, they stumbled upon a clearing. In the center of the clearing stood an old, gnarled tree, its branches twisted and tangled. Hoot and Whiskers told Sam that this was the "Tree of Courage," and that it held the power to make his fears disappear.\n\nSam felt a surge of determination and approached the tree. As he touched its rough bark, he felt a strange sensation, like his fears were being washed away. Suddenly, the darkness didn\'t seem so scary anymore. In fact, it was rather... exciting!\n\nFrom that day on, Sam was no longer afraid of the dark. He would venture out into the meadow at night, exploring and playing with his friends, his', token_ids=[334, 791, 55448, 315, 8388, 279, 70308, 49431, 57277, 644, 264, 40798, 757, 5967, 11, 23712, 555, 16615, 16763, 288, 323, 34966, 8545, 89770, 11, 12439, 264, 2697, 39824, 7086, 8388, 13, 8388, 10456, 311, 13488, 323, 1514, 4994, 11, 719, 568, 1047, 832, 2466, 3575, 25, 568, 574, 16984, 315, 279, 6453, 382, 11769, 11714, 11, 994, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 11, 8388, 1053, 18659, 901, 449, 8850, 13, 1283, 1053, 10477, 304, 813, 43535, 7951, 654, 11, 813, 4851, 22019, 449, 1475, 272, 1127, 323, 23941, 273, 315, 279, 11141, 13, 5414, 4885, 11, 264, 24219, 2362, 53369, 7086, 473, 1944, 323, 264, 3169, 2115, 8814, 7086,