Output~2025-04-24 17:50:10.611554: [RequestOutput(request_id=1948, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What is the sum of all integer values n for which C(20,n)+C(20,10)=C(21,11)? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 374, 279, 2694, 315, 682, 7698, 2819, 308, 369, 902, 356, 7, 508, 10337, 7405, 34, 7, 508, 11, 605, 11992, 34, 7, 1691, 11, 806, 12106, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='A nice combinatorics problem!\n\nWe are given the equation:\n\nC(20, n) + C(20, 10) = C(21, 11)\n\nwhere C(n, k) is the binomial coefficient, also known as the number of ways to choose k items from a set of n items.\n\nWe can rewrite the equation as:\n\nC(20, n) = C(21, 11) - C(20, 10)\n\nUsing the recursive formula for binomial coefficients:\n\nC(n, k) = C(n-1, k-1) + C(n-1, k)\n\nWe can rewrite the equation as:\n\nC(20, n) = C(20-1, 11-1) + C(20-1, 11)\n\n= C(19, 10) + C(19, 11)\n\nNow, we can simplify the equation:\n\nC(19, 10) + C(19, 11) = C(21, 11) - C(19, 11)\n\n= C(20, 10)\n\nThis implies that:\n\nC(19, 10) = C(19, 11)\n\nThis is true only when n = 10 or n = 11.\n\nTherefore, the sum of all integer values n for which C(20, n) + C(20, 10) = C(21, 11) is:\n\n10 + 11 = 21\n\nSo, the answer is 21.', token_ids=[32, 6555, 3698, 17720, 1233, 3575, 2268, 1687, 527, 2728, 279, 24524, 1473, 34, 7, 508, 11, 308, 8, 489, 356, 7, 508, 11, 220, 605, 8, 284, 356, 7, 1691, 11, 220, 806, 696, 2940, 356, 1471, 11, 597, 8, 374, 279, 9736, 21524, 36706, 11, 1101, 3967, 439, 279, 1396, 315, 5627, 311, 5268, 597, 3673, 505, 264, 743, 315, 308, 3673, 382, 1687, 649, 18622, 279, 24524, 439, 1473, 34, 7, 508, 11, 308, 8, 284, 356, 7, 1691, 11, 220, 806, 8, 482, 356, 7, 508, 11, 220, 605, 696, 16834, 279, 31919, 15150, 369, 9736, 21524, 37929, 1473, 34, 1471, 11, 597, 8, 284, 356, 1471, 12, 16, 11, 597, 12, 16, 8, 489, 356, 1471, 12, 16, 11, 597, 696, 1687, 649, 18622, 279, 24524, 439, 1473, 34, 7, 508, 11, 308, 8, 284, 356, 7, 508, 12, 16, 11, 220, 806, 12, 16, 8, 489, 356, 7, 508, 12, 16, 11, 220, 806, 696, 28, 356, 7, 777, 11, 220, 605, 8, 489, 356, 7, 777, 11, 220, 806, 696, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 40821, 279, 24524, 1473, 34, 7, 777, 11, 220, 605, 8, 489, 356, 7, 777, 11, 220, 806, 8, 284, 356, 7, 1691, 11, 220, 806, 8, 482, 356, 7, 777, 11, 220, 806, 696, 28, 356, 7, 508, 11, 220, 605, 696, 2028, 24897, 430, 1473, 34, 7, 777, 11, 220, 605, 8, 284, 356, 7, 777, 11, 220, 806, 696, 2028, 374, 837, 1193, 994, 308, 284, 220, 605, 477, 308, 284, 220, 806, 382, 55915, 11, 279, 2694, 315, 682, 7698, 2819, 308, 369, 902, 356, 7, 508, 11, 308, 8, 489, 356, 7, 508, 11, 220, 605, 8, 284, 356, 7, 1691, 11, 220, 806, 8, 374, 1473, 605, 489, 220, 806, 284, 220, 1691, 271, 4516, 11, 279, 4320, 374, 220, 1691, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
