al features include:\n\n* High-quality audio with clear and crisp sound\n* Compatibility with popular music streaming services\n* Ability to control other smart devices in your home, such as lights and thermostats\n* Long-lasting battery life with up to 12 hours of playback time\n* Compact and portable design that fits easily on a shelf or table\n\nUpgrade your home with the Smart Speaker and experience the convenience and entertainment of a smart home like never before.', token_ids=[334, 1090, 60637, 279, 16147, 30173, 25, 4718, 19758, 22103, 304, 279, 33578, 315, 4718, 8704, 57277, 791, 16147, 30173, 374, 264, 30191, 3756, 430, 33511, 279, 2410, 315, 21075, 11478, 449, 279, 19679, 315, 264, 19114, 11, 10923, 499, 311, 2585, 701, 2162, 11, 2680, 2038, 11, 323, 4774, 701, 7075, 4731, 449, 1120, 701, 7899, 13, 3161, 1202, 48494, 323, 17251, 2955, 11, 420, 7941, 19114, 374, 279, 4832, 5369, 311, 904, 3130, 304, 701, 2162, 382, 334, 1622, 20289, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 52267, 22103, 41169, 96618, 578, 16147, 30173, 4131, 19167, 449, 264, 5918, 3502, 7899, 18328, 430, 6276, 499, 311, 2585, 701, 3756, 449, 4382, 7899, 11545, 13, 21069, 433, 311, 1514, 701, 7075, 5609, 11, 743, 66697, 11, 477, 1524, 2585, 1023, 7941, 7766, 304, 701, 2162, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 20981, 11151, 4285, 12632, 96618, 3161, 279, 16147, 30173, 11, 499, 649, 4774, 701, 4731, 304, 1475, 3130, 315, 701, 2162, 13, 29524, 6857, 5361, 22032, 3871, 311, 1893, 264, 4459, 25389, 7855, 1887, 430, 15714, 499, 9020, 311, 701, 7075, 55090, 28578, 499, 527, 382, 30119, 4519, 2997, 1473, 9, 5234, 22867, 7855, 449, 2867, 323, 42954, 5222, 198, 9, 79095, 449, 5526, 4731, 17265, 3600, 198, 9, 37083, 311, 2585, 1023, 7941, 7766, 304, 701, 2162, 11, 1778, 439, 13001, 323, 9139, 3646, 1900, 198, 9, 5843, 65265, 11863, 2324, 449, 709, 311, 220, 717, 4207, 315, 33059, 892, 198, 9, 55882, 323, 23665, 2955, 430, 18809, 6847, 389, 264, 28745, 477, 2007, 271, 44961, 701, 2162, 449, 279, 16147, 30173, 323, 3217, 279, 19679, 32