Output~2025-04-24 17:51:07.115388: [RequestOutput(request_id=1982, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story that includes the following words: vase, lighthouse, sparrow. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 430, 5764, 279, 2768, 4339, 25, 93484, 11, 326, 59009, 11, 993, 6172, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="As the sun began to set on the small coastal town, a gentle breeze carried the sweet scent of saltwater and seaweed through the streets. The villagers were settling in for the night, but one resident was still wide awake, lost in thought.\n\nEmily, a young woman with a wild mane of curly hair, sat perched on the edge of her bed, staring out the window at the lighthouse that stood tall and proud on the rocky shore. She had always been fascinated by the way its beam cut through the darkness, guiding ships safely to harbor.\n\nAs she gazed out at the lighthouse, a small sparrow perched on the windowsill caught her eye. It was a scrappy little thing, with feathers ruffled by the wind, but its bright, inquisitive gaze seemed to hold a deep wisdom. Emily felt a sense of peace wash over her as she watched the bird, and she reached out a hand to gently stroke its soft feathers.\n\nJust then, a faint cry echoed through the night air, and Emily's thoughts turned to the vase that sat on her mantle. It was an heirloom, passed down from her grandmother, and it held a special significance for her. She had always felt a sense of comfort when she held it in her hands, and tonight was no exception.\n\nAs she sat there, the sparrow still perched on her windowsill, Emily felt a sense of clarity wash over her. She realized that just as the lighthouse guided ships through the darkness, the vase guided her through the ups and downs of life. And the sparrow, with its quiet, steady gaze, reminded her to stay grounded and focused on what truly mattered.\n\nWith a sense of peace and purpose, Emily settled in for the night, the vase and the sparrow her loyal companions as she drifted off to sleep, lulled by the sound of the waves crashing against the shore.", token_ids=[2170, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 389, 279, 2678, 35335, 6424, 11, 264, 22443, 46385, 11953, 279, 10437, 41466, 315, 12290, 13284, 323, 67329, 12320, 1555, 279, 14708, 13, 578, 61921, 1051, 52945, 304, 369, 279, 3814, 11, 719, 832, 19504, 574, 2103, 7029, 35447, 11, 5675, 304, 3463, 382, 85148, 11, 264, 3995, 5333, 449, 264, 8545, 53460, 315, 69203, 7013, 11, 7731, 824, 2454, 389, 279, 6964, 315, 1077, 4950, 11, 37874, 704, 279, 3321, 520, 279, 326, 59009, 430, 14980, 16615, 323, 12691, 389, 279, 56617, 31284, 13, 3005, 1047, 2744, 1027, 61914, 555, 279, 1648, 1202, 24310, 4018, 1555, 279, 27394, 11, 51346, 18198, 21676, 311, 57511, 382, 2170, 1364, 342, 28109, 704, 520, 279, 326, 59009, 11, 264, 2678, 993, 6172, 824, 2454, 389, 279, 11276, 484, 10791, 1077, 8071, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 9406, 11392, 2697, 3245, 11, 449, 56994, 436, 43435, 555, 279, 10160, 11, 719, 1202, 10107, 11, 304, 9383, 3486, 36496, 9508, 311, 3412, 264, 5655, 24278, 13, 35266, 6612, 264, 5647, 315, 9096, 11623, 927, 1077, 439, 1364, 15746, 279, 12224, 11, 323, 1364, 8813, 704, 264, 1450, 311, 30373, 12943, 1202, 8579, 56994, 382, 10156, 1243, 11, 264, 38678, 16106, 55212, 1555, 279, 3814, 3805, 11, 323, 35266, 596, 11555, 6656, 311, 279, 93484, 430, 7731, 389, 1077, 71532, 13, 1102, 574, 459, 51543, 18981, 11, 5946, 1523, 505, 1077, 39284, 11, 323, 433, 5762, 264, 3361,