Output~2025-04-24 17:51:13.277813: [RequestOutput(request_id=1984, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Given that a+b=3 and a^3+b^3=81, find ab. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 16644, 430, 264, 36193, 28, 18, 323, 264, 61, 18, 36193, 61, 18, 28, 5932, 11, 1505, 671, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='A nice algebra problem!\n\nWe are given two equations:\n\n1) a + b = 3 ... (Equation 1)\n2) a^3 + b^3 = 81 ... (Equation 2)\n\nWe can start by expanding the cube of a and b in Equation 2:\n\na^3 + b^3 = (a + b)(a^2 - ab + b^2)\n\nNow, substitute Equation 1 into this expanded form:\n\n(3)(a^2 - ab + b^2) = 81\n\nSimplify the equation:\n\n3a^2 - 3ab + 3b^2 = 81\n\nDivide both sides by 3:\n\na^2 - ab + b^2 = 27\n\nNow, we can try to factor the quadratic expression:\n\n(a - b)^2 = 27\n\nTake the square root of both sides:\n\na - b = ±√27\n\na - b = ±3√3\n\nNow, we can add b to both sides to get:\n\na = b ± 3√3\n\nWe are looking for the value of ab, so we can multiply both sides by b:\n\nab = b(a ± 3√3)\n\nNow, we can use Equation 1 to express b in terms of a:\n\nb = 3 - a\n\nSubstitute this expression for b into the equation above:\n\nab = (3 - a)(a ± 3√3)\n\nExpand and simplify:\n\nab = 3a - a^2 ± 3√3a - 3√3\n\nCombine like terms:\n\nab = -a^2 + 3a ± 3√3a - 3√3\n\nNow, we can try to factor the quadratic expression:\n\n-ab + 3a = (a - 3) ± 3√3\n\nThis is a quadratic equation in the form of (x - r) ± s, where x = a and r = 3. The solutions are:\n\na = 3 ± √3\n\nNow, we can find the value of ab for each solution:\n\nCase 1: a = 3 + √3\nab = (3 + √3)(3 - √3) = 9 - 3 = 6\n\nCase 2: a = 3 - √3\nab = (3 - √3)(3 + √3) = 9 - 3 = 6\n\nIn both cases, we get:\n\nab = 6\n\n', token_ids=[32, 6555, 47976, 3575, 2268, 1687, 527, 2728, 1403, 39006, 1473, 16, 8, 264, 489, 293, 284, 220, 18, 2564, 320, 25523, 367, 220, 16, 340, 17, 8, 264, 61, 18, 489, 293, 61, 18, 284, 220, 5932, 2564, 320, 25523, 367, 220, 17, 696, 1687, 649, 1212, 555, 24050, 279, 24671, 315, 264, 323, 293, 304, 85770, 220, 17, 1473, 64, 61, 18, 489, 293, 61, 18, 284, 320, 64, 489, 293, 2432, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 696, 7184, 11, 28779, 85770, 220, 16, 1139, 420, 17626, 1376, 1473, 7, 18, 2432, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 8, 284, 220, 5932, 271, 50, 71306, 279, 24524, 1473, 18, 64, 61, 17, 482, 220, 18, 370, 489, 220, 18, 65, 61, 17, 284, 220, 5932, 271, 12792, 579, 2225, 11314, 555, 220, 18, 1473, 64, 61, 17, 482, 671, 489, 293, 61, 17, 284, 220, 1544, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 1456, 311, 8331, 279, 80251, 7645, 1473, 2948, 482, 293, 30876, 17, 284, 220, 1544, 271, 18293, 279, 9518, 3789, 315, 2225, 11314, 1473, 64, 482, 293, 284, 20903, 110682, 1544, 271, 64, 482, 293, 284, 20903, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 923, 293, 311, 2225, 11314, 311, 636, 1473, 64, 284, 293, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 1687, 527, 3411, 369, 279, 907, 315, 671, 11, 779, 584, 649, 31370, 2225, 11314, 555, 293, 1473, 370, 284, 293, 2948, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 696, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 1005, 85770, 220, 16, 311, 3237, 293, 304, 3878, 315, 264, 1473, 65, 284, 220, 18, 482, 264, 271, 3214, 7815, 420, 7645, 369, 293, 1139, 279, 24524, 3485, 1473, 370, 284, 320, 18, 482, 264, 2432, 64, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 696, 40046, 323, 40821, 1473, 370, 284, 220, 18, 64, 482, 264, 61, 17, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 64, 482, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 271, 82214, 1093, 3878, 1473, 370, 284, 482, 64, 61, 17, 489, 220, 18, 64, 20903, 220, 18, 110682, 18, 6