Incident**\n\n1. **Initial Response**: Upon notification of an armed intruder, the ERT will immediately respond to the scene.\n2. **Lockdown**: Implement lockdown procedures, securing all classrooms and hiding areas.\n3. **Evacuation**: If necessary, evacuate the affected area or the entire school, following established evacuation routes.\n4. **Communication**: Communicate with staff, students, and parents through the emergency alert system and public address system.\n5. **Law Enforcement Response**: Coordinate with local law enforcement to respond to the incident and provide assistance.\n\n**IV. Evacuation and Reunification**\n\n1. **Evacuation Routes**: Identify and mark evacuation routes, ensuring that they are safe and accessible.\n2. **Designated Meeting Points**: Establish designated meeting points outside the school, where students and staff can gather and be accounted for.\n3. **Reunification**: Reunite students with their parents or authorized guardians at designated reunification points.\n\n**V. Post-Incident Procedures**\n\n1. **Debriefing**: Conduct a debriefing with the ERT and staff to review the response and identify areas for improvement.\n2. **Investigation**: Conduct a thorough investigation into the incident, including gathering evidence and interviewing witnesses.\n3. **Follow-up**: Provide support and counseling to affected students and staff, and review and update the safety plan as necessary.\n\n**VI. Conclusion**\n\nThe school safety plan for armed intruder response is designed', token_ids=[334, 33849, 19220, 9878, 369, 42494, 61894, 33719, 6075, 57277, 334, 40, 13, 29438, 57277, 791, 7580, 315, 420, 3197, 374, 311, 3493, 264, 16195, 2077, 311, 459, 17903, 10805, 33719, 10672, 304, 264, 2978, 6376, 13, 578, 3197, 374, 6319, 311, 6106, 279, 7296, 323, 4868, 315, 4236, 11, 5687, 11, 323, 22291, 11, 323, 311, 30437, 279, 5326, 315, 11682, 477, 11134, 382, 334, 5660, 13, 5075, 32600, 66, 1748, 74435, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 80069, 6075, 8068, 96618,