Output~2025-04-24 17:53:45.717871: [RequestOutput(request_id=2027, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a synopsis of a movie about a talking dog who saves the world. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 81763, 315, 264, 5818, 922, 264, 7556, 5679, 889, 27024, 279, 1917, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a synopsis of a movie about a talking dog who saves the world:\n\n**Title:** "Paw of Destiny"\n\n**Synopsis:** In a world on the brink of destruction, a talented and charismatic talking dog named Max, a golden retriever with a heart of gold, is the unlikely hero who saves humanity from an alien invasion.\n\nThe movie begins with Max, a stray dog who has been living on the streets, stumbling upon a mysterious, ancient artifact that gives him the power of human-like intelligence and the ability to speak. As news of the artifact spreads, Max is discovered by a team of scientists who are desperate to understand its secrets.\n\nMeanwhile, an alien spaceship, led by the ruthless and cunning Zorvath, descends upon Earth, intent on destroying the planet and its inhabitants. The aliens, known as the "Kra\'gixx," have been searching for a new home after their own planet was destroyed, and they believe Earth is the perfect replacement.\n\nAs the Kra\'gixx begin their destruction, Max, now equipped with his newfound intelligence and abilities, decides to take matters into his own paws. With the help of his new human friends, a ragtag group of scientists, soldiers, and civilians, Max hatches a plan to stop the Kra\'gixx and save humanity.\n\nUsing his quick wit, cunning, and bravery, Max leads the charge against the alien invaders, using his newfound intelligence to outsmart them at every turn. Along the way, he forms an unlikely bond with a young girl named Lily, who becomes his partner in the fight against the Kra\'gixx.\n\nAs the stakes grow higher, Max and his team face off against Zorvath in an epic battle to save the world. With his quick thinking and bravery, Max is able to outmaneuver the Kra\'gixx and destroy their spaceship, saving humanity from destruction.\n\nIn the end, Max is hailed as a hero, and his legend lives on as a symbol of hope and courage in the face of adversity. The movie ends with Max and Lily standing together, looking out at the newly restored Earth, ready to face whatever challenges come their way.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 81763, 315, 264, 5818, 922, 264, 7556, 5679, 889, 27024, 279, 1917, 1473, 334, 3936, 68063, 330, 47, 675, 315, 51497, 1875, 334, 90170, 68063, 763, 264, 1917, 389, 279, 68215, 315, 19814, 11, 264, 23944, 323, 79323, 7556, 5679, 7086, 7639, 11, 264, 21411, 10992, 424, 449, 264, 4851, 315, 6761, 11, 374, 279, 17821, 12084, 889, 27024, 22706, 505, 459, 20167, 30215, 382, 791, 5818, 12302, 449, 7639, 11, 264, 62490, 5679, 889, 706, 1027, 5496, 389, 279, 14708, 11, 88455, 5304, 264, 26454, 11, 14154, 37739, 430, 6835, 1461, 279, 2410, 315, 3823, 12970, 11478, 323, 279, 5845, 311, 6604, 13, 1666, 3754, 315, 279, 37739, 43653, 11, 7639, 374, 11352, 555, 264, 2128, 315, 14248, 889, 527, 28495, 311, 3619, 1202, 24511, 382, 26054, 11, 459, 20167, 85942, 11, 6197, 555, 279, 69510, 323, 81779, 1901, 269, 85, 589, 11, 6697, 1438, 5304, 9420, 11, 7537, 389, 33812, 279, 11841, 323, 1202, 40771, 13, 578, 37219, 11, 3967, 439, 279, 330, 42, 969, 6, 70, 953, 87, 1359, 617, 1027, 15389, 369, 264, 502, 2162, 1306, 872, 1866, 11841, 574, 14763, 11, 323, 814, 4510, 9