in.\n2. Check your network settings: Make sure your laptop is set to obtain an IP address automatically. You can do this by going to your network settings and selecting "Obtain an IP address automatically" or "DHCP".\n3. Check your Wi-Fi connection: Ensure that your Wi-Fi is enabled on your laptop and that you\'re connected to the correct network. You can do this by going to your network settings and selecting the network you want to connect to.\n4. Check for any interference: Other devices in your home or office might be causing interference with your Wi-Fi signal. Try moving your router to a different location or switching off other devices that use the same frequency band.\n\nIf none of these steps resolve the issue, we can try some more advanced troubleshooting steps. Please let me know if you\'d like to proceed with those.', token_ids=[40, 4265, 387, 6380, 311, 1520, 499, 20498, 97508, 279, 4360, 449, 701, 7757, 3717, 13, 3053, 499, 4587, 3371, 757, 264, 2766, 810, 922, 1148, 596, 12765, 994, 499, 1456, 311, 4667, 30, 8886, 499, 3794, 904, 1493, 6743, 477, 374, 433, 1120, 539, 21583, 520, 682, 1980, 13699, 11, 617, 499, 6051, 5614, 904, 5110, 477, 10487, 904, 502, 3241, 430, 2643, 387, 14718, 279, 4360, 30, 23212, 11, 617, 499, 6818, 93624, 701, 9457, 477, 52604, 1980, 10267, 596, 1212, 449, 1063, 6913, 69771, 7504, 13, 3053, 499, 4587, 1456, 279, 2768, 1473, 16, 13, 57901, 701, 9457, 323, 52604, 25, 18156, 11, 264, 4382, 35692, 649, 9006, 31357, 4819, 13, 1252, 48574, 279, 2410, 23125, 505, 279, 1203, 315, 279, 9457, 323, 52604, 11, 3868, 369, 220, 966, 6622, 11, 323, 1243, 20206, 1124, 1203, 304, 627, 17, 13, 4343, 701, 4009, 5110, 25, 7557, 2771, 701, 21288, 374, 743, 311, 6994, 459, 6933, 2686, 9651, 13, 1472, 649, 656, 420, 555, 2133, 311, 701, 4009, 5110, 323, 27397, 330, 4213, 23771, 459, 6933, 2686, 9651, 1, 477, 330, 52426, 7269, 23811, 18, 13, 4343, 701, 17664, 27395, 3717, 25, 30379, 430, 701, 17664, 27395, 374, 9147, 389, 701, 21288, 323, 430, 499, 