Output~2025-04-24 17:55:05.736424: [RequestOutput(request_id=2060, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the four seasons of the year. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 3116, 15956, 315, 279, 1060, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The four seasons of the year are:\n\n**Spring**: Spring is the season that marks the beginning of the year and is characterized by mild temperatures, blooming flowers, and greenery. It is a time of renewal and growth, as the earth awakens from its winter slumber. The weather is usually mild, with temperatures gradually warming up, and the days get longer. Spring is a popular season for outdoor activities like hiking, gardening, and picnics.\n\n**Summer**: Summer is the warmest season of the year, typically lasting from June to August in the Northern Hemisphere. It is characterized by long, hot days, and warm nights. The weather is usually sunny, with temperatures often reaching the mid-80s to mid-90s Fahrenheit (30-35°C). Summer is a popular time for vacations, beach trips, and outdoor activities like swimming, camping, and barbecues.\n\n**Autumn** (or **Fall**): Autumn is the season that marks the transition from summer to winter, typically lasting from September to November in the Northern Hemisphere. It is characterized by cooler temperatures, changing foliage, and the harvest season. The leaves on the trees turn brilliant shades of orange, red, and yellow, creating a picturesque landscape. Autumn is a popular season for outdoor activities like apple picking, hayrides, and bonfires.\n\n**Winter**: Winter is the coldest season of the year, typically lasting from December to February in the Northern Hemisphere. It is characterized by cold temperatures, snowfall, and short days. The weather is often icy, with temperatures ranging from freezing to below freezing. Winter is a popular season for indoor activities like skiing, ice skating, and cozying up by the fireplace.', token_ids=[791, 3116, 15956, 315, 279, 1060, 527, 1473, 334, 26208, 96618, 12531, 374, 279, 3280, 430, 15785, 279, 7314, 315, 279, 1060, 323, 374, 32971, 555, 23900, 20472, 11, 14545, 18238, 19837, 11, 323, 6307, 727, 13, 1102, 374, 264, 892, 315, 43901, 323, 6650, 11, 439, 279, 9578, 1384, 71837, 505, 1202, 12688, 1776, 900, 13, 578, 9282, 374, 6118, 23900, 11, 449, 20472, 27115, 24808, 709, 11, 323, 279, 2919, 636, 5129, 13, 12531, 374, 264, 5526, 3280, 369, 16166, 7640, 1093, 38464, 11, 60299, 11, 323, 10532, 77, 1233, 382, 334, 51787, 96618, 19367, 374, 279, 8369, 478, 3280, 315, 279, 1060, 11, 11383, 29869, 505, 5651, 311, 6287, 304, 279, 17355, 96878, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 1317, 11, 4106, 2919, 11, 323, 8369, 22178, 13, 578, 9282, 374, 6118, 40798, 11, 449, 20472, 3629, 19261, 279, 5209, 12, 1490, 82, 311, 5209, 12, 1954, 82, 69823, 320, 966, 12, 1758, 32037, 570, 19367, 374, 264, 5526, 892, 369, 75667, 11, 11573, 23277, 11, 323, 16166, 7640, 1093, 24269, 11, 33873, 11, 323, 3703, 17106, 1157, 382, 334, 20175, 22082, 334, 320, 269, 3146, 50872, 334, 1680, 60902, 374, 279, 3280, 430, 15785, 279, 9320, 505, 7474, 311, 12688, 11, 11383, 29869, 505, 6250, 311, 6841, 304, 279, 17355, 96878, 13, 1102, 374, 32971, 555, 36921, 20472, 11, 10223, 80105, 11, 323, 279, 24322, 3280, 13, 578, 11141, 389, 279, 12690, 2543, 20333, 37199, 315, 19087, 11, 2579, 11, 323, 14071, 11, 6968, 264, 75001, 18921, 13, 60902, 374, 264, 5526, 3280, 369, 16166, 7640, 1093, 24149, 21816, 11, 18137, 18746, 11, 323