Output~2025-04-24 17:55:30.296749: [RequestOutput(request_id=2067, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Tell an interesting story about a day in the life of an animal ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 25672, 459, 7185, 3446, 922, 264, 1938, 304, 279, 2324, 315, 459, 10065, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="What a delightful task! Here's a story about a day in the life of a curious and adventurous animal:\n\n---\n\nIt was a sunny morning in the heart of the African savannah. Kipo, a playful and agile mongoose, stretched her long, slender body on the warm grass. She yawned, arching her back and extending her sharp claws, giving a good morning stretch to her entire body. After a quick sniff around, she set off to explore the day.\n\nFirst on her agenda was a visit to the nearby watering hole. Kipo loved watching the other animals gather around the water's edge, sipping and splashing in the cool, clear water. She joined the group, taking care not to get too close to the territorial warthogs, who were notorious for their grumpy demeanor. As she lapped up the water, she noticed a family of gazelles grazing nearby. Their large, gentle eyes caught her attention, and she decided to introduce herself.\n\nThe gazelles, feeling a bit wary at first, soon warmed up to Kipo's friendly demeanor. They showed her the best spots to find juicy grasses and succulent berries. Kipo was thrilled to discover a hidden patch of ripe, sweet berries, and she spent the next hour munching away, her tail wagging with joy.\n\nAfter lunch, Kipo decided to take a nap in a nearby thicket. She curled up, wrapping her bushy tail around her body, and soon fell into a peaceful slumber. The warm sun on her fur and the soothing sounds of the savannah lulled her into a deep sleep.\n\nLater that afternoon, Kipo woke up to the sound of chirping birds and rustling leaves. She stretched again, feeling refreshed and ready for more adventure. This time, she set her sights on the nearby termite mound. She had heard rumors of a secret underground tunnel system, and she was determined to explore it.\n\nWith her keen sense of smell and agility, Kipo navigated the narrow tunnels, marveling at the intricate networks of tunnels and chambers. She discovered hidden treasures like shiny pebbles and tasty insect eggs. As the sun began to set, Kipo made her way back to her cozy den, tired but exhilarated from her day's escapades.\n\nAs she settled in for the night, Kipo reflected on the wonderful day she had just had. She had made new friends, discovered hidden wonders, and experienced the thrill of exploration. As she drifted off to sleep, she couldn't wait to see", token_ids=[3923, 264, 50189, 3465, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 1938, 304, 279, 2324, 315, 264, 22999, 323, 68188, 10065, 1473, 45464, 2181, 574, 264, 40798, 6693, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 11904, 11427, 44104, 13, 735, 7088, 11, 264, 57169, 323, 62565, 15980, 11, 41398, 1077, 1317, 11, 73342, 2547, 389, 279, 8369, 16763, 13, 3005, 379, 6513, 291, 11, 5438, 287, 1077, 1203, 323, 33459, 1077, 17676, 68550, 11, 7231, 264, 1695, 6693, 14841, 311, 1077, 4553, 2547, 13, 4740, 264, 4062, 58387, 2212, 11, 1364, 743, 1022, 311, 13488, 279, 1938, 382, 5451, 389, 1077, 18909, 574, 264, 4034, 311, 279, 14373, 73841, 14512, 13, 735, 7088, 10456, 10307, 279, 1023, 10099, 9762, 2212, 279, 3090, 596, 6964, 11, 274, 5772, 323, 12786, 19587, 304, 279, 7155, 11, 2867, 3090, 13, 3005, 11096, 279, 1912, 11, 4737, 2512, 5