hould prioritize safety, ensuring it is safe for children to use and interact with.\n\n**Design Elements**\n\n1. **Body**: WhizBot's body will be a rounded, anthropomorphic shape with a bright, cartoon-inspired color scheme. The body will be made of a durable, child-friendly material.\n2. **Face**: WhizBot's face will feature a large, expressive screen that displays emotions and animations, making it more relatable and engaging for children.\n3. **Arms and Legs**: WhizBot will have two arms and two legs, allowing it to move around and interact with its environment.\n4. **Screen**: The screen will display a variety of interactive elements, including games, educational content, and animations.\n5. **Microphone and Speaker**: WhizBot will be equipped with a high-quality microphone and speaker, enabling it to communicate with children and respond to their voice commands.\n\n**Features**\n\n1. **AI-Powered Learning**: WhizBot will use AI to adapt to a child's learning style and pace, providing personalized educational content and feedback.\n2. **Robotics**: WhizBot will be able to move around and interact with its environment, allowing children to explore and learn about robotics and programming.\n3. **Games and Activities**: WhizBot will offer a range of games and activities that teach STEM concepts, such as coding, problem-solving, and critical thinking.\n4. **Voice Assistant**: WhizBot will be able to respond to voice commands, allowing children to control its movements and interactions.\n\n**Design Considerations**\n\n1. **Safety**: WhizBot's", token_ids=[334, 4921, 7127, 13002, 25, 1254, 450, 24406, 482, 362, 69530, 71626, 16809, 15592, 612, 77564, 70075, 57277, 334, 42144, 57277, 1671, 450, 24406, 374, 264, 14713, 48448, 15592, 41503, 12585, 6319, 311, 7945, 323, 46276, 2911, 20330, 220, 21, 12, 717, 13, 3161, 1202, 31449, 53161, 2955, 11, 1254, 450, 24406, 22262, 311, 1304, 6975, 323, 27501, 2523, 323, 23387, 13, 1115, 2027, 2955, 8641, 50729, 279, 1401, 4519, 11,