Output~2025-04-24 17:56:12.880881: [RequestOutput(request_id=2078, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a children\'s story that includes the character of a friendly lion. ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 2911, 596, 3446, 430, 5764, 279, 3752, 315, 264, 11919, 40132, 13, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**The Tale of Leo the Friendly Lion**\n\nIn the heart of the African savannah, there lived a friendly lion named Leo. He was the biggest and most majestic lion in the land, with a shaggy mane that reached all the way down to his paws. Despite his fearsome appearance, Leo was a kind and gentle soul, loved by all the animals in the savannah.\n\nOne sunny day, a little rabbit named Rosie hopped into the savannah, searching for a new home. She had heard about the beautiful grasslands and sparkling streams of the savannah, and she was eager to explore. As she wandered through the tall grass, she stumbled upon Leo, who was lazily lounging in the shade of a acacia tree.\n\nAt first, Rosie was frightened by the sight of the big lion. She had heard stories about lions being fierce predators, and she didn\'t know what to expect. But Leo, sensing her fear, stood up and introduced himself with a warm roar. "Hello there, little one!" he boomed. "My name is Leo, and I\'m a friendly lion. What brings you to our neck of the woods?"\n\nRosie was surprised by Leo\'s friendly demeanor and explained that she was looking for a new home. Leo\'s ears perked up, and he offered to show her around the savannah. Together, they set off on an adventure, exploring the rolling hills, sparkling streams, and colorful flowers.\n\nAs they wandered, Leo told Rosie all about the different animals that lived in the savannah. He introduced her to his friends, a wise old tortoise named Max, a mischievous monkey named Mango, and a playful antelope named Luna. Rosie was amazed by the diversity of creatures and the beauty of the landscape.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Leo led Rosie to a secluded clearing, where a group of animals were gathered around a campfire. They welcomed Rosie with open arms, and Leo introduced her to the group. They shared stories, sang songs, and laughed together, and Rosie felt like she had found a new family.\n\nFrom that day on, Rosie lived in the savannah with Leo and his friends. She learned about the importance of friendship, kindness, and community, and she grew up to be a brave and adventurous rabbit. And Leo, the friendly lion, remained her closest friend and protector, always ready to defend her and keep her safe.\n\nThe end.', token_ids=[334, 791, 55448, 315, 37848, 279, 49517, 33199, 57277, 644, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 11904, 11427, 44104, 11, 1070, 12439, 264, 11919, 40132, 7086, 37848, 13, 1283, 574, 279, 8706, 323, 1455, 81389, 40132, 304, 279, 4363, 11, 449, 264, 559, 351, 4680, 53460, 430, 8813, 682, 279, 1648, 1523, 311, 813, 281, 8805, 13, 18185, 813, 24087, 638, 11341, 11, 37848, 574, 264, 3169, 323, 22443, 13836, 11, 10456, 555, 682, 279, 10099, 304, 279, 11427, 44104, 382, 4054, 40798, 1938, 11, 264, 2697, 39824, 7086, 97867, 305, 18033, 1139, 279, 11427, 44104, 11, 15389, 369, 264, 502, 2162, 13, 3005, 1047, 6755, 922, 279, 6366, 16763, 8329, 323, 64612, 23914, 315, 279, 11427, 44104, 11, 323, 1364, 574, 24450, 311, 13488, 13, 1666, 1364, 82294, 1555, 279, 16615, 16763, 11, 1364, 50157, 5304, 37848, 11, 889, 574, 65536, 1570, 84244, 287, 304, 279, 28601, 315, 264, 1645, 28139, 5021, 382, 1