r in the orange juice and sliced almonds.\n6. Divide the batter evenly between the prepared pans and smooth the tops.\n7. Bake for 25-30 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean.\n8. Remove from the oven and let cool in the pans for 5 minutes before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely.\n9. Dust with confectioners' sugar, if desired.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n* Make sure to use freshly squeezed orange juice for the best flavor.\n* You can toast the sliced almonds in a 350°F (180°C) oven for 5-7 minutes or until fragrant and lightly browned for added depth of flavor.\n* This cake is perfect for a springtime celebration or a brunch gathering. You can also top it with a simple glaze made from powdered sugar and orange juice for an extra burst of citrus flavor.\n\nEnjoy your delicious Almond Orange Cake!", token_ids=[3923, 264, 50189, 10824, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 11363, 369, 459, 1708, 12669, 22725, 33860, 430, 33511, 279, 10184, 1919, 17615, 315, 88922, 449, 279, 33306, 315, 19087, 23661, 1473, 334, 2149, 12669, 22725, 33860, 26371, 57277, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 220, 16, 14, 17, 26446, 320, 7028, 70, 8, 682, 59338, 20415, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 4364, 70, 8, 16109, 7913, 13465, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 28915, 17138, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 12290, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 320, 1399, 70, 8, 7120, 62334, 14432, 11, 90158, 198, 9, 220, 17, 3544, 19335, 198, 9, 220, 17, 93200, 97276, 19087, 81631, 198, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 50999, 65262, 19087, 23661, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 4364, 70, 8, 48715, 88922, 198, 9, 1221, 13421, 388, 6, 13465, 11, 369, 16174, 287, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5075, 20559, 701, 24276, 311, 220, 8652, 59572, 320, 5245, 32037, 570, 13842, 521, 1403, 220, 23, 25224, 320, 508, 6358, 8, 4883, 19692, 64883, 323, 1584, 279, 93650, 449, 87204, 5684, 627, 17, 13, 763, 264, 11298, 19763, 11, 41759, 3871, 20415, 11, 13465, 11, 28915, 17138, 11, 323, 12290, 627, 18, 13, 763, 264, 3544,