Output~2025-04-24 17:57:10.258231: [RequestOutput(request_id=2093, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the process of making a cup of tea with milk, step by step. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 1920, 315, 3339, 264, 10747, 315, 15600, 449, 14403, 11, 3094, 555, 3094, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a step-by-step guide on how to make a cup of tea with milk:\n\n**Step 1: Gather the necessary ingredients and equipment**\n\n* 1 tea bag (black, green, or herbal, depending on your preference)\n* 1 cup (8 oz) of water\n* 1 cup (8 oz) of milk (whole, skim, or a non-dairy alternative, such as almond or soy milk)\n* A tea kettle or a pot\n* A cup or mug\n* A spoon\n\n**Step 2: Boil the water**\n\n* Fill the tea kettle or pot with fresh, cold water.\n* Place the kettle or pot on the stove and turn the heat to high.\n* Wait for the water to boil. You can check if the water has reached a boil by looking for big bubbles rising to the surface.\n\n**Step 3: Add the tea bag**\n\n* Once the water has boiled, remove the kettle or pot from the heat.\n* Add one tea bag to the cup or mug.\n* Make sure the tea bag is fully submerged in the water.\n\n**Step 4: Steep the tea**\n\n* Allow the tea bag to steep in the hot water for the recommended amount of time, usually 1-3 minutes, depending on your preferred strength of tea.\n* You can check the tea bag for the recommended steeping time on the packaging or by tasting the tea as you go.\n\n**Step 5: Add milk**\n\n* Once the tea has steeped, remove the tea bag from the cup or mug.\n* Add milk to the tea, stirring gently to combine.\n* You can add as much or as little milk as you prefer.\n\n**Step 6: Enjoy your tea**\n\n* Stir the tea again to ensure the milk is fully incorporated.\n* Your cup of tea with milk is now ready to drink and enjoy!\n\nThat's it! With these simple steps, you can make a delicious cup of tea with milk.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 8641, 389, 1268, 311, 1304, 264, 10747, 315, 15600, 449, 14403, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 279, 5995, 14293, 323, 7241, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 15600, 9145, 320, 11708, 11, 6307, 11, 477, 51487, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 22698, 340, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 23, 25616, 8, 315, 3090, 198, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 320, 23, 25616, 8, 315, 14403, 320, 67733, 11, 79669, 11, 477, 264, 2536, 1773, 22704, 10778, 11, 1778, 439, 63168, 477, 29839, 14403, 340, 9, 362, 15600, 73418, 477, 264, 3419, 198, 9, 362, 10747, 477, 52589, 198, 9, 362, 46605, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 2577, 321, 279, 3090, 57277, 9, 22748, 279, 15600, 73418, 477, 3419, 449, 7878, 11, 9439, 3090, 627, 9, 11004, 279, 73418, 477, 3419, 389, 279, 45115, 323, 2543, 279, 8798, 311, 1579, 627, 9, 14144, 369, 279, 3090, 311, 44790, 13, 1472, 649, 1817, 422, 279, 3090, 706, 8813, 264, 44790, 555, 3411, 369, 2466, 44783, 16448, 311, 279, 7479, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 2758, 279, 15600, 9145, 57277, 9, 9843, 279, 3090, 706, 66185, 11, 4148, 279, 73418, 477, 3419, 505, 279, 8798, 627, 9, 2758, 832, 15600, 9145, 311, 279, 10747, 477, 52589, 627, 9, 7557, 2771, 279, 15600, 9145, 374, 7373, 85177, 304, 279, 3090, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 3441, 752, 279, 15600, 57277, 9, 27628, 279, 15600, 9145, 311, 32366, 304, 279, 4106, 3090, 369, 279, 11349, 3392, 315, 892, 11, 6118, 220, 16, 12, 18, 4520, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 15236, 8333, 315, 15600, 627, 9, 1472, 649, 1817, 279, 15600, 9145, 369, 279, 11349, 32366, 287, 892, 389, 279, 2406