s: These models use a weighted average of past values to predict future values.\n5. Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs) and Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks: These models can be used to model complex non-linear relationships in the data and capture long-term dependencies.\n\nThese models can be used to analyze historical stock price data and make predictions about future prices.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 3465, 315, 52997, 279, 3430, 315, 264, 5708, 1306, 832, 2046, 11, 358, 1053, 7079, 1701, 264, 3146, 1489, 11378, 56775, 287, 334, 1646, 382, 1489, 11378, 56775, 287, 4211, 527, 6319, 311, 7168, 3938, 2819, 304, 264, 8668, 315, 828, 430, 374, 11713, 304, 892, 13, 763, 420, 1162, 11, 279, 3465, 18065, 52997, 279, 3430, 315, 264, 5708, 1306, 832, 2046, 11, 902, 374, 264, 11670, 3187, 315, 264, 892, 4101, 79482, 3575, 382, 8538, 5526, 4212, 11378, 56775, 287, 4211, 430, 1436, 387, 14791, 369, 420, 3465, 2997, 1473, 16, 13, 9648, 461, 47819, 320, 946, 8, 4211, 25, 4314, 4211, 1005, 3347, 2819, 315, 279, 5708, 3430, 311, 7168, 3938, 2819, 627, 17, 13, 38727, 24478, 320, 4940, 8, 4211, 25, 4314, 4211, 1005, 279, 5578, 315, 3347, 6103, 311, 7168, 3938, 2819, 627, 18, 13, 9648, 461, 47819, 50521, 38727, 24478, 320, 946, 73924, 8, 4211, 25, 4314, 4211, 16343, 279, 36486, 315, 6395, 323, 9917, 4211, 311, 12602, 2225, 2875, 9860, 323, 1317, 9860, 12912, 304, 279, 828, 627, 19, 13, 1398, 60925, 4487, 39513, 320, 1600, 8, 4211, 25, 4314, 4211, 1005, 264, 37924, 5578, 315, 3347, 2819, 311, 7168, 3938, 2819, 627, 20, 13, 4158, 963, 61577, 39810, 320, 49, 9944, 82, 8, 323, 5843, 10928, 9469, 4289, 14171, 320, 43, 36949, 8, 14488, 25, 4314, 4211, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 1646, 6485, 2536, 62399, 12135, 304, 279, 828, 323, 12602, 1317, 9860, 20113, 382, 9673, 4211, 649, 387, 1511, 311, 24564, 13970, 5708, 3430, 828, 323, 1304, 20492, 922, 3938, 7729, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_reques