Output~2025-04-06 23:36:35.762060: [RequestOutput(request_id=38, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Goal:\\nA complex palindrome is a string that is a palindrome when only its alphanumeric characters are considered and the case of the characters is ignored. The task is to determine whether a given string is a complex palindrome.\\n\\nInput:\\nA string `text` made of ASCII characters. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 41047, 7338, 77, 32, 6485, 74197, 374, 264, 925, 430, 374, 264, 74197, 994, 1193, 1202, 100079, 5885, 527, 6646, 323, 279, 1162, 315, 279, 5885, 374, 12305, 13, 578, 3465, 374, 311, 8417, 3508, 264, 2728, 925, 374, 264, 6485, 74197, 7255, 77, 1734, 2566, 7338, 77, 32, 925, 1595, 1342, 63, 1903, 315, 40416, 5885, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a Python solution for the task:\n\n```\ndef is_complex_palindrome(text):\n    # Remove non-alphanumeric characters and convert to lowercase\n    cleaned_text = \'\'.join(e for e in text if e.isalnum()).lower()\n    \n    # Check if the cleaned text is the same when reversed\n    return cleaned_text == cleaned_text[::-1]\n```\n\nYou can use this function by passing a string as an argument, like this:\n\n```\nprint(is_complex_palindrome("A man, a plan, a canal, Panama"))  # Returns: True\nprint(is_complex_palindrome("Not a palindrome"))  # Returns: False\n```', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 13325, 6425, 369, 279, 3465, 1473, 14196, 4077, 755, 374, 42622, 74410, 37158, 7383, 997, 262, 674, 11016, 2536, 19308, 66888, 5885, 323, 5625, 311, 43147, 198, 262, 28822, 4424, 284, 43963, 6115, 2069, 369, 384, 304, 1495, 422, 384, 2124, 94462, 6139, 15115, 746, 1084, 262, 674, 4343, 422, 279, 28822, 1495, 374, 279, 1890, 994, 28537, 198, 262, 471, 28822, 4424, 624, 28822, 4424, 63254, 16, 933, 14196, 19884, 2675, 649, 1005, 420, 734, 555, 12579, 264, 925, 439, 459, 5811, 11, 1093, 420, 1473, 14196, 4077, 1374, 9820, 42622, 74410, 37158, 446, 32, 893, 11, 264, 3197, 11, 264, 40021, 11, 49136, 2830, 220, 674, 5295, 25, 3082, 198, 1374, 9820, 42622, 74410, 37158, 446, 2688, 264, 74197, 2830, 220, 674, 5295, 25, 3641, 198, 74694, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
