lp automate repetitive tasks and workflows, freeing up time for more important tasks. For example, a customer service team can use Zapier to automatically send a follow-up email to customers who have opened a support ticket, or to trigger a notification to a team member when a new ticket is created. This can help reduce the time spent on manual tasks and improve response times to customer inquiries.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 10507, 315, 1701, 5557, 369, 15374, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 42172, 660, 5546, 9744, 96618, 12362, 2447, 6373, 3241, 1093, 350, 75233, 11, 1666, 3444, 11, 477, 5464, 26304, 649, 1520, 82703, 9256, 323, 5376, 26206, 13, 4314, 7526, 2187, 2128, 3697, 311, 9993, 9256, 11, 743, 58982, 11, 323, 3839, 5208, 11, 3339, 433, 8831, 311, 4822, 17057, 323, 10968, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 264, 8661, 2128, 649, 1005, 350, 75233, 311, 10299, 872, 3674, 3772, 21343, 11, 449, 1855, 4580, 14393, 264, 2204, 5452, 320, 21124, 11, 6405, 11, 14318, 11, 5099, 6266, 323, 7563, 14393, 3927, 9256, 320, 65664, 11, 38952, 11, 23387, 449, 20723, 11, 5099, 75303, 17, 13, 3146, 34126, 86683, 96618, 50935, 287, 4200, 16659, 1701, 2835, 49843, 11627, 7526, 1093, 38629, 11, 5195, 26911, 11, 477, 42309, 649, 3665, 892, 323, 8108, 279, 1205, 369, 304, 29145, 16659, 13, 1115, 374, 5423, 5505, 369, 8870, 7411, 477, 7411, 449, 3697, 304, 2204, 10687, 13, 1789, 2937, 11, 264, 3241, 4500, 2128, 649, 1005, 38629, 311, 3412, 7446, 2559, 5352, 16659, 11, 4358, 2447, 9013, 11, 323, 51696, 389, 2082, 8544, 11, 682, 2085, 3515, 311, 22655, 387, 304, 279, 1890, 3813, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 99956, 14173, 96618, 12362, 33762, 7526, 1093, 70331, 1291, 11, 358, 4082, 15249, 320, 2746, 1115, 5112, 3011, 705, 477, 20319, 859, 649, 1520, 69711, 59177, 9256, 323, 88568, 11, 67817, 709, 892, 369, 810, 3062, 9256, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 264, 6130, 2532, 2128, 649, 1005, 70331, 1291, 311, 9651, 3708, 264, 1833, 5352, 2613, 311, 6444, 889, 617, 9107, 264, 1862, 11989, 11, 477, 311, 8346, 264, 11801, 311, 264, 2128, 4