ate Change"**\n\nThese titles aim to capture the complexity and urgency of the climate change issue, while also highlighting the importance of scientific research, policy action, and collective responsibility in addressing this global challenge.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 1063, 4754, 2316, 2671, 369, 264, 3495, 5684, 389, 10182, 2349, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 1708, 34002, 1221, 62808, 315, 31636, 10604, 25, 362, 10506, 315, 279, 38130, 44796, 323, 11216, 14727, 10939, 1, 1035, 17, 13, 3146, 1, 83146, 10604, 25, 362, 8121, 46250, 1050, 71194, 81410, 63120, 323, 60018, 5703, 1, 1035, 18, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 29680, 315, 31636, 10604, 389, 469, 24168, 82, 323, 11344, 42509, 26640, 25, 362, 10506, 315, 279, 9303, 3314, 315, 33025, 1, 1035, 19, 13, 3146, 1, 49, 3876, 75783, 2859, 11, 49987, 350, 4769, 25, 578, 11344, 323, 25027, 1221, 62808, 315, 31636, 10604, 1, 1035, 20, 13, 3146, 1, 83146, 10604, 22515, 18413, 56619, 25, 362, 35761, 18825, 315, 279, 13756, 13071, 315, 9303, 63348, 323, 12781, 54586, 1, 1035, 21, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 31636, 46250, 25, 362, 7290, 311, 5703, 369, 61593, 11050, 323, 25027, 800, 24998, 5383, 1, 1035, 22, 13, 3146, 1, 83146, 10604, 323, 11344, 6401, 25, 578, 1252, 29412, 1221, 62808, 315, 264, 468, 34002, 29935, 1, 1035, 23, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 23362, 323, 9983, 14727, 11613, 315, 31636, 10604, 25, 362, 10506, 315, 279, 44796, 323, 11216, 14908, 1, 1035, 24, 13, 3146, 1, 83146, 10604, 323, 279, 12781, 315, 5751, 29935, 25, 362, 10506, 315, 279, 38130, 7440, 13940, 323, 11216, 89520, 1, 1035, 605, 13, 3146, 1, 2654, 391, 1303, 311, 264, 51269, 31636, 25, 578, 15766, 315, 1838, 321, 1873, 323, 59531, 367, 304, 22515, 343, 1113, 279, 14727, 11613, 315, 31636, 10604, 1, 57277, 9673, 15671, 9395, 311, 12602, 279, 23965, 323, 54917, 315, 279, 10182, 2349, 4360, 11, 1418, 1101, 39686, 279, 12939, 315, 12624, 3495, 11, 4947, 1957, 11, 323, 22498, 12014, 304, 28118, 420, 3728, 8815, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, st