Output~2025-04-06 23:38:29.388955: [RequestOutput(request_id=75, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Develop a workflow that can take an input of a question and automatically summarize the answer. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 8000, 264, 29388, 430, 649, 1935, 459, 1988, 315, 264, 3488, 323, 9651, 63179, 279, 4320, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a potential workflow to develop a system that can take an input of a question and automatically summarize the answer:\n\n**Step 1: Natural Language Processing (NLP) - Question Analysis**\n\n* Use a natural language processing (NLP) library such as spaCy or Stanford CoreNLP to analyze the input question and extract relevant information such as:\n\t+ Entities (people, places, organizations, etc.)\n\t+ Concepts (topics, themes, etc.)\n\t+ Sentiment (positive, negative, neutral)\n\t+ Intent (informational, transactional, etc.)\n\n**Step 2: Knowledge Retrieval**\n\n* Use a knowledge graph or a database to retrieve relevant information related to the question. This can be done using techniques such as:\n\t+ Entity disambiguation: identifying the correct entity mentioned in the question\n\t+ Concept matching: matching the concepts extracted in Step 1 with relevant concepts in the knowledge graph\n\t+ Query expansion: expanding the search query to include related terms and concepts\n\n**Step 3: Answer Generation**\n\n* Use a language generation library such as NLG (Natural Language Generation) or Rasa to generate a summary of the answer based on the retrieved information. This can be done using techniques such as:\n\t+ Template-based generation: using pre-defined templates to generate the answer\n\t+ Data-driven generation: generating the answer based on the retrieved information\n\t+ Hybrid approach: combining template-based and data-driven generation\n\n**Step 4: Post-processing**\n\n* Use a post-processing library such as spaCy or Stanford CoreNLP to refine the generated answer by:\n\t+ Removing redundant information\n\t+ Improving grammar and syntax\n\t+ Enhancing readability\n\n**Step 5: Output**\n\n* Output the summarized answer to the user in a format such as text, speech, or visualizations.\n\n**Example Architecture**\n\nHere is an example architecture for the workflow:\n\n```\n          +---------------+\n          |  Question  |\n          +---------------+\n                  |\n                  |\n                  v\n          +---------------+\n          |  NLP - Question  |\n          |  Analysis      |\n          +---------------+\n                  |\n                  |\n                  v\n          +---------------+\n          |  Knowledge    |\n          |  Retrieval    |\n          +---------------+\n                  |\n                  |\n                  v\n          +---------------+\n          |  Answer      |\n          |  Generation  |\n          +---------------+\n                  |\n                  |\n                  v\n          +---------------+\n          |  Post-processing|\n          |  (Refining)', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 4754, 29388, 311, 2274, 264, 1887, 430, 649, 1935, 459, 1988, 315, 264, 3488, 323, 9651, 63179, 279, 4320, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 18955, 11688, 29225, 320, 45, 12852, 8, 482, 16225, 18825, 57277, 9, 5560, 264, 5933, 4221, 8863, 320, 45, 12852, 8, 6875, 1778, 439, 31493, 57815, 477, 31788, 9708, 45, 12852, 311, 24564, 279, 1988, 3488, 323, 8819, 9959, 2038, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 53349, 320, 16455, 11, 7634, 11, 11351, 11, 5099, 29275, 197, 10, 76872, 320, 56252, 11, 22100, 11, 5099, 29275, 197, 10, 24248, 3904, 320, 31587, 11, 8389, 11, 21277, 340, 197, 10, 9005, 320, 26125, 278, 11, 7901, 278, 11, 5099, 9456, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 33025, 20035, 838, 57277, 9, 5560, 264, 6677, 4876, 477, 264, 4729, 311, 17622, 9959, 2038, 5552, 311, 279, 3488, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 2884, 1701, 12823, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 10606, 834, 3042, 343, 4090, 25, 25607, 279, 4495, 5502, 9932, 304, 279, 3488, 198, 197, 10, 35455, 12864, 25, 12864, 279, 19476, 28532, 304, 15166, 220, 16, 449, 9959, 19476, 304, 279, 6677, 4876, 198, 197, 10, 11615, 14800, 25, 24050, 279, 2778, 3319, 311, 2997, 5552, 3878, 323, 19476, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 22559, 24367, 57277, 9, 5560, 264, 4221, 9659, 6875, 1778, 439, 33260, 38, 320, 55381, 11688, 24367, 8, 477, 432, 15790, 311, 7068, 264, 12399, 315, 279, 4320, 3196, 389, 279, 31503, 2038, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 2884, 1701, 12823, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 14692, 6108, 9659, 25, 1701, 864, 39817, 20506, 311, 7068, 279, 4320, 198, 197, 10, 2956, 32505, 9659, 25, 24038, 279, 4320, 3196, 389, 279, 31503, 2038, 198, 197, 10, 50727, 5603, 25, 35271, 3896, 6108, 323, 828, 32505, 9659, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 3962, 70293, 57277, 9, 5560, 264, 1772, 70293, 6875, 1778, 439, 31493, 57815, 477, 31788, 9708, 45, 12852, 311, 46464, 279, 8066, 4320, 555, 512, 197, 10, 67803, 48832, 2038, 198, 197, 10, 22728, 4504, 32528, 323, 20047, 198, 197, 10, 29757, 9151, 92594, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 9442, 57277, 9, 9442, 279, 69729, 4320, 311, 279, 1217, 304, 264, 3645, 1778, 439, 1495, 11, 8982, 11, 477, 9302, 8200, 382, 334, 13617, 38943, 57277, 8586, 374, 459, 3187, 18112, 369, 279, 29388, 1473, 14196, 4077, 692, 489, 39745, 17359, 692, 765, 220, 16225, 220, 9432, 692, 489, 39745, 17359, 1733, 9432, 1733, 9432, 1733, 348, 198, 692, 489, 39745, 17359, 692, 765, 220, 452, 12852, 482, 16225, 220, 9432, 692, 765, 220, 18825, 415, 9432, 692, 489, 3