 stay on track and achieve your goals.\n\nThis playlist is designed to provide a mix of relaxing and energizing tracks to help you stay focused and motivated while studying. The songs are carefully selected to create a calm and productive atmosphere, with a balance of mellow and upbeat tracks to keep you engaged and inspired.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 27889, 315, 220, 23, 11936, 430, 499, 649, 9020, 311, 1418, 21630, 1473, 334, 14139, 323, 62261, 2214, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 1, 8459, 1752, 1, 555, 2947, 86310, 9323, 334, 482, 1115, 5609, 374, 74647, 17033, 311, 387, 279, 1455, 34948, 5609, 304, 279, 1917, 11, 3339, 433, 4832, 369, 6968, 264, 19858, 323, 10968, 16975, 1418, 21630, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1, 83380, 14355, 36967, 1, 555, 36967, 26172, 334, 482, 362, 296, 5412, 323, 65464, 42045, 3839, 430, 690, 1520, 499, 636, 1139, 264, 27331, 57506, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 1, 65965, 1, 555, 1708, 2259, 4821, 1394, 12627, 13, 52709, 307, 334, 482, 362, 37401, 323, 45475, 14683, 3839, 430, 690, 2567, 499, 17045, 323, 27762, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 1, 47, 61292, 3216, 735, 5908, 1, 555, 39274, 279, 9029, 334, 482, 362, 86605, 323, 85773, 44578, 41352, 3839, 430, 690, 2567, 499, 4602, 1534, 323, 10968, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 1, 86799, 3061, 4336, 304, 1472, 1, 555, 816, 404, 13722, 334, 482, 362, 6366, 323, 78729, 27374, 6710, 430, 690, 1520, 499, 12234, 323, 37455, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 1, 1991, 1472, 1, 555, 15469, 54753, 334, 482, 362, 13836, 1285, 323, 26609, 9262, 432, 49339, 3839, 430, 690, 2567, 499, 17045, 323, 27762, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 1, 38286, 3919, 10919, 1, 555, 13789, 358, 424, 334, 482, 362, 77754, 398, 6366, 44578, 2269, 23427, 3839, 430, 690, 1520, 499, 4822, 10968, 323, 14948, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 1, 1844, 26650, 1, 555, 87766, 13394, 287, 2630, 334, 482, 1556, 95609, 323, 66388, 2477, 56664, 430, 690, 62425, 499, 311, 4822, 389, 3839, 323, 11322, 701, 9021, 382, 2028, 27889, 374, 6319, 311, 3493, 264, 6651, 315, 34948, 323, 4602, 4954, 14242, 311, 1520, 499, 4822, 10968, 323