nd a nutty flavor.\n5. **Spices**: Depending on the type of baked good you're making, you can add a pinch of cinnamon, nutmeg, or cardamom to give it a warm, aromatic flavor.\n6. **Fresh or dried fruits**: Dried cranberries, cherries, or raisins can add natural sweetness and chewiness. Fresh fruits like blueberries, raspberries, or strawberries can add a burst of flavor and color.\n\nSome specific ideas based on the ingredients you have:\n\n* If you're making a cake, consider adding some chopped nuts or a teaspoon of vanilla extract to enhance the flavor.\n* If you're making cookies, try adding a pinch of salt and a sprinkle of cinnamon or nutmeg for added depth.\n* If you're making a bread, consider adding some chopped fresh herbs like rosemary or thyme for a savory twist.\n\nRemember, these are just suggestions! The beauty of baking is that you can experiment and adjust to your taste.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 6041, 1486, 0, 3161, 20415, 11, 13465, 11, 28915, 17138, 11, 323, 3090, 11, 358, 4265, 4284, 7999, 1063, 5217, 14293, 311, 18885, 279, 17615, 323, 10651, 315, 701, 11363, 13, 5810, 527, 264, 2478, 6848, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 48418, 96618, 362, 50346, 315, 12290, 649, 8335, 704, 279, 64550, 505, 279, 13465, 323, 4546, 704, 279, 32523, 315, 279, 1023, 14293, 13, 5560, 264, 1344, 29200, 9581, 12290, 477, 98740, 12290, 369, 3779, 10651, 323, 17615, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 4071, 466, 477, 5707, 96618, 31470, 264, 2766, 315, 8834, 649, 31518, 279, 17615, 323, 8541, 29668, 315, 701, 41778, 1695, 13, 1472, 649, 1005, 50459, 14432, 11, 50459, 34557, 5707, 11, 477, 1524, 33213, 5707, 311, 923, 32257, 323, 8149, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 46324, 6374, 8819, 96618, 362, 42384, 315, 33165, 8819, 649, 923, 264, 8369, 11, 69130, 17615, 311, 701, 41778, 1695, 13, 1102, 13840, 1664, 449, 279, 64550, 315, 13465, 323, 649, 18885, 279, 8244, 55279, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 45, 6256, 477, 19595, 96618, 31470, 1063, 38525, 31049, 320, 27495, 64866, 11, 88922, 11, 477, 20750, 17912, 6256, 990, 166