Output~2025-04-06 23:41:04.098652: [RequestOutput(request_id=139, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Specify two characteristics of a good team player. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 48495, 1403, 17910, 315, 264, 1695, 2128, 2851, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Two characteristics of a good team player are:\n\n1. **Communication skills**: A good team player is able to effectively communicate with their teammates, both verbally and non-verbally. This includes actively listening to others, clarifying expectations, and providing clear and concise feedback. Good communication helps to prevent misunderstandings, builds trust, and ensures that everyone is working towards the same goal.\n2. **Flexibility and adaptability**: A good team player is flexible and adaptable, able to adjust to changing circumstances and priorities. This includes being willing to take on new tasks, adjust to new information, and pivot when necessary. Flexibility and adaptability help to ensure that the team can respond quickly and effectively to challenges and opportunities, and that everyone is working together towards a common goal.', token_ids=[11874, 17910, 315, 264, 1695, 2128, 2851, 527, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 66511, 7512, 96618, 362, 1695, 2128, 2851, 374, 3025, 311, 13750, 19570, 449, 872, 32746, 11, 2225, 85207, 323, 2536, 12, 23129, 750, 13, 1115, 5764, 22815, 14624, 311, 3885, 11, 20064, 7922, 17078, 11, 323, 8405, 2867, 323, 64694, 11302, 13, 7839, 10758, 8779