oints reach 0, the game is over.\n\n**Your Current Location:** You are standing in the entrance of the laboratory. The door behind you is locked, and you see a group of angry minions approaching you.\n\n**Minion Stats:**\n\n* Health: 20\n* Attack: 5\n\n**Your Inventory:**\n\n* None\n\nWhat do you want to do?\n\nType a command to proceed:', token_ids=[334, 14262, 311, 330, 10976, 894, 3468, 919, 1, 0, 57277, 2675, 527, 264, 34300, 100235, 889, 706, 50157, 5304, 264, 6367, 27692, 8340, 5655, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 264, 29050, 45520, 13, 578, 10278, 374, 2162, 311, 264, 1912, 315, 19021, 60905, 11, 3549, 555, 264, 13088, 28568, 889, 706, 8208, 54991, 13, 578, 60905, 527, 56168, 311, 7066, 4395, 304, 872, 1853, 11, 323, 433, 596, 709, 311, 499, 311, 3009, 1124, 382, 334, 7927, 41047, 68063, 29878, 535, 279, 10278, 323, 18506, 279, 19021, 60905, 311, 12731, 382, 334, 4973, 1387, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 1472, 690, 387, 10666, 449, 264, 1495, 6108, 3834, 11, 1405, 499, 649, 955, 11545, 311, 21546, 323, 16681, 449, 279, 4676, 627, 17, 13, 1472, 690, 1212, 449, 220, 1041, 2890, 3585, 627, 18, 13, 578, 10278, 374, 18255, 1139, 3892, 12295, 11, 1855, 449, 1202, 1866, 11774, 323, 32116, 627, 19, 13, 1472, 649, 3351, 10411, 11, 10007, 11, 11226, 11, 477, 9909, 555, 20061, 279, 12435, 5216, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 330, 62995, 39709, 20, 13, 1472, 649, 3440, 279, 60905, 555, 20061, 330, 21208, 1, 477, 330, 21828, 23811, 21, 13, 1472, 649, 1005, 3673, 499, 1505, 304, 279, 10278, 311, 701, 9610, 555, 20061, 330, 817, 510, 1224, 836, 19727, 627, 22, 13, 1442, 499, 1935, 5674, 11, 499, 690, 9229, 2890, 3585, 13, 1442, 701, 2890, 3585, 5662, 220, 15, 11, 279, 1847, 374, 927, 382, 334, 7927, 9303, 10067, 68063, 1472, 527, 11509, 304, 279, 20396, 315, 279, 27692, 13, 578, 6134, 4920, 499, 374, 16447, 11, 323, 499, 1518, 264, 1912, 315, 19021, 60905, 31047, 499, 382, 334, 6349, 290, 31027, 25, 57277, 9, 6401, 25, 220, 508, 198, 9, 21453, 25, 220, 20, 271, 334, 7927, 29226, 25, 57277, 9, 2290, 271, 