Output~2025-04-06 23:43:05.612036: [RequestOutput(request_id=184, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe how the given character changed in the given story. ### Input: Character: Harry Potter\\nStory: Harry Potter and the Sorcerer\'s Stone ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 1268, 279, 2728, 3752, 5614, 304, 279, 2728, 3446, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 16007, 25, 14253, 30427, 1734, 18422, 25, 14253, 30427, 323, 279, 30631, 69981, 596, 14637, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='In the story "Harry Potter and the Sorcerer\'s Stone", Harry Potter undergoes significant changes as he navigates his first year at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. At the beginning of the story, Harry is an orphan who has been living with his cruel and neglectful Muggle (non-magical) relatives, the Dursleys. He is unaware of his true identity as a wizard and has been kept in the dark about his parents\' deaths.\n\nThroughout the story, Harry discovers his true identity and begins to uncover the truth about his parents and their deaths. He also learns about the wizarding world and his own connection to it. As he makes new friends and allies, such as Ron Weasley and Hermione Granger, Harry begins to develop a sense of belonging and purpose.\n\nOne of the most significant changes Harry undergoes is his growth from a timid and uncertain boy to a brave and confident young wizard. He learns to stand up for himself and others, and he begins to understand the importance of loyalty, friendship, and the power of love. By the end of the story, Harry has transformed from a shy and uncertain boy to a confident and courageous young wizard who is ready to face the challenges that lie ahead.\n\nAdditionally, Harry\'s relationships with others also undergo significant changes. He forms strong bonds with his new friends and mentors, such as Albus Dumbledore and Rubeus Hagrid, and he begins to understand the complexities of his relationships with his parents and their legacies. Overall, Harry\'s journey in "Harry Potter and the Sorcerer\'s Stone" is one of self-discovery, growth, and transformation, as he navigates the magical world and uncovers the truth about his past and his destiny.', token_ids=[644, 279, 3446, 330, 42398, 30427, 323, 279, 30631, 69981, 596, 14637, 498, 14253, 30427, 37771, 288, 5199, 4442, 439, 568, 34512, 988, 813, 1176, 1060, 520, 78253, 6150, 315, 39450, 7868, 323, 39487, 894, 13, 2468, 279, 7314, 315, 279, 3446, 11, 14253, 374, 459, 13036, 889, 706, 1027, 5496, 449, 813, 28128, 323, 39332, 1285, 386, 50428, 320, 6414, 1474, 351, 950, 8, 29658, 11, 279, 423, 1759, 48779, 13, 1283, 374, 41747, 315, 813, 837, 9764, 439, 264, 35068, 323, 706, 1027, 8774, 304, 279, 6453, 922, 813, 6699, 6, 16779, 382, 60105, 279, 3446, 11, 14253, 52114, 813, 837, 9764, 323, 12302, 311, 45063, 279, 8206, 922, 813, 6699, 323, 872, 16779, 13, 1283, 1101, 47310, 922, 279, 35068, 287, 1917, 323, 813, 1866, 3717, 311, 433, 13, 1666, 568, 3727, 502, 4885, 323, 20724, 11, 1778, 439, 14662, 1226, 74111, 323, 54599, 2895, 4091, 11, 14253, 12302, 311, 2274, 264, 5647, 315, 33152, 323, 7580, 382, 4054, 315, 279, 1455, 5199, 4442, 14253, 37771, 288, 374, 813, 6650, 505, 264, 99149, 323, 36218, 8334, 311, 264, 34300, 323, 16913, 3995, 35068, 13, 1283, 47310, 311, 2559, 709, 369, 5678, 323, 3885, 11, 323, 568, 12302, 311, 3619, 279, 12939, 315, 32883, 