sweet and savory casserole made with mashed sweet potatoes, brown sugar, and marshmallows, topped with a crunchy pecan streusel.\n* Cranberry-Orange Relish: A tangy and refreshing relish made with fresh cranberries, orange zest, and a hint of cinnamon.\n\n**Desserts**\n\n* Pumpkin Pie: A classic Thanksgiving dessert made with a flaky crust, a creamy pumpkin filling, and a sprinkle of cinnamon.\n* Apple Crisp: A warm and comforting dessert made with tender apples, oatmeal, and brown sugar, topped with a crunchy streusel topping.\n* Whipped Cream: A dollop of whipped cream to top off your dessert of choice.\n\n**Beverages**\n\n* Apple Cider: A warm and spicy apple cider made with cinnamon sticks and a hint of nutmeg.\n* Mulled Wine: A rich and fruity mulled wine made with red wine, orange slices, and spices.\n\nI hope this menu helps inspire your Thanksgiving feast!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 11670, 37250, 5130, 430, 596, 2771, 311, 4587, 1473, 334, 3563, 388, 57277, 9, 12093, 15386, 2030, 4253, 332, 20685, 1003, 61434, 25, 362, 47985, 323, 69130, 19724, 1903, 449, 54662, 719, 4253, 332, 59576, 11, 45697, 11, 31735, 11, 323, 264, 13310, 315, 10184, 71376, 11, 10434, 449, 264, 87460, 315, 272, 9831, 6816, 12333, 323, 264, 85947, 315, 26365, 41554, 627, 9, 60902, 42691, 64646, 25, 362, 7878, 6651, 315, 36899, 52011, 11, 1589, 26902, 6437, 17604, 11, 93972, 41926, 64866, 11, 323, 32720, 70637, 36989, 11, 51249, 304, 264, 3177, 348, 2259, 343, 68028, 32623, 382, 334, 6334, 17026, 57277, 9, 74956, 11151, 78, 15386, 17442, 25, 362, 11670, 54662, 45405, 17659, 11, 67854, 449, 264, 20955, 315, 42393, 323, 49659, 11, 2737, 270, 31218, 11, 39361, 11, 323, 16392, 1563, 11, 323, 54662, 311, 39143, 627, 9, 386, 13883, 27687, 14020, 20798, 25, 30800, 88, 323, 68661, 96234, 10437, 35267, 72903, 449, 14432, 11, 14198, 13465, 11, 323, 264, 13310, 315, 51992, 627, 9, 7997, 34823, 26520, 261, 1286, 25, 362, 11670, 37250, 3185, 12269, 1903, 449, 6307, 27994, 11, 12932, 315, 58466, 1972