0) of the number using the `math.log10` function from the Python `math` module. We format the result to two decimal places using the `format` function. Finally, we print the calculated value. If the user enters a non-positive number, we print an error message.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 13325, 2068, 430, 45695, 279, 3465, 1473, 74694, 12958, 198, 2, 21069, 279, 1217, 311, 3810, 264, 6928, 1396, 198, 2470, 284, 2273, 5498, 446, 6403, 264, 6928, 1396, 25, 330, 4489, 2, 4343, 422, 279, 1396, 374, 6928, 198, 333, 1661, 871, 220, 15, 512, 262, 674, 21157, 279, 91036, 76, 320, 3231, 220, 605, 8, 315, 279, 2728, 1396, 198, 262, 1515, 3220, 284, 2273, 21355, 8228, 11, 6389, 17, 69, 7132, 262, 1515, 5400, 284, 7033, 1699, 605, 12814, 3220, 340, 1084, 262, 674, 8377, 279, 16997, 907, 198, 262, 1194, 446, 791, 91036, 76, 320, 3231, 220, 605, 8, 315, 279, 2728, 1396, 374, 25, 3755, 1515, 5400, 340, 1531, 512, 262, 1194, 446, 5618, 3810, 264, 6928, 1396, 13352, 14196, 19884, 644, 420, 2068, 11, 584, 1176, 2610, 279, 1217, 311, 3810, 264, 6928, 1396, 1701, 279, 1595, 1379, 63, 734, 13, 1226, 1243, 1817, 422, 279, 10862, 1396, 374, 6928, 1701, 459, 1595, 333, 63, 5224, 13, 1442, 279, 1396, 374, 6928, 11, 584, 11294, 279, 91036, 76, 320, 3231, 220, 605, 8, 315, 279, 1396, 1701, 279, 1595, 10590, 1699, 605, 63, 734, 505, 279, 13325, 1595, 10590, 63, 4793, 13, 1226, 3645, 279, 1121, 311, 1403, 12395, 7634, 1701, 279, 1595, 2293, 63, 734, 13, 17830, 11, 584, 1194, 279, 16997, 907, 13, 1442, 279, 1217, 29933, 264, 2536, 69788, 1396, 11, 584, 1194, 459, 1493, 1984, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
