, trumpet-shaped center?\n\t+ Yes → Go to Step 18\n\t+ No → Go to Step 19\n\n**Step 11:**\n\n* Does the flower have a sweet, pleasant scent?\n\t+ Yes → Go to Step 20\n\t+ No → Go to Step 21\n\n**Step 12:**\n\n* Are the petals frilly and ruffled?\n\t+ Yes → Go to Step 22\n\t+ No → Go to Step 23\n\n**Step 13:**\n\n* Does the flower have a bright, showy center?\n\t+ Yes → Go to Step 24\n\t+ No → Go to Step 25\n\n**Step 14:**\n\n* Are the petals soft and feath', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 21154, 13340, 315, 264, 29953, 354, 316, 788, 1401, 1473, 334, 35, 718, 354, 316, 788, 5422, 311, 65647, 264, 43786, 57277, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 57277, 9, 12838, 279, 23153, 617, 96740, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 17, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 18, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 57277, 9, 8886, 279, 96740, 1501, 88, 323, 76389, 28296, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 19, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 20, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 57277, 9, 12838, 279, 23153, 617, 264, 3831, 11, 47989, 54097, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 21, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 22, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 57277, 9, 8886, 279, 96740, 28902, 304, 264, 42197, 5497, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 8219, 39853, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 23, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 57277, 9, 12838, 279, 23153, 617, 264, 10879, 315, 2678, 11, 3927, 19837, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 24, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 605, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 21, 25, 57277, 9, 12838, 279, 23153, 617, 264, 35947, 11, 281, 2234, 306, 41466, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 4923, 3200, 356, 57589, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 806, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 22, 25, 57277, 9, 12838, 279, 23153, 617, 264, 36301, 11, 326, 2826, 11341, 5380, 197, 10, 7566, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 717, 198, 197, 10, 2360, 11651, 6122, 311, 15166, 220, 1032, 271