Output~2025-04-06 23:48:45.995883: [RequestOutput(request_id=320, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Identify 3 ways to encourage individuals to practice social distancing. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 65647, 220, 18, 5627, 311, 15253, 7931, 311, 6725, 3674, 73669, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are three ways to encourage individuals to practice social distancing:\n\n1. **Set clear expectations and guidelines**: Establish clear rules and guidelines for social distancing in public spaces, such as schools, workplaces, and public transportation. This can include maintaining a minimum distance of 6 feet from others, avoiding close contact, and limiting the number of people in a given area. Make sure to communicate these expectations clearly and consistently to ensure everyone understands the importance of social distancing.\n\n2. **Provide incentives and rewards**: Offer incentives and rewards to encourage individuals to practice social distancing. For example, businesses can offer discounts or promotions to customers who wear masks or maintain a safe distance from others. Governments can also offer incentives, such as tax breaks or other benefits, to individuals who follow social distancing guidelines.\n\n3. **Make social distancing a habit**: Encourage individuals to make social distancing a habit by incorporating it into their daily routines. This can be done by creating a routine of maintaining a safe distance from others, such as always keeping a 6-foot distance from others in public, or avoiding crowded areas and opting for quieter spaces instead. Additionally, individuals can also practice social distancing by avoiding close contact with others, such as not shaking hands or hugging, and instead opting for alternative greetings like waving or fist bumps.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 5627, 311, 15253, 7931, 311, 6725, 3674, 73669, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1681, 2867, 17078, 323, 17959, 96618, 40498, 2867, 5718, 323, 17959, 369, 3674, 73669, 304, 586, 12908, 11, 1778, 439, 8853, 11, 93162, 11, 323, 586, 18386, 13, 1115, 649, 2997, 20958, 264, 8187, 6138, 315, 220, 21, 7693, 505, 3885, 11, 31526, 3345, 3729, 11, 323, 33994, 279, 1396, 315, 1274, 304, 264, 2728, 3158, 13, 7557, 2771, 311, 19570, 1521, 17078, 9539, 323, 21356, 311, 6106, 5127, 31869, 279, 12939, 315, 3674, 73669, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 61524, 36580, 323, 21845, 96618, 25510, 36580, 323, 21845, 311, 15253, 7931, 311, 6725, 3674, 73669, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 9873, 649, 3085, 32162, 477, 37071, 311, 6444, 889, 10051, 27227, 477, 10519, 264, 6220, 6138, 505, 3885, 13, 88799, 649, 1101, 3085, 36580, 11, 1778, 439, 3827, 18808, 477, 1023, 7720, 11, 311, 7931, 889, 1833, 3674, 73669, 17959, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 8238, 3674, 73669, 264, 14464, 96618, 10984, 61140, 7931, 311, 1304, 3674, 73669, 264, 14464, 555, 52913, 433, 1139, 872, 7446, 30597, 13, 1115, 649, 387, 2884, 555, 6968, 264, 14348, 315, 20958, 264, 6220, 6138, 505, 3885, 11, 1778, 439, 2744, 10494, 264, 220, 21, 21117, 6138, 505, 3885, 304, 586, 11, 477, 31526, 39313, 5789, 323, 75701, 369, 90845, 12908, 4619, 13, 23212, 11, 7931, 649, 1101, 6725, 3674, 73669, 555, 31526, 3345, 3729, 449, 3885, 11, 1778, 439, 539, 38839, 6206, 477, 305, 36368, 11, 323, 4619, 75701, 369, 10778, 95185, 1093, 64211, 477, 40902, 65822, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_mo