00 PM - 2:00 PM: Live Music Performance (Local Band)\n* 2:00 PM - 3:00 PM: Interactive Activities (Face Painting, Hula Hooping, etc.)\n* 3:00 PM - 4:00 PM: Food and Beverage Break\n* 4:00 PM - 5:00 PM: Live Music Performance (Headlining Act)\n* 5:00 PM - 6:00 PM: Community Booths and Activities (Local Businesses, Non-Profits, etc.)\n* 6:00 PM - 7:00 PM: Food and Beverage Break\n* 7:00 PM - 10:00 PM: Live Music Performance (DJ and Dancing)\n\n**Logistics:**\n\n* **Parking:** Designate parking areas for attendees, with shuttle services available for those with mobility issues.\n* **Food and Beverage:** Offer a variety of food options, including vegetarian and gluten-free choices, and provide water stations throughout the event area.\n* **Restrooms:** Ensure adequate restrooms are available, with attendants on hand to maintain cleanliness and', token_ids=[334, 1585, 35455, 68063, 330, 51787, 37, 478, 220, 2366, 18, 25, 362, 75200, 315, 10948, 11, 12369, 11, 323, 12332, 1875, 334, 79406, 68063, 2057, 3552, 264, 3544, 13230, 1567, 430, 12716, 3871, 220, 20, 11, 931, 40285, 505, 279, 2254, 4029, 311, 4774, 3974, 4731, 11, 18406, 3691, 11, 323, 21416, 7640, 11, 1418, 22923, 31426, 323, 3674, 64186, 382, 334, 1585, 12589, 25, 57277, 9, 2696, 25, 7884, 11, 5651, 220, 1114, 339, 11, 220, 2366, 18, 198, 9, 4212, 25, 220, 717, 25, 410, 5975, 482, 220, 605, 25, 410, 5975, 198, 9, 10067, 25, 44985, 4409, 5657, 11, 220, 4513, 4802, 800, 11, 5884, 28931, 11, 7427, 198, 9, 32121, 80057, 25, 220, 20, 11, 931, 271, 334, 4808, 12, 1585, 28780, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 91236, 25117, 68063, 44985, 4409, 5657, 374, 12146, 4245, 311, 1202, 8792, 3813, 11, 42853, 13217, 11, 323, 62081, 6325, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1585, 35455, 68063, 19367, 37, 478, 220, 2366, 18, 690, 4668, 264, 6651, 315, 3974, 4731, 24601, 11, 3691, 29629, 11, 21416, 7640, 11, 323, 4029, 92259, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 64001, 68063, 400, 3965, 11, 931, 320, 58472, 369, 22150, 19160, 11, 16924, 11, 3691, 11, 8661, 11, 323, 93504, 1