althy snacks like nuts, seeds, or dried fruits\n* A supplement or vitamin pack for energy and wellness\n* A self-care item like a face mask or a set of scented bath bombs\n* A motivational book or a guided journal for mindfulness and self-care\n\n**Idea 5: "Adventure Seeker" Gift Box**\n\n* A gift card to a local outdoor gear store or an experience like rock climbing or kayaking\n* A portable power bank or a waterproof Bluetooth speaker\n* A set of travel-sized games or a puzzle book for on-the-go entertainment\n* A set of travel accessories like packing cubes or a packing list app\n* A guidebook or map to a nearby national park or hiking trail\n\nThese are just a few ideas to get you started. You can customize the contents based on the recipient\'s interests and preferences to make it a truly unique and thoughtful gift!', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 5016, 6848, 369, 264, 8352, 3830, 1473, 334, 40, 56188, 220, 16, 25, 330, 6882, 710, 367, 88494, 1, 22837, 8425, 57277, 9, 362, 78729, 7718, 5707, 3722, 882, 198, 9, 362, 743, 315, 1156, 16243, 52305, 304, 65464, 8508, 95597, 1093, 81460, 323, 33165, 198, 9, 362, 72779, 8071, 7056, 323, 264, 6857, 315, 8579, 11, 53833, 40086, 198, 9, 362, 33687, 33862, 11325, 477, 264, 4232, 2082, 369, 264, 33862, 917, 198, 9, 362, 10361, 315, 51487, 15600, 477, 264, 9145, 315, 73585, 11033, 311, 12192, 43685, 271, 334, 40, 56188, 220, 17, 25, 330, 38, 51802, 12369, 648, 1, 22837, 8425, 57277, 9, 362, 6727, 315, 67219, 278, 98564, 11, 94911, 11, 323, 90398, 198, 9, 362, 16893, 315, 13378, 477, 65393, 198, 9, 362, 73585, 3691, 1537, 1093, 490, 13511, 26828, 477, 72903, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 362, 77204, 505, 264, 37048, 30806, 477, 264, 3230, 36105, 198, 9, 362, 743, 315, 73585, 49659, 477, 3280, 826, 311, 69730, 2162, 17677, 271, 334, 40, 56188, 220, 18, 25, 330, 64046, 16783, 1, 22837, 8425, 57277, 9, 362, 743, 315, 1579, 22867, 1989, 17135, 1093, 57948, 11, 24915, 11, 477, 28296, 97438, 198, 9, 362, 8486, 477, 26610, 2239, 449, 34147, 1