Output~2025-04-06 23:51:32.460015: [RequestOutput(request_id=365, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a script for a 3-minute stand-up comedy act. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 5429, 369, 264, 220, 18, 24401, 2559, 5352, 23160, 1180, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here\'s a script for a 3-minute stand-up comedy act:\n\n(stage is dimly lit, spotlight shines on the comedian)\n\nComedian: "Hey everyone! How\'s it going? Great to be here tonight! You know, I love this city. I mean, have you seen the traffic? It\'s like the entire city is trying to get to the same place at the same time. I\'m like, \'Guys, we\'re all going to be late, can we just take a deep breath and enjoy the ride?\' (pauses for laughter)\n\nAnd have you noticed how everyone\'s a foodie now? \'Oh, I\'m a foodie.\' No, you\'re not a foodie, you just like eating. I\'m a foodie, I can eat a whole pizza by myself. That\'s a foodie. (laughs)\n\nAnd don\'t even get me started on dating apps. \'What are you looking for in a partner?\' Um, someone who doesn\'t ghost me after one date? That\'s not too much to ask, is it? (laughs)\n\nBut you know what\'s weird? We\'re all so busy trying to find love, we forget to love ourselves. I mean, I\'m 30, I\'m single, and I\'m starting to think I\'m just a cat lady in training. I mean, I already have a cat, I just need a few more cats and a rocking chair... (laughs)\n\nAnd have you seen those \'influencers\' on Instagram? \'I\'m living my best life.\' No, you\'re not living your best life, you\'re just taking a really good selfie. (laughs)\n\nBut in all seriousness, I love being an adult. I mean, who needs responsibility when you can just pretend to be a functioning member of society? (laughs) I\'m like, \'I\'m a grown-up, I can do this!\' And then I trip on my own feet and spill coffee all over my shirt. (laughs)\n\nWell, that\'s my time. Thanks for laughing with me, folks! Goodnight!"\n\n(stage goes dark, applause)', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 5429, 369, 264, 220, 18, 24401, 2559, 5352, 23160, 1180, 1473, 72530, 374, 5213, 398, 13318, 11, 37973, 65880, 389, 279, 51912, 696, 1110, 29667, 25, 330, 19182, 5127, 0, 2650, 596, 433, 2133, 30, 8681, 311, 387, 1618, 18396, 0, 1472, 1440, 11, 358, 3021, 420, 3363, 13, 358, 3152, 11, 617, 499, 3970, 279, 9629, 30, 1102, 596, 1093, 279, 4553, 3363, 374, 4560, 311, 636, 311, 279, 1890, 2035, 520, 279, 1890, 892, 13, 358, 2846, 1093, 11, 364, 17198, 1065, 11, 584, 2351, 682, 2133, 311, 387, 3389, 11, 649, 584, 1120, 1935, 264, 5655, 11745, 323, 4774, 279, 12141, 20837, 320, 6733, 4881, 369, 43214, 696, 3112, 617, 499, 14000, 1268, 5127, 596, 264, 3691, 648, 1457, 30, 364, 12174, 11, 358, 2846, 264, 3691, 648, 3238, 2360, 11, 499, 2351, 539, 264, 3691, 648, 11, 499, 1120, 1093, 12459, 13, 358, 2846, 264, 3691, 648, 11, 358, 649, 8343, 264, 4459, 23317, 555, 7182, 13, 3011, 596, 264, 3691, 648, 13, 320, 73556, 696, 3112, 1541, 956, 1524, 636, 757, 3940, 389, 5029, 10721, 13, 364, 3923, 527, 499, 3411, 369, 304, 264, 8427, 20837, 24218, 11, 4423, 889, 3250, 956, 20457, 757, 1306, 832, 2457, 30, 3011, 596, 539, 2288, 1790, 311, 2610, 11, 374, 433, 30, 320, 73556, 696, 4071, 499, 1440, 1148, 596, 16682, 30, 1226, 2351, 682, 779, 13326, 4560, 311, 1505, 3021, 11, 584, 10894, 311, 3021, 13520, 13, 358, 3152, 11, 358, 2846, 220, 966, 11, 358, 2846, 3254, 11, 323, 358, 2846, 6041, 311, 1781, 358, 2846, 1120, 264, 8415, 17240, 304, 4967, 13, 358, 3152, 11, 