a card with the same letter (A-D).\n\t* Symbol: Playing a card with the same symbol (!, @, #, or $).\n\t* Color: Playing a card with the same color (Red, Blue, Green, or Yellow).\n\t* Action: Playing a card with the same action (Swap, Reverse, Skip, or Draw).\n6. If a player has no cards that match the top card of the discard pile, they must draw a card from the draw pile.\n7. If a player draws a card that matches the top card of the discard pile, they can immediately play it.\n8. If a player has only one card left in their hand, they must say "Card Chain Reaction" to alert their opponent. If they fail to do so and their opponent notices that they have only one card left, they can take another turn.\n9. The game continues until one player has played all their cards. That player is the winner.\n\n**Special Cards:**\n\n* "Swap": Swap the top card of the discard pile with the top card of', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1403, 43467, 1847, 430, 649, 387, 6476, 449, 264, 743, 315, 220, 508, 7563, 1473, 334, 4973, 4076, 25, 6938, 29625, 67941, 57277, 334, 2903, 315, 25640, 68063, 220, 17, 271, 334, 40468, 68063, 362, 5410, 9722, 315, 220, 508, 7563, 11, 449, 279, 2768, 8141, 1473, 9, 220, 19, 7563, 449, 279, 5219, 220, 16, 12, 19, 320, 19, 7563, 1855, 340, 9, 220, 19, 7563, 449, 279, 12197, 362, 9607, 320, 19, 7563, 1855, 340, 9, 220, 19, 7563, 449, 279, 18210, 758, 11, 571, 11, 674, 11, 323, 400, 320, 19, 7563, 1855, 340, 9, 220, 19, 7563, 449, 279, 8146, 3816, 11, 8868, 11, 7997, 11, 323, 26541, 320, 19, 7563, 1855, 340, 9, 220, 19, 7563, 449, 279, 4339, 330, 47279, 498, 330, 46795, 498, 330, 36234, 498, 323, 330, 8300, 1, 320, 19, 7563, 1855, 696, 334, 79406, 68063, 578, 16945, 315, 279, 1847, 374, 311, 1893, 264, 8957, 13010, 315, 12864, 7563, 555, 5737, 7563, 304, 264, 3230, 2015, 382, 334, 4438, 311, 7199, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 90025, 279, 9722, 323, 3568, 220, 605, 7563, 311, 1855, 2851, 627, 17, 13, 578, 9861, 220, 17, 7563, 527, 9277, 3663, 1523, 304, 264, 4128, 27402, 