Output~2025-04-06 23:53:55.919068: [RequestOutput(request_id=418, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Identify five tips to improve computer security. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 65647, 4330, 10631, 311, 7417, 6500, 4868, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are five tips to improve computer security:\n\n**Tip 1: Keep Your Operating System and Software Up-to-Date**\n\nRegularly update your operating system, browser, and other software to ensure you have the latest security patches and features. This will help protect your computer from known vulnerabilities and prevent hackers from exploiting them.\n\n**Tip 2: Use Strong and Unique Passwords**\n\nUse strong and unique passwords for all accounts, and consider using a password manager to generate and store complex passwords. Avoid using easily guessable information such as your name, birthdate, or common words.\n\n**Tip 3: Use Antivirus Software and a Firewall**\n\nInstall and regularly update antivirus software to protect against malware and other types of malicious software. Also, enable the firewall on your computer to block unauthorized access to your system.\n\n**Tip 4: Be Cautious with Email and Online Transactions**\n\nBe cautious when opening attachments or clicking on links from unknown sources, as they may contain malware or phishing scams. Also, be careful when making online transactions, such as shopping or banking, and ensure the website is secure (look for "https" and a lock icon in the address bar).\n\n**Tip 5: Use Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)**\n\nEnable two-factor authentication (2FA) whenever possible, which requires both a password and a second form of verification (such as a code sent to your phone or a biometric scan) to access an account. This adds an extra layer of security to prevent unauthorized access to your accounts.\n\nBy following these tips, you can significantly improve the security of your computer and protect your personal and sensitive information.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 10631, 311, 7417, 6500, 4868, 1473, 334, 16394, 220, 16, 25, 13969, 4718, 36233, 744, 323, 4476, 3216, 4791, 12, 1956, 57277, 31504, 398, 2713, 701, 10565, 1887, 11, 7074, 11, 323, 1023, 3241, 311, 6106, 499, 617, 279, 5652, 4868, 29760, 323, 4519, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 6144, 701, 6500, 505, 3967, 52227, 323, 5471, 41467, 505, 71701, 1124, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 17, 25, 5560, 27191, 323, 29750, 12642, 82, 57277, 10464, 3831, 323, 5016, 34816, 369, 682, 9815, 11, 323, 2980, 1701, 264, 3636, 6783, 311, 7068, 323, 3637, 6485, 34816, 13, 35106, 1701, 6847, 8101, 481, 2038, 1778, 439, 701, 836, 11, 7342, 1045, 11, 477, 4279, 4339, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 18, 25, 5560, 6898, 59013, 4476, 323, 264, 97331, 57277, 25718, 323, 15870, 2713, 80649, 3241, 311, 6144, 2403, 40831, 323, 1023, 4595, 315, 39270, 3241, 13, 7429, 11, 7431, 279, 50977, 389, 701, 6500, 311, 2565, 45571, 2680, 311, 701, 1887, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 19, 25, 2893, 356, 2784, 1245, 449, 8463, 323, 8267, 56385, 57277, 3513, 46878, 994, 8736, 34779, 477, 18965, 389, 7902, 505, 9987, 8336, 11, 439, 814, 1253, 6782, 40831, 477, 99197, 64155, 13, 7429, 11, 387, 16994, 994, 3339, 2930, 14463, 11, 1778, 439, 12185, 477, 23641, 11, 323, 6106, 279, 3997, 374, 9966, 320, 7349, 369, 330, 2485, 1, 323, 264, 5409, 4706, 304, 279, 2686, 3703, 3677, 334, 16394, 220, 20, 25, 5560, 9220, 7424, 5739, 24446, 320, 17, 3711, 33395, 271, 11331, 1403, 75197, 17066, 320, 17, 3711, 8, 15716, 3284, 11, 902, 761