ten used in design and art to draw attention, stimulate creativity, and evoke a sense of excitement.\n\nWhen combined, Blue and Yellow can create a beautiful contrast that represents balance and harmony. The calming effects of blue can balance out the energetic and stimulating effects of yellow, creating a sense of equilibrium and stability. This color combination can be used in design to create a sense of balance and harmony, or to evoke a sense of optimism and positivity.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 2294, 3465, 2268, 29815, 389, 279, 1988, 8146, 11, 8868, 323, 26541, 11, 358, 4265, 1093, 311, 10552, 1148, 21958, 814, 95263, 1473, 334, 10544, 96618, 8868, 374, 3629, 5938, 449, 16024, 315, 19858, 2136, 11, 1446, 56685, 11, 323, 41664, 1429, 13, 1102, 596, 264, 65464, 1933, 430, 649, 95263, 264, 5647, 315, 43685, 323, 26733, 2136, 13, 763, 1690, 27833, 11, 6437, 374, 1101, 10815, 311, 7095, 11, 32883, 11, 323, 24278, 13, 38891, 264, 2867, 6437, 13180, 389, 264, 40798, 1938, 11, 477, 264, 2103, 18435, 389, 264, 8369, 7474, 13658, 482, 1521, 54077, 649, 22571, 7710, 603, 311, 264, 1614, 315, 19858, 323, 43685, 13, 8868, 374, 1101, 3629, 1511, 304, 2955, 323, 1989, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 20334, 323, 66429, 382, 334, 48799, 96618, 26541, 11, 389, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 374, 264, 34076, 323, 45955, 1933, 430, 649, 95263, 16024, 315, 23871, 11, 54508, 11, 323, 41463, 13, 1102, 596, 3629, 5938, 449, 52495, 11, 52495, 11, 323, 52495, 0, 26541, 649, 1101, 4097, 28697, 11, 3987, 11, 323, 36232, 13, 38891, 264, 10107, 14071, 7160, 39853, 477, 264, 18803, 315, 52495, 15061, 1555, 279, 30614, 482, 1521, 54077, 649, 22571, 12157, 1057, 20247, 323, 4602, 553, 603, 13, 26541, 374, 1101, 3629, 1511, 304, 2955, 323, 1989, 311, 4128, 6666, 11, 51077, 28697, 11, 323, 95263, 264, 5647, 315, 28361, 382, 4599, 11093, 11, 8868, 323, 26541, 649, 1893, 264, 6366, 13168, 430, 11105, 8335, 323, 26348, 13, 578, 78729, 6372, 315, 6437, 649, 8335, 704, 279, 45955, 323, 65792, 6372, 315, 14071, 11, 6