*Other**\n\n* Relativistic Mass = γ \\* m\n* Relativistic Energy = γ \\* m c^2\n* Lorentz Transformation: x' = γ (x - vt)\n\nRemember to review your notes and textbook for more detailed explanations and examples. Good luck on your test!", token_ids=[40, 4265, 387, 6380, 311, 1520, 499, 449, 264, 4062, 22027, 41868, 11071, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 64694, 12399, 315, 1401, 19476, 323, 55179, 311, 1520, 499, 10772, 369, 701, 1296, 1473, 334, 27411, 323, 1221, 29390, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 296, 284, 220, 1041, 10166, 284, 220, 1041, 15, 9653, 198, 9, 220, 16, 21647, 284, 220, 1041, 15, 342, 198, 9, 220, 16, 452, 284, 220, 16, 21647, 296, 2754, 61, 17, 198, 9, 220, 16, 622, 284, 220, 16, 452, 296, 198, 9, 220, 16, 468, 284, 220, 16, 622, 2754, 198, 9, 220, 16, 37192, 284, 220, 16, 274, 50409, 16, 271, 334, 41438, 57277, 9, 32235, 284, 4185, 16491, 284, 82263, 87, 284, 865, 766, 482, 865, 5431, 198, 9, 55534, 284, 82263, 87, 611, 82263, 83, 284, 348, 284, 14142, 3529, 83, 198, 9, 48005, 367, 284, 82263, 85, 611, 82263, 83, 284, 264, 284, 33876, 3529, 83, 198, 9, 348, 61, 17, 284, 577, 61, 17, 489, 220, 17, 300, 198, 9, 348, 284, 577, 489, 520, 271, 334, 19085, 323, 21324, 596, 42089, 57277, 9, 435, 284, 7643, 320, 19085, 284, 3148, 865, 31903, 340, 9, 435, 284, 597, 87, 320, 39, 86558, 596, 7658, 369, 42242, 340, 9, 435, 1928, 284, 480, 1144, 9, 320, 76, 16, 1144, 9, 296, 17, 8, 611, 436, 61, 17, 320, 6600, 44210, 1697, 5457, 340, 9, 435, 1635, 284, 597, 1144, 9, 320, 87, 482, 865, 2253, 8, 320, 12484, 5457, 696, 334, 33775, 323, 5664, 57277, 9, 31991, 5411, 12634, 284, 220, 16, 14, 17, 24039, 61, 17, 198, 9, 55057, 12634, 284, 296, 876, 198, 9, 5664, 284, 435, 1144, 9, 294, 198, 9, 7572, 284, 468, 611, 259, 271, 334, 44, 59411, 57277, 9, 281, 284, 24039, 198, 9, 281, 284, 435, 1144, 9, 259, 320, 26282, 17660, 340, 9, 45435, 315, 96210, 25, 281, 5431, 284, 281, 766, 271, 334, 38036, 1697, 27660, 57277, 9, 29678, 4185, 16491, 284, 101174, 284, 82263, 89638, 198, 9, 29678, 55534, 284