Output~2025-04-06 23:56:52.100822: [RequestOutput(request_id=496, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Provide two examples of how artificial intelligence is used in our daily lives. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 40665, 1403, 10507, 315, 1268, 21075, 11478, 374, 1511, 304, 1057, 7446, 6439, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are two examples of how artificial intelligence (AI) is used in our daily lives:\n\n**Example 1: Virtual Assistants**\n\nArtificial intelligence is used in virtual assistants like Amazon\'s Alexa, Google Assistant, and Apple\'s Siri. These virtual assistants use natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning algorithms to understand voice commands and perform tasks such as:\n\n* Setting reminders and alarms\n* Playing music and videos\n* Controlling smart home devices\n* Providing information on weather, news, and sports\n* Making phone calls and sending messages\n\nFor example, you can ask Alexa to "play my favorite song" and it will play the song from your music library. You can also ask Siri to "set a reminder for 2 PM" and it will remind you at the specified time.\n\n**Example 2: Image Recognition**\n\nArtificial intelligence is also used in image recognition technology, which is used in various applications such as:\n\n* Facial recognition software used in security cameras and smartphones to identify individuals\n* Image search engines like Google Images, which use AI to recognize and categorize images\n* Self-driving cars, which use computer vision to recognize and respond to road signs, pedestrians, and other vehicles\n\nFor example, when you upload a photo to Facebook, the platform uses AI to recognize the people in the photo and suggest tags. Similarly, when you use a smartphone app like Google Lens, it uses AI to recognize objects, animals, and text in images and provide information about them.\n\nThese are just a couple of examples of how artificial intelligence is used in our daily lives. AI is becoming increasingly pervasive and is being used in many other areas, such as healthcare, finance, and education.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 1403, 10507, 315, 1268, 21075, 11478, 320, 15836, 8, 374, 1511, 304, 1057, 7446, 6439, 1473, 334, 13617, 220, 16, 25, 21382, 54349, 1821, 57277, 9470, 16895, 11478, 374, 1511, 304, 4200, 57619, 1093, 8339, 596, 50712, 11, 5195, 22103, 11, 323, 8325, 596, 76074, 13, 4314, 4200, 57619, 1005, 5933, 4221, 8863, 320, 45, 12852, 8, 323, 5780, 6975, 26249, 311, 3619, 7899, 11545, 323, 2804, 9256, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 20638, 66697, 323, 63411, 198, 9, 40551, 4731, 323, 6946, 198, 9, 2140, 16608, 7941, 2162, 7766, 198, 9, 81200, 2038, 389, 9282, 11, 3754, 11, 323, 10034, 198, 9, 25274, 4641, 6880, 323, 11889, 6743, 271, 2520, 3187, 11, 499, 649, 2610, 50712, 311, 330, 1387, 856, 7075, 5609, 1, 323, 433, 690, 1514, 279, 5609, 505, 701, 4731, 6875, 13, 1472, 649, 1101, 2610, 76074, 311, 330, 751, 264, 27626, 369, 220, 17, 5975, 1, 323, 433, 690, 24928, 499, 520, 279, 5300, 892, 382, 334, 13617, 220, 17, 25, 4758, 48698, 57277, 9470, 16895, 11478, 374, 1101, 1511, 304, 2217, 18324, 5557, 11, 902, 374, 1511, 304, 5370, 8522, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 75622, 18324, 3241, 1511, 304, 4868, 18632, 323, 36122, 311, 10765, 7931, 198, 9, 4758, 2778, 21787, 1093, 5195, 12041, 11, 902, 1005, 15592, 311, 15641, 323, 22824, 553, 5448, 198, 9, 10323, 60811, 9515, 11, 902, 1005, 6500, 11376, 311, 15641, 323, 6013, 311, 5754, 12195, 11, 62558, 11, 323, 1023, 11731,