Output~2025-04-06 23:59:02.543202: [RequestOutput(request_id=542, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a resume highlighting your strengths in communication and problem-solving. ### Input: Name: John Doe\\nPhone: (123) 456-7890\\nEmail: jdoe@email.com\\nCurrent role: Software Developer at Ocean Solutions ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 16063, 39686, 701, 36486, 304, 10758, 323, 3575, 99246, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 4076, 25, 3842, 50728, 1734, 7084, 25, 320, 4513, 8, 220, 10961, 12, 16474, 15, 1734, 4886, 25, 503, 3055, 68, 72876, 916, 1734, 5520, 3560, 25, 4476, 25922, 520, 22302, 23508, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a sample resume highlighting John Doe\'s strengths in communication and problem-solving:\n\n**John Doe**\n**Contact Information:**\n\n* Phone: (123) 456-7890\n* Email: [jdoe@email.com](mailto:jdoe@email.com)\n\n**Summary:**\nResults-driven Software Developer with 5+ years of experience in developing innovative solutions and communicating complex technical information to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Proven track record of successfully resolving technical issues and collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality products.\n\n**Professional Experience:**\n\n**Software Developer, Ocean Solutions (2018-Present)**\n\n* Designed and developed multiple software applications using Java, Python, and C++\n* Collaborated with project managers, designers, and quality assurance testers to ensure timely and effective delivery of projects\n* Resolved complex technical issues and bugs, resulting in a 25% reduction in project delays\n* Developed and maintained technical documentation, including user manuals and technical guides\n* Communicated technical information to non-technical stakeholders, including project managers and clients, to ensure effective project execution\n\n**Education:**\n\n* Bachelor\'s Degree in Computer Science, XYZ University (2015-2018)\n\n**Skills:**\n\n* Programming languages: Java, Python, C++, JavaScript\n* Development frameworks: Spring, Django, React\n* Agile methodologies: Scrum, Kanban\n* Strong communication and problem-solving skills\n* Excellent written and verbal communication skills\n* Ability to work effectively in a team environment\n\n**Achievements:**\n\n* Successfully led a team of developers to deliver a high-priority project 2 weeks ahead of schedule\n* Developed a technical training program for new hires, resulting in a 30% reduction in onboarding time\n* Received the "Best Team Player" award at Ocean Solutions for outstanding collaboration and communication skills\n\nI hope this sample resume meets your requirements! Let me know if you need any further assistance.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6205, 16063, 39686, 3842, 50728, 596, 36486, 304, 10758, 323, 3575, 99246, 1473, 334, 13379, 50728, 1035, 334, 8906, 8245, 25, 57277, 9, 14642, 25, 320, 4513, 8, 220, 10961, 12, 16474, 15, 198, 9, 8463, 25, 510, 73, 3055, 68, 72876, 916, 9725, 39626, 58658, 3055, 68, 72876, 916, 696, 334, 19791, 25, 1035, 10001, 32505, 4476, 25922, 449, 220, 20, 10, 1667, 315, 3217, 304, 11469, 18699, 10105, 323, 42247, 6485, 11156, 2038, 311, 2225, 11156, 323, 2536, 12, 73237, 39210, 13, 1322, 1055, 3839, 3335, 315, 7946, 53583, 11156, 4819, 323, 73301, 449, 5425, 99616, 7411, 311, 6493, 1579, 22867, 3956, 382, 334, 58613, 21460, 25