nk is going to make it to the finals?\n\n**Alex:** Ah, that's a great question! I think the Lakers have a good shot, but I'm also keeping an eye on the Bucks. Giannis is a beast on the court. What about you, do you have a favorite NBA team?\n\n**Samantha:** Yeah, I'm a big fan of the Warriors! I love watching Steph Curry play. But I have to say, I'm also really excited for the World Cup this summer. Who do you think is going to win it all?\n\n**Alex:** Oh, that's a great question! I think France has a good shot, but I'm also keeping an eye on Brazil. They always seem to bring their A-game to the World Cup. What about you, do you have a favorite World Cup team?\n\n**Samantha:** Yeah, I'm a big fan of the US Women's National Team! I love watching them play. But I have to say, I'm also really excited for the Olympics this summer. Who do you", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 10652, 922, 10034, 1990, 1403, 4885, 1473, 334, 50, 13005, 23218, 68063, 28653, 11, 8683, 0, 2650, 596, 433, 2133, 30, 14910, 499, 2339, 279, 1847, 1566, 3814, 1980, 334, 28487, 68063, 22335, 11, 358, 1550, 0, 578, 47596, 1051, 389, 4027, 0, 58335, 574, 93764, 13, 3639, 922, 499, 11, 1550, 499, 3821, 279, 1847, 1980, 334, 50, 13005, 23218, 68063, 22335, 11, 358, 1550, 0, 358, 574, 389, 279, 6964, 315, 856, 10954, 279, 4459, 892, 13, 358, 3021, 10307, 58335, 1514, 13, 2030, 358, 617, 311, 2019, 11, 358, 2846, 810, 315, 264, 22963, 8571, 7182, 13, 2650, 922, 499, 11, 656, 499, 1833, 904, 22963, 7411, 1980, 334, 28487, 68063, 34863, 11, 358, 2846, 264, 6908, 8571, 315, 19922, 3723, 0, 358, 3077, 1027, 2768, 1124, 2533, 358, 574, 264, 10585, 13, 2650, 922, 499, 11, 656, 499, 617, 264, 7075, 2128, 1980, 334, 50, 13005, 23218, 68063, 16770, 11, 6555, 0, 358, 2846, 810, 315, 264, 28035, 8571, 7182, 13, 358, 3021, 71105, 596, 5737, 1742, 13, 2030, 358, 617, 311, 2019, 11, 358, 2846, 2216, 12304, 369, 279, 14827, 12873, 3280, 13, 10699, 656, 499, 1781, 374, 2133, 311, 3243, 279, 7445, 20904, 420, 1060, 1980, 334,