5**: Einstein develops his theory of general relativity.\n\n**1919**: Einstein's theory of general relativity is confirmed by observations of a solar eclipse.\n\n**1932**: Einstein is awarded the Nobel Prize in Physics for his explanation of the photoelectric effect.\n\n**1933**: Einstein immigrates to the United States and becomes a professor at Princeton University.\n\n**1955**: Einstein becomes an American citizen.\n\n**1955**: Einstein dies on April 18th in Princeton, New Jersey, USA.\n\nI hope this timeline helps! Let me know if you have any further requests.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 25845, 315, 17971, 55152, 596, 2324, 69376, 1473, 334, 9674, 24, 96618, 17971, 55152, 374, 9405, 389, 5587, 220, 975, 339, 304, 16991, 76, 11, 15422, 315, 468, 2448, 3423, 880, 7881, 11, 6063, 21080, 320, 3409, 961, 315, 10057, 8, 311, 32565, 1036, 323, 7043, 483, 55152, 382, 334, 9367, 19, 96618, 55152, 596, 3070, 11031, 311, 47304, 11, 78080, 10649, 11, 6063, 21080, 320, 3409, 961, 315, 10057, 3677, 334, 9378, 19, 96618, 55152, 12302, 24096, 279, 445, 3159, 79, 820, 46631, 46523, 2411, 304, 47304, 382, 334, 9378, 20, 96618, 55152, 596, 3070, 11031, 311, 30221, 11, 1405, 568, 75112, 279, 30791, 12411, 19294, 26522, 292, 3907, 320, 3409, 38842, 72826, 3677, 334, 7028, 15, 96618, 55152, 38581, 505, 279, 30791, 12411, 19294, 26522, 292, 3907, 449, 264, 8547, 304, 22027, 382, 334, 7028, 17, 96618, 55152, 9221, 264, 25589, 45357, 304, 14502, 11, 30221, 382, 334, 7028, 20, 96618, 55152, 596, 3008, 355, 8822, 13052, 285, 320, 20531, 8061, 1060, 1680, 568, 65585, 3116, 64955, 16064, 304, 279, 8486, 9489, 36749, 2761, 13101, 1609, 11, 2737, 813, 10334, 315, 3361, 1375, 44515, 323, 279, 11495, 24524, 469, 28, 13183, 30556, 382, 334, 7529, 16, 96618, 55152, 9221, 264, 72235, 520, 279, 3907, 315, 14502, 382, 334, 7529, 19, 96618, 55152, 9221, 264, 14561, 520, 279, 3907, 315, 72826, 382, 334, 7529, 20, 96618, 55152, 39671, 813, 10334, 315, 4689, 1375, 44515, 382, 334, 7529, 24, 96618, 5515