Output~2025-04-07 00:02:14.834938: [RequestOutput(request_id=602, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest an item of clothing that would combine style, comfort and practicality. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 459, 1537, 315, 17895, 430, 1053, 16343, 1742, 11, 6981, 323, 15325, 488, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='I would suggest a pair of high-waisted, dark-washed jeans. They combine style, comfort, and practicality in the following ways:\n\n* Style: Dark-washed jeans are a timeless and versatile choice that can be dressed up or down, making them suitable for a variety of occasions. They can be paired with a crisp white shirt and blazer for a formal look or with a graphic tee and sneakers for a casual one.\n* Comfort: High-waisted jeans are designed to sit higher on the waist, which can provide additional support and comfort for the midsection. They also tend to be more forgiving and can be worn with a variety of tops and shoes without feeling constricting.\n* Practicality: Dark-washed jeans are easy to care for and can be dressed up or down, making them a practical choice for everyday wear. They can also be easily paired with a variety of shoes, from sneakers to boots, and can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion.', token_ids=[40, 1053, 4284, 264, 6857, 315, 1579, 2695, 64, 13539, 11, 6453, 2695, 13883, 34389, 13, 2435, 16343, 1742, 11, 6981, 11, 323, 15325, 488, 304, 279, 2768, 5627, 1473, 9, 12179, 25, 12538, 2