Output~2025-04-07 00:02:30.196829: [RequestOutput(request_id=606, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest a 5-minute team-building activity. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 264, 220, 20, 24401, 2128, 52499, 5820, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here\'s a 5-minute team-building activity that you can try:\n\n**Activity: "Human Bingo"**\n\n**Objective:** To encourage team members to get to know each other better and build connections.\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1. Create bingo cards with different traits, characteristics, or interests in each square (e.g. "has traveled to another country", "speaks more than one language", "has a pet", etc.).\n2. Distribute the bingo cards to each team member.\n3. Set a timer for 5 minutes.\n4. Instruct each team member to mingle and ask their colleagues questions to find someone who fits each of the characteristics in the squares.\n5. When a team member finds someone who fits a characteristic, they get that person to sign the corresponding square.\n6. The goal is to fill out as many squares as possible within the 5-minute time frame.\n7. When the timer goes off, ask each team member to share one or two interesting things they learned about their colleagues during the activity.\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n* Encourages team members to interact with each other and build connections\n* Fosters a sense of community and camaraderie\n* Helps to break the ice and reduce anxiety in new team members\n* Can be adapted to fit the team\'s interests and preferences\n\n**Variations:**\n\n* You can customize the bingo cards to fit your team\'s specific goals or values.\n* You can add a twist by giving a small prize or reward to the team member who fills out the most squares.\n* You can also use this activity as a warm-up for a larger team-building event or meeting.\n\nI hope this activity helps your team build stronger relationships and have some fun!', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 220, 20, 24401, 2128, 52499, 5820, 430, 499, 649, 1456, 1473, 334, 4142, 25, 330, 35075, 93148, 1, 57277, 334, 79406, 68063, 2057, 15253, 2128, 3697, 311, 636, 311, 1440, 1855, 1023, 2731, 323, 1977, 13537, 382, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 4324, 78124, 7563, 449, 2204, 25022, 11, 17910, 11, 477, 12034, 304, 1855, 9518, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 330, 4752, 31796, 311, 2500, 3224, 498, 330, 34474, 10011, 810, 1109, 832, 4221, 498, 330, 4752, 264, 6896, 498, 5099, 13, 4390, 17, 13, 54691, 1088, 279, 78124, 7563, 311, 1855, 2128, 4562, 627, 18, 13, 2638, 264, 9198, 369, 220, 20, 4520, 627, 19, 13, 763, 1257, 1855, 2128, 4562, 311, 91125, 323, 2610, 872, 18105, 4860, 311, 1505, 4423, 889, 18809, 1855, 315, 279, 17910, 304, 279, 32440, 627, 20, 13, 3277, 264, 2128, 4562, 14035, 4423, 889, 18809, 264, 29683, 11, 814, 636, 430, 1732, 311, 1879, 279, 12435, 9518, 627, 21, 13, 578, 5915, 374, 311, 5266, 704, 439, 1690, 32440, 439, 3284, 2949, 279, 220, 20, 24401, 892, 4124, 627, 22, 13, 3277, 279, 9198, 5900, 1022, 11, 2610, 1855, 2128, 4562, 311, 4430, 832, 477, 1403, 7185, 2574, 814, 9687, 922, 872, 18105, 2391, 279, 5820, 382, 334, 85423, 25, 57277, 9, 10984, 414, 1154, 2128, 3697, 311, 16681, 449, 1855, 1023, 323, 1977, 13537, 198, 9, 435, 537, 388, 264, 5647, 315, 4029, 323, 97686, 1013, 648, 198, 9, 89616, 311, 1464, 279, 10054, 323, 8108, 18547, 304, 502, 2128, 3697, 198, 9, 3053, 387, 30464, 311, 5052, 279, 2128, 596, 12034, 323, 19882, 271, 334, 57235, 811, 25, 57277, 9, 1472, 649, 32187, 279, 78124, 7563, 311, 