ica.\n\nThe song "We\'re gonna be here forever" would be a perfect fit for this genre, with its themes of eternal presence and longing. The lyrics would be delivered in a soaring, ethereal melody, with a haunting piano accompaniment and a subtle, pulsing electronic beat. The song would build towards a crescendo of swirling synths and distorted guitars, culminating in a sense of cathartic release and emotional resolution.\n\nEchochronica would be a genre that invites listeners to immerse themselves in its sonic landscapes, to lose themselves in the swirling mists of sound and emotion. It would be a genre that celebrates the beauty of the human experience, and the power of music to transcend time and space.', token_ids=[3923, 459, 41765, 10137, 2268, 29815, 389, 279, 24142, 330, 1687, 2351, 16926, 387, 1618, 16058, 1359, 358, 4265, 1093, 311, 30714, 264, 11775, 18273, 17779, 430, 33511, 5540, 315, 45475, 11, 35288, 17130, 3074, 449, 279, 26609, 9262, 11, 10382, 535, 29600, 315, 44578, 2269, 23427, 13, 6914, 596, 1650, 420, 17779, 330, 76094, 7562, 3074, 2266, 76094, 7562, 3074, 1053, 4668, 8063, 88, 11, 93378, 5222, 2445, 9521, 3549, 555, 6324, 287, 58367, 52389, 12509, 11, 62236, 60594, 11, 323, 77754, 26480, 18249, 552, 13, 578, 24108, 1053, 387, 6435, 1481, 54444, 11, 449, 264, 5357, 389, 45475, 30953, 323, 20247, 61556, 78133, 13, 578, 24142, 1053, 13488, 22100, 315, 65875, 11, 79422, 11, 323, 279, 3823, 3217, 11, 3629, 449, 264, 5647, 315, 892, 33028, 323, 64482, 382, 644, 38906, 7562, 3074, 11, 279, 47196, 1053, 387, 12886, 304, 264, 305, 53078, 11, 32487, 16630, 11, 449, 264, 5357, 389, 48929, 323, 76534, 24142, 13, 578, 5788, 1053, 387, 72770, 3686, 9257, 11, 449, 264, 25679, 389, 6968, 264, 5647, 315, 3634, 323, 8149, 13, 21834, 315, 264, 5425, 1990, 42660, 324, 432, 29832, 11, 13789, 358, 424, 11, 323, 386, 6069, 11, 449, 264, 24858, 315, 35288, 323, 37401, 412, 17130, 3074, 382, 791, 5609, 330, 1687, 2351, 16926, 387, 1618, 16058, 1, 1053, 387, 264, 4832, 5