Output~2025-04-07 00:06:12.920859: [RequestOutput(request_id=694, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Determine the complex number z satisfying the equation 2z-3z̅=-2-30i. Note that z̅ denotes the conjugate of z. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 31001, 279, 6485, 1396, 1167, 37154, 279, 24524, 220, 17, 89, 12, 18, 89, 136, 227, 11065, 17, 12, 966, 72, 13, 7181, 430, 1167, 136, 227, 72214, 279, 64380, 349, 315, 1167, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='To determine the complex number z satisfying the equation 2z - 3z̅ = -2 - 30i, we can start by rewriting the equation in the form:\n\n2z - 3z̅ = -2 - 30i\n\nSince z̅ denotes the conjugate of z, we can rewrite the equation as:\n\n2z - 3(z̅) = -2 - 30i\n\nNow, we can add 3z̅ to both sides of the equation to get:\n\n2z = -2 - 30i + 3z̅\n\nNext, we can subtract 2z from both sides of the equation to get:\n\n0 = -2 - 30i + 3z̅ - 2z\n\nNow, we can add 2z to both sides of the equation to get:\n\n2z = -2 - 30i + 3z̅\n\nNow, we can divide both sides of the equation by 2 to get:\n\nz = (-2 - 30i + 3z̅) / 2\n\nNow, we can simplify the right-hand side of the equation by combining like terms:\n\nz = (-2 - 30i + 3z̅) / 2\n\nSince z̅ denotes the conjugate of z, we can rewrite the equation as:\n\nz = (-2 - 30i + 3z) / 2\n\nNow, we can simplify the right-hand side of the equation by combining like terms:\n\nz = (-2 - 30i + 3z) / 2\n\nNow, we can solve for z by multiplying both sides of the equation by 2:\n\nz = -2 - 30i + 3z\n\nNow, we can subtract 3z from both sides of the equation to get:\n\nz = -2 - 30i\n\nTherefore, the complex number z satisfying the equation 2z - 3z̅ = -2 - 30i is z = -2 - 30i.', token_ids=[1271, 8417, 279, 6485, 1396, 1167, 37154, 279, 24524, 220, 17, 89, 482, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 11, 584, 649, 1212, 555, 95545, 279, 24524, 304, 279, 1376, 1473, 17, 89, 482, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 271, 12834, 1167, 136, 227, 72214, 279, 64380, 349, 315, 1167, 11, 584, 649, 18622, 279, 24524, 439, 1473, 17, 89, 482, 220, 18, 13476, 136, 227, 8, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 923, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 311, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 311, 636, 1473, 17, 89, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 271, 5971, 11, 584, 649, 33356, 220, 17, 89, 505, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 311, 636, 1473, 15, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 482, 220, 17, 89, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 923, 220, 17, 89, 311, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 311, 636, 1473, 17, 89, 284, 482, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 22497, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 555, 220, 17, 311, 636, 1473, 89, 284, 10505, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 8, 611, 220, 17, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 40821, 279, 1314, 25417, 3185, 315, 279, 24524, 555, 35271, 1093, 3878, 1473, 89, 284, 10505, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 136, 227, 8, 611, 220, 17, 271, 12834, 1167, 136, 227, 72214, 279, 64380, 349, 315, 1167, 11, 584, 649, 18622, 279, 24524, 439, 1473, 89, 284, 10505, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 8, 611, 220, 17, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 40821, 279, 1314, 25417, 3185, 315, 279, 24524, 555, 35271, 1093, 3878, 1473, 89, 284, 10505, 17, 482, 220, 966, 72, 489, 220, 18, 89, 8, 611, 220, 17, 271, 7184, 11, 584, 649, 11886, 369, 1167, 555, 85292, 2225, 11314, 315, 279, 24524, 555, 220, 17, 1473, 89, 284, 482