Output~2025-04-07 00:07:25.215343: [RequestOutput(request_id=724, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Develop a survey to survey the opinions of customers on a new product. ### Input: Product: Home security system ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 8000, 264, 10795, 311, 10795, 279, 18463, 315, 6444, 389, 264, 502, 2027, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 5761, 25, 5492, 4868, 1887, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a sample survey to gather opinions from customers on a new home security system:\n\n**Home Security System Survey**\n\n**Introduction:**\nThank you for considering our new home security system! We value your opinion and would like to hear your thoughts on our product. Your feedback will help us improve and refine our system to better meet your needs. Please take a few minutes to complete this survey.\n\n**Section 1: Overall Satisfaction**\n\n1. How satisfied are you with the overall performance of our home security system?\n\na) Very Satisfied\nb) Somewhat Satisfied\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat Dissatisfied\ne) Very Dissatisfied\n\n2. How likely are you to recommend our home security system to a friend or family member?\n\na) Very Likely\nb) Somewhat Likely\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat Unlikely\ne) Very Unlikely\n\n**Section 2: Ease of Use**\n\n1. How easy was it to install and set up the system?\n\na) Very Easy\nb) Somewhat Easy\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat Difficult\ne) Very Difficult\n\n2. How easy is it to use the system's features and controls?\n\na) Very Easy\nb) Somewhat Easy\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat Difficult\ne) Very Difficult\n\n**Section 3: Features and Functionality**\n\n1. Which of the following features do you find most useful?\n\na) Motion detection\nb) Door and window sensors\nc) Video monitoring\nd) Smart home integration\ne) Other (please specify)\n\n2. Are there any features you would like to see added to the system?\n\n(Open-ended text field for respondents to provide feedback)\n\n**Section 4: Customer Support**\n\n1. How would you rate the quality of customer support you received?\n\na) Excellent\nb) Good\nc) Fair\nd) Poor\ne) Very Poor\n\n2. How easy was it to get help when you needed it?\n\na) Very Easy\nb) Somewhat Easy\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat Difficult\ne) Very Difficult\n\n**Section 5: Additional Comments**\n\nIs there anything else you would like to share about your experience with our home security system?\n\n(Open-ended text field for respondents to provide feedback)\n\n**Thank You:**\nThank you for taking the time to provide your feedback! Your input is invaluable in helping us improve our product.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6205, 10795, 311, 9762, 18463, 505, 6444, 389, 264, 502, 2162, 4868, 1887, 1473, 334, 7778, 8398, 744, 24507, 57277, 334, 38255, 25, 1035, 13359, 499, 369, 13126, 1057, 502, 2162, 4868, 1887, 0, 1226, 907, 701, 9647, 323, 1053, 1093, 311, 6865, 701, 11555, 389, 1057, 2027, 13, 4718, 11302, 690, 1520, 603, 7417, 323, 46464, 1057, 1887, 311, 2731, 3449, 701, 3966, 13, 5321, 1935, 264, 2478, 4520, 311, 4686, 420, 10795, 382, 334, 9817, 220, 16, 25, 28993, 94957, 57277, 16, 13, 2650, 20097, 527, 499, 449, 279, 8244, 5178, 315, 1057, 2162, 4868, 1887, 1980, 64, 8, 15668, 328, 47365, 198, 65, 8, 18024, 81575, 328, 47365, 198, 66, 8, 59794, 198, 67, 8, 18024, 81575, 52132, 47365, 198, 68, 8, 15668, 52132, 47365, 271, 17, 13, 2650, 4461, 527, 499, 311, 7079, 1057, 2162, 