Output~2025-04-07 00:08:22.291731: [RequestOutput(request_id=745, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Research the history of the internet, and create an outline that summarizes the key moments. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 8483, 279, 3925, 315, 279, 7757, 11, 323, 1893, 459, 21782, 430, 94594, 279, 1401, 14269, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a summary of the history of the internet in outline form:\n\n**I. Early Development (1960s-1980s)**\n\n* 1969: The United States Department of Defense's Advanced Research Projects Agency (ARPA) funds the creation of the first network, ARPANET, which is designed to connect computers at different research institutions.\n* 1971: The first email is sent over ARPANET by Ray Tomlinson.\n* 1973: The first international network connection is established between the United States and the United Kingdom.\n* 1983: The Internet Protocol (IP) is developed, allowing different networks to communicate with each other.\n\n**II. Growth and Expansion (1980s-1990s)**\n\n* 1985: The Internet Relay Chat (IRC) is developed, allowing users to communicate in real-time.\n* 1989: The World Wide Web (WWW) is invented by Tim Berners-Lee, making it easy for users to access and share information using web browsers and hyperlinks.\n* 1990: The Internet is opened to commercial use, leading to the growth of the internet as a global network.\n* 1991: The first web browser, Mosaic, is released, making it easy for users to access the web.\n* 1993: The first graphical web browser, Netscape Navigator, is released.\n\n**III. Internet Goes Mainstream (1990s-2000s)**\n\n* 1995: The internet becomes widely available to the general public, with the number of internet users growing from 16 million to over 360 million.\n* 1998: Google is founded, becoming a dominant search engine.\n* 2000: The dot-com bubble bursts, leading to a decline in internet-related stocks and a re-evaluation of the internet's potential.\n* 2004: Facebook is founded, becoming a popular social networking site.\n\n**IV. Modern Internet (2000s-present)**\n\n* 2005: YouTube is founded, becoming a popular video-sharing platform.\n* 2007: The iPhone is released, popularizing mobile internet access.\n* 2010: The Arab Spring protests use social media to organize and spread information.\n* 2011: The internet becomes a global phenomenon, with over 2.5 billion users.\n* 2019: The internet is used by over 4.4 billion people worldwide.\n\nThis outline provides a brief overview of the key moments in the history of the internet, from", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 12399, 315, 279, 3925, 315, 279, 7757, 304, 21782, 1376, 1473, 334, 40, 13, 23591, 11050, 320, 5162, 15, 82, 12, 3753, 15, 82, 33395, 271, 9, 220, 5162, 24, 25, 578, 3723, 4273, 6011, 315, 16777, 596, 21844, 8483, 32323, 16784, 320, 946, 8201, 8, 10736, 279, 9886, 315, 279, 1176, 4009, 11, 92437, 1111, 1372, 11, 902, 374, 6319, 311, 4667, 19002, 520, 2204, 3495, 14673, 627, 9, 220, 4468, 16, 25, 578, 1176, 2613, 374, 3288, 927, 92437, 1111, 1372, 555, 13558, 8529, 3817, 942, 627, 9, 220, 4468, 18, 25, 578, 1176, 6625, 4009, 3717, 374, 9749, 1990, 279, 3723, 4273, 323, 279, 3723, 15422, 627, 9, 220, 3753, 18, 25, 578, 8191, 25590, 320, 3378, 8, 374, 8040, 11, 10923, 2204, 14488, 311, 19570, 449, 1855, 1023, 382, 334, 5660, 13, 34871, 323, 55654, 320, 3753, 15, 82, 12, 2550, 15, 82, 33395, 271, 9, 220, 3753, 20, 25, 578, 8191, 47272, 13149, 320, 52940, 8, 374, 8040, 11, 10923, 3932, 311, 19570, 304, 1972, 7394, 627, 9, 220, 3753, 24, 25, 578, 4435, 33845, 5000, 320, 46608, 8, 374, 36592, 555, 9538, 14502, 388, 8288, 2176, 11, 3339, 433, 4228, 369, 3932, 311, 2680, 323, 4430, 2038, 1701, 3566, 33957, 323, 17508, 16259, 627, 9, 220, 2550, 15, 25, 578, 8191, 374, 9107, 311, 8518, 1005, 11, 6522, 311, 279, 6650, 315, 279, 7757, 439, 264, 3728, 4009, 627, 9, 220, 2550, 16, 25, 578, 1176, 3566, 7074, 11, 386, 45883, 11, 374, 6004, 11, 3339, 433, 4228, 369, 3932, 311, 2680, 279, 3566, 627, 9, 220, 2550, 18, 25, 578, 1176, 54243, 3566, 7074, 11, 59487, 5443, 27640, 11, 374, 6004, 382, 334, 23440, 13, 8191, 61261, 4802, 4116, 320, 2550, 15, 82, 12, 1049, 15, 82, 33395, 271, 9, 220, 2550, 20, 25, 578, 7757, 9221, 13882, 2561, 311, 279, 4689, 586, 11, 449, 279, 1396, 315, 7757, 3932, 7982, 505, 220, 845, 3610, 311, 927, 220, 6843, 3610, 627, 9, 220, 2550, 23, 25, 5195, 374, 18538, 11, 10671, 264, 25462, 2778, 4817, 627, 9, 220, 1049, 15, 25, 578, 13046, 11733, 24529, 66801, 11, 6522, 311, 264, 18174, 304, 7757, 14228, 23301, 323, 264, 312, 5773, 24756, 315, 279, 7757, 596, 4754, 627, 9, 220, 1049, 19, 25, 5690, 374, 18538, 11, 10671, 264, 5526, 3674, 29130, 2816, 382, 334, 3166, 13, 18766, 8191, 320, 1049, 15, 82, 49124, 33395, 271, 9, 220, 1049, 20, 25, 13674, 374, 18538, 11, 10671, 264, 5526, 2835, 55856, 5452, 627, 9, 220, 1049, 22, 25, 578, 12443, 374, 6004, 11, 5526, 4954, 6505, 7757, 2680, 627, 9, 220, 679, 15, 25, 578, 10989, 12531, 22670, 1005, 3674, 3772, 311, 31335, 323, 9041, 2038, 627, 9, 220, 679, 16, 25, 578, 7757, 9221, 264, 3728, 25885, 11, 449, 927, 220, 17, 13, 20, 7239, 3932, 627, 9, 220, 679, 24, 25, 578, 7757, 374, 1511, 555, 927, 220, 19, 13, 19, 7239, 1274, 15603, 382, 2028, 21782, 5825, 264, 10015, 24131, 315, 279, 1401, 14269, 304, 279, 3925, 315, 279, 7757, 11, 505], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=length, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_mod