nings are expected to improve, supporting stock prices.\n\n**Medium-term (1-3 years):**\n\nIn the medium term, the stock market is likely to be influenced by:\n\n1. Global economic growth: As the global economy continues to recover, growth is expected to accelerate, driving stock prices higher.\n2. Interest rates: As interest rates rise, bond yields may increase, potentially impacting stock prices. However, if interest rates rise gradually, it may not have a significant impact on the stock market.\n3. Technological advancements: The continued adoption of technologies like artificial intelligence, cloud computing, and renewable energy may drive innovation and growth, leading to increased stock prices.\n\n**Long-term (3-5 years):**\n\nIn the long term, the stock market is likely to be influenced by:\n\n1. Demographic trends: The aging population and changing consumer behavior may lead to shifts in consumer spending patterns, influencing stock prices.\n2. Climate change and sustainability: As governments and companies focus on sustainability, investments in renewable energy, green technologies, and sustainable infrastructure may become more prominent, driving stock prices.\n3. Globalization and trade: The ongoing trade tensions and globalization may lead to changes in supply chains, trade agreements, and economic relationships, impacting stock prices.\n\n**Key takeaways:**\n\n1. The stock market is inherently unpredictable, and even the best predictions can be wrong.\n2. It's essential to diversify your portfolio and", token_ids=[40, 2846, 6380, 311, 3493, 264, 2077, 11, 719, 4587, 5296, 430, 52997, 279, 3938, 5216, 315, 279, 5708, 3157, 374, 264, 6485, 3465, 430, 18065, 5370, 9547, 11, 2737, 7100, 34824, 11, 3157, 18845, 11, 323, 3728, 4455, 13, 1102, 596, 7718, 311, 5603, 420, 3465, 449, 264, 82891, 323, 46878, 13356, 382, 4897, 1694, 1071, 11, 1618, 596, 264, 2077, 430, 5825, 264, 4689, 36721, 389, 279, 3938, 5216, 315, 279, 5708, 3157, 1473, 334, 12755, 9860, 320, 3684, 220, 21, 12, 717, 4038, 1680, 57277, 791, 2875, 9860, 5216, 315, 279, 5708, 3157, 374, 4461, 311, 387, 28160, 555, 279, 14529, 20562, 12, 777, 28522, 11, 3728, 7100, 13654, 11, 323, 8792, 14286, 6, 33384, 10396, 13, 1666, 279, 28522, 9731, 311, 38680, 11, 279, 3157, 1253, 3217, 53838, 11, 449, 4754, 33834, 323, 40291, 13, 4452, 11, 279, 8244, 9327, 374, 3685, 311, 387, 6928, 11, 16625, 555, 1473, 16, 13, 23362, 13654, 25, 1666, 47165, 9045, 3136, 323, 51235, 82, 14553, 11, 279, 3728, 8752, 374, 3685, 311, 11993, 11, 6522, 311, 7319, 11761, 10374, 323, 2626, 9341, 627, 17, 13, 10913, 14286, 6, 1862, 25, 10913, 14286, 527, 4461, 311, 10519, 14252, 1413, 33384, 10396, 11, 10494, 2802, 7969, 3428, 323, 8405, 53113, 311, 279, 3157, 627, 18, 13, 469, 15202, 6650, 25, 1666, 279, 8752, 1421, 9146, 11, 13166, 24608, 527, 3685, 311, 7417, 11, 12899, 5708, 7729, 382, 334, 42094, 9860, 320, 16, 12, 18, 1667, 1680, 57277, 644, 279, 11298, 4751, 11, 279, 5708, 3157, 374, 4461, 311, 387, 28160, 555, 1473, 16, 13, 8121, 7100, 6650, 25, 1666, 279, 3728, 8752, 9731, 311, 11993, 11, 6650, 374, 3685, 311, 43880, 11, 10043, 5708, 7729, 5190, 627, 17, 13, 25074, 7969, 25, 1666, 2802, 7969, 10205, 11, 11049, 36508, 1253, 5376, 11, 13893, 74055, 5708, 7729, 13, 4452, 11, 422, 2802, 7969, 10205, 27115, 11, 433, 1253, 539, 617, 264, 5199, 5536, 389, 279, 5708, 3157, 627, 18, 13, 7146, 5848, 83787, 25, 578, 8738, 25375, 315, 14645, 1093, 21075, 11478, 11, 9624, 25213, 11, 323, 33268, 4907, 1253, 6678, 19297, 323, 6650, 11, 6522, 311, 7319, 5708, 7729, 382, 334, 6720, 9860, 320, 18, 12, 20, 1667, 1680, 57277, 644, 279, 1317, 4751, 11, 279, 5708, 3157, 374, 4461, 311, 387, 28160, 555, 1473, 16, 13, 4829, 12968, 18845, 25, 578, 30084, 7187, 323, 10223, 11761, 7865, 1253, 3063, 311, 29735, 304, 11761, 10374, 12912, 11, 66700, 5708, 7729, 627, 17, 13, 31636, 2349, 323, 41329, 25, 1666, 17047, 323, 5220, 5357, 389, 41329, 11, 22538, 304, 33268, 4907, 11, 6307, 14645, 11, 323, 22556, 14054, 12