y and then told Wilbur that he knew just the rabbit for him. He led Wilbur to a cozy little burrow where a kind and gentle rabbit named Rosie was waiting. Wilbur and Rosie instantly clicked, bonding over their love of berries and long walks through the forest. From that day on, Wilbur and Rosie were inseparable, and Wilbur finally felt like he had found his true best friend.', token_ids=[2170, 10785, 11490, 82294, 1555, 279, 13952, 11, 568, 2322, 264, 24219, 2362, 53369, 7086, 473, 1944, 648, 889, 574, 824, 2454, 304, 264, 16615, 38971, 5021, 13, 473, 1944, 648, 4691, 10785, 11490, 1148, 568, 574, 15389, 369, 11, 323, 10785, 11490, 11497, 813, 12876, 311, 1505, 264, 1888, 4333, 13, 473, 1944, 648, 34793, 15884, 323, 1243, 3309, 10785, 11490, 430, 568, 7020, 1120, 279, 39824, 369, 1461, 13, 1283, 6197, 10785, 11490, 311, 264, 43535, 2697, 7951, 654, 1405, 264, 3169, 323, 22443, 39824, 7086, 97867, 574, 8748, 13, 10785, 11490, 323, 97867, 22571, 20505, 11, 64186, 927, 872, 3021, 315, 63494, 323, 1317, 23291, 1555, 279, 13952, 13, 5659, 430, 1938, 389, 11, 10785, 11490, 323, 97867, 1051, 54682, 50256, 11, 323, 10785, 11490, 5616, 6612, 1093, 568, 1047, 1766, 813, 837, 1888, 4333, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
