pt to changing market trends and capitalize on emerging opportunities.\n\n**Long-term (2026-2028):** As the global economy continues to evolve, I predict that Google will remain a key player in the tech industry, with a strong presence in emerging areas like quantum computing, autonomous vehicles, and healthcare. The company's stock price may increase by 30-40% over the next 2-3 years, driven by its ability to innovate and adapt to changing market conditions.\n\n**Final Prediction:** Based on these predictions, I estimate that the stock price of Google will increase by approximately 60-80% over the next five years, from around $2,500 per share to around $4,000 per share.\n\n**Important Caveat:** This prediction is based on general market trends and should not be considered as investment advice. It's essential to conduct thorough research and consult with a financial advisor before making any investment decisions.", token_ids=[334, 53380, 7181, 68063, 33810, 287, 5708, 7729, 374, 264, 6485, 3465, 430, 18065, 42118, 5370, 3157, 18845, 11, 7100, 34824, 11, 323, 2883, 19440, 9547, 13, 3092, 2077, 374, 3196, 389, 4689, 3157, 18845, 323, 17880, 2561, 828, 11, 719, 433, 1288, 539, 387, 6646, 439, 9341, 9650, 382, 334, 89379, 25, 57277, 29815, 389, 13970, 18845, 323, 1510, 3157, 4787, 11, 358, 7168, 430, 279, 5708, 3430, 315, 5195, 320, 2149, 18992, 4953, 2637, 16473, 63981, 25, 12890, 46, 3910, 8, 690, 4461, 5376, 927, 279, 1828, 4330, 1667, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 3284, 15398, 1473, 334, 12755, 9860, 320, 2366, 18, 12, 2366, 19, 1680, 334, 5195, 596, 5708, 3430, 1253, 3217, 24070, 6650, 11, 16625, 555, 279, 2883, 596, 8738, 44592, 304, 279, 7528, 13172, 3157, 11, 1202, 24050, 9546, 304, 24084, 14645, 1093, 9624, 25213, 11, 21075, 11478, 11, 323, 62542, 13, 358, 7168, 264, 220, 605, 12, 868, 4, 5376, 304, 279, 5708, 3430, 927, 279, 1828, 220, 717, 12, 972, 4038, 382, 334, 34748, 9860, 320, 2366, 19, 12, 2366, 21, 1680, 334, 1666, 5195, 9731, 311, 92064, 323, 9407, 1202, 2027, 