ntial threats.\n3. Receive alerts and notifications when something unusual occurs, such as a door or window opening, or motion detected.\n4. Be able to remotely monitor and control the security system using a mobile app.\n\n**Solution:** The Smiths decide to install a comprehensive home security system that includes:\n\n1. Door and window sensors: These sensors detect when doors and windows are opened or closed, and send alerts to the family\'s mobile devices.\n2. Motion detectors: These sensors detect movement within the home and send alerts when unusual activity is detected.\n3. Video cameras: The family installs cameras at the front door, back door, and living room to monitor the interior and exterior of the home.\n4. Smart doorbell: The smart doorbell with a camera allows the family to see and communicate with visitors at the door, even when they\'re not at home.\n5. Smart locks: The family installs smart locks that can be controlled remotely, allowing them to grant access to trusted individuals, such as babysitters or dog walkers.\n6. Mobile app: The family uses a mobile app to monitor the security system, receive alerts, and control the system remotely.\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n1. Increased peace of mind: The Smiths feel more secure knowing that their home is protected and monitored, even when they\'re away.\n2. Enhanced safety:', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3284, 1005, 1162, 369, 264, 2162, 4868, 1887, 1473, 334, 10464, 11799, 68063, 330, 34917, 5492, 8398, 744, 369, 264, 95809, 12517, 449, 13566, 15394, 323, 36986, 1875, 334, 8879, 68063, 578, 9259, 3070, 315, 3116, 320, 20375, 6699, 323, 1403, 2911, 11, 17051, 220, 21, 323, 220, 23, 8, 6439, 304, 264, 46318, 12818, 449, 264, 11298, 28935, 3838, 13, 11995, 6699, 990, 2539, 7394, 11, 323, 279, 2911, 9604, 2978, 13, 2435, 617, 264, 6896, 5679, 11, 7639, 11, 889, 374, 2744, 12304, 311, 41886, 1124, 994, 814, 2586, 2162, 13, 578, 3070, 2819, 872, 7296, 323, 4868, 3485, 682, 775, 11, 5423, 449, 3995, 2911, 323, 264, 68