of impulsive decisions can be devastating, and that the destructive nature of blind passion can lead to tragic outcomes.\n\nOverall, the theme of "Romeo and Juliet" is a powerful exploration of the human experience, highlighting the complexities and dangers of love, hate, and the human condition.', token_ids=[791, 7057, 315, 12656, 42482, 596, 1514, 11, 330, 49, 638, 78, 323, 72124, 498, 374, 279, 40652, 7138, 315, 18507, 11939, 323, 279, 33318, 16296, 315, 3242, 58921, 11429, 13, 578, 1514, 41424, 279, 35279, 24162, 315, 1403, 3995, 33218, 505, 1172, 51867, 8689, 11, 279, 9995, 13796, 323, 279, 8171, 1130, 2641, 11, 889, 4498, 17693, 304, 3021, 8994, 279, 4039, 22828, 1990, 872, 8689, 13, 578, 7057, 374, 31288, 2212, 279, 4623, 430, 279, 19428, 21958, 323, 32097, 315, 279, 1403, 33218, 13967, 3063, 311, 872, 88867, 11, 439, 814, 1304, 11709, 430, 527, 16625, 555, 11939, 4856, 1109, 2944, 382, 791, 1514, 22020, 279, 40652, 2410, 315, 3021, 323, 12491, 11, 439, 279, 1403, 8689, 6, 1317, 56703, 57810, 17482, 439, 264, 39577, 311, 279, 35279, 4455, 430, 28572, 13, 578, 7057, 374, 1101, 15499, 17791, 311, 279, 7434, 315, 25382, 11, 439, 279, 5885, 6, 11709, 323, 6299, 527, 3629, 16625, 555, 264, 5647, 315, 47176, 11, 6522, 311, 264, 35279, 17102, 382, 57417, 11, 279, 1514, 41424, 279, 4623, 315, 279, 14993, 1990, 25382, 323, 1949, 690, 11, 439, 279, 5885, 6, 11709, 323, 11429, 527, 28160, 555, 872, 21958, 11, 59529, 17078, 11, 323, 279, 13463, 2212, 1124, 13, 578, 7057, 13967, 13533, 430, 279, 16296, 315, 3242, 58921, 11429, 649, 387, 33318, 11, 323, 430, 279, 40652, 7138, 315, 18507, 11939, 649, 3063, 311, 35279, 20124, 382, 28589, 11, 279, 7057, 315, 330, 49, 638, 78, 323, 72124, 1, 374, 264, 8147, 27501, 315, 279, 3823, 3217, 11, 39686, 279, 84140, 323, 37064, 315, 3021, 11, 12491, 11, 323, 279, 3823, 3044, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=Non