Output~2025-04-07 00:13:37.458427: [RequestOutput(request_id=865, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a list of instructions for brewing coffee ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 1160, 315, 11470, 369, 50259, 11033, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a list of instructions for brewing coffee:\n\n**Step 1: Gather Equipment**\n\n* Coffee beans or ground coffee\n* Coffee filter or French press\n* Coffee maker (drip, French press, or pour-over)\n* Water\n* Measuring cups and spoons\n* Optional: sugar, creamer, or other desired additives\n\n**Step 2: Measure the Coffee**\n\n* Measure out the right amount of coffee for your brewing method. A general rule of thumb is 1 tablespoon of coffee for every 6 ounces of water.\n* If using whole beans, grind them to the desired coarseness for your brewing method.\n\n**Step 3: Heat the Water**\n\n* Heat water to the ideal temperature for brewing coffee, which is between 195°F and 205°F.\n* Use a kettle or the built-in heating element on your coffee maker to heat the water.\n\n**Step 4: Add Coffee to the Filter or French Press**\n\n* Place the coffee grounds in the filter or French press, depending on your brewing method.\n* Make sure the grounds are evenly distributed and not compacted.\n\n**Step 5: Add Water**\n\n* Pour the heated water over the coffee grounds in the filter or French press.\n* Make sure the water is at the correct temperature and flows evenly over the grounds.\n\n**Step 6: Steep the Coffee**\n\n* Allow the coffee to steep for the recommended amount of time, depending on your brewing method:\n\t+ Drip coffee: 5-7 minutes\n\t+ French press: 4-5 minutes\n\t+ Pour-over: 3-4 minutes\n* Stir the coffee occasionally to ensure even extraction.\n\n**Step 7: Strain and Serve**\n\n* Once the steeping time is complete, remove the filter or French press from the pot.\n* Pour the coffee into a cup and add any desired additives, such as sugar, creamer, or milk.\n* Enjoy your freshly brewed coffee!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 11470, 369, 50259, 11033, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 20849, 57277, 9, 27171, 27994, 477, 5015, 11033, 198, 9, 27171, 4141, 477, 8753, 3577, 198, 9, 27171, 25214, 320, 67, 4664, 11, 8753, 3577, 11, 477, 5019, 29352, 340, 9, 10164, 198, 9, 2206, 69774, 26446, 323, 20016, 2439, 198, 9, 12536, 25, 13465, 11, 12932, 261, 11, 477, 1023, 12974, 85286, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 35204, 279, 27171, 57277, 9, 35204, 704, 279, 1314, 3392, 315, 11033, 369, 701, 50259, 1749, 13, 362, 4689, 6037, 315, 25015, 374, 220, 16, 62611, 315, 11033, 369, 1475, 220, 21, 49138, 315, 3090, 627, 9, 1442, 1701, 4459, 27994, 11, 40336, 1124, 311, 279, 12974, 1080, 1590, 24639, 369, 701, 50259, 1749, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 27162, 279, 10164, 57277, 9, 27162, 3090, 311, 279, 10728, 9499, 369, 50259, 11033, 11, 902, 374, 1990, 220, 6280, 59572, 323, 220, 10866, 59572, 627, 9, 5560, 264, 73418, 477, 279, 5918, 3502, 24494, 2449, 389, 701, 11033, 25214, 311, 8798, 279, 3090, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 2758, 27171, 311, 279, 12619, 477, 8753, 8612, 57277, 9, 11004, 279, 11033, 21319, 304, 279, 4141, 477, 8753, 3577, 11, 11911, 389, 701, 50259, 1749, 627, 9, 7557, 2771, 279, 21319, 527, 42147, 4332, 323, 539, 17251, 291, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 2758, 10164, 57277, 9, 27058, 279, 32813, 3090, 927, 279, 11033, 21319, 304, 279, 4141, 477, 8753, 3577, 627, 9, 7557, 2771, 279, 3090, 374, 520, 279, 4495, 9499, 323, 28555, 42147, 927, 2