Output~2025-04-07 00:13:55.799836: [RequestOutput(request_id=870, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a storyboard depicting the following sequence of events. ### Input: A basketball coach motivating his players ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 43133, 60794, 279, 2768, 8668, 315, 4455, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 362, 19794, 7395, 89689, 813, 4311, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a possible storyboard depicting the sequence of events:\n\n**Panel 1:**\n\n* The coach, a determined-looking man with a whistle around his neck, stands in front of a whiteboard with a basketball court diagram drawn on it.\n* The players, a diverse group of young adults, sit on the floor, looking focused but slightly disinterested.\n* The coach holds a marker in his hand, ready to begin.\n\n**Panel 2:**\n\n* The coach starts writing on the whiteboard, using bold strokes to emphasize key points.\n* The players lean in, their eyes fixed on the board as the coach explains the game plan.\n* One player, a tall, lanky kid with a messy mop of hair, looks particularly engaged, nodding along as the coach speaks.\n\n**Panel 3:**\n\n* The coach points to a specific spot on the court, using his marker to draw a circle.\n* "This is where we need to focus our defense," he says, his voice rising with enthusiasm.\n* The players nod, their faces set with determination.\n\n**Panel 4:**\n\n* The coach moves to the center of the court, his eyes scanning the room as he speaks.\n* "We need to work together, communicate, and trust each other. We\'re a team, not individuals."\n* The players look up at him, their faces reflecting a sense of unity and purpose.\n\n**Panel 5:**\n\n* The coach holds up a basketball, his eyes shining with intensity.\n* "Let\'s show them what we\'re made of. Let\'s go out there and give it everything we\'ve got!"\n* The players jump to their feet, their faces set with determination, as the coach leads them out onto the court.\n\n**Panel 6:**\n\n* The camera zooms out to show the team in action, moving as one unit across the court.\n* The coach watches from the sidelines, his eyes fixed on the action, his face a picture of pride and encouragement.\n* The players are a blur of movement, their sweat-drenched faces set with determination as they work together to achieve their goal.\n\n**Panel 7:**\n\n* The final shot is of the coach, his arms raised in triumph as the team celebrates a hard-fought win.\n* The players surround him, grinning from ear to ear, their faces flushed with excitement and exhaustion.\n* The coach\'s eyes shine with pride and satisfaction, knowing that his team has given it their all.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 3284, 43133, 60794, 279, 8668, 315, 4455, 1473, 334, 4480, 220, 16, 25, 57277, 9, 578, 7395, 11, 264, 11075, 31348, 893, 449, 264, 40649, 2212, 813, 13272, 11, 13656, 304, 4156, 315, 264, 4251, 2541, 449, 264, 19794, 5590, 13861, 15107, 389, 433, 627, 9, 578, 4311, 11, 264, 17226, 1912, 315, 3995, 12884, 11, 2503, 389, 279, 6558, 11, 3411, 10968, 719, 10284, 834, 84798, 627, 9, 578, 7395, 10187, 264, 11381, 304, 813, 1450, 11, 5644, 311, 3240, 382, 334, 4480, 220, 17, 25, 57277, 9, 578, 7395, 8638, 4477, 389, 279, 4251, 2541, 11, 1701, 14265, 53572, 311, 47032, 1401, 3585, 627, 9, 578, 4311, 16025, 304, 11, 872, 6548, 8521, 389, 279, 4580, 439, 279, 7395, 15100, 279, 1847, 3197, 627,