on cost ($300), it is the most cost-effective location.\n3. Output the result:\n\t* The most cost-effective location to produce the product is City 1, with an expected production cost of $100.\n\nIn this case, City 1 is the most cost-effective location to produce the product, with an expected production cost of $100.", token_ids=[1271, 10765, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 311, 8356, 264, 2027, 11, 584, 649, 1893, 264, 4382, 12384, 430, 43565, 279, 3685, 5788, 7194, 304, 1855, 3363, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 3094, 14656, 30308, 5603, 1473, 16, 13, 19127, 279, 1988, 7482, 512, 197, 9, 4409, 220, 16, 25, 32121, 5788, 2853, 284, 400, 1041, 198, 197, 9, 4409, 220, 17, 25, 32121, 5788, 2853, 284, 400, 1049, 198, 197, 9, 4409, 220, 18, 25, 32121, 5788, 2853, 284, 400, 3101, 198, 17, 13, 31001, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 555, 27393, 279, 3685, 5788, 7194, 512, 197, 9, 1442, 4409, 220, 16, 706, 279, 15821, 3685, 5788, 2853, 1746, 1041, 705, 433, 374, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 627, 197, 9, 1442, 4409, 220, 17, 706, 279, 15821, 3685, 5788, 2853, 1746, 1049, 705, 433, 374, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 627, 197, 9, 1442, 4409, 220, 18, 706, 279, 15821, 3685, 5788, 2853, 1746, 3101, 705, 433, 374, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 627, 18, 13, 9442, 279, 1121, 512, 197, 9, 578, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 311, 8356, 279, 2027, 374, 4409, 220, 16, 11, 449, 459, 3685, 5788, 2853, 315, 400, 1041, 382, 644, 420, 1162, 11, 4409, 220, 16, 374, 279, 1455, 2853, 53421, 3813, 311, 8356, 279, 2027, 11, 449, 459, 3685, 5788, 2853, 315, 400, 1041, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
