Output~2025-04-07 00:17:21.885079: [RequestOutput(request_id=936, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a flower arrangement for a birthday party. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 23153, 27204, 369, 264, 15553, 4717, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='What a lovely task! Here\'s a response that completes the request:\n\n**Flower Arrangement for a Birthday Party**\n\nFor a vibrant and festive flower arrangement that\'s sure to delight the birthday celebrant and their guests, I propose the following design:\n\n**Theme:** "Sunshine Celebration"\n\n**Color Scheme:** Bright and cheerful colors like yellow, orange, pink, and white to evoke feelings of happiness and joy.\n\n**Flowers:**\n\n* Main flowers: Sunflowers (yellow) and Gerbera daisies (pink and white)\n* Accent flowers: Baby\'s breath (white) and Queen Anne\'s lace (cream)\n* Filler flowers: Fresh greenery like eucalyptus or ferns to add texture and depth\n\n**Arrangement:**\n\n1. Start with a clear glass vase or a decorative container that complements the color scheme.\n2. Begin by placing a few stems of sunflowers in the vase, slightly angled to create a sense of movement.\n3. Add a few stems of Gerbera daisies around the sunflowers, varying the heights and angles to create visual interest.\n4. Fill in the gaps with baby\'s breath and Queen Anne\'s lace to add volume and texture.\n5. Finish the arrangement by adding some fresh greenery around the edges to complete the look.\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n* To add a personal touch, consider incorporating the birthday person\'s favorite flowers or colors into the arrangement.\n* For a more dramatic look, use a larger vase or add some decorative elements like ribbons, bows, or beads.\n* To make the arrangement more compact, use a smaller vase or trim the stems of the flowers to create a more compact shape.\n\n**Final Touches:**\n\n* Place the arrangement on a decorative tablecloth or a colorful table runner to add an extra pop of color.\n* Consider adding some candles, balloons, or other decorative elements to create a festive atmosphere.\n\nThis flower arrangement is sure to bring a smile to the birthday person\'s face and set the tone for a joyful celebration!', token_ids=[3923, 264, 17104, 3465, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 334, 3968, 1223, 18925, 57733, 369, 264, 37340, 8722, 57277, 2520, 264, 34076, 323, 59937, 23153, 27204, 430, 596, 2771, 311, 18454, 279, 15553, 7495, 519, 323, 872, 15051, 11, 358, 30714, 279, 2768, 2955, 1473, 334, 12880, 68063, 330, 31192, 31338, 75200, 1875, 334, 1668, 44881, 68063, 27508, 323, 71414, 8146, 1093, 14071, 11, 19087, 11, 18718, 11, 323, 4251, 311, 95263, 16024, 315, 23871, 323, 16267, 382, 334, 3968, 16345, 25, 57277, 9, 4802, 19837, 25, 8219, 89770, 320, 28969, 8, 323, 20524, 655, 64, 294, 2852, 552, 320, 64349, 323, 4251, 340, 9, 82909, 19837, 25, 21266, 596, 11745, 320, 5902, 8, 323, 16657, 29026, 596, 46793, 320, 47100, 340, 9, 435, 15610, 19837, 25, 30260, 6307, 727, 1093, 384, 1791, 5893, 418, 355, 477, 88124, 82, 311, 923, 10651, 323, 8149, 271, 334, 9014, 57733, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5256, 449, 264, 2867, 9168, 93484, 477, 264, 46536, 5593, 430, 1946, 1392, 279, 1933, 13155, 627, 17, 13, 19110, 555, 25012, 264, 2478, 44814, 315, 7160, 89770, 304, 279, 93484, 11, 10284, 99410, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 7351, 627, 18, 13, 2758, 264, 2478, 44814, 315, 20524, 655, 64, 294, 2852, 552, 2212, 279, 7160, 89770, 11, 29865, 27