e combination of fruits to create a unique flavor profile.\n* Add a sprinkle of cinnamon or nutmeg for extra spice.\n* Try using different types of sugar, such as brown sugar or coconut sugar, for a unique flavor.\n* For a more intense flavor, drizzle the pizza with a little bit of balsamic glaze or caramel sauce.\n\nEnjoy your delicious fruit pizza!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 4382, 11363, 369, 264, 18406, 14098, 23317, 430, 596, 4832, 369, 264, 9498, 323, 37018, 43849, 477, 40459, 1473, 334, 37, 21702, 35918, 26371, 57277, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 864, 27975, 23317, 40712, 320, 269, 220, 16, 6462, 315, 23317, 31452, 340, 9, 220, 16, 10747, 315, 701, 7075, 14098, 11, 1778, 439, 512, 197, 10, 328, 75730, 76203, 198, 197, 10, 8868, 36989, 198, 197, 10, 2895, 9521, 198, 197, 10, 30558, 17043, 198, 197, 10, 42609, 23182, 198, 197, 10, 76924, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 315, 26828, 198, 9, 220, 16, 62611, 315, 30564, 23661, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 42384, 315, 33165, 8819, 198, 9, 15883, 36244, 315, 13465, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5075, 20559, 701, 24276, 311, 220, 3443, 59572, 320, 1049, 32037, 4390, 17, 13, 15028, 704, 279, 23317, 40712, 311, 701, 12974, 26839, 323, 2035, 433, 389, 264, 28915, 11071, 627, 18, 13, 763, 264, 2678, 19763, 11, 6651, 3871, 279, 26828, 11, 30564, 23661, 11, 323, 33165, 8819, 627, 19, 13, 41680, 279, 48715, 14098, 389, 1948, 315, 279, 23317, 40712, 11, 9564, 264, 2678, 3973, 2212, 279, 13116, 627, 20, 13, 2999, 44237, 279, 26828, 31307, 1677, 21655, 927, 279, 14098, 11, 3339, 2771, 814, 2351, 682, 49482, 42147, 627, 21, 13, 15883, 36244, 264, 50346, 315, 13465, 927, 279, 14098, 11, 422, 12974, 11, 369, 5066, 64550, 627, 22, 13, 53174, 279, 23317, 304, 279, 864, 383, 660, 24276, 369, 220, 868, 12, 508, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 40712, 374, 21411, 14198, 323, 279, 14098, 374, 28682, 627, 23, 13, 11016, 279, 23317, 505, 279, 24276, 323, 1095, 433, 7155, 369, 264, 2478, 4520, 1603, 86015, 323, 13788, 382, 33