Output~2025-04-07 00:17:52.612041: [RequestOutput(request_id=948, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe your favorite vacation spot. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 701, 7075, 20769, 7858, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="I'm happy to share my favorite vacation spot with you!\n\nMy favorite vacation spot is the beautiful island of Bora Bora in French Polynesia. Located in the South Pacific, Bora Bora is a small South Pacific island that is part of French Polynesia, an overseas collectivity of France. The island is surrounded by a stunning turquoise lagoon and a barrier reef, making it a snorkeler's and scuba diver's paradise.\n\nThe moment I stepped foot on the island, I was struck by its breathtaking beauty. The overwater bungalows, with their thatched roofs and glass floors, seemed like something out of a movie. The warm sandy beaches, the crystal-clear waters, and the lush green mountains in the background created a serene and peaceful atmosphere that was hard to resist.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was taking a sunset cruise around the lagoon. We sailed past the motus (small islands) and saw an array of marine life, including sea turtles, rays, and colorful fish. We also stopped at a secluded motu for a beach barbecue and watched the sunset over the ocean. It was truly magical.\n\nAnother memorable experience was snorkeling in the lagoon. The water was so clear that I could see fish swimming beneath my feet, and the coral reefs were teeming with life. I even spotted a sea turtle swimming alongside me!\n\nBora Bora is also a great place to relax and unwind. I spent many afternoons lounging on the beach, reading a book, and taking the occasional dip in the ocean. The island's laid-back atmosphere and stunning scenery made it the perfect place to disconnect from the world and recharge.\n\nOverall, Bora Bora is a true tropical paradise that offers something for everyone. Whether you're looking for adventure, relaxation, or romance, this island has it all. I highly recommend it to anyone looking for a dream vacation!", token_ids=[40, 2846, 6380, 311, 4430, 856, 7075, 20769, 7858, 449, 499, 2268, 5159, 7075, 20769, 7858, 374, 279, 6366, 13218, 315, 426, 6347, 426, 6347, 304, 8753, 3735, 84267, 689, 13, 42867, 304, 279, 4987, 16867, 11, 426, 6347, 426, 6347, 374, 264, 2678, 4987, 16867, 13218, 430, 374, 961, 315, 8753, 3735, 84267, 689, 11, 459, 25355, 6667, 1968, 315, 9822, 13, 578, 13218, 374, 23712, 555, 264, 20441, 97047, 326, 68513, 323, 264, 22881, 71145, 11, 3339, 433, 264, 97806, 8023, 596, 323, 1156, 31529, 37441, 596, 50852, 382, 791, 4545, 358, 25319, 4579, 389, 279, 13218, 11, 358, 574, 17948, 555, 1202, 57192, 13444, 13, 578, 927, 13284, 293, 58267, 4336, 11, 449, 872, 430, 2454, 77395, 323, 9168, 27035, 11, 9508, 1093, 2555, 704, 315, 264, 5818, 13, 578, 8369, 68539, 35909, 11, 279, 26110, 68127, 21160, 11, 323, 279, 58367, 6307, 24405, 304, 279, 4092, 3549, 264, 95863, 323, 26733, 16975, 430, 574, 2653, 311, 22884, 382, 4054, 315, 279, 22020, 315, 856, 8577, 574, 4737, 264, 44084, 31551, 2212, 279, 326, 68513, 13, 1226, 76844, 3347, 279, 3937, 355, 320, 9181, 30100, 8, 323, 5602, 459, 1358, 315, 29691, 2324, 11, 2737, 9581, 72503, 11, 45220, 11, 323, 34966, 7795, 13, 1226, 1101, 10717, 520, 264, 89115, 3937, 84, 369, 264, 11573, 62312, 323, 15746, 279, 44084, 927, 279, 18435, 13, 1102, 574, 9615, 24632, 382, 14364, 33596, 3217, 574, 97806, 20659, 304, 279, 326, 68513, 1