I technology can detect and alert you to potential security threats, such as unauthorized access attempts or suspicious activity.\n* Enhanced photo and video recognition: With our AI-powered facial recognition, you can easily identify and tag friends and family in your photos and videos, making sharing and organization a breeze.\n\nBut don\'t just take our word for it - our Smartphone\'s AI technology has been tested and proven to be one of the most secure and accurate facial recognition systems on the market. With its advanced AI capabilities, you can trust that your personal data and identity are in good hands.\n\nUpgrade to our Smartphone today and experience the future of security and convenience. With its AI-powered facial recognition, you\'ll be able to enjoy a safer, more streamlined, and more enjoyable mobile experience. Don\'t wait - get your hands on our revolutionary new Smartphone and discover a whole new world of possibilities!"', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 40661, 5811, 311, 12192, 279, 75037, 1473, 1, 11787, 499, 19781, 315, 1701, 41626, 4868, 11193, 311, 6144, 701, 4443, 828, 323, 9764, 30, 9372, 912, 4726, 1109, 1057, 30191, 502, 75037, 11, 19167, 449, 14713, 48448, 15592, 5557, 304, 28900, 18324, 0, 3161, 420, 18699, 4668, 11, 499, 649, 2800, 28478, 430, 701, 4641, 374, 30549, 1109, 3596, 1603, 382, 8140, 15592, 41503, 28900, 18324, 1887, 5829, 11084, 26249, 311, 11388, 323, 15641, 701, 5016, 28900, 4519, 11, 10923, 499, 311, 15405, 701, 4641, 449, 14553, 323, 16437, 13, 2030, 430, 596, 539, 682, 482, 420, 5557, 1101, 20682, 11084, 4868, 4519, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 12371, 24264, 17066, 25, 25961, 47555, 311, 34816, 323, 28228, 82, 11, 323, 24748, 311, 264, 810, 9966, 323, 17125, 1648, 311, 2680, 701, 4641, 627, 9, 75622, 18324, 6108, 4868, 25, 5751, 15592, 5557, 649, 11388, 323, 5225, 499, 311, 4754, 4868, 18208, 11, 1778, 439, 45571, 2680, 13865, 477, 32427, 5820, 627, 9, 62549, 6685, 323, 2835, 18324, 25, 3161, 1057, 15592, 41503, 28900, 18324, 11, 