 meets.\n\nAs a young pup, Puff is still learning the ropes, but she\'s a quick learner and is already house-trained. She\'s also crate-trained and knows basic commands, making her a great candidate for first-time dog owners.\n\nPuff\'s previous owners have described her as "sweet" and "loving," and we couldn\'t agree more. She\'s a true sweetheart who will capture your heart from the moment you meet her. Whether you\'re looking for a running buddy, a snuggle partner, or just a loyal companion, Puff is the perfect pup for you.\n\n**Adoption Details:**\n\n* Age: 8 months\n* Breed: [Unknown]\n* Size: [Medium]\n* Temperament: Loving and Friendly\n* House-trained: Yes\n* Crate-trained: Yes\n* Basic commands: Yes\n* Energy level: Medium-high\n* Good with children: Yes\n* Good with other pets: Yes\n\n**Ready to Bring Puff Home?**\n\nIf you\'re ready to add a little love and joy to your life, come visit us today and meet Puff in person. We can\'t wait to see you fall in love with this sweet pup!', token_ids=[334, 41651, 393, 1386, 11, 279, 27687, 478, 70075, 1472, 3358, 18374, 26911, 0, 57277, 11787, 499, 5644, 311, 923, 264, 75519, 4333, 311, 701, 3070, 30, 9372, 912, 4726, 1109, 393, 1386, 11, 1057, 41708, 220, 23, 23086, 6418, 8954, 5679, 0, 1115, 21955, 323, 11919, 15241, 374, 3411, 369, 264, 16058, 2162, 1405, 1364, 649, 17639, 1077, 7980, 449, 37805, 323, 4224, 2661, 645, 382, 47, 1386, 374, 264, 13190, 315, 4907, 323, 16267, 11, 449, 264, 57169, 17743, 430, 596, 2771, 311, 4546, 264, 15648, 311, 701, 3663, 13, 3005, 16180, 311, 1629, 2212, 323, 1514, 11, 719, 1364, 596, 1101, 6380, 311, 14284, 709, 304, 701, 24301, 369, 264, 1695, 65245, 273, 3882, 13, 6385, 22443, 7138, 3727, 1077, 264, 2294, 22489, 369, 8689, 449, 2911, 11, 323, 1077, 11919, 94115, 3445, 1364, 3358, 6288, 1304, 4885, 449, 5606, 1364, 20628, 382, 2170, 264, 3995, 15241, 11, 393, 1386, 374, 2103, 6975, 279, 65046, 11, 719, 1364, 596, 264, 4062, 64060, 323, 374, 2736, 3838, 70024, 13, 3005, 596, 1101