e controlled remotely, granting access to authorized individuals and keeping your home secure.\n8. **Smart Smoke Detector**: Our Smart Smoke Detector detects smoke and alerts you and the authorities in case of an emergency, ensuring your safety and peace of mind.\n9. **Smart Water Leak Detector**: Our Smart Water Leak Detector detects water leaks and alerts you in real-time, preventing damage and costly repairs.\n10. **Smart Home Automation Kit**: Our Smart Home Automation Kit is a bundle of our most popular widgets, allowing you to automate and control your entire home with ease.\n\nPlease note that prices and availability may vary depending on your location and the specific products you choose.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 279, 1160, 315, 32955, 430, 264, 1217, 649, 7782, 505, 1057, 3637, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 34917, 5492, 27636, 96618, 5751, 43772, 2027, 11, 279, 16147, 5492, 27636, 374, 264, 8792, 6597, 430, 75762, 682, 701, 7941, 7766, 323, 6276, 499, 311, 2585, 1124, 39529, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 34917, 23258, 55825, 96618, 5751, 16147, 23258, 55825, 47310, 701, 9499, 19882, 323, 84431, 279, 9499, 28178, 11, 23391, 264, 10882, 323, 4907, 73916, 2162, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 34917, 45623, 744, 96618, 5751, 16147, 45623, 744, 5764, 264, 2134, 315, 7941, 54320, 430, 649, 387, 14400, 39529, 11, 13847, 11, 323, 28598, 311, 1893, 279, 4832, 95673, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 34917, 8398, 14669, 96618, 5751, 16147, 8398, 14669, 5825, 1579, 90150, 2835, 17265, 11, 11633, 18468, 11, 323, 3814, 11376, 11, 7231, 499, 9096, 315, 4059, 323, 10494, 701, 2162, 9966, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 34917, 30173, 96618, 5751, 16147, 30173, 374, 264, 7899, 41370, 3756, 430, 11335, 4731, 11, 7437, 63411, 11, 323, 5825, 2038, 389, 3754, 11, 9282, 11, 323, 810, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 34917, 53909, 96618, 5751, 16147, 53909, 6276, 499, 311, 2585, 904, 3756, 59329, 1139, 433, 39529, 11, 9899, 1202, 10648, 11, 323, 8891, 1202, 4907, 15652, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 34917, 25166, 16076, 96618, 5751, 16147, 25166, 16076, 374, 264, 14