Output~2025-04-07 00:22:33.414706: [RequestOutput(request_id=1050, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a short story about a grandmother and her grand-daughter. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 2875, 3446, 922, 264, 39284, 323, 1077, 6800, 66997, 7490, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a short story about a grandmother and her grand-daughter:\n\nAs the sun began to set on a warm summer evening, Grandma Jean settled into her favorite armchair, surrounded by the familiar comforts of her cozy living room. Her grand-daughter, Lily, burst through the front door, her bright blue eyes sparkling with excitement.\n\n"Grandma, Grandma! Guess what?" Lily exclaimed, dropping her backpack onto the floor and racing over to give her grandmother a big hug.\n\nGrandma Jean smiled, her eyes crinkling at the corners as she wrapped her arms around Lily\'s small frame. "What is it, sweetie? You look like you\'ve got the world\'s biggest secret to share!"\n\nLily\'s face lit up even brighter. "I got an A on my math test today! And Mrs. Johnson said I\'m the best student in the class!"\n\nGrandma Jean beamed with pride, her heart swelling with love for her clever grand-daughter. "That\'s wonderful news, Lily! I\'m so proud of you. You must have studied really hard."\n\nLily nodded, her ponytail bobbing up and down. "I did, Grandma. And I couldn\'t have done it without your help. You\'re the best teacher in the whole world!"\n\nGrandma Jean chuckled, feeling a warmth spread through her chest. "Well, I think you\'re the one who did all the hard work, sweetie. But I\'m happy to help whenever you need it."\n\nAs they sat together on the couch, Grandma Jean pulled out a plate of freshly baked cookies and a glass of cold milk. "How about a special treat to celebrate your good news?"\n\nLily\'s eyes grew wide as she surveyed the spread. "Wow, Grandma! You\'re the best!"\n\nAs they munched on cookies and sipped their milk, Grandma Jean listened as Lily told her all about her day, from the math test to her favorite book club meeting. As the evening drew to a close, Grandma Jean wrapped her arms around Lily once more, feeling grateful for this special bond they shared.\n\n"I love you, Grandma," Lily said, her voice muffled against her grandmother\'s shoulder.\n\n"I love you too, sweetie," Grandma Jean replied, her voice filled with emotion. "More than words can say."', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2875, 3446, 922, 264, 39284, 323, 1077, 6800, 66997, 7490, 1473, 2170, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 389, 264, 8369, 7474, 11714, 11, 99068, 20263, 23183, 1139, 1077, 7075, 6916, 35296, 11, 23712, 555, 279, 11537, 97181, 315, 1077, 43535, 5496, 3130, 13, 6385, 6800, 66997, 7490, 11, 48390, 11, 21165, 1555, 279, 4156, 6134, 11, 1077, 10107, 6437, 6548, 64612, 449, 28361, 382, 1, 41251, 1764, 11, 99068, 0, 55379, 1148, 7673, 48390, 80608, 11, 26156, 1077, 34236, 8800, 279, 6558, 323, 22019, 927, 311, 3041, 1077, 39284, 264, 2466, 30884, 382, 41251, 1764, 20263, 31645, 11, 1077, 6548, 1589, 771, 2785, 520, 279, 24359, 439, 1364, 20037, 1077, 11977, 2212, 48390, 596, 2678, 4124, 13, 330, 3923, 374, 433, 11, 10437, 648, 30, 1472, 1427, 1093, 499, 3077, 2751, 279, 1917, 596, 8706, 6367, 311, 4430, 17642, 43, 1570, 596, 3663, 13318, 709, 1524, 53657, 13, 330, 40, 2751, 459, 362, 389, 856, 7033, 1296, 3432, 0, 1628, 18083, 13, 11605, 1071, 358, 2846, 279, 1888, 5575, 304, 279, 538, 17642, 41251, 1764, 20263, 387, 3690, 449, 22519, 