Output~2025-04-07 00:23:24.518968: [RequestOutput(request_id=1069, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the details of a dream you had recently. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 3649, 315, 264, 8063, 499, 1047, 6051, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="I had a vivid and surreal dream last night that I'm still trying to process. In the dream, I found myself standing in a vast, open field surrounded by towering trees that seemed to stretch up to the sky. The air was filled with a sweet, floral scent that was both familiar and yet, utterly foreign.\n\nAs I looked around, I noticed that the field was filled with strange, glowing orbs that hovered just above the ground. They pulsed with a soft, blue light that seemed to be beckoning me towards them. I felt an overwhelming sense of curiosity and wonder, and I began to walk towards the orbs, feeling the soft, lush grass beneath my feet.\n\nAs I drew closer, the orbs began to take on a life of their own, morphing into strange, abstract shapes that seemed to defy gravity. They floated and danced around me, their lights pulsing in time with my heartbeat. I felt a sense of euphoria wash over me, as if I was experiencing a deep sense of connection to the universe.\n\nSuddenly, the orbs began to coalesce into a single, glowing entity that hovered before me. It took the shape of a woman, her features soft and indistinct, yet somehow familiar. She reached out to me with a gentle, ethereal hand, and I felt a surge of peace and tranquility wash over me.\n\nThe dream was so vivid and real that I woke up feeling refreshed and invigorated, with a sense of wonder and awe that lingered long after I opened my eyes. It was as if the dream had awakened a part of me that I had forgotten existed, and I'm still trying to unravel the symbolism and meaning behind it.", token_ids=[40, 1047, 264, 43120, 323, 65623, 8063, 1566, 3814, 430, 358, 2846, 2103, 4560, 311, 1920, 13, 763, 279, 8063, 11, 358, 1766, 7182, 11509, 304, 264, 13057, 11, 1825, 2115, 23712, 555, 87794, 12690, 430, 9508, 311, 14841, 709, 311, 279, 13180, 13, 578, 3805, 574, 10409, 449, 264, 10437, 11, 46119, 41466, 430, 574, 2225, 11537, 323, 3686, 11, 38631, 7362, 382, 2170, 358, 7111, 2212, 11, 358, 14000, 430, 279, 2115, 574, 10409, 449, 15234, 11, 49592, 99505, 430, 91551, 1120, 3485, 279, 5015, 13, 2435, 7893, 32424, 449, 264, 8579, 11, 6437, 3177, 430, 9508, 311, 387, 92186, 20324, 757, 7119, 1124, 13, 358, 6612, 459, 22798, 5647, 315, 41328, 323, 5895, 11, 323, 358, 6137, 311, 4321, 7119, 279, 99505, 11, 8430, 279, 8579, 11, 58367, 16763, 24923, 856, 7693, 382, 2170, 358, 24465, 12401, 11, 279, 99505, 6137, 311, 1935, 389, 264, 2324, 315, 872, 1866, 11, 27448, 287, 1139, 15234, 11, 8278, 21483, 430, 9508, 311, 90672, 24128, 13, 2435, 67135, 323, 84852, 2212, 757, 11, 872, 13001, 56037, 287, 304, 892, 449, 856, 53205, 13, 358, 6612, 264, 5647, 315, 65043, 96729, 11623, 927, 757, 11, 439, 422, 358, 574, 25051, 264, 5655, 5647, 315, 3717, 311, 279, 15861, 382, 98331, 11, 279, 99505, 6137, 311, 1080, 74350, 1139, 264, 3254, 11, 49592, 5502, 430, 91551, 1603, 757, 13, 1102, 3952, 279, 6211, 315, 264, 5333, 11, 1077, 4519, 8579, 323, 1280, 380, 7956, 11, 3686, 17354, 11537, 13, 3005, 8813, 704, 311, 757, 449, 264, 22443, 11, 8537, 44353, 1450, 11, 323, 358, 6612, 264, 22531, 315, 9096, 323, 41664, 1429, 11623, 927, 757, 382, 791, 8063, 574, 779, 43120, 323, 1972, 430, 358, 39826, 709, 8430, 66229, 323