plits into two or more smaller nuclei, releasing a large amount of energy in the process?\n\nA) Radioactive decay\nB) Nuclear fusion\nC) Nuclear fission\nD) Ionization\n\nAnswer: C) Nuclear fission', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 4860, 5552, 311, 11499, 22027, 1473, 16, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 1920, 555, 902, 25524, 97192, 16343, 311, 1376, 264, 44922, 62607, 11, 28965, 264, 3544, 3392, 315, 4907, 304, 279, 1920, 1980, 32, 8, 13792, 3104, 31815, 198, 33, 8, 38544, 282, 7711, 198, 34, 8, 38544, 37608, 198, 35, 8, 45905, 2065, 271, 16533, 25, 356, 8, 38544, 37608, 271, 17, 13, 16299, 315, 279, 2768, 19252, 374, 4276, 264, 955, 315, 25407, 48042, 555, 59862, 7384, 1980, 32, 8, 25737, 19252, 198, 33, 8, 35343, 19252, 198, 34, 8, 58782, 45220, 198, 35, 8, 4275, 332, 26692, 271, 16533, 25, 423, 8, 4275, 332, 26692, 271, 18, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 4751, 369, 279, 3392, 315, 4907, 2631, 311, 4148, 459, 17130, 505, 459, 19670, 11, 11383, 17303, 304, 17130, 12821, 2641, 320, 68, 53, 74630, 32, 8, 26990, 4907, 198, 33, 8, 45905, 2065, 4907, 198, 34, 8, 38544, 11212, 4907, 198, 35, 8, 13792, 3104, 31815, 4907, 271, 16533, 25, 426, 8, 45905, 2065, 4907, 271, 19, 13, 16299, 315, 279, 2768, 12518, 922, 11499, 71573, 374, 8378, 1980, 32, 8, 2435, 1005, 14400, 11499, 25481, 311, 7068, 18200, 198, 33, 8, 2435, 1005, 653, 59707, 11499, 25481, 311, 7068, 18200, 198, 34, 8, 2435, 1005, 11742, 25481, 311, 7068, 18200, 198, 35, 8, 2435, 1005, 13238, 4907, 311, 7068, 18200, 271, 16533, 25, 362, 8, 2435, 1005, 14400, 11499, 25481, 311, 7068, 18200, 271, 20, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 4751, 369, 279, 1920, 555, 902, 264, 62607, 41567, 1139, 1403, 477, 810, 9333, 97192, 11, 28965, 264, 3544, 3392, 315, 4907, 304, 279, 1920, 1980, 32, 8, 13792, 3104, 31815, 198, 33, 8, 38544, 37608, 198, 34, 8, 38544, 282, 7711, 198, 35, 8, 45905, 2065, 271, 16533, 25, 356, 8, 38544, 282, 7711, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=No