Output~2025-04-07 00:25:51.284435: [RequestOutput(request_id=1140, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Figure out the final principle payment amount for a loan with the given details. ### Input: Principle balance: $400,000, Interest rate: 3.5%, Length of loan: 20 years ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 19575, 704, 279, 1620, 17966, 8323, 3392, 369, 264, 11941, 449, 279, 2728, 3649, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 82086, 8335, 25, 400, 3443, 11, 931, 11, 25074, 4478, 25, 220, 18, 13, 20, 13689, 17736, 315, 11941, 25, 220, 508, 1667, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='To calculate the final principle payment amount for the loan, we can use a formula that takes into account the principal balance, interest rate, and length of the loan. The formula is:\n\nFinal Principle Payment = Principal Balance x (Interest Rate / (1 - (1 + Interest Rate)^(-Length of Loan)))\n\nPlugging in the given values, we get:\n\nFinal Principle Payment = $400,000 x (3.5% / (1 - (1 + 0.035)^(-20)))\n= $400,000 x (0.035 / (1 - (1.035)^(-20)))\n= $400,000 x (0.035 / 0.444)\n= $400,000 x 0.079\n= $31,600\n\nSo, the final principle payment amount for the loan is $31,600.', token_ids=[1271, 11294, 279, 1620, 17966, 8323, 3392, 369, 279, 11941, 11, 584, 649, 1005, 264, 15150, 430, 5097, 1139, 2759, 279, 12717, 8335, 11, 2802, 4478, 11, 323, 3160, 315, 279, 11941, 13, 578, 15150, 374, 1473, 19918,