ed by Clancy Brown): The strict and sadistic captain of the prison guards, who is feared by the inmates. He is a loyal servant of the warden and will stop at nothing to maintain order and discipline.\n\nThese characters, along with several others, come together to create a powerful and emotional story of hope, redemption, and the human spirit\'s ability to persevere in the face of adversity.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 334, 15762, 68063, 578, 5818, 330, 791, 36285, 939, 1201, 89741, 1, 374, 743, 304, 279, 220, 6393, 15, 82, 304, 264, 7340, 63302, 9527, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 13, 578, 3446, 5097, 2035, 304, 279, 44682, 36285, 939, 1201, 3314, 13597, 275, 23202, 661, 11, 264, 2291, 65, 3785, 323, 49941, 6070, 430, 781, 7085, 927, 279, 2678, 6424, 315, 426, 2249, 783, 11, 30890, 13, 578, 9527, 374, 264, 2035, 315, 25984, 4787, 11, 21948, 11, 323, 46996, 11, 1405, 3987, 5084, 5675, 369, 279, 42712, 382, 334, 38589, 25, 57277, 9, 3146, 68517, 423, 1739, 417, 818, 334, 320, 51908, 555, 9538, 88315, 1680, 362, 6992, 72759, 889, 374, 72309, 23959, 315, 81027, 813, 7555, 323, 1077, 31657, 13, 25871, 374, 264, 11594, 11, 25530, 11, 323, 5211, 1285, 3927, 889, 374, 11075, 311, 2867, 813, 836, 323, 12731, 505, 9527, 627, 9, 3146, 6161, 334, 320, 51908, 555, 23809, 50664, 1680, 362, 10345, 261, 889, 706, 5675, 3987, 323, 706, 3719, 33232, 1534, 13, 3816, 374, 264, 52614, 67535, 889, 706, 9687, 311, 18167, 304, 279, 25984, 4676, 315, 36285, 939, 1201, 11, 719, 568, 374, 1101, 57775, 555, 813, 3347, 21294, 627, 9, 3146, 54, 8506, 60364, 334, 320, 51908, 555, 14596, 22450, 783, 1680, 578, 22681, 323, 69510, 289, 8506, 315, 36285, 939, 1201, 42618, 11, 889, 374, 44898, 449, 20958, 2015, 323, 2585, 927, 279, 42712, 13, 1283, 374, 264, 7891, 315, 279, 78612, 1887, 430, 25871, 323, 3816, 2011, 21546, 627, 9, 3146, 62158, 24805, 3258, 334, 320, 51908, 555, 2493, 6709, 10690, 1680, 578, 7452, 323, 12703, 4633, 24862, 315, 279, 9527, 27270, 11, 889, 374,