Output~2025-04-07 00:28:43.204028: [RequestOutput(request_id=1196, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe a time where you used problem solving skills in order to overcome a difficult situation. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 264, 892, 1405, 499, 1511, 3575, 22581, 7512, 304, 2015, 311, 23075, 264, 5107, 6671, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="I recall a particularly challenging situation where I had to utilize my problem-solving skills to overcome a difficult obstacle. It was during my junior year of college, when I was working as a team leader on a group project for my marketing class. Our task was to create a comprehensive marketing campaign for a new product launch, and our team was tasked with presenting our findings to a panel of industry experts.\n\nAs the team leader, I was responsible for ensuring that our presentation was well-organized, informative, and engaging. However, just a day before the presentation, our team's key researcher informed us that she had accidentally deleted all of the data we had collected for the campaign. This was a major setback, as we had relied heavily on that data to support our arguments and recommendations.\n\nI immediately sprang into problem-solving mode, recognizing that we had to act quickly to salvage the situation. I called an emergency meeting with my team to assess the situation and brainstorm potential solutions. We quickly realized that we had to recreate the data from scratch, which would require a significant amount of time and effort.\n\nTo overcome this challenge, I suggested that we divide the task into smaller, manageable chunks, and assign specific tasks to each team member. I also proposed that we use our existing knowledge and research to create a rough estimate of the data, which we could then use as a starting point to build upon.\n\nWith a clear plan in place, we worked tirelessly throughout the night to recreate the data. I also made sure to keep our team motivated and focused, by providing regular updates and encouragement. By the time the presentation arrived, we had managed to recreate most of the data, and our presentation was well-received by the panel of experts.\n\nLooking back, I realize that this experience taught me the importance of staying calm under pressure, thinking creatively, and working collaboratively as a team. By using my problem-solving skills, I was able to turn a potentially disastrous situation into a successful outcome, and I'm proud of the way my team and I worked together to overcome the challenge.", token_ids=[40, 19635, 264, 8104, 17436, 6671, 1405, 358, 1047, 311, 29166, 856, 3575, 99246, 7512, 311, 23075, 264, 5107, 33287, 13, 1102, 574, 2391, 856, 27144, 1060, 315, 7926, 11, 994, 358, 574, 3318, 439, 264, 2128, 7808, 389, 264, 1912, 2447, 369, 856, 8661, 538, 13, 5751, 3465, 574, 311, 1893, 264, 16195, 8661, 4901, 369, 264, 502, 2027, 7195, 11, 323, 1057, 2128, 574, 51920, 449, 32644, 1057, 14955, 311, 264, 7090, 315, 5064, 11909, 382, 2170, 279, 2128, 7808, 11, 358, 574, 8647, 369, 23391, 430, 1057, 15864, 574, 1664, 12, 63316, 11, 39319, 11, 323, 23387, 13, 4452, 11, 1120, 264, 1938, 1603, 279, 15864, 11, 1057, 2128, 596, 1401, 32185, 16369, 603, 430, 1364, 1047, 33484, 11309, 682, 315, 279, 828, 584, 1047, 14890, 369, 279, 4901, 13, 1115, 574, 264, 3682, 79913, 11, 439, 584, 1047, 41013, 17345, 389, 430, 828, 311, 1862, 1057, 6105, 323, 19075, 382, 40, 7214, 8314, 526, 1139, 3575, 99246, 3941