Output~2025-04-07 00:29:24.820764: [RequestOutput(request_id=1208, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a story about a cat that is stuck in a tree. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 3446, 922, 264, 8415, 430, 374, 16075, 304, 264, 5021, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Whiskers, a curious and agile cat, was exploring the backyard when she spotted a bird perched on a branch of a tall oak tree. Her eyes fixed on the bird, she crouched low to the ground, tail twitching with excitement. Without hesitation, she sprang into action, leaping up the tree trunk with ease.\n\nAs she climbed higher, the branches grew thinner and more brittle, but Whiskers was determined to catch her feathered friend. She reached out a paw, just as the bird took flight, leaving Whiskers grasping at air. In her haste, she lost her footing and found herself stuck, her paws clinging to a thin branch high above the ground.\n\nPanic set in as Whiskers realized she was trapped. She meowed loudly, hoping someone would hear her distress call. But the only response was the chirping of birds and the rustling of leaves in the gentle breeze.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Whiskers grew more desperate. She tried to climb down, but her paws slipped and she slid back up the branch. Her claws ached and her fur was ruffled from the struggle. Just as she was about to give up hope, she heard the sound of footsteps crunching through the underbrush.\n\nA kind old man, who lived in the house next door, had heard Whiskers' cries for help. He approached the tree, calling out softly to the cat. Whiskers meowed again, and the man carefully made his way around the tree, searching for a way to rescue her.\n\nAfter a few minutes of searching, the man spotted a sturdy branch that led to a lower limb. He gently coaxed Whiskers down, speaking softly and reassuring her that everything would be okay. With a final nudge, Whiskers tumbled onto the grass, shaking her fur and stretching her stiff limbs.\n\nThe old man scooped up the grateful cat and cradled her in his arms, earning a gentle purr of appreciation. As they walked back to the house, Whiskers realized that sometimes, even the most determined explorers need a little help from their friends. From that day on, she was more cautious in her adventures, but never lost her sense of curiosity and love for the great outdoors.", token_ids=[1671, 3267, 388, 11, 264, 22999, 323, 62565, 8415, 11, 574, 24919, 279, 36760, 994, 1364, 30652, 264, 12224, 824, 2454, 389, 264, 9046, 315, 264, 16615, 38971, 5021, 13, 6385, 6548, 8521, 389, 279, 12224, 11, 1364, 272, 583, 2454, 3428, 311, 279, 5015, 11, 9986, 60513, 287, 449, 28361, 13, 17586, 65437, 11, 1364, 8314, 526, 1139, 1957, 11, 514, 14550, 709, 279, 5021, 38411, 449, 14553, 382, 2170, 1364, 45519, 5190, 11, 279, 23962, 14264, 65355, 323, 810, 95749, 11, 719, 1254, 3267, 388, 574, 11075, 311, 2339, 1077, 50876, 291, 4333, 13, 3005, 8813, 704, 264, 77938, 11, 1120, 439, 279, 12224, 3952, 11213, 11, 9564, 1254, 3267, 388, 50087, 10194, 520, 3805, 13, 763, 1077, 90539, 11, 1364, 5675, 1077, 74503, 323, 1766, 11937, 16075, 11, 1077, 281, 8805, 97458, 311, 264, 15792, 9046, 1579, 3485, 279, 5015, 382, 47, 32370, 743, 304, 439, 1254, 3267, 388, 15393, 1364, 574, 31691, 13, 3005, 757, 13111, 54945, 11, 16026, 4423, 1053, 6865, 1077, 35104, 1650, 13, 2030, 279, 1193, 2077, 574, 279, 71546, 10194, 315, 20229, 323, 279, 23941, 2785, 315, 11141, 304, 279, 22443, 46385, 