Output~2025-04-07 00:30:03.225527: [RequestOutput(request_id=1230, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe in general terms what happens in the first days after someone gets infected with Covid-19. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 304, 4689, 3878, 1148, 8741, 304, 279, 1176, 2919, 1306, 4423, 5334, 29374, 449, 38074, 12, 777, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='When someone gets infected with COVID-19, the first few days after infection are crucial in determining the severity of the illness. In general, the initial symptoms of COVID-19 can appear anywhere from 2-14 days after exposure to the virus, with the average incubation period being around 5-6 days.\n\nIn the first few days, the infected person may not exhibit any noticeable symptoms, and the virus may be replicating rapidly in their body. As the virus multiplies, the immune system begins to respond, and the person may start to experience mild symptoms such as:\n\n* Fatigue or tiredness\n* Headache\n* Sore throat\n* Runny nose or stuffy nose\n* Mild cough\n* Muscle or body aches\n* Mild fever\n\nAs the infection progresses, the symptoms can worsen, and the person may experience more severe symptoms such as:\n\n* High fever\n* Chills\n* Coughing up mucus or phlegm\n* Shortness of breath or difficulty breathing\n* Chest tightness or chest pain\n* Loss of appetite\n* Nausea or vomiting\n* Diarrhea\n\nIn some cases, the infection can progress to more severe forms of the disease, such as pneumonia, acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS), or even multi-organ failure. It is essential for individuals who suspect they have been exposed to COVID-19 to seek medical attention promptly, as early treatment can significantly improve outcomes and reduce the risk of complications.', token_ids=[4599, 4423, 5334, 29374, 449, 20562, 12, 777, 11, 279, 1176, 2478, 2919, 1306, 19405, 527, 16996, 304, 26679, 279, 31020, 315, 279, 17563, 13, 763, 4689, 11, 279, 2926, 13803, 315, 20562, 12, 777, 649, 5101, 12660, 505, 220, 17, 12, 975, 2919, 1306, 14675, 311, 279, 17188, 11, 449, 279, 5578, 49727, 367, 4261, 1694, 2212, 220, 20, 12, 21, 2919, 382, 644, 279, 1176, 2478, 2919, 11, 279, 29374, 1732, 1253, 539, 31324, 904, 43426, 13803, 11, 323, 279, 17188, 1253, 387, 29641, 1113, 19019, 304, 872, 2547, 13, 1666, 279, 17188, 7447, 7350, 11, 279, 22852, 1887, 12302, 311, 6013, 11, 323, 279, 1732, 1253, 1212, 311, 3217, 23900, 13803, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 26417, 22711, 477, 19781, 2136, 198, 9, 11452, 1815, 198, 9, 328, 461, 28691, 198, 9, 6588, 3919, 19689, 477, 6392, 88, 19689, 198, 9, 61289, 40700, 198, 9, 68427, 477, 2547, 264, 8696, 198, 9, 61289, 34653, 271, 2170, 279, 19405, 68711, 11, 279, 13803, 649, 47293, 268, 11, 323, 279, 1732, 1253, 3217, 810, 15748, 13803, 1778, 439, 1473, 9, 5234, 34653, 198, 9, 921, 3385, 198, 9, 356, 1409, 287, 709, 296, 38601, 477, 1343, 1978, 76, 198, 9, 10928, 2136, 315, 11745, 477, 17250, 27027, 198, 9, 42871, 10508, 2136, 477, 15489, 6784, 198, 9, 25733, 315, 38575, 198, 9, 452, 3538, 64, 477, 63571, 198, 9, 7923, 1138, 41033, 271, 644, 1063, 5157, 11, 279, 19405, 649, 5208, 311, 810, 15748, 7739, 315, 279, 8624, 11, 1778, 439, 69329, 11, 30883, 42631, 35104, 28439, 320, 60994, 705, 477, 1524, 7447, 12, 8629, 8060, 13, 1102, 374, 7718, 369, 7931, 889, 15562, 814, 617, 1027, 15246, 311, 20562, 12, 777, 311, 6056, 6593, 6666, 40522, 11, 439, 4216, 6514, 649, 12207, 7417, 20124, 323, 8108, 279, 5326, 315, 36505, 13, 128009], cumula