Output~2025-04-07 00:30:37.504313: [RequestOutput(request_id=1236, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Design a survey to collect customer feedback on the quality of a product. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7127, 264, 10795, 311, 6667, 6130, 11302, 389, 279, 4367, 315, 264, 2027, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="**Customer Feedback Survey: Product Quality**\n\n**Introduction:**\nThank you for purchasing our product! We value your opinion and would like to hear about your experience with our product. Your feedback will help us improve the quality and satisfaction of our products. Please take a few minutes to complete this survey and let us know what you think.\n\n**Section 1: Overall Satisfaction**\n\n1. How would you rate the overall quality of our product?\n\na) Excellent\nb) Good\nc) Fair\nd) Poor\n\n2. How likely are you to recommend our product to a friend or family member?\n\na) Very likely\nb) Somewhat likely\nc) Not very likely\nd) Not at all likely\n\n**Section 2: Product Performance**\n\n1. How would you rate the performance of our product in terms of its intended use?\n\na) Exceeds expectations\nb) Meets expectations\nc) Falls short of expectations\nd) Does not meet expectations\n\n2. Have you experienced any issues with the product's performance?\n\nYes No\n\nIf yes, please describe the issue:\n\n**Section 3: Features and Design**\n\n1. How would you rate the design and features of our product?\n\na) Excellent\nb) Good\nc) Fair\nd) Poor\n\n2. Are there any features or design elements that you would like to see improved or added?\n\nYes No\n\nIf yes, please describe:\n\n**Section 4: Ease of Use**\n\n1. How easy was it to use our product?\n\na) Very easy\nb) Somewhat easy\nc) Neutral\nd) Somewhat difficult\ne) Very difficult\n\n2. Were there any difficulties or challenges you faced while using the product?\n\nYes No\n\nIf yes, please describe:\n\n**Section 5: Additional Comments**\n\nIs there anything else you would like to share about your experience with our product?\n\n**Conclusion:**\nThank you for taking the time to provide your feedback. Your input is invaluable in helping us improve our products and services. If you have any further questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n\n**Demographic Information (optional)**\n\n* Name:\n* Email:\n* Phone number:\n* How did you hear about our product? (e.g. social media, advertisement, recommendation)\n\n**Thank you again for your feedback!**", token_ids=[334, 13084, 37957, 24507, 25, 5761, 18410, 57277, 334, 38255, 25, 1035, 13359, 499, 369, 23395, 1057, 2027, 0, 1226, 907, 701, 9647, 323, 1053, 1093, 311, 6865, 922, 701, 3217, 449, 1057, 2027, 13, 4718, 11302, 690, 1520, 603, 7417, 279, 4367, 323, 24617, 315, 1057, 3956, 13, 5321, 1935, 264, 2478, 4520, 311, 4686, 420, 10795, 323, 1095, 603, 1440, 1148, 499, 1781, 382, 334, 9817, 220, 16, 25, 28993, 94957, 57277, 16, 13, 2650, 1053, 499, 4478, 279, 8244, 4367, 315, 1057, 2027, 1980, 64, 8, 37866, 198, 65, 8, 7839, 198, 66, 8, 14930, 198, 67, 8, 45773, 271, 17, 13, 2650, 4461, 527, 499, 311, 7079, 1057, 2027, 311, 264, 4333, 477, 3070, 4562, 1980, 64, 8, 15668, 4461, 198, 65, 8, 18024, 81575, 4461, 198, 66, 8, 2876, 1633, 4461, 198, 67, 8, 2876, 520, 682, 4461, 271, 334, 9817, 220, 17, 25, 5761, 21304, 57277, 16, 13, 2650, 1053, 499, 4478, 279, 5178, 315, 1057, 2027, 304, 3878, 315, 1202, 10825, 1005, 1980, 64, 8, 1398, 4739, 82, 17078, 198, 65, 8, 2206, 1441, 17078, 198, 66, 