Output~2025-04-07 00:34:16.465370: [RequestOutput(request_id=1314, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Utilize the metaphor of a river to describe the emotional turmoil of a relationship. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 10377, 553, 279, 46450, 315, 264, 15140, 311, 7664, 279, 14604, 63355, 315, 264, 5133, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="The relationship was like a river, constantly flowing and shifting, its currents carrying us along on a journey of ups and downs. At times, the waters were calm and peaceful, with the sun shining down upon us, warming our skin and filling our hearts with joy. We would float effortlessly, our love growing stronger with each passing day, our bond deepening like the riverbed.\n\nBut then, without warning, the waters would churn and swirl, turbulent and unpredictable. The rapids would toss us about, threatening to capsize our little boat of love. The roar of the water would drown out our voices, making it hard to communicate, and the darkness of the depths would seem to swallow us whole. We would cling to each other, desperate to stay afloat, as the river raged on, its power and fury overwhelming.\n\nAnd yet, even in the midst of the turmoil, there were moments of stillness, where the water would calm and the sun would break through the clouds. We would find ourselves beached on a sandy shore, exhausted but grateful to have made it through the storm. We would look into each other's eyes, and the love we shared would shine like a beacon, guiding us back into the river's flow.\n\nJust as a river carves its path through the landscape, shaping and reshaping the world around it, our relationship was constantly evolving, its twists and turns shaping us into the people we were meant to be. And just as a river never stays the same, our love was always changing, adapting to the currents of life, yet remaining strong and true.", token_ids=[791, 5133, 574, 1093, 264, 15140, 11, 15320, 36612, 323, 32931, 11, 1202, 60701, 15691, 603, 3235, 389, 264, 11879, 315, 33834, 323, 40291, 13, 2468, 3115, 11, 279, 21160, 1051, 19858, 323, 26733, 11, 449, 279, 7160, 49025, 1523, 5304, 603, 11, 24808, 1057, 6930, 323, 21973, 1057, 23492, 449, 16267, 13, 1226, 1053, 2273, 69704, 11, 1057, 3021, 7982, 16643, 449, 1855, 12579, 1938, 11, 1057, 11049, 5655, 6147, 1093, 279, 15140, 2788, 382, 4071, 1243, 11, 2085, 10163, 11, 279, 21160, 1053, 81969, 323, 87460, 11, 83321, 323, 50235, 13, 578, 7477, 3447, 1053, 26251, 603, 922, 11, 27903, 311, 2107, 2190, 1057, 2697, 15688, 315, 3021, 13, 578, 78724, 315, 279, 3090, 1053, 87968, 704, 1057, 24196, 11, 3339, 433, 2653, 311, 19570, 11, 323, 279, 27394, 315, 279, 43957, 1053, 2873, 311, 42276, 603, 4459, 13, 1226, 1053, 78264, 311, 1855, 1023, 11, 28495, 311, 4822, 264, 3733, 11, 439, 279, 15140, 436, 3359, 389, 11, 1202, 2410, 323, 64159, 22798, 382, 3112, 3686, 11, 1524, 304, 279, 35446, 315, 279, 63355, 11, 1070, 1051, 14269, 315, 2103, 2136, 11, 1405, 279, 3090, 1053, 19858, 323, 279, 7160, 1053, 1464, 1555, 279, 30614, 13, 1226, 1053, 1505, 13520, 387, 3939, 389, 264, 68539, 31284, 11, 39019, 719, 26259, 311, 617, 1903, 433, 1555, 279, 13766, 13, 1226, 1053, 1427, 1139, 1855, 1023, 596, 6548, 11, 323, 279, 3021, 584, 6222, 1053, 33505, 1093, 264, 52402, 11, 51346, 603, 1203, 1139, 279, 15140, 596, 6530, 382, 10156, 439, 264, 15140, 1841, 2396, 1202, 1853, 1555, 279, 18921, 11, 46620, 323, 64793, 14550, 279, 1917, 2212, 433, 11, 1057, 5133, 574, 15320, 4