 from the lean protein, healthy fats, and complex carbohydrates. The avocado adds a creamy texture and a boost of vitamins and minerals, while the mixed greens and cherry tomatoes provide a burst of freshness and flavor. Enjoy!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 4382, 323, 78216, 16163, 11363, 430, 499, 2643, 4774, 1473, 334, 6600, 4473, 34619, 323, 7671, 47282, 43287, 57277, 334, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 16, 57277, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 17685, 1752, 11, 6930, 1752, 16553, 17659, 198, 9, 220, 16, 57796, 68346, 11, 48715, 198, 9, 220, 16, 4459, 34153, 16831, 6374, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 9709, 52011, 320, 28163, 10743, 11, 68798, 11, 802, 773, 5724, 340, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 41980, 41613, 11, 15104, 2111, 198, 9, 220, 16, 62611, 2854, 38827, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 12536, 25, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 1589, 26902, 282, 1955, 17604, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5075, 20559, 264, 40158, 477, 40158, 7363, 311, 11298, 28661, 8798, 13, 14598, 279, 16553, 17659, 449, 12290, 323, 25349, 13, 50948, 369, 220, 20, 12, 21, 4520, 824, 3185, 11, 477, 3156, 30205, 1555, 13, 6914, 433, 2800, 369, 264, 2478, 4520, 1603, 86015, 627, 17, 13, 763, 264, 2678, 19763, 11, 9041, 279, 2854, 38827, 389, 832, 4376, 315, 279, 16831, 6374, 627, 18, 13, 2758, 279, 48715, 68346, 11, 9709, 52011, 11, 41980, 41613, 11, 323, 48715, 61733, 16553, 389, 1948, 315, 279, 2854, 38827, 627, 19, 13, 15883, 36244, 449, 282, 1955, 17604, 422, 1701, 627, 20, 13, 61573, 279, 16831, 6374, 304, 4376, 311, 3289, 1497, 279, 21973, 627, 21, 13, 20223, 304, 4376, 323, 8854, 7214, 382, 334, 79570, 37842, 8245, 320, 49153, 3509, 1680, 57277, 9, 84037, 25, 220, 12819, 198, 9, 49475, 25, 220, 1272, 70, 198, 9, 26417, 25, 220, 1187, 70, 198, 9, 328, 35467, 26417, 25, 220, 19, 70, 198, 9, 3341, 34658, 988, 25, 220, 508, 70, 198, 9, 54727, 25, 220, 605, 70, 198, 9, 83541, 25, 220, 5154, 12591, 271, 2028, 11363, 374, 539, 1193, 18406, 11, 719, 433, 596, 1101, 19937, 449, 37493, 50