Output~2025-04-07 00:38:43.815956: [RequestOutput(request_id=1391, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Give advice to a friend whose pet just died ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 21335, 9650, 311, 264, 4333, 6832, 6896, 1120, 8636, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="I'm so sorry to hear about the loss of your pet. Losing a beloved companion can be incredibly difficult and painful. Here are some words of advice that may help you navigate this tough time:\n\nFirstly, allow yourself to grieve. It's okay to feel sad, angry, or overwhelmed. Your pet was a member of your family, and it's natural to mourn their passing. Don't put a timeline on your grief; it's a process that takes time, and it's essential to acknowledge and accept your emotions.\n\nTake care of yourself during this time. Make sure you're getting enough rest, eating well, and staying hydrated. Engage in activities that bring you comfort and joy, whether it's spending time with loved ones, practicing yoga, or watching your favorite movie. Remember to prioritize self-care and be kind to yourself.\n\nIt's also important to remember the good times you shared with your pet. Think about the happy moments, the laughter, and the memories you created together. Celebrate their life and the impact they had on yours. You can do this by looking at old photos, watching videos, or sharing stories with friends and family.\n\nConsider reaching out to a trusted friend, family member, or pet loss support group for emotional support. Sharing your feelings with others who have experienced a similar loss can be incredibly comforting and help you feel less alone.\n\nLastly, remember that it's okay to find ways to honor your pet's memory. This could be as simple as planting a tree, creating a memory box, or making a donation to an animal welfare organization in their name. These gestures can help you feel more connected to your pet and provide a sense of closure.\n\nRemember, time may heal the pain of your loss, but it's essential to be patient and kind to yourself throughout the process. You're not alone, and your pet will always be with you in your heart.", token_ids=[40, 2846, 779, 14931, 311, 6865, 922, 279, 4814, 315, 701, 6896, 13, 99239, 264, 28530, 22489, 649, 387, 17235, 5107, 323, 26175, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 4339, 315, 9650, 430, 1253, 1520, 499, 21546, 420, 11292, 892, 1473, 5451, 398, 11, 2187, 6261, 311, 342, 46104, 13, 1102, 596, 17339, 311, 2733, 12703, 11, 19021, 11, 477, 43206, 13, 4718, 6896, 574, 264, 4562, 315, 701, 3070, 11, 323, 433, 596, 5933, 311, 60234, 872, 12579, 13, 4418, 956, 2231, 264, 25845, 389, 701, 38384, 26, 433, 596, 264, 1920, 430, 5097, 892, 11, 323, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 25670, 323, 4287, 701, 21958, 382, 18293, 2512, 315, 6261, 2391, 420, 892, 13, 7557, 2771, 499, 2351, 3794, 3403, 2800, 11, 12459, 1664, 11, 323, 19994, 95831, 13, 3365, 425, 304, 7640, 430, 4546, 499, 6981, 323, 16267, 11, 3508, 433, 596, 10374, 892, 449, 10456, 6305, 11, 36666, 27102, 11, 477, 10307, 701, 7075, 5818, 13, 20474, 311, 63652, 659, 41206, 323, 387, 3169, 311, 6261, 382, 2181, 596, 1101, 3062, 311, 6227, 279, 1695, 3115, 499, 6222, 449, 701, 6896, 13, 21834, 922, 279, 6380, 14269, 11, 279, 43214, 11, 323, 279, 19459, 499, 3549, 3871, 13, 33292, 349, 872, 2324, 323, 279, 5536, 814, 1047, 389, 18821, 13, 1472, 649, 656, 420, 555, 3411, 520, 2362, 7397, 11, 10307, 6946, 11, 477, 11821, 7493, 449, 4885, 323, 3070, 382, 38275, 19261, 704, 311, 264, 22542, 4333