pression.\n* "Homage to Catalonia" (1938), a non-fiction book that recounts Orwell\'s experiences fighting in the Spanish Civil War.\n\nOrwell\'s writing style is known for its clarity, simplicity, and directness, and his works have been translated into many languages and have sold millions of copies worldwide. He is widely regarded as a classic author of 20th-century literature, and his works continue to be widely read and studied today.', token_ids=[40052, 83853, 574, 264, 8013, 3229, 11, 23672, 11, 323, 9940, 889, 374, 1888, 3967, 369, 813, 69110, 48748, 11775, 330, 3753, 19, 1, 323, 813, 7179, 70848, 6747, 6985, 330, 42515, 18945, 3343, 1283, 574, 9405, 16645, 28686, 42969, 389, 5651, 220, 914, 11, 220, 7028, 18, 11, 304, 19514, 7141, 2850, 11, 93374, 11, 8013, 6890, 11, 323, 8636, 389, 6186, 220, 1691, 11, 220, 6280, 15, 11, 304, 7295, 11, 9635, 382, 2244, 9336, 374, 13882, 27458, 439, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 32549, 16483, 315, 279, 220, 508, 339, 9478, 11, 323, 813, 4375, 527, 3967, 369, 872, 3463, 10039, 85, 10979, 323, 3629, 9200, 31710, 389, 11759, 11, 8396, 11, 323, 3823, 7138, 13, 5414, 4477, 3629, 36131, 22100, 315, 90364, 2191, 11, 52988, 11, 323, 279, 37064, 315, 3109, 2585, 927, 3927, 11542, 382, 2244, 9336, 596, 1455, 11495, 4375, 2997, 1473, 9, 330, 3753, 19, 1, 320, 6393, 24, 705, 264, 69110, 48748, 11775, 430, 62991, 264, 90364, 3938, 8396, 1405, 279, 3109, 23783, 2860, 2585, 927, 1202, 10495, 627, 9, 330, 42515, 18945, 1, 320, 6393, 20, 705, 459, 7179, 70848, 6747, 6985, 430, 10975, 279, 3446, 315, 264, 1912, 315, 8961, 10099, 889, 36417, 2403, 872, 3823, 90838, 1105, 11, 1193, 311, 3719, 50500, 555, 279, 2410, 814, 8895, 627, 9, 330, 791, 9728, 311, 468, 11118, 21377, 1, 320, 7285, 22, 705, 264, 2536, 74531, 2363, 430, 27076, 4440, 83853, 596, 11704, 21646, 1555, 279, 10411, 315, 9635, 323, 24919, 279, 6439, 315, 3318, 15144, 1274, 2391, 279, 8681, 46904, 627, 9, 330, 50742, 425, 311, 96952, 1, 320, 7285, 23, 705, 264, 2536, 74531, 2363, 430, 95889