Output~2025-04-07 00:40:11.715774: [RequestOutput(request_id=1430, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a list of five questions people should ask themselves to help set goals for the following year. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 1160, 315, 4330, 4860, 1274, 1288, 2610, 5694, 311, 1520, 743, 9021, 369, 279, 2768, 1060, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are five questions people can ask themselves to help set goals for the upcoming year:\n\n1. **What are my core values and priorities?** Take some time to reflect on what matters most to you in life, such as family, career, health, relationships, personal growth, or financial stability. This will help you identify what you want to focus on in the coming year.\n\n2. **What did I accomplish last year that I'm proud of?** Reflecting on your past achievements can help you identify patterns, strengths, and areas where you've made progress. This can also give you a sense of confidence and motivation to build on those successes.\n\n3. **What are the things that drain my energy and stress me out?** Identify the things that cause you unnecessary stress, anxiety, or frustration. This could be a specific task, person, or situation. By acknowledging these areas, you can start to develop strategies to minimize their impact or eliminate them altogether.\n\n4. **What are the things I've been putting off or procrastinating on?** Be honest with yourself about the tasks, projects, or decisions you've been avoiding. Write them down and consider breaking them down into smaller, manageable steps to make them feel less overwhelming.\n\n5. **What are the things I want to learn, experience, or achieve in the next year?** Think about what you want to accomplish in the coming year, whether it's learning a new skill, traveling, starting a new business, or improving your physical or mental health. Make sure your goals are specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound (SMART) to increase your chances of success.\n\nBy asking yourself these questions, you'll be able to clarify your priorities, identify areas for improvement, and set goals that align with your values and aspirations.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 4860, 1274, 649, 2610, 5694, 311, 1520, 743, 9021, 369, 279, 14827, 1060, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 3923, 527, 856, 6332, 2819, 323, 30601, 30, 334, 12040, 1063, 892, 311, 8881, 389, 1148, 13146, 1455, 311, 499, 304, 2324, 11, 1778, 439, 3070, 11, 7076, 11, 2890, 11, 12135, 11, 4443, 6650, 11, 477, 6020, 20334, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 10765, 1148, 499, 1390, 311, 5357, 389, 304, 279, 5108, 1060, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 3923, 1550, 358, 22829, 1566, 1060, 430, 358, 2846, 12691, 315, 30, 334, 35698, 287, 389, 701, 3347, 33997, 649, 1520, 499, 10765, 12912, 11, 36486, 11, 323, 5789, 1405, 499, 3077, 1903, 5208, 13, 1115, 649, 1101, 3041, 499, 264, 5647, 315, 12410, 323, 25835, 311, 1977, 389, 1884, 48188, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 3923, 527, 279, 2574, 430, 24659, 856, 4907, 323, 8631, 757, 704, 30, 334, 65647, 279, 2574, 430, 5353, 499, 26225, 8631, 11, 18547, 11, 477, 33086, 13, 1115, 1436, 387, 264, 3230, 3465, 11, 1732, 11, 477, 6671, 13, 3296, 61708, 1521, 5789, 11, 499, 649, 1212, 311, 2274, 15174, 311, 30437, 872, 5536, 477, 22472, 1124, 31155, 382, 19, 13, 3146, 3923, 527, 279, 2574, 358, 3077, 1027, 10917, 1022, 477, 97544, 16252, 389, 30, 334, 2893, 10978, 449, 6261, 922, 279, 9256, 11, 7224, 11, 477, 11429, 499, 3077, 1027, 31526, 13, 9842, 1124, 15