nalogy is comparing the effect of throwing a pebble in a pond to the impact of a small action or idea on a larger scale. The ripples in the water represent how a small action can have far-reaching consequences, just as the pebble\'s impact can be felt across the entire pond.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 1988, 11, 358, 3077, 11054, 1403, 24291, 552, 505, 279, 2728, 1495, 1473, 16, 13, 330, 2127, 56203, 43565, 832, 3245, 311, 2500, 304, 2015, 311, 1520, 10552, 433, 2266, 2028, 56203, 374, 27393, 279, 1920, 315, 26073, 2555, 320, 884, 45252, 832, 3245, 311, 2500, 8, 311, 264, 3230, 1957, 320, 7265, 287, 264, 1069, 60980, 304, 264, 36670, 570, 578, 4623, 374, 430, 1120, 439, 264, 2678, 1069, 60980, 649, 1893, 436, 51660, 304, 279, 3090, 11, 264, 2678, 4623, 477, 7434, 649, 617, 264, 5199, 5536, 994, 11497, 304, 264, 1648, 430, 8779, 3885, 3619, 433, 382, 17, 13, 330, 2181, 596, 1093, 21939, 264, 1069, 60980, 304, 264, 36670, 25, 279, 436, 51660, 315, 279, 3090, 1501, 1268, 2555, 2678, 649, 7958, 264, 1790, 8294, 3158, 2266, 2028, 56203, 374, 27393, 279, 2515, 315, 21939, 264, 1069, 60980, 304, 264, 36670, 311, 279, 5536, 315, 264, 2678, 1957, 477, 4623, 389, 264, 8294, 5569, 13, 578, 436, 51660, 304, 279, 3090, 4097, 1268, 264, 2678, 1957, 649, 617, 3117, 87248, 16296, 11, 1120, 439, 279, 1069, 60980, 596, 5536, 649, 387, 6612, 4028, 279, 4553, 36670, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
