oku, chess, or other puzzles and brain teasers.\n11. **Indoor gardening**: Plant and care for indoor plants, and enjoy the benefits of having greenery in your home.\n12. **Language learning**: Use online resources or language learning apps to learn a new language and improve your communication skills.\n13. **Board games or card games**: Play solo or with friends and family, and enjoy the social and competitive aspects of board games and card games.\n14. **Dancing**: Practice dance moves, watch dance tutorials, or take online dance classes, and improve your coordination and rhythm.\n15. **Watching movies or TV shows**: Catch up on your favorite shows, discover new series, or watch classic films and documentaries.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many hobbies that can be done indoors. You can always find something that suits your interests and preferences!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 64405, 430, 649, 387, 2884, 55154, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 32999, 96618, 2175, 5675, 304, 264, 2363, 11, 4652, 11, 477, 20303, 2363, 323, 13488, 502, 24800, 323, 7493, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 38, 6605, 96618, 7199, 2835, 3953, 389, 264, 2393, 11, 6500, 11, 477, 6505, 3756, 11, 323, 8815, 6261, 477, 20874, 449, 3885, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 59482, 287, 477, 28915, 96618, 9934, 704, 502, 19141, 11, 9526, 449, 32523, 323, 14293, 11, 323, 1893, 18406, 21644, 323, 32839, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 18590, 287, 477, 13633, 96618, 17855, 6261, 93396, 1555, 1989, 11, 1701, 5370, 98912, 1093, 3090, 21712, 11, 59741, 82, 11, 477, 7528, 13633, 7526, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 25099, 96618, 15281, 311, 1514, 459, 14473, 11, 7936, 11, 477, 31435, 4731, 11, 323, 1893, 701, 1866, 11936, 477, 14861, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 56, 14361, 477, 33862, 96618, 28082, 71705, 11, 43685, 11, 323, 25152, 1555, 5370, 27102, 34103, 323, 33862, 12823, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 40413, 96618, 9842, 7493, 11, 32349, 11, 477, 8486, 10925, 11, 323, 13488, 701, 11782, 4477, 7512, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 53304, 5814, 96618, 12040, 7397, 315, 6302, 11, 12