 power of storytelling. Released in 2020, this book is a stunning exploration of the power of imagination and the boundaries of reality.\n\nBoth of these books offer unique and thought-provoking takes on the science fiction genre, and are sure to captivate readers who enjoy exploring the possibilities of the universe and the human experience.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 5699, 315, 10170, 43754, 11, 358, 4265, 1093, 311, 7079, 1403, 6603, 430, 617, 1027, 6004, 304, 279, 3347, 1060, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 8155, 39616, 37164, 1, 555, 6941, 57104, 96618, 1115, 11775, 374, 264, 81291, 8198, 17422, 54461, 430, 41424, 279, 16296, 315, 22706, 596, 54180, 389, 3634, 27501, 13, 578, 3446, 11263, 264, 4846, 47733, 889, 374, 3288, 389, 264, 9131, 311, 19874, 264, 26454, 64048, 389, 279, 18266, 11, 1193, 311, 7142, 264, 6453, 6367, 430, 48926, 279, 3938, 315, 22706, 13, 45894, 304, 220, 2366, 15, 11, 420, 2363, 374, 264, 2011, 29906, 369, 7359, 315, 8198, 17422, 323, 3634, 27501, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 1, 791, 18165, 75453, 50717, 315, 6186, 1, 555, 14925, 87, 469, 13, 5340, 654, 96618, 1115, 32719, 5439, 11775, 374, 264, 20955, 315, 8198, 17422, 11, 18884, 11, 323, 13970, 17422, 13, 1102, 10975, 279, 3446, 315, 264, 3995, 5333, 889, 52114, 264, 26454, 2363, 430, 11767, 1077, 311, 25631, 24800, 323, 88244, 13, 1666, 1364, 34512, 988, 1521, 502, 50446, 11, 1364, 21482, 9146, 24511, 922, 1077, 1866, 3347, 323, 279, 2410, 315, 48929, 13, 45894, 304, 220, 2366, 15, 11, 420, 2363, 374, 264, 20441, 27501, 315, 279, 2410, 315, 28899, 323, 279, 23546, 315, 8903, 382, 21279, 315, 1521, 6603, 3085, 5016, 323, 3463, 10039, 85, 10979, 5097, 389, 279, 8198, 17422, 17779, 11, 323, 527, 2771, 311, 6563, 736, 13016, 889, 4774, 24919, 279, 24525, 315, 279, 15861, 323, 279, 3823, 3217, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
