splashed and played in the waves, Bob whinnied with delight, enjoying the show.\n\nAs the day wore on, Kevin and Bob decided to take a break and find some shade under a nearby palm tree. Kevin was fascinated by the way the palm fronds rustled in the breeze, while Bob was more interested in the interesting smells wafting from the nearby beachside snacks.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Kevin and Bob settled in for a relaxing evening on the beach. They watched the stars twinkling to life in the night sky, and Kevin even tried to imitate the sound of the crickets with his own lobster chirps. Bob, feeling a bit sleepy, nuzzled his friend and drifted off to sleep, lulled by the sound of the waves and the warmth of the setting sun.", token_ids=[2170, 279, 7160, 16392, 927, 279, 35174, 11, 16768, 279, 80815, 323, 14596, 279, 15580, 11721, 520, 279, 11573, 11, 24450, 311, 1212, 872, 20769, 13, 16768, 11, 1694, 264, 80815, 11, 574, 12304, 311, 2733, 279, 8369, 9462, 1990, 813, 68550, 323, 279, 7155, 18435, 46385, 304, 813, 72577, 6043, 13, 14596, 11, 1694, 264, 15580, 11, 574, 3411, 4741, 311, 15730, 385, 10194, 3235, 279, 99164, 323, 8430, 279, 10160, 304, 813, 53460, 382, 2170, 814, 1903, 872, 1648, 1523, 311, 279, 3090, 596, 6964, 11, 16768, 7846, 956, 1520, 719, 5406, 279, 13057, 506, 95519, 315, 279, 18435, 42949, 704, 1603, 1461, 13, 1283, 1047, 2646, 3970, 779, 1790, 3090, 304, 813, 2324, 0, 14596, 11, 389, 279, 1023, 1450, 11, 574, 61914, 555, 279, 5222, 315, 279, 17301, 46574, 2403, 279, 31284, 382, 6153, 264, 1418, 11, 16768, 6773, 311, 1935, 264, 24522, 304, 279, 18435, 11, 15884, 3339, 813, 1648, 1139, 279, 3090, 311, 5766, 3794, 2288, 3345, 311, 279, 7479, 13, 14596, 11, 539, 19762, 311, 636, 813, 11640, 10296, 14739, 11, 41867, 311, 4822, 389, 279, 11573, 323, 3821, 813, 4333, 16587, 13, 1666, 16768, 12786, 13883, 323, 6476, 304, 279, 17301, 11, 14596, 421, 6258, 1142, 449, 18454, 11, 22128, 279, 1501, 382, 2170, 279, 1938, 28670, 389, 11, 16768, 323, 14596, 6773, 