Output~2025-04-07 00:45:30.055523: [RequestOutput(request_id=1565, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Tell an anecdote based on the given context ### Input: A visit to the zoo ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 25672, 459, 50750, 1295, 3196, 389, 279, 2728, 2317, 17010, 5688, 25, 362, 4034, 311, 279, 42014, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='I remember the day my family and I visited the zoo like it was yesterday. It was a sunny Saturday morning, and we were all excited to spend the day exploring the various exhibits and seeing the amazing animals up close. As we walked through the entrance, my younger brother, who was 6 at the time, was bubbling with excitement, asking "Can we see the monkeys? Can we see the monkeys?" over and over again.\n\nWe made our way to the primate exhibit, and as we approached the enclosure, my brother\'s eyes widened in awe. There, swinging from tree to tree, were a troop of capuchin monkeys. They were so agile and playful, and my brother was mesmerized. He stood there for what felt like hours, watching them with a huge grin on his face.\n\nAs we continued our tour of the zoo, we came across a sea lion exhibit. My brother was a bit hesitant at first, but as we got closer, he started to get more and more excited. The sea lions were swimming and playing in the water, and my brother couldn\'t resist the urge to try and imitate them. He started making "splash" sounds and flapping his arms like a sea lion, much to the amusement of the other visitors around us.\n\nAs the day went on, we saw so many amazing animals, from the majestic lions to the colorful birds. But it was my brother\'s antics at the sea lion exhibit that really made the day special. It was a reminder that sometimes the best memories are the ones that are a little silly and unexpected. And as we left the zoo that day, my brother turned to me and said, "Best. Day. Ever!"', token_ids=[40, 6227, 279, 1938, 856, 3070, 323, 358, 12263, 279, 42014, 1093, 433, 574, 13985, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 40798, 7884, 6693, 11, 323, 584, 1051, 682, 12304, 311, 8493, 279, 1938, 24919, 279, 5370, 50829, 323, 9298, 279, 8056, 10099, 709, 3345, 13, 1666, 584, 15203, 1555, 279, 20396, 11, 856, 14992, 10868, 11, 889, 574, 220, 21, 520, 279, 892, 11, 574, 78869, 9894, 449, 28361, 11, 10371, 330, 6854, 584, 1518, 279, 61820, 30, 3053, 584, 1518, 279, 61820, 7673, 927, 323, 927, 1578, 382, 1687, 1903, 1057, 1648, 311, 279, 550, 3509, 31324, 11, 323, 439, 584, 25735, 279, 58912, 11, 856, 10868, 596, 6548, 86988, 304, 51517, 13, 2684, 11, 55060, 505, 5021, 311, 5021, 11, 1051, 264, 71816, 315, 2107, 1412, 258, 61820, 13, 2435, 1051, 779, 62565, 323, 57169, 11, 323, 856, 10868, 574, 84461, 1534, 13, 1283, 14980, 1070, 369, 1148, 6612, 1093, 4207, 11, 10307, 1124, 449, 264, 6908, 59380, 389, 813, 3663, 382, 2170, 584, 8738, 1057, 7364, 315, 279, 42014, 11, 584, 3782, 4028, 264, 9581, 40132, 31324, 13, 3092, 10868, 574, 264, 2766, 71560, 520, 1176, 11, 719, 439, 584, 2751, 12401, 11, 568, 3940, 311, 636, 810, 323, 810, 12304, 13, 578, 9581, 69132, 1051, 24269, 323, 5737, 304, 279, 3090, 11, 323, 856, 10868, 7846, 956, 22884, 279, 33147, 311, 1456, 323, 737, 20227, 1124, 13, 1283, 3940, 3339, 330, 49732, 1, 10578, 323, 1344, 3713, 813, 11977, 1093, 264, 9581, 40132, 11, 1790, 311, 279, 62468, 315, 279, 1023, 15613, 2212, 603, 382, 2170, 279, 1938, 4024, 389, 