Output~2025-04-07 00:46:14.001983: [RequestOutput(request_id=1589, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What are the three most essential foods to store in an emergency? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 527, 279, 2380, 1455, 7718, 15657, 311, 3637, 304, 459, 13147, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="When it comes to preparing for an emergency, having a well-stocked pantry with non-perishable foods can be a lifesaver. Here are the three most essential foods to store in an emergency:\n\n1. **Canned Goods**: Canned foods are a great option for emergency storage because they are non-perishable, lightweight, and can be stored for a long time. Some essential canned goods to stock up on include:\n\t* Canned vegetables (beans, corn, peas, carrots)\n\t* Canned fruits (peaches, pears, mandarin oranges)\n\t* Canned meats (tuna, chicken, beef stew)\n\t* Canned soups and broths\n2. **Dried Goods**: Dried foods are another great option for emergency storage because they are lightweight, compact, and can be stored for a long time. Some essential dried goods to stock up on include:\n\t* Dried fruits (raisins, apricots, prunes)\n\t* Dried legumes (beans, lentils, chickpeas)\n\t* Dried grains (rice, pasta, oats)\n\t* Instant coffee and tea\n3. **Energy-Rich Foods**: Energy-rich foods are essential for emergency situations because they provide a quick and easy source of sustenance. Some essential energy-rich foods to stock up on include:\n\t* Peanut butter\n\t* Canned or dried nuts (almonds, walnuts, cashews)\n\t* Dried fruit leather or fruit roll-ups\n\t* Energy bars\n\nRemember to always check the expiration dates of your stored foods and replace them as needed. It's also a good idea to store your emergency food supplies in a cool, dry place and to have a manual can opener on hand.", token_ids=[4599, 433, 4131, 311, 20646, 369, 459, 13147, 11, 3515, 264, 1664, 5594, 68485, 69357, 449, 2536, 17453, 819, 481, 15657, 649, 387, 264, 49785, 7403, 13, 5810, 527, 279, 2380, 1455, 7718, 15657, 311, 3637, 304, 459, 13147, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 34, 7443, 42695, 96618, 356, 7443, 15657, 527, 264, 2294, 3072, 369, 13147, 5942, 1606, 814, 527, 2536, 17453, 819, 481, 11, 30244, 11, 323, 649, 387, 9967, 369, 264, 1317, 892, 13, 4427, 7718, 64114, 11822, 311, 5708, 709, 389, 2997, 512, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 24822, 320, 28440, 11, 14095, 11, 47136, 11, 62517, 340, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 26390, 320, 375, 14576, 11, 281, 7596, 11, 11837, 43840, 85138, 340, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 63875, 320, 83, 8733, 11, 16553, 11, 25309, 61443, 340, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 5945, 1725, 323, 2967, 17323, 198, 17, 13, 3146, 35, 4588, 42695, 96618, 423, 4588, 15657, 527, 2500, 2294, 3072, 369, 13147, 5942, 1606, 814, 527, 30244, 11, 17251, 11, 323, 649, 387, 9967, 369, 264, 1317, 892, 13, 4427, 7718, 32720, 11822, 311, 5708, 709, 389, 2997, 512, 197, 9, 423, 4588, 26390, 320, 41098, 1354, 11, 21726, 292, 2469, 11, 550, 8699, 340, 197, 9, 423, 4588, 2531, 19131, 320, 28440, 11, 48907, 8839, 11, 31863, 375, 300, 340, 197, 9, 423, 4588, 41936, 320, 23994, 11, 37547, 11, 85270, 340, 197, 9, 18549, 11033, 323, 15600, 198, 18, 13, 3146, 33775, 11151, 718, 40160, 96618, 12634, 41947, 15657, 527, 7718, 369, 13147, 15082, 1606, 814, 3493, 264, 4062, 323, 4228, 2592, 315, 10446, 10431, 13, 4427, 7718, 4907, 41947, 15657, 311, 5708, 709, 389, 2997, 512, 197, 9, 94044, 14432, 198, 197, 9, 356, 7443, 477, 32720, 31049, 320, 278, 55720, 11, 41926, 64866, 11, 8515, 28844, 340, 197, 9, 42