ocolate Lava Cake with Vanilla Ice Cream: Rich, gooey chocolate lava cake served warm with a scoop of creamy vanilla ice cream.\n* Fresh Fruit Tart with Whipped Cream: A sweet and tangy mix of fresh berries atop a buttery pastry crust, topped with a dollop of whipped cream.\n\n**Beverages**\n\n* Signature Cocktail: "Summer Sunset" - a refreshing mix of gin, peach puree, lemon juice, and sparkling water, garnished with a slice of peach and a sprig of mint.\n* Wine Pairings: A selection of white, red, and sparkling wines available to complement each course.\n\nThis menu offers a variety of flavors and textures, and can be adjusted to accommodate any dietary restrictions or preferences. Bon appétit!', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 14177, 5130, 24710, 369, 264, 14177, 4717, 1473, 334, 3563, 388, 57277, 9, 2895, 4473, 64695, 323, 1676, 773, 5724, 64646, 449, 1322, 54927, 56572, 323, 87284, 460, 45419, 25, 362, 37018, 7474, 53161, 33566, 16850, 61733, 1069, 14576, 11, 83804, 727, 802, 773, 5724, 11, 73624, 463, 54927, 56572, 11, 323, 47985, 7951, 81, 460, 17604, 11, 26435, 449, 264, 293, 1147, 4079, 348, 2259, 343, 68028, 627, 9, 1283, 404, 18981, 94091, 3320, 52178, 27625, 25, 30260, 51543, 18981, 41613, 11, 68186, 11, 31735, 11, 323, 4647, 96982, 17604, 47088, 93972, 9145, 84, 6672, 35354, 11, 1377, 8934, 839, 449, 33213, 5707, 323, 293, 1147, 4079, 2840, 10033, 382, 334, 6334, 17026, 57277, 9, 2895, 4473, 2958, 83, 386, 62799, 449, 12093, 15386, 95825, 386, 13883, 14020, 20798, 323, 6031, 641, 95894, 25, 94967, 1052, 83, 296, 62799, 61733, 311, 39143, 11, 10434, 449, 47985, 54662, 31735, 96234, 35267, 323, 4179, 3690, 2967, 641, 95894, 627, 9, 11233, 98628, 1636, 62826, 449, 52310, 31457, 323, 6385, 1302, 25, 30260, 41420, 1488, 1169, 513, 1636, 311, 264, 73624, 40712, 11, 10434, 449, 264, 1167, 41339, 30564, 14432, 19737, 323, 264, 85947, 315, 7878, 42393, 382, 334, 50, 3422, 57277, 9, 12093, 15386, 1666, 94789, 449, 56744, 63524, 45419, 25, 30260, 439, 94789, 54662, 311