Output~2025-04-07 00:48:38.132654: [RequestOutput(request_id=1636, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List some diseases caused by smoking. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 1063, 19338, 9057, 555, 20149, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a list of some diseases caused by smoking:\n\n1. Lung Cancer: Smoking is the leading cause of lung cancer and is responsible for about 80-90% of all lung cancer deaths.\n2. Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD): Smoking damages the lungs and can cause COPD, a progressive lung disease that makes it difficult to breathe.\n3. Heart Disease: Smoking damages the cardiovascular system and increases the risk of heart disease, heart attacks, and strokes.\n4. Chronic Bronchitis: Smoking can cause chronic bronchitis, a condition that inflames and narrows the airways, making it difficult to breathe.\n5. Emphysema: Smoking can cause emphysema, a condition that damages the air sacs in the lungs, making it difficult to breathe.\n6. Pneumonia: Smoking weakens the immune system and increases the risk of pneumonia, a serious infection that inflames the air sacs in the lungs.\n7. Cervical Cancer: Smoking is a major risk factor for cervical cancer, particularly in women.\n8. Pancreatic Cancer: Smoking is a risk factor for pancreatic cancer, which is a serious and often deadly disease.\n9. Kidney Cancer: Smoking is a risk factor for kidney cancer, which is a type of cancer that affects the kidneys.\n10. Bladder Cancer: Smoking is a risk factor for bladder cancer, which is a type of cancer that affects the bladder.\n11. Osteoporosis: Smoking can increase the risk of osteoporosis, a condition that weakens the bones and increases the risk of fractures.\n12. Rheumatoid Arthritis: Smoking can increase the risk of rheumatoid arthritis, a condition that causes inflammation and pain in the joints.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many diseases caused by smoking. Quitting smoking can significantly reduce the risk of developing these diseases and improve overall health.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 1063, 19338, 9057, 555, 20149, 1473, 16, 13, 78336, 26211, 25, 73699, 374, 279, 6522, 5353, 315, 21271, 9572, 323, 374, 8647, 369, 922, 220, 1490, 12, 1954, 4, 315, 682, 21271, 9572, 16779, 627, 17, 13, 73782, 4761, 1257, 535, 35962, 55892, 31974, 320, 34, 3143, 35, 1680, 73699, 26186, 279, 45274, 323, 649, 5353, 68672, 35, 11, 264, 23053, 21271, 8624, 430, 3727, 433, 5107, 311, 37397, 627, 18, 13, 18449, 31974, 25, 73699, 26186, 279, 41713, 1887, 323, 12992, 279, 5326, 315, 4851, 8624, 11, 4851, 8951, 11, 323, 53572, 627, 19, 13, 73782, 20407, 331, 20000, 25, 73699, 649, 5353, 21249, 31071, 331, 20000, 11, 264, 3044, 430, 4704, 986, 323, 44669, 1849, 279, 3805, 2336, 11, 3339, 433, 5107, 311, 37397, 627, 20, 13, 5867, 12989, 325, 1764, 25, 73699, 649, 5353, 991, 12989, 325, 1764, 11, 264, 3044, 430, 26186, 279, 3805, 11347, 82, 304, 279, 45274, 11, 3339, 433, 5107, 311, 37397, 627, 21, 13, 393, 126261, 21947, 25, 73699, 7621, 729, 279, 22852, 1887, 323, 12992, 279, 5326, 315, 69329, 11, 264, 6129, 19405, 430, 4704, 986, 279, 3805, 11347, 82, 304, 279, 45274, 627, 22, 13, 356, 651, 950, 26211, 25, 73699, 374, 264, 3682, 5326, 8331, 369, 67827, 9572, 11, 8104, 304, 3278, 627, 23, 13, 11233, 846, 780, 26211, 25, 73699, 374, 264, 5326, 8331, 369, 98144, 9572, 11, 902, 374, 264, 6129, 323, 3629, 25114, 8624, 627, 24, 13, 32666, 3520, 26211, 25, 73699, 374, 264, 5326, 833