y of light and shadow, the soft focus of the colors, and the sense of movement and energy that seems to emanate from the very heart of the painting. "Whispers of Morning" is a masterpiece of Impressionist technique, a celebration of the beauty and wonder of the natural world at its most serene and peaceful.', token_ids=[1, 1671, 69935, 315, 29084, 1875, 791, 10247, 374, 264, 8579, 11, 8063, 88, 90409, 315, 44695, 323, 52011, 11, 3721, 10979, 279, 22443, 8770, 430, 38268, 505, 279, 9578, 520, 39493, 13, 34088, 267, 56137, 15612, 4028, 279, 7479, 11, 1172, 589, 727, 323, 3177, 11, 439, 422, 279, 1633, 28591, 315, 279, 6693, 67532, 706, 1027, 17439, 389, 279, 10247, 382, 644, 279, 40405, 11, 36301, 96740, 315, 18718, 323, 73188, 28572, 11, 1093, 279, 28682, 9662, 1103, 287, 315, 264, 23153, 13, 578, 8146, 527, 60121, 11, 3686, 34076, 11, 439, 422, 279, 6693, 7160, 706, 1120, 22088, 311, 33692, 927, 279, 35174, 11, 25146, 264, 8369, 37066, 927, 279, 6237, 382, 644, 279, 6138, 11, 279, 57827, 315, 264, 5021, 38268, 11, 1202, 23962, 1093, 704, 267, 62837, 11977, 56501, 279, 13180, 13, 578, 11141, 527, 264, 8579, 11, 1172, 589, 727, 6307, 11, 323, 279, 38411, 374, 264, 45652, 11, 9578, 88, 14198, 13, 578, 5021, 5084, 311, 387, 2064, 17718, 30373, 304, 279, 6693, 46385, 11, 439, 422, 433, 374, 35955, 287, 24511, 311, 279, 10160, 382, 791, 15998, 267, 56137, 527, 20784, 323, 78223, 11, 449, 12314, 13931, 315, 6308, 6968, 264, 74644, 11, 4661, 2380, 33520, 2515, 13, 578, 8244, 20247, 374, 832, 315, 1446, 56685, 323, 9096, 11, 439, 422, 279, 19354, 374, 264, 3321, 1139, 264, 68040, 6693, 1917, 11, 1405, 279, 34672, 315, 279, 1938, 617, 539, 3686, 22088, 311, 10805, 799, 382, 2170, 279, 8071, 29810, 388, 4028, 279, 10247, 11, 433, 374, 15107, 311, 279, 27545, 1514, 315, 3177, 323, 12737, 11, 279, 8579, 5357, 315, 279, 8146, 11, 323, 279, 5647, 315, 7351, 323, 4907, 430, 5084, 311, 69239, 349, 505, 279, 1633, 4851, 315, 279, 19354, 13, 330, 1671, 69935, 315, 29084, 1, 374, 264, 