r.\n\n"For Denmark\'s sake, I shall not rest,\nUntil the truth is told, and justice is best.\nAnd though my heart doth heavy lie,\nI shall not falter, nor my spirit die."\n\nHow\'s that? I hope it meets your expectations!', token_ids=[3923, 264, 50189, 3465, 0, 5810, 596, 264, 2092, 18536, 447, 88, 369, 9777, 1169, 304, 279, 1742, 315, 42482, 1473, 55005, 11, 63971, 25382, 11, 430, 656, 339, 9234, 295, 757, 8617, 345, 32, 42826, 315, 35440, 11, 21830, 364, 15930, 953, 83, 14523, 323, 68162, 627, 5159, 7126, 596, 20457, 11, 264, 9618, 261, 315, 279, 3347, 345, 5519, 339, 84758, 856, 1475, 48728, 3463, 11, 323, 690, 539, 1566, 382, 30233, 11734, 11, 264, 11734, 11, 358, 1097, 11, 3686, 539, 264, 11734, 345, 2520, 2410, 323, 16044, 11, 358, 656, 3412, 304, 13599, 627, 5159, 38594, 11, 62412, 9334, 11, 656, 339, 96188, 79, 279, 44721, 345, 3112, 449, 813, 4353, 613, 727, 11, 856, 4851, 656, 339, 520, 606, 382, 55005, 11, 1268, 279, 19459, 315, 856, 7126, 596, 4648, 345, 5519, 55413, 856, 13836, 11, 1093, 264, 16579, 17676, 49995, 6, 11745, 627, 791, 3463, 315, 1461, 11, 779, 2539, 315, 2324, 323, 3177, 345, 38766, 1523, 555, 4353, 613, 727, 11, 304, 279, 5710, 315, 3814, 382, 47016, 3686, 11, 358, 39666, 11, 264, 42826, 315, 10712, 345, 2520, 8850, 315, 4648, 11, 323, 8850, 315, 1148, 596, 311, 2586, 922, 627, 791, 54940, 315, 856, 3347, 11, 814, 35955, 304, 856, 2487, 345, 2173, 12437, 11, 16044, 11, 323, 279, 14523, 430, 358, 2011, 3412, 25237, 382, 42513, 8579, 11, 1148, 3177, 1555, 379, 14518, 3321, 18808, 5380, 32, 2840, 19519, 315, 3987, 11, 264, 6140, 311, 1304, 1097, 1438, 345, 1271, 1314, 279, 5076, 82, 315, 856, 7126, 596, 26242, 842, 627, 40, 4985, 1541, 279, 62494, 315, 52819, 11, 323, 35840, 345, 1271, 387, 264, 24931, 11, 264, 503, 5302, 11, 323, 264, 42826, 11, 912, 810, 345, 3112, 304, 279, 35612, 11, 358, 4985, 7234, 11, 323, 3197, 11, 323, 78724, 382, 57741, 35440, 596, 25491, 11, 358, 4985, 539, 2800, 345, 25503, 279, 8206, 374, 3309, 11, 323, 12437, 