 If you want to print the table up to a different number, you can modify the range of the outer loop accordingly.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 13325, 2082, 12569, 430, 24370, 704, 279, 47544, 2007, 709, 311, 220, 605, 512, 14196, 4077, 2000, 602, 304, 2134, 7, 16, 11, 220, 806, 997, 262, 369, 503, 304, 2134, 7, 16, 11, 220, 806, 997, 286, 1194, 968, 14461, 72, 92, 865, 314, 73, 92, 284, 314, 72, 55145, 14790, 262, 1194, 368, 220, 674, 1194, 264, 40127, 1306, 1855, 2872, 198, 14196, 4077, 2028, 2082, 5829, 1403, 24997, 30853, 311, 30729, 927, 279, 7123, 323, 8310, 315, 279, 47544, 2007, 13, 578, 16335, 6471, 5480, 988, 927, 279, 7123, 320, 72, 705, 323, 279, 9358, 6471, 5480, 988, 927, 279, 8310, 320, 73, 570, 578, 1595, 1374, 63, 5224, 4871, 279, 9358, 6471, 24370, 279, 47544, 1121, 315, 1595, 72, 63, 323, 1595, 73, 29687, 578, 1595, 69, 31981, 63, 37666, 374, 1511, 311, 1194, 279, 1121, 304, 264, 34898, 3645, 382, 4599, 499, 1629, 420, 2082, 11, 433, 690, 2612, 279, 2768, 47544, 2007, 512, 14196, 4077, 16, 865, 220, 16, 284, 220, 16, 198, 16, 865, 220, 17, 284, 220, 17, 198, 16, 865, 220, 18, 284, 220, 18, 198, 16, 865, 220, 19, 284, 220, 19, 198, 16, 865, 220, 20, 284, 220, 20, 198, 16, 865, 220, 21, 284, 220, 21, 198, 16, 865, 220, 22, 284, 220, 22, 198, 16, 865, 220, 23, 284, 220, 23, 198, 16, 865, 220, 24, 284, 220, 24, 198, 16, 865, 220, 605, 284, 220, 605, 271, 17, 865, 220, 16, 284, 220, 17, 198, 17, 865, 220, 17, 284, 220, 19, 198, 17, 865, 220, 18, 284, 220, 21, 198, 17, 865, 220, 19, 284, 220, 23, 198, 17, 865, 220, 20, 284, 220, 605, 198, 17, 865, 220, 21, 284, 220, 717, 198, 17, 865, 220, 22, 284, 220, 975, 198, 17, 865, 220, 23, 284, 220, 845, 198, 17, 865, 220, 24, 284, 220, 972, 198, 17, 865, 220, 605, 284, 220, 508, 271, 2195, 605, 865, 220, 16, 284, 220, 605, 198, 605, 865, 220, 17, 284, 220, 508, 198, 605, 865, 220, 18, 284, 220, 966, 198, 605, 865, 220, 19, 284, 220, 1272, 198, 605, 865, 220, 20, 284, 220, 1135, 198, 605, 865, 220, 21, 284, 220, 