Output~2025-04-07 00:50:27.484559: [RequestOutput(request_id=1675, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the colour palette of a traditional Japanese bedroom. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 12745, 27404, 315, 264, 8776, 11002, 14150, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='A traditional Japanese bedroom, also known as a "washitsu," typically features a serene and calming color palette that reflects the country\'s emphasis on simplicity, minimalism, and harmony with nature. The dominant colors used in a traditional Japanese bedroom are often a combination of natural hues that evoke a sense of tranquility and relaxation.\n\nThe primary colors used in a traditional Japanese bedroom are:\n\n1. Shoji (Soft White): A soft, creamy white color used for the walls, often with a subtle texture to give it a gentle, matte finish. This color helps to create a sense of calmness and serenity.\n2. Washi (Natural Beige): A warm, beige color used for the tatami mats, which cover the floor. This color is often used to create a sense of warmth and coziness in the room.\n3. Matsu (Moss Green): A soft, muted green color used for accents, such as the edges of the tatami mats or the trim on the shoji screens. This color is reminiscent of the natural surroundings of Japan and adds a touch of freshness to the room.\n4. Kuro (Deep Brown): A rich, dark brown color used for the furniture, such as the low-seating tables and chairs. This color adds warmth and depth to the room, while also providing a sense of grounding.\n5. Sakura (Soft Pink): A soft, pastel pink color used for accents, such as the edges of the futon or the trim on the shoji screens. This color is often used to add a touch of femininity and delicacy to the room.\n\nThe color palette of a traditional Japanese bedroom is designed to create a sense of harmony and balance, with each color working together to create a soothing and calming atmosphere. The use of natural materials, such as wood and paper, also adds to the sense of serenity and connection to nature.', token_ids=[32, 8776, 11002, 14150, 11, 1101, 3967, 439, 264, 330, 70545, 50657, 1359, 11383, 4519, 264, 95863, 323, 78729, 1933, 27404, 430, 27053, 279, 3224, 596, 25679, 389, 40075, 11, 17832, 2191, 11, 323, 26348, 449, 7138, 13, 578, 25462, 8146, 1511, 304, 264, 8776, 11002, 14150, 527, 3629, 264, 10824, 315, 5933, 82757, 430, 95263, 264, 5647, 315, 41664, 1429, 323, 43685, 382, 791, 6156, 8146, 1511, 304, 264, 8776, 11002, 14150, 527, 1473, 16, 13, 1443, 28000, 320, 31631, 5929, 1680, 362, 8579, 11, 47985, 4251, 1933, 1511, 369, 279, 14620, 11, 3629, 449, 264, 27545, 10651, 311, 3041, 433, 264, 22443, 11, 65257, 6381, 13, 1115, 1933, 8779, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 19858, 2136, 323, 1446, 56685, 627, 17, 13, 6113, 72, 320, 55381, 2893, 7404, 1680, 362, 8369, 11, 79365, 1933, 1511, 369, 279, 72813, 10830, 62156, 11, 902, 3504, 279, 6558, 13, 1115, 1933, 374, 3629, 1511, 311, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 41463, 323, 85920, 1918, 304, 279, 3130, 627, 18, 13, 386, 51843, 320, 44, 3746, 7997, 1680, 362, 8579, 11, 60121, 6307, 1933, 1511, 369, 59570, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 13116, 315, 279, 72813, 10830, 62156, 477, 279, 11259, 389, 279, 559, 28000, 15670, 13, 1115, 1933, 374, 56085, 315, 279, 5933, 40190, 315, 6457, 323, 11621, 264, 5916, 315, 99316, 311, 279, 3130, 627, 19, 13, 735, 2868, 320, 34564, 10690, 1680, 362, 9257, 11, 6453, 14198, 1933, 1511, 369, 279, 14891, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 3428, 7962, 1113, 12