Output~2025-04-07 00:52:26.057600: [RequestOutput(request_id=1720, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a short story about a <mask> trying to find their place in the world. ### Input: Cheetah ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 2875, 3446, 922, 264, 366, 11508, 29, 4560, 311, 1505, 872, 2035, 304, 279, 1917, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 356, 3759, 1494, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='As the sun rose over the savannah, a young cheetah named Akira stretched her long, sleek body across the warm grass. She yawned, revealing sharp teeth, and arched her back in a languid stretch. Akira was a curious creature, always eager to explore and discover new things. But as she gazed out at the endless expanse of grasslands, she felt a pang of uncertainty. What was her place in this world?\n\nAkira\'s mother had taught her everything she knew: how to hunt, how to stalk prey, and how to avoid predators. But as she grew older, Akira began to feel restless. She longed to do something more, to make a difference in the world. But what?\n\nShe decided to set out on a journey to find her place. Akira traveled far and wide, meeting all manner of creatures along the way. She met a wise old tortoise who taught her about patience and perseverance. She met a mischievous monkey who showed her the joy of play and laughter. And she even met a majestic lion who shared with her the importance of courage and leadership.\n\nBut no matter where she went or who she met, Akira couldn\'t shake the feeling that she was meant for something more. She felt like she was just going through the motions, without a sense of purpose.\n\nOne day, as she was exploring a particularly dense thicket, Akira stumbled upon a hidden clearing. In the center of the clearing stood an ancient acacia tree, its branches twisted and gnarled with age. Akira felt drawn to the tree, as if it held the secrets she had been searching for.\n\nAs she approached the tree, she noticed that its branches seemed to be... singing. The soft, melodic hum was almost imperceptible, but Akira\'s sensitive ears picked up on it. She reached out a paw to touch the trunk, and as she did, the humming grew louder.\n\nSuddenly, the tree spoke to her in a low, rumbling voice. "Akira, you have been searching for your place in the world. But your place is not out there, it is within. You have a unique gift, one that only you possess. Use it to make a difference, to bring joy and harmony to the world."\n\nAkira\'s ears perked up, and she felt a surge of excitement. She realized that her place was not as a hunter or a warrior, but as a bringer of joy and harmony. From that day on', token_ids=[2170, 279, 7160, 16392, 927, 279, 11427, 44104, 11, 264, 3995, 3091, 295, 1494, 7086, 16762, 9008, 41398, 1077, 1317, 11, 48494, 2547, 4028, 279, 8369, 16763, 13, 3005, 379, 6513, 291, 11, 31720, 17676, 18311, 11, 323, 802, 2454, 1077, 1203, 304, 264, 83400, 307, 14841, 13, 16762, 9008, 574, 264, 22999, 17661, 11, 2744, 24450, 311, 13488, 323, 7142, 502, 2574, 13, 2030, 439, 1364, 342, 28109, 704, 520, 279, 26762, 506, 95519, 315, 16763, 8329, 11, 1364, 6612, 264, 97974, 315, 27924, 13, 3639, 574, 1077, 2035, 304, 420, 1917, 1980, 56902, 9008, 596, 6691, 1047, 15972, 1077, 4395, 1364, 7020, 25, 1268, 311, 19614, 11, 1268, 311, 55972, 37693, 11, 323, 1268, 311, 5766, 56217, 13, 2030, 439, 1364, 14264, 