Output~2025-04-07 00:53:07.734275: [RequestOutput(request_id=1730, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe how a character acts in a particular situation. ### Input: Character: Alice\\nSituation: Meeting a group of new people ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 1268, 264, 3752, 14385, 304, 264, 4040, 6671, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 16007, 25, 30505, 1734, 61935, 4090, 25, 30155, 264, 1912, 315, 502, 1274, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Alice walks into the room with a warm and friendly smile, her eyes scanning the group of new people in front of her. She takes a deep breath, feeling a slight flutter of nervousness in her chest, but it's quickly replaced by her natural enthusiasm and curiosity. As she approaches the group, she extends her hand in greeting, introducing herself with a firm but gentle handshake.\n\nAs she begins to mingle, Alice is attentive and engaged, asking thoughtful questions about each person's interests and hobbies. She listens actively, nodding along and making supportive noises, showing genuine interest in getting to know them better. Her body language is open and approachable, with a relaxed posture and a smile that puts everyone at ease.\n\nAs the conversation flows, Alice's natural wit and sense of humor start to shine through, and she finds herself laughing and joking with the group. She's not trying to be the center of attention, but she's not afraid to share her own stories and experiences, either. Her authenticity and kindness are infectious, and soon the group is chatting and laughing together like old friends.\n\nThroughout the meeting, Alice remains mindful of her surroundings, taking in the atmosphere and the dynamics of the group. She's aware of her own boundaries and is respectful of others', making sure to include everyone in the conversation and avoid dominating the discussion. As the meeting comes to a close, Alice feels a sense of satisfaction and connection, knowing that she's made a positive impression and formed some new connections.", token_ids=[62786, 23291, 1139, 279, 3130, 449, 264, 8369, 323, 11919, 15648, 11, 1077, 6548, 36201, 279, 1912, 315, 502, 1274, 304, 4156, 315, 1077, 13, 3005, 5097, 264, 5655, 11745, 11, 8430, 264, 8275, 74883, 315, 23418, 2136, 304, 1077, 15489, 11, 719, 433, 596, 6288, 12860, 555, 1077, 5933, 36232, 323, 41328, 13, 1666, 1364, 20414, 279, 1912, 11, 1364, 2289, 1077, 1450, 304, 43213, 11, 33018, 11937, 449, 264, 7626, 719, 22443, 58120, 382, 2170, 1364, 12302, 311, 91125, 11, 30505, 374, 73898, 323, 17045, 11, 10371, 43766, 4860, 922, 1855, 1732, 596, 12034, 323, 64405, 13, 3005, 64748, 22815, 11, 16387, 7113, 3235, 323, 3339, 33445, 58448, 11, 9204, 22785, 2802, 304, 3794, 311, 1440, 1124, 2731, 13, 6385, 2547, 4221, 374, 1825, 323, 5603, 481, 11, 449, 264, 31467, 48378, 323, 264, 15648, 430, 9711, 5127, 520, 14553, 382, 2170, 279, 10652, 28555, 11, 30505, 596, 5933, 38467, 323, 5647, 315, 28485, 1212, 311, 33505, 1555, 11, 323, 1364, 14035, 11937, 32681, 323, 58134, 449, 279, 1912, 13, 3005, 596, 539, 4560, 311, 387, 279, 4219, 315, 6666, 11, 719, 1364, 596, 539, 16984, 311, 4430, 1077, 1866, 7493, 323, 11704, 11, 3060, 13, 6385, 54348, 323, 45972, 527, 50600, 11, 323, 5246, 279, 1912, 374, 52067, 323, 32681, 3871, 1093, 2362, 4885, 382, 60105, 279, 6574, 11, 30505, 8625, 63442, 315, 1077, 40190, 11, 4737, 304, 279, 16975, 3